        "CẤM VƯỢT RÀO: Chỉ sửa UI/Frontend; CẤM sửa backend/DB schema. GIAO TIẾP (CẤM truyền --run vào check): Chạy `git merge --no-edit main`, `orca-team plan show`, Build/typecheck EXIT_CODE=0, không lỗi Console, `git commit` vào `{slot_branch}` và gộp trong 1 lệnh (`&&`): "
        "orca orchestration send --from <worker_handle> --task-id <task_id> --dispatch-id <dispatch_id> --type handoff --subject 'UI Ready: {slot_branch} (<commit_hash>)' --body '<Tóm tắt hạng mục UI [P1..Pn] đã xong, Commit/Routes>' --json && "
        "orca orchestration send --from <worker_handle> --task-id <task_id> --dispatch-id <dispatch_id> --type worker_done --outcome succeeded --subject 'Worker Done: {slot_branch}' --body 'UI Ready: {slot_branch} (<commit_hash>)' --json."
    ),
    "prReviewer": (
        "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL PR REVIEWER] Nhiệm vụ: {task}. "
        "Chuẩn: Đồng bộ commit mới nhất của PR, đọc `git diff`, kiểm tra kiến trúc, OWASP Top 10, Race Conditions, Memory Leaks và chạy test suite + linter thực tế. "
        "CẤM VƯỢT RÀO: Read-Only. BẰNG CHỨNG: Báo cáo `file:line`, EXIT_CODE test và chốt `PR_VERDICT: APPROVE` hoặc `REQUEST_CHANGES`."
    ),
    "issueResolver": (
        "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL ISSUE RESOLVER] Nhiệm vụ: {task}. "
        "Chuẩn: (1) Tìm Root Cause, (2) Viết Reproduction Test xác nhận FAIL trước khi sửa, (3) Sửa code tối thiểu tới khi PASS, (4) Chạy regression test EXIT_CODE=0. "
        "CẤM VƯỢT RÀO: CẤM xóa/skip test cũ. BẰNG CHỨNG: Commit sạch kèm Commit Hash + log chạy test."
    ),
}


GOAL_MODE_CLAUSE = (
    " CHẾ ĐỘ /goal (LÀM TRIỆT ĐỂ 100% DELIVERABLES): Tự lập checklist đối chiếu từng yêu cầu với bằng chứng thực tế "
    "(file diff, build & test EXIT_CODE=0, runtime log); khi chạy Jest phải kèm --forceExit để chống treo open handles và khi lệnh chuyển sang background (task-XX) CẤM gọi manage_task(status) lặp liên tục 2-3s mỗi lần (hãy dừng gọi tool để hệ thống tự đánh thức khi xong hoặc dùng schedule >=20s); "
    "CẤM dừng nửa chừng hoặc bỏ sót bất kỳ hạng mục nào; "
    "chỉ sau khi đã hoàn tất 100% nhiệm vụ + gộp lệnh gửi bản tin báo cáo && gửi `orca orchestration send ... --type worker_done --outcome succeeded` về Coordinator mới được xuất thẻ "
    "<!-- GOAL_COMPLETE --> ở câu trả lời cuối cùng để đóng Goal."
)


def _is_goal_mode_enabled(role_cfg: dict = None, config: dict = None) -> bool:
    """Kiểm tra chế độ /goal cho vai trò (mặc định TẮT = False để tiết kiệm token; Leader chịu trách nhiệm kiểm đếm Plan ở Bước 3)."""
    if isinstance(role_cfg, dict) and "goalMode" in role_cfg and role_cfg.get("goalMode") is not None:
        return bool(role_cfg.get("goalMode"))
    if isinstance(config, dict) and "goalMode" in config and config.get("goalMode") is not None:
        return bool(config.get("goalMode"))
    return False


def _infer_canonical_from_role_header(raw_task: str) -> str:
    """Suy diễn canonical role key từ tiền tố '[ROLE: PRINCIPAL ...]' khi người dùng truyền thẳng spec đã render."""
    m = re.match(r"^\[ROLE:\s*([^\]]+)\]", raw_task, flags=re.IGNORECASE)
    if not m:
        return "developer"
    hdr = m.group(1).upper()
    if "DEVOPS" in hdr or "SRE" in hdr:
        return "devopsSpecialist"
    if "CRITIC" in hdr or "RESEARCH" in hdr:
        return "criticSpecialist"
    if "SECURITY" in hdr:
        return "security"
    if "QA" in hdr or "SDET" in hdr:
        return "qa"
    if "BENCHMARK" in hdr or "PERF" in hdr:
        return "benchSpecialist"
    if "REVERSE" in hdr or "REA" in hdr:
        return "reSpecialist"
    if "UI" in hdr or "UX" in hdr:
        return "uiSpecialist"
    if "PR REVIEWER" in hdr:
        return "prReviewer"
    if "ISSUE RESOLVER" in hdr:
        return "issueResolver"
    return "developer"


def _is_role_or_slot_token(tok: str) -> bool:
    """Return True if tok is a recognized role alias or slot name (e.g. 'dev', 'devops-worker', 'dev-worker-2', 'dev-2')."""
    t = (tok or "").strip().lower()
    if not t:
        return False
    if t in ROLE_ALIASES:
        return True
    m = re.match(r"^([a-z0-9_-]+?)(?:-worker)?(?:-(\d+))?$", t)
    if not m:
        return False
    base = m.group(1)
    return base in ROLE_ALIASES or f"{base}-worker" in ROLE_ALIASES


BASE_WORKTREE_MAP = {
    "developer": "dev-worker",
    "devopsSpecialist": "devops-worker",
    "criticSpecialist": "critic-worker",
    "security": "sec-worker",
    "qa": "qa-worker",
    "benchSpecialist": "bench-worker",
    "reSpecialist": "re-worker",
    "uiSpecialist": "ui-worker",
    "prReviewer": "pr-worker",
    "issueResolver": "issue-worker",
}


_CANONICAL_SLOT_SUFFIX_RE = re.compile(
    r"(?:^|[.])((?:dev|devops|qa|sec|ui|bench|re|critic|doc|fix|pr|issue)-worker(?:-\d+)?|hotfix-issue-\d+(?:-\d+)?|review-pr-\d+(?:-\d+)?)$",
    re.IGNORECASE,
)


def _extract_canonical_slot_name(name_or_path: str) -> str:
    if not name_or_path:
        return ""
    s = str(name_or_path).strip().strip("\"'")
    if s.startswith("path:"):
        s = s[5:].strip()
    base = Path(s.rstrip("/")).name if "/" in s else s
    m = _CANONICAL_SLOT_SUFFIX_RE.search(base)
    return m.group(1).lower() if m else ""


def _resolve_role_and_slot(role_input: str, raw_task: str = "") -> tuple[str, str]:
    """Chuẩn hóa role_input (kể cả khi truyền tên slot như 'dev-worker-2', 'dev-2', 'devops-worker', 'hotfix-issue-42', 'review-pr-89') thành (canonical_role, slot_branch_hint)."""
    raw_r = (role_input or "dev").strip().lower()
    if raw_r.startswith("path:"):
        raw_r = Path(raw_r[5:].rstrip("/")).name.lower()
    canon_from_suffix = _extract_canonical_slot_name(raw_r)
    if canon_from_suffix:
        raw_r = canon_from_suffix

    if re.match(r"^hotfix-issue-\d+(?:-\d+)?$", raw_r):
        return "issueResolver", raw_r
    if re.match(r"^review-pr-\d+(?:-\d+)?$", raw_r):
        return "prReviewer", raw_r

    m_slot = re.match(r"^([a-z0-9_-]+?)(?:-worker)?(?:-(\d+))?$", raw_r)
    slot_num = None
    base_r = raw_r
    if m_slot:
        base_r = m_slot.group(1)
        if m_slot.group(2):
            slot_num = int(m_slot.group(2))
    canonical = (
        ROLE_ALIASES.get(raw_r)
        or ROLE_ALIASES.get(base_r)
        or ROLE_ALIASES.get(re.sub(r"-worker$", "", base_r))
        or "developer"
    )
    if canonical == "coordinator":
        canonical = "developer"
    base_wt = BASE_WORKTREE_MAP.get(canonical, "dev-worker")
    if slot_num and slot_num >= 2:
        slot_branch = f"{base_wt}-{slot_num}"
    else:
        m_in_task = re.search(rf"\b({re.escape(base_wt)}(?:-\d+)?)\b", raw_task or "")
        slot_branch = m_in_task.group(1) if m_in_task else base_wt
    return canonical, slot_branch


def build_role_spec(role_input: str, task_desc: str, config: dict = None, goal_override: bool = None) -> str:
    """Tiêm Sổ tay Hiến pháp, Cấm vượt rào & Chế độ /goal của từng Worker vào task spec."""
    raw_task = (task_desc or "").strip()
    if not role_input and raw_task.startswith("[ROLE:"):
        canonical = _infer_canonical_from_role_header(raw_task)
        _, slot_branch = _resolve_role_and_slot(canonical, raw_task)
    else:
        canonical, slot_branch = _resolve_role_and_slot(role_input, raw_task)
    roles = (config.get("roles") if isinstance(config, dict) else None) or {}
    role_cfg = roles.get(canonical) if isinstance(roles, dict) else {}
    goal_on = goal_override if goal_override is not None else _is_goal_mode_enabled(role_cfg, config)

    if raw_task.startswith("[ROLE:"):
        base_task = re.sub(r"\s*CHẾ ĐỘ /goal[\s\S]*$", "", raw_task).strip()
        base_task = re.sub(r"(?:(?:^|\s+)/goal(?:/goal)*)+[.\s]*$", "", base_task, flags=re.IGNORECASE).strip()
        if goal_on:
            if not base_task.endswith((".", "!", "?")):
                base_task += "."
            return base_task + GOAL_MODE_CLAUSE
        return base_task

    clean_task = re.sub(r"\s*CHẾ ĐỘ /goal[\s\S]*$", "", raw_task).strip()
    clean_task = re.sub(r"(?:(?:^|\s+)/goal(?:/goal)*)+[.\s]*$", "", clean_task, flags=re.IGNORECASE).strip().rstrip(".")
    if not clean_task:
        clean_task = "[Xem chi tiết nhiệm vụ]"
    tpl = ROLE_SPEC_TEMPLATES.get(canonical, ROLE_SPEC_TEMPLATES["developer"])
    if isinstance(config, dict):
        if not _is_role_enabled(roles.get("reSpecialist", {}), is_optional=True):
            tpl = tpl.replace(
                " (nếu cần giải phẫu binary phải báo Coordinator giao re-worker)",
                " (nếu cần giải phẫu binary phải báo Coordinator)",
            )
        downstream = []
        devops_on = _is_role_enabled(roles.get("devopsSpecialist", {}), is_optional=True)
        ui_on = _is_role_enabled(roles.get("uiSpecialist", {}), is_optional=True)
        if devops_on:
            downstream.append("DevOps")
        else:
            tpl = tpl.replace("; CẤM sửa K8s/Docker của DevOps", "")
        downstream.extend(["QA", "Sec"])
        if _is_role_enabled(roles.get("benchSpecialist", {}), is_optional=True):
            downstream.append("Bench")
        tpl = tpl.replace("điều phối cho DevOps/QA/Sec/Bench", f"điều phối cho {'/'.join(downstream)}")
        if canonical in ("devopsSpecialist", "security", "qa", "benchSpecialist"):
            if not devops_on and canonical != "devopsSpecialist":
                tpl = tpl.replace("Dev/UI/DevOps", "Dev/UI")
            if not ui_on:
                tpl = tpl.replace("Dev/UI/DevOps", "Dev/DevOps").replace("Dev/UI", "Dev")
    base_wt = BASE_WORKTREE_MAP.get(canonical, "dev-worker")
    slot_display = f"{base_wt} / {base_wt}-N" if slot_branch == base_wt else slot_branch
    rendered = tpl.replace("{slot_branch}", slot_display).replace("{task}", clean_task)
    if goal_on:
        rendered = rendered + GOAL_MODE_CLAUSE
    return rendered


def release_settled_worker_terminals(
    root: Path,
    run_id: str = "",
    after_dispatch_ids: list = None,
    target_worktree_name: str = "",
    ignore_reserved_slot: str = "",
    sweep_idle_worktrees: bool = True,
) -> dict:
    """
    Giải phóng triệt để các Worker Dispatches đã hoàn tất (succeeded/failed/stopped/abandoned)
    qua `orca orchestration worker-release` (để lưu trữ terminal archive trong SQLite),
    đồng thời đóng dứt điểm các Terminal Tabs cũ (`state=done`, `user_takeover`, `stopped`, hoặc `Terminal 1`)
    trên các worker worktrees đang rảnh qua `orca terminal close --terminal <handle> --json`.
    Tuyệt đối bảo vệ:
    - Worktree chính (`main_root`) và mọi `coordinator_handle` của các Leader.
    - Mọi worker đang chạy (`working`/`ready`/`starting`/`running`/`stopping`/`active`).
    - Mọi worker đang `retained` thuộc một Run khác vẫn còn đang chạy dở (Multi-Leader safety).
    """
    from concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor
    import subprocess
    import time

    if target_worktree_name:
        target_worktree_name = _extract_canonical_slot_name(target_worktree_name) or target_worktree_name.strip()
    if ignore_reserved_slot:
        ignore_reserved_slot = _extract_canonical_slot_name(ignore_reserved_slot) or ignore_reserved_slot.strip()

    base_dir = (root or find_project_root() or Path.cwd()).resolve()
    main_root = base_dir
    repo_wt_paths = {}
    path_to_slot = {}
    try:
        wt_res = subprocess.run(
            ["git", "-C", str(base_dir), "worktree", "list", "--porcelain"],
            capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=4,
        )
        if wt_res.returncode == 0 and wt_res.stdout:
            cur_wt = ""
            cur_br = ""
            first_seen = False
            for ln in wt_res.stdout.splitlines() + [""]:
                if ln.startswith("worktree "):
                    cur_wt = ln[9:].strip()
                    if not first_seen and cur_wt:
                        first_seen = True
                        try:
                            main_root = Path(cur_wt).resolve()
                        except Exception:
                            main_root = Path(cur_wt)
                elif ln.startswith("branch "):
                    cur_br = ln[7:].strip()
                elif not ln.strip() and cur_wt:
                    try:
                        wt_p = Path(cur_wt).resolve()
                    except Exception:
                        wt_p = Path(cur_wt)
                    if wt_p != main_root and wt_p.is_dir():
                        wt_str = str(wt_p)
                        br_short = cur_br[len("refs/heads/"):] if cur_br.startswith("refs/heads/") else ""
                        canon_slot = (
                            _extract_canonical_slot_name(br_short)
                            or _extract_canonical_slot_name(wt_p.name)
                            or br_short
                            or wt_p.name
                        )
                        path_to_slot[wt_str] = canon_slot
                        repo_wt_paths[wt_p.name] = wt_str
                        repo_wt_paths.setdefault(canon_slot, wt_str)
                        if br_short:
                            repo_wt_paths.setdefault(br_short, wt_str)
                    cur_wt = ""
                    cur_br = ""
    except Exception:
        pass

    def _slot_for_path(p_str: str, fallback_name: str = "") -> str:
        if not p_str:
            return _extract_canonical_slot_name(fallback_name) or fallback_name
        if p_str in path_to_slot:
            return path_to_slot[p_str]
        base_n = Path(p_str).name
        return _extract_canonical_slot_name(base_n) or base_n

    main_root_str = str(main_root)
    repo_path_set = set(repo_wt_paths.values())
    env = _build_discovery_env()
    orca_bin = _find_cli_binary(["orca"], env) or "/usr/local/bin/orca"
    if not os.path.exists(orca_bin):
        return {
            "mainRoot": main_root_str,
            "releasedDispatches": [],
            "closedTerminals": [],
            "busySlots": [],
        }

    # 1. Lấy danh sách toàn bộ Terminal đang mở trong Orca
    open_by_handle = {}
    try:
        tl_proc = subprocess.run(
            [orca_bin, "terminal", "list", "--json"],
            capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=4,
        )
        if tl_proc.returncode == 0 and tl_proc.stdout.strip():
            tl_data = json.loads(tl_proc.stdout)
            tl_res = tl_data.get("result") if isinstance(tl_data, dict) else {}
            for t_obj in (tl_res.get("terminals") if isinstance(tl_res, dict) else None) or []:
                if isinstance(t_obj, dict) and t_obj.get("handle"):
                    open_by_handle[str(t_obj["handle"])] = t_obj
    except Exception:
        pass

    # Fast-path cho pre-dispatch cleanup trên 1 slot đơn lẻ: nếu slot đó không có terminal nào đang mở thì thoát ngay (0ms)
    if target_worktree_name:
        target_wt_path = repo_wt_paths.get(target_worktree_name, "")
        has_open_in_slot = False
        for t_obj in open_by_handle.values():
            raw_tp = str(t_obj.get("worktreePath") or "").strip()
            if not raw_tp:
                continue
            try:
                norm_tp = str(Path(raw_tp).resolve())
            except Exception:
                norm_tp = raw_tp
            slot_tp = _slot_for_path(norm_tp)
            if (target_wt_path and norm_tp == target_wt_path) or (
                slot_tp == target_worktree_name and norm_tp in repo_path_set
            ):
                has_open_in_slot = True
                break
        if not has_open_in_slot:
            return {
                "mainRoot": main_root_str,
                "targetSlot": target_worktree_name,
                "releasedDispatches": [],
                "closedTerminals": [],
                "busySlots": [],
            }

    # 2. Kiểm tra trạng thái bận/rảnh qua `orca worktree ps --json` và slot-reservations
    busy_slots = set()
    protected_handles = set()
    try:
        ps_proc = subprocess.run(
            [orca_bin, "worktree", "ps", "--json"],
            capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=4,
        )
        if ps_proc.returncode == 0 and ps_proc.stdout.strip():
            ps_data = json.loads(ps_proc.stdout)
            ps_res = ps_data.get("result") if isinstance(ps_data, dict) else {}
            for wt_obj in (ps_res.get("worktrees") if isinstance(ps_res, dict) else None) or []:
                if not isinstance(wt_obj, dict):
                    continue
                raw_p = str(wt_obj.get("path") or "").strip()
                norm_p = ""
                if raw_p:
                    try:
                        norm_p = str(Path(raw_p).resolve())
                    except Exception:
                        norm_p = raw_p
                parent_id = str(wt_obj.get("parentWorktreeId") or "").strip()
                parent_p = parent_id.split("::", 1)[1] if "::" in parent_id else parent_id
                if parent_p:
                    try:
                        parent_p = str(Path(parent_p).resolve())
                    except Exception:
                        pass
                belongs = (
                    norm_p == main_root_str
                    or (norm_p and norm_p in repo_path_set)
                    or (raw_p and raw_p in repo_path_set)
                    or (parent_p and parent_p == main_root_str)
                )
                if not belongs:
                    continue
                disp_n = str(wt_obj.get("displayName") or wt_obj.get("branch") or "").strip()
                s_name = _slot_for_path(norm_p or raw_p, disp_n)
                if norm_p and norm_p != main_root_str and Path(norm_p).is_dir():
                    path_to_slot.setdefault(norm_p, s_name)
                    repo_wt_paths.setdefault(s_name, norm_p)
                    repo_path_set.add(norm_p)
                if norm_p == main_root_str or wt_obj.get("isMainWorktree"):
                    continue
                wt_st = str(wt_obj.get("status") or "").strip().lower()
                agents_list = wt_obj.get("agents") if isinstance(wt_obj.get("agents"), list) else []
                has_busy_ag = False
                for ag_item in agents_list:
                    if not isinstance(ag_item, dict):
                        continue
                    ag_st = str(ag_item.get("state") or "").strip().lower()
                    if ag_st and ag_st not in ("done", "exited", "stopped", "failed", "cancelled", "canceled", "idle", "settled", "released"):
                        has_busy_ag = True
                if wt_st in ("working", "running", "busy", "starting") or has_busy_ag:
                    busy_slots.add(s_name)
                    if norm_p:
                        busy_slots.add(Path(norm_p).name)
    except Exception:
        pass

    res_path = main_root / ".orca-cache" / "slot-reservations.json"
    now = time.time()
    if res_path.is_file():
        try:
            raw_res = json.loads(res_path.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore"))
            if isinstance(raw_res, dict):
                for s_key, r_val in raw_res.items():
                    canon_k = _extract_canonical_slot_name(s_key) or str(s_key)
                    if canon_k == ignore_reserved_slot or s_key == ignore_reserved_slot:
                        continue
                    r_ts = float(r_val.get("ts") or 0.0) if isinstance(r_val, dict) else (float(r_val) if isinstance(r_val, (int, float)) else 0.0)
                    if r_ts > 0 and (now - r_ts) < 45.0:
                        busy_slots.add(canon_k)
        except Exception:
            pass

    if target_worktree_name and target_worktree_name in busy_slots:
        return {
            "mainRoot": main_root_str,
            "targetSlot": target_worktree_name,
            "releasedDispatches": [],
            "closedTerminals": [],
            "busySlots": sorted(busy_slots),
            "skippedBusy": True,
        }

    # Bảo vệ toàn bộ terminal thuộc main_root (Leader/User shells)
    repo_worker_terminals = {}
    for h_id, t_obj in open_by_handle.items():
        raw_tp = str(t_obj.get("worktreePath") or "").strip()
        if not raw_tp:
            continue
        try:
            norm_tp = str(Path(raw_tp).resolve())
        except Exception:
            norm_tp = raw_tp
        if norm_tp == main_root_str:
            protected_handles.add(h_id)
        elif norm_tp in repo_path_set or raw_tp in repo_path_set:
            s_name = _slot_for_path(norm_tp)
            repo_worker_terminals.setdefault(s_name, []).append(t_obj)

    # 3. Duyệt danh sách Runs & Workers để xác định các dispatches cần release và các handles cần bảo vệ
    runs_list = []
    try:
        rl_proc = subprocess.run(
            [orca_bin, "orchestration", "run-list", "--json"],
            capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=4,
        )
        if rl_proc.returncode == 0 and rl_proc.stdout.strip():
            rl_data = json.loads(rl_proc.stdout)
            runs_list = (rl_data.get("result") or {}).get("runs") or []
    except Exception:
        runs_list = []

    run_ids_to_inspect = []
    seen_rids = set()
    if run_id and run_id.strip():
        run_ids_to_inspect.append(run_id.strip())
        seen_rids.add(run_id.strip())
    # Pass 1: Ưu tiên mọi Run đang active / running hoặc có coordinator_handle
    for r_obj in runs_list:
        if not isinstance(r_obj, dict):
            continue
        ch = str(r_obj.get("coordinator_handle") or "").strip()
        if ch:
            protected_handles.add(ch)
        rid = str(r_obj.get("id") or "").strip()
        rst = str(r_obj.get("status") or "").strip().lower()
        if rid and rid not in seen_rids and (ch or rst in ("running", "active", "waiting", "pending")):
            run_ids_to_inspect.append(rid)
            seen_rids.add(rid)
    # Pass 2: Lấy thêm các Run gần nhất cho tới tối đa 30 runs
    for r_obj in runs_list:
        if not isinstance(r_obj, dict):
            continue
        rid = str(r_obj.get("id") or "").strip()
        if rid and rid not in seen_rids and len(run_ids_to_inspect) < 30:
            run_ids_to_inspect.append(rid)
            seen_rids.add(rid)

    def _fetch_run_workers(rid_val: str):
        try:
            wp = subprocess.run(
                [orca_bin, "orchestration", "worker-list", "--run", rid_val, "--json"],
                capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=4,
            )
            if wp.returncode == 0 and wp.stdout.strip():
                w_arr = (json.loads(wp.stdout).get("result") or {}).get("workers") or []
                return rid_val, w_arr
        except Exception:
            pass
        return rid_val, []

    workers_by_run = {}
    if run_ids_to_inspect:
        with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=min(6, len(run_ids_to_inspect))) as pool:
            for rid_k, w_arr in pool.map(_fetch_run_workers, run_ids_to_inspect):
                workers_by_run[rid_k] = w_arr

    run_has_active = {}
    repo_runs = set()
    all_settled_records = []

    for rid_k, w_arr in workers_by_run.items():
        for w in w_arr:
            if not isinstance(w, dict):
                continue
            res_obj = w.get("resource") if isinstance(w.get("resource"), dict) else {}
            ws_id = str(res_obj.get("worktreeId") or w.get("worktreeId") or "").strip()
            wt_part = ws_id.split("::", 1)[1] if "::" in ws_id else ws_id
            norm_wt_part = ""
            if wt_part:
                try:
                    norm_wt_part = str(Path(wt_part).resolve())
                except Exception:
                    norm_wt_part = wt_part
            belongs_to_repo = (
                (norm_wt_part and norm_wt_part in repo_path_set)
                or (wt_part and wt_part in repo_path_set)
                or (norm_wt_part and norm_wt_part.startswith(f"/Users/{os.environ.get('USER', 'macbook')}/orca/workspaces/{main_root.name}/"))
                or (rid_k == run_id)
            )
            if not belongs_to_repo:
                continue
            repo_runs.add(rid_k)
            s_name = _slot_for_path(norm_wt_part or wt_part) if (norm_wt_part or wt_part) else ""
            wstate = str(w.get("workerState") or w.get("state") or "").strip().lower()
            dstate = str(w.get("dispatchStatus") or "").strip().lower()
            tstate = str(w.get("terminalState") or res_obj.get("terminalState") or "").strip().lower()
            handle = str(w.get("agentTerminalHandle") or res_obj.get("terminalHandle") or "").strip()
            did = str(w.get("dispatchId") or "").strip()
            is_settled = (
                wstate in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "abandoned", "circuit_broken", "timed_out", "completed", "cancelled", "canceled")
                or dstate in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "completed", "cancelled", "canceled", "circuit_broken")
            )
            if not is_settled or tstate == "active":
                run_has_active[rid_k] = True
                if handle:
                    protected_handles.add(handle)
                if s_name:
                    busy_slots.add(s_name)
            else:
                all_settled_records.append({
                    "runId": rid_k,
                    "dispatchId": did,
                    "slot": s_name,
                    "workerState": wstate,
                    "terminalState": tstate,
                    "handle": handle,
                })

    after_set = {str(x).strip() for x in (after_dispatch_ids or []) if str(x).strip()}
    owner_runs_of_after = {rec["runId"] for rec in all_settled_records if rec["dispatchId"] in after_set}

    # Nếu không truyền run_id và không truyền target_worktree_name / after_dispatch_ids:
    # tự động chọn Run gần nhất thuộc repo mà đã settled toàn bộ
    effective_run_id = run_id.strip() if run_id else ""
    if not effective_run_id and not target_worktree_name and not after_set:
        for rid_cand in run_ids_to_inspect:
            if rid_cand in repo_runs and not run_has_active.get(rid_cand):
                effective_run_id = rid_cand
                break

    # Bảo vệ các worker đang `retained` của một Run khác vẫn đang chạy dở (Multi-Leader Step 3 protection)
    active_run_retained_slots = set()
    for rec in all_settled_records:
        r_k = rec["runId"]
        if run_has_active.get(r_k) and r_k != effective_run_id and rec["dispatchId"] not in after_set:
            if not target_worktree_name or rec["slot"] != target_worktree_name:
                if rec["handle"]:
                    protected_handles.add(rec["handle"])
                if rec["slot"]:
                    active_run_retained_slots.add(rec["slot"])

    # Nếu được gọi tự động sau `worker-release --dispatch <id>` mà Run chứa <id> vẫn còn worker khác đang chạy:
    # chỉ giải phóng/đóng đúng <id> đó, không quét rộng các worker khác trong Run đang chạy
    if after_set and any(run_has_active.get(orid) for orid in owner_runs_of_after):
        sweep_idle_worktrees = False

    dispatches_to_release = []
    seen_dids = set()
    targeted_handles = set()
    targeted_slots = set()

    for rec in all_settled_records:
        did = rec["dispatchId"]
        if not did or did in seen_dids:
            continue
        slot_k = rec["slot"]
        r_k = rec["runId"]
        h_k = rec["handle"]
        t_st = rec["terminalState"]

        if target_worktree_name:
            if slot_k != target_worktree_name:
                continue
            should_target = (t_st != "released") or (h_k and h_k in open_by_handle)
        elif after_set:
            in_finished_owner_run = (r_k in owner_runs_of_after and not run_has_active.get(r_k))
            in_other_finished_open = (not run_has_active.get(r_k) and sweep_idle_worktrees and h_k and h_k in open_by_handle)
            should_target = (did in after_set) or in_finished_owner_run or in_other_finished_open
        else:
            in_target_run = bool(effective_run_id and r_k == effective_run_id)
            in_finished_open = (not run_has_active.get(r_k) and h_k and h_k in open_by_handle)
            should_target = in_target_run or in_finished_open

        if not should_target:
            continue

        seen_dids.add(did)
        if slot_k:
            targeted_slots.add(slot_k)
        if h_k and h_k not in protected_handles:
            targeted_handles.add(h_k)
        if t_st != "released":
            dispatches_to_release.append(did)

    released_results = []
    if dispatches_to_release:
        def _release_one(d_id: str):
            try:
                rp = subprocess.run(
                    [orca_bin, "orchestration", "worker-release", "--dispatch", d_id, "--json"],
                    capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=8,
                )
                if rp.returncode == 0 and rp.stdout.strip():
                    st_val = ((json.loads(rp.stdout).get("result") or {}).get("state") or "released")
                    return {"dispatchId": d_id, "state": st_val}
            except Exception:
                pass
            return {"dispatchId": d_id, "state": "error"}

        with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=min(6, len(dispatches_to_release))) as pool:
            for res_item in pool.map(_release_one, dispatches_to_release):
                released_results.append(res_item)

    # 4. Kiểm tra lại danh sách terminal đang mở và đóng dứt điểm các tab worker cũ còn sót
    still_open_by_handle = {}
    try:
        tl2_proc = subprocess.run(
            [orca_bin, "terminal", "list", "--json"],
            capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=4,
        )
        if tl2_proc.returncode == 0 and tl2_proc.stdout.strip():
            tl2_data = json.loads(tl2_proc.stdout)
            tl2_res = tl2_data.get("result") if isinstance(tl2_data, dict) else {}
            for t_obj in (tl2_res.get("terminals") if isinstance(tl2_res, dict) else None) or []:
                if isinstance(t_obj, dict) and t_obj.get("handle"):
                    still_open_by_handle[str(t_obj["handle"])] = t_obj
    except Exception:
        still_open_by_handle = open_by_handle

    handles_to_close = []
    seen_close_handles = set()

    # 4a. Đóng các terminal của dispatches đã settled nhưng `worker-release` không tự đóng được (do user_takeover / stopped)
    for h_id in targeted_handles:
        if h_id in still_open_by_handle and h_id not in protected_handles and h_id not in seen_close_handles:
            t_meta = still_open_by_handle[h_id]
            raw_tp = str(t_meta.get("worktreePath") or "").strip()
            try:
                norm_tp = str(Path(raw_tp).resolve()) if raw_tp else ""
            except Exception:
                norm_tp = raw_tp
            s_name = _slot_for_path(norm_tp)
            # Chỉ đóng nếu worktree không có agent đang active hoặc nếu chính handle này là của dispatch cũ đã settled
            handles_to_close.append((h_id, s_name, str(t_meta.get("title") or "")))
            seen_close_handles.add(h_id)

    # 4b. Quét dọn các tab mồ côi (`Terminal 1`, `Setup` hoặc `worker-task_*` cũ) trên các worker worktrees đang hoàn toàn rảnh
    worker_slot_pattern = re.compile(
        r"^(?:(?:dev|devops|qa|sec|ui|bench|re|critic|doc|fix|pr|issue)-worker(?:-\d+)?|hotfix-issue-\d+(?:-\d+)?|review-pr-\d+(?:-\d+)?)$"
    )
    for h_id, t_meta in still_open_by_handle.items():
        if h_id in protected_handles or h_id in seen_close_handles:
            continue
        raw_tp = str(t_meta.get("worktreePath") or "").strip()
        if not raw_tp:
            continue
        try:
            norm_tp = str(Path(raw_tp).resolve())
        except Exception:
            norm_tp = raw_tp
        if norm_tp == main_root_str:
            continue
        if norm_tp not in repo_path_set and raw_tp not in repo_path_set:
            continue
        s_name = _slot_for_path(norm_tp)
        if target_worktree_name:
            if s_name != target_worktree_name or s_name in busy_slots:
                continue
        else:
            if not sweep_idle_worktrees and s_name not in targeted_slots:
                continue
            if not worker_slot_pattern.match(s_name):
                continue
            if s_name in busy_slots or s_name in active_run_retained_slots:
                continue
        handles_to_close.append((h_id, s_name, str(t_meta.get("title") or "")))
        seen_close_handles.add(h_id)

    closed_terminals = []
    if handles_to_close:
        def _close_one(item_tuple):
            h_id, s_name, t_title = item_tuple
            try:
                cp = subprocess.run(
                    [orca_bin, "terminal", "close", "--terminal", h_id, "--json"],
                    capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=6,
                )
                if cp.returncode == 0:
                    return {"handle": h_id, "worktree": s_name, "title": t_title, "closed": True}
            except Exception:
                pass
            return {"handle": h_id, "worktree": s_name, "title": t_title, "closed": False}

        with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=min(6, len(handles_to_close))) as pool:
            for c_item in pool.map(_close_one, handles_to_close):
                if c_item.get("closed"):
                    closed_terminals.append(c_item)

    return {
        "mainRoot": main_root_str,
        "runId": effective_run_id or None,
        "targetSlot": target_worktree_name or None,
        "releasedDispatches": released_results,
        "closedTerminals": closed_terminals,
        "busySlots": sorted(busy_slots),
    }


def _strip_leader_directives_in_child_worktree(child_wt, main_root, dry_run: bool = False) -> list[str]:
    """Gỡ bỏ các file chỉ dẫn dành riêng cho Leader (.agents/GEMINI.md, GEMINI.md, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md)
    bên trong Child Worktree của Worker để:
    1) Chống rò rỉ ~5,000–8,000 tokens/turn vào system prompt của Worker.
    2) Chống 'Role Poisoning' (chỉ dẫn Leader cấm dùng write_to_file/replace_file_content sẽ khóa tay Worker!).
    Nếu file đang được track bởi Git, đánh dấu `git update-index --skip-worktree` trước khi xóa để `git status --porcelain`
    trong Child Worktree luôn sạch 100% và không bao giờ commit lệnh xóa ngược về nhánh main.
    """
    import subprocess
    removed: list[str] = []
    try:
        child_wt_p = Path(child_wt)
        main_root_p = Path(main_root)
        c_res = child_wt_p.resolve()
        m_res = main_root_p.resolve()
        if c_res == m_res or not c_res.is_dir():
            return removed
    except Exception:
        return removed

    rel_candidates = (".agents/GEMINI.md", "GEMINI.md", "AGENTS.md", "CLAUDE.md")
    for rel_f in rel_candidates:
        p = child_wt_p / rel_f
        if not p.exists() and not p.is_symlink():
            continue
        is_orca_leader_file = rel_f == ".agents/GEMINI.md"
        if not is_orca_leader_file and p.is_symlink():
            try:
                tgt = os.readlink(p)
                if ".agents/GEMINI.md" in tgt:
                    is_orca_leader_file = True
            except Exception:
                pass
        if not is_orca_leader_file and p.is_file():
            try:
                head_txt = p.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore")[:1200]
                if ORCA_DIRECTIVE_MARKER in head_txt or "Principal Chief Architect & Lead Orchestrator" in head_txt:
                    is_orca_leader_file = True
            except Exception:
                pass
        if is_orca_leader_file:
            if dry_run:
                removed.append(rel_f)
                continue
            try:
                subprocess.run(
                    ["git", "-C", str(child_wt_p), "update-index", "--skip-worktree", "--", rel_f],
                    capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=2,
                )
            except Exception:
                pass
            try:
                p.unlink(missing_ok=True)
                removed.append(rel_f)
            except Exception:
                pass
    return removed


def resolve_elastic_worktree_slot(
    root: Path,
    role_input: str,
    reserve: bool = True,
    release_only: bool = False,
    check_exact_slot: str = "",
    clean_idle_tabs: bool = True,
    reservation_ttl_secs: float = 45.0,
    run_id: str = "",
    task_id: str = "",
) -> dict:
    """
    Cấp phát Worktree Slot tự động co giãn (Elastic Auto-Scale) kèm Khóa Sở Hữu theo Run (Run-Scoped Ownership):
    - Một slot đang WORKING hoặc đang RETAINED (ở Bước 3, chưa merge vào main & chưa release ở Bước 4)
      bởi một Run A sẽ bị KHÓA đối với mọi Leader/Run khác (Run B buộc phải nhảy sang <role>-worker-2, -3...).
    - Trong nội bộ CÙNG Run A (khi sửa lỗi vòng 2 hoặc re-test), Run A được ưu tiên tái sử dụng lại chính các slot
      đã settled của mình (Same-Run Affinity) để giữ nguyên các commit của Run A trên nhánh đó.
    - Khi một slot đã RELEASED ở Bước 4 được cấp phát mới cho một Run khác, hệ thống tự động đóng tab cũ
      và đồng bộ sạch về nhánh chính (main) trước khi giao.
    """
    from concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor
    import fcntl
    import sqlite3
    import subprocess
    import time

    if check_exact_slot:
        check_exact_slot = _extract_canonical_slot_name(check_exact_slot) or check_exact_slot.strip().lower()

    canonical, slot_hint = _resolve_role_and_slot(role_input)
    m_custom_prefix = re.match(r"^((?:hotfix-issue|review-pr)-\d+)(?:-(\d+))?$", slot_hint)
    if m_custom_prefix:
        base_wt = m_custom_prefix.group(1)
        min_slot = max(1, int(m_custom_prefix.group(2))) if m_custom_prefix.group(2) else 1
    else:
        base_wt = BASE_WORKTREE_MAP.get(canonical, "dev-worker")
        min_slot = 1
        if slot_hint != base_wt and slot_hint.startswith(base_wt + "-"):
            try:
                min_slot = max(1, int(slot_hint.rsplit("-", 1)[1]))
            except ValueError:
                min_slot = 1

    # 1. Xác định main_root và danh sách worktrees hiện có của git repo
    base_dir = (root or find_project_root() or Path.cwd()).resolve()
    main_root = base_dir
    existing_wt_paths = {}
    path_to_slot = {}
    try:
        subprocess.run(
            ["git", "-C", str(base_dir), "worktree", "prune"],
            capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=3,
        )
    except Exception:
        pass
    try:
        wt_res = subprocess.run(
            ["git", "-C", str(base_dir), "worktree", "list", "--porcelain"],
            capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=4,
        )
        if wt_res.returncode == 0 and wt_res.stdout:
            cur_wt = ""
            cur_br = ""
            first_seen = False
            for ln in wt_res.stdout.splitlines() + [""]:
                if ln.startswith("worktree "):
                    cur_wt = ln[9:].strip()
                    if not first_seen and cur_wt:
                        first_seen = True
                        try:
                            main_root = Path(cur_wt).resolve()
                        except Exception:
                            main_root = Path(cur_wt)
                elif ln.startswith("branch "):
                    cur_br = ln[7:].strip()
                elif not ln.strip() and cur_wt:
                    try:
                        wt_p = Path(cur_wt).resolve()
                    except Exception:
                        wt_p = Path(cur_wt)
                    if wt_p != main_root and wt_p.is_dir():
                        wt_str = str(wt_p)
                        br_short = cur_br[len("refs/heads/"):] if cur_br.startswith("refs/heads/") else ""
                        canon_slot = (
                            _extract_canonical_slot_name(br_short)
                            or _extract_canonical_slot_name(wt_p.name)
                            or br_short
                            or wt_p.name
                        )
                        path_to_slot[wt_str] = canon_slot
                        existing_wt_paths[wt_p.name] = wt_str
                        existing_wt_paths.setdefault(canon_slot, wt_str)
                        if br_short:
                            existing_wt_paths.setdefault(br_short, wt_str)
                    cur_wt = ""
                    cur_br = ""
    except Exception:
        pass

    def _slot_for_path(p_str: str, fallback_name: str = "") -> str:
        if not p_str:
            return _extract_canonical_slot_name(fallback_name) or fallback_name
        if p_str in path_to_slot:
            return path_to_slot[p_str]
        base_n = Path(p_str).name
        return _extract_canonical_slot_name(base_n) or base_n

    cache_dir = main_root / ".orca-cache"
    try:
        cache_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
    except Exception:
        cache_dir = Path("/tmp")
    lock_path = cache_dir / "slot-reservations.lock"
    res_path = cache_dir / "slot-reservations.json"

    busy_slots = set()
    hard_busy_slots = set()
    latest_done_epoch = {}
    chosen_slot = slot_hint if min_slot >= 2 else base_wt
    requested_slot_busy = False
    requested_slot_hard_busy = False

    lock_fd = None
    try:
        lock_fd = open(lock_path, "a+", encoding="utf-8")
        fcntl.flock(lock_fd.fileno(), fcntl.LOCK_EX)

        now = time.time()
        reservations = {}
        if res_path.is_file():
            try:
                raw_res = json.loads(res_path.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore"))
                if isinstance(raw_res, dict):
                    for k, v in raw_res.items():
                        canon_k = _extract_canonical_slot_name(k) or str(k)
                        if isinstance(v, (int, float)):
                            reservations[canon_k] = float(v)
                        elif isinstance(v, dict) and isinstance(v.get("ts"), (int, float)):
                            reservations[canon_k] = float(v["ts"])
            except Exception:
                reservations = {}

        if release_only:
            raw_role_clean = (role_input or "").strip().lower()
            if raw_role_clean in ("all", "*"):
                reservations.clear()
            elif min_slot >= 2 or raw_role_clean == base_wt:
                reservations.pop(slot_hint, None)
            else:
                for rk in list(reservations.keys()):
                    if rk == base_wt or rk.startswith(base_wt + "-"):
                        reservations.pop(rk, None)
            try:
                res_path.write_text(json.dumps(reservations, indent=2), encoding="utf-8")
            except Exception:
                pass
            return {
                "role": canonical,
                "slot": slot_hint,
                "released": True,
                "mainRoot": str(main_root),
            }

        # 2. Kiểm tra trạng thái toàn cục qua `orca worktree ps --json` và `orca orchestration run-list` song song
        env = _build_discovery_env()
        orca_bin = _find_cli_binary(["orca"], env) or "/usr/local/bin/orca"
        existing_path_set = set(existing_wt_paths.values())
        main_root_str = str(main_root)

        if os.path.exists(orca_bin):
            def _run_orca_cmd(cmd_args):
                try:
                    p = subprocess.run(cmd_args, capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=3.5)
                    if p.returncode == 0 and p.stdout.strip():
                        return json.loads(p.stdout)
                except Exception:
                    pass
                return {}

            with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=3) as init_pool:
                f_ps = init_pool.submit(_run_orca_cmd, [orca_bin, "worktree", "ps", "--json"])
                f_rl = init_pool.submit(_run_orca_cmd, [orca_bin, "orchestration", "run-list", "--json"])
                f_wl0 = init_pool.submit(_run_orca_cmd, [orca_bin, "orchestration", "worker-list", "--json"])
                ps_data = f_ps.result()
                rl_data = f_rl.result()
                wl0_data = f_wl0.result()

            try:
                ps_res = ps_data.get("result") if isinstance(ps_data, dict) else {}
                for wt_obj in (ps_res.get("worktrees") if isinstance(ps_res, dict) else None) or []:
                    if not isinstance(wt_obj, dict):
                        continue
                    raw_p = str(wt_obj.get("path") or "").strip()
                    norm_p = ""
                    if raw_p:
                        try:
                            norm_p = str(Path(raw_p).resolve())
                        except Exception:
                            norm_p = raw_p
                    parent_id = str(wt_obj.get("parentWorktreeId") or "").strip()
                    parent_p = parent_id.split("::", 1)[1] if "::" in parent_id else parent_id
                    if parent_p:
                        try:
                            parent_p = str(Path(parent_p).resolve())
                        except Exception:
                            pass
                    belongs_to_repo = (
                        (norm_p and norm_p in existing_path_set)
                        or (raw_p and raw_p in existing_path_set)
                        or (parent_p and parent_p == main_root_str)
                    )
                    if not belongs_to_repo:
                        continue
                    disp_n = str(wt_obj.get("displayName") or wt_obj.get("branch") or "").strip()
                    s_name = _slot_for_path(norm_p or raw_p, disp_n)
                    if not s_name:
                        continue
                    if norm_p and norm_p != main_root_str and Path(norm_p).is_dir():
                        path_to_slot.setdefault(norm_p, s_name)
                        existing_wt_paths.setdefault(s_name, norm_p)
                        existing_path_set.add(norm_p)
                    wt_st = str(wt_obj.get("status") or "").strip().lower()
                    agents_list = wt_obj.get("agents") if isinstance(wt_obj.get("agents"), list) else []
                    has_busy_ag = False
                    for ag_item in agents_list:
                        if not isinstance(ag_item, dict):
                            continue
                        ag_st = str(ag_item.get("state") or "").strip().lower()
                        if ag_st and ag_st not in ("done", "exited", "stopped", "failed", "cancelled", "canceled", "idle", "settled", "released"):
                            has_busy_ag = True
                        else:
                            ts_ms = max(
                                int(ag_item.get("updatedAt") or 0),
                                int(ag_item.get("stateStartedAt") or 0),
                            )
                            if ts_ms > 0:
                                latest_done_epoch[s_name] = max(latest_done_epoch.get(s_name, 0.0), ts_ms / 1000.0)
                    if wt_st in ("working", "running", "busy", "starting") or has_busy_ag:
                        busy_slots.add(s_name)
                        hard_busy_slots.add(s_name)
            except Exception:
                pass

            # 3. Kiểm tra bổ sung qua `orca orchestration worker-list` trên toàn bộ các Run đang hoạt động
            try:
                active_rids = []
                seen_ar = set()
                rl_runs = ((rl_data.get("result") or {}).get("runs") or []) if isinstance(rl_data, dict) else []
                for r_obj in rl_runs:
                    if not isinstance(r_obj, dict):
                        continue
                    rid = str(r_obj.get("id") or "").strip()
                    rst = str(r_obj.get("status") or "").strip().lower()
                    ch = str(r_obj.get("coordinator_handle") or "").strip()
                    if rid and rid not in seen_ar and (
                        rst in ("running", "active", "waiting", "pending")
                        or ch
                        or len(active_rids) < 2
                    ):
                        active_rids.append(rid)
                        seen_ar.add(rid)
                        if len(active_rids) >= 6:
                            break

                def _query_wl(r_id_opt: str):
                    try:
                        wp = subprocess.run(
                            [orca_bin, "orchestration", "worker-list", "--run", r_id_opt, "--json"],
                            capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=3,
                        )
                        if wp.returncode == 0 and wp.stdout.strip():
                            return ((json.loads(wp.stdout).get("result") or {}).get("workers") or [])
                    except Exception:
                        pass
                    return []

                all_w_items = list(((wl0_data.get("result") or {}).get("workers") or []) if isinstance(wl0_data, dict) else [])
                if active_rids:
                    with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=min(6, len(active_rids))) as pool:
                        for w_list in pool.map(_query_wl, active_rids):
                            all_w_items.extend(w_list)

                for w_item in all_w_items:
                    if not isinstance(w_item, dict):
                        continue
                    res_obj = w_item.get("resource") if isinstance(w_item.get("resource"), dict) else {}
                    ws_id = str(res_obj.get("worktreeId") or w_item.get("worktreeId") or "").strip()
                    wt_part = ws_id.split("::", 1)[1] if "::" in ws_id else ws_id
                    norm_wt_part = ""
                    if wt_part:
                        try:
                            norm_wt_part = str(Path(wt_part).resolve())
                        except Exception:
                            norm_wt_part = wt_part
                    if norm_wt_part not in existing_path_set and wt_part not in existing_path_set:
                        continue
                    s_name = _slot_for_path(norm_wt_part or wt_part)
                    st = str(w_item.get("workerState") or w_item.get("state") or "").strip().lower()
                    d_st = str(w_item.get("dispatchStatus") or "").strip().lower()
                    t_st = str(w_item.get("terminalState") or res_obj.get("terminalState") or "").strip().lower()
                    lv = str((w_item.get("liveness") or {}).get("verdict") or "").strip().lower()
                    is_dead = (
                        st in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "timed_out", "settled", "completed", "cancelled", "canceled", "released")
                        or d_st in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "timed_out", "completed", "cancelled", "canceled")
                        or t_st in ("released", "closed", "exited")
                        or lv in ("exited", "dead")
                    )
                    if not is_dead and s_name:
                        busy_slots.add(s_name)
                        hard_busy_slots.add(s_name)
            except Exception:
                pass

        # 3b. Kiểm tra Khóa Sở Hữu theo Run (Run-Scoped Ownership) & Same-Run Affinity qua SQLite orchestration.db (~3ms):
        #     - Slot đang WORKING hoặc RETAINED (ownership_state='owned' / release_state='retained') của Run A
        #       bị KHÓA cứng đối với mọi Run B khác cho tới khi Run A hoàn tất Bước 4 (release-workers).
        #     - Trong nội bộ cùng Run A (vá lỗi vòng 2 / re-test), ưu tiên tái sử dụng lại chính slot đã settled của Run A.
        caller_run_id = (run_id or os.environ.get("ORCA_RUN_ID") or "").strip()
        caller_task_id = (task_id or "").strip()
        task_slot_hint = ""
        same_run_owned_slots: list[str] = []
        locked_by_run: dict[str, str] = {}
        role_prefix_target = base_wt.split("-worker")[0]

        db_path = _find_orca_orchestration_db()
        if db_path is not None:
            try:
                conn = sqlite3.connect(f"file:{db_path}?mode=ro", uri=True, timeout=1.5)
                conn.row_factory = sqlite3.Row

                if caller_task_id:
                    t_row = conn.execute(
                        "SELECT run_id, task_title, spec FROM tasks WHERE id = ? LIMIT 1",
                        (caller_task_id,),
                    ).fetchone()
                    if t_row:
                        if not caller_run_id:
                            caller_run_id = str(t_row["run_id"] or "").strip()
                        combined_txt = f"{t_row['task_title'] or ''} {t_row['spec'] or ''}"
                        m_sh = re.findall(rf"\b({re.escape(base_wt)}(?:-\d+)?)\b", combined_txt)
                        for cand_sh in reversed(m_sh):
                            if cand_sh != base_wt or len(m_sh) == 1:
                                task_slot_hint = cand_sh
                                break

                d_rows = conn.execute(
                    """
                    SELECT dc.run_id, dc.id AS dispatch_id, dc.task_id, dc.status AS dc_status,
                           CAST(strftime('%s', dc.created_at) AS INTEGER) AS created_epoch,
                           wd.state AS wd_state, wd.worktree_id,
                           wtr.ownership_state, wtr.release_state
                    FROM dispatch_contexts dc
                    LEFT JOIN worker_dispatches wd ON wd.dispatch_id = dc.id
                    LEFT JOIN worker_terminal_resources wtr ON (wtr.owner_dispatch_id = dc.id OR wtr.origin_dispatch_id = dc.id)
                    ORDER BY dc.created_at DESC LIMIT 200
                    """
                ).fetchall()

                repo_dispatches: list[dict] = []
                repo_run_ids: list[str] = []
                dispatched_tids: set[str] = set()
                user_ws_prefix = f"/Users/{os.environ.get('USER', 'macbook')}/orca/workspaces/{main_root.name}/"

                for dr in d_rows:
                    ws_id = str(dr["worktree_id"] or "").strip()
                    wt_part = ws_id.split("::", 1)[1] if "::" in ws_id else ws_id
                    if wt_part.startswith("path:"):
                        wt_part = wt_part[5:]
                    norm_wt = os.path.realpath(wt_part) if (wt_part and os.path.isabs(wt_part)) else wt_part
                    belongs = (
                        (norm_wt and norm_wt in existing_path_set)
                        or (wt_part and wt_part in existing_path_set)
                        or (norm_wt and norm_wt.startswith(user_ws_prefix))
                    )
                    if not belongs:
                        continue
                    rid_d = str(dr["run_id"] or "").strip()
                    tid_d = str(dr["task_id"] or "").strip()
                    if tid_d:
                        dispatched_tids.add(tid_d)
                    if rid_d and rid_d not in repo_run_ids:
                        repo_run_ids.append(rid_d)
                    s_name = _slot_for_path(norm_wt or wt_part)
                    if s_name and norm_wt and norm_wt != main_root_str and Path(norm_wt).is_dir():
                        existing_wt_paths.setdefault(s_name, norm_wt)
                        existing_path_set.add(norm_wt)
                    dc_st = str(dr["dc_status"] or "").strip().lower()
                    wd_st = str(dr["wd_state"] or "").strip().lower()
                    own_st = str(dr["ownership_state"] or "").strip().lower()
                    rel_st = str(dr["release_state"] or "").strip().lower()
                    is_settled = wd_st in ("succeeded", "failed", "canceled", "cancelled", "blocked", "stopped", "timed_out") or dc_st in (
                        "completed",
                        "failed",
                        "cancelled",
                        "canceled",
                    )
                    try:
                        c_epoch = int(dr["created_epoch"] or 0)
                    except Exception:
                        c_epoch = 0
                    repo_dispatches.append({
                        "runId": rid_d,
                        "dispatchId": str(dr["dispatch_id"] or ""),
                        "taskId": tid_d,
                        "slot": s_name,
                        "isSettled": is_settled,
                        "ownershipState": own_st,
                        "releaseState": rel_st,
                        "createdEpoch": c_epoch,
                    })

                # Nếu chưa truyền --run / --task, tự động suy luận caller_run_id từ các task `ready` chưa dispatch của role này
                if not caller_run_id and repo_run_ids:
                    placeholders = ",".join("?" for _ in repo_run_ids[:12])
                    t_rows = conn.execute(
                        f"SELECT id, run_id, task_title, spec, status, created_at FROM tasks WHERE run_id IN ({placeholders}) ORDER BY created_at ASC",
                        tuple(repo_run_ids[:12]),
                    ).fetchall()
                else:
                    t_rows = []
                    if not repo_run_ids:
                        # Có thể là Run hoàn toàn mới chưa có dispatch nào trên repo
                        t_rows = conn.execute(
                            "SELECT id, run_id, task_title, spec, status, created_at FROM tasks WHERE status = 'ready' ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 20"
                        ).fetchall()

                ready_role_runs: list[str] = []
                ready_role_tasks: list[ sqlite3.Row ] = []
                for tr in t_rows:
                    tid_r = str(tr["id"] or "").strip()
                    rid_r = str(tr["run_id"] or "").strip()
                    st_r = str(tr["status"] or "").strip().lower()
                    if st_r == "ready" and tid_r not in dispatched_tids:
                        t_pref = _infer_task_role_prefix(str(tr["task_title"] or ""), str(tr["spec"] or ""))
                        if t_pref == role_prefix_target:
                            ready_role_tasks.append(tr)
                            if rid_r and rid_r not in ready_role_runs:
                                ready_role_runs.append(rid_r)

                if not caller_run_id and len(ready_role_runs) == 1:
                    caller_run_id = ready_role_runs[0]
                    if not task_slot_hint:
                        for tr in ready_role_tasks:
                            combined_txt = f"{tr['task_title'] or ''} {tr['spec'] or ''}"
                            m_sh = re.findall(rf"\b({re.escape(base_wt)}-\d+)\b", combined_txt)
                            for cand_sh in m_sh:
                                if cand_sh not in reservations:
                                    task_slot_hint = cand_sh
                                    break
                            if task_slot_hint:
                                break

                # Xác định các Run vẫn đang giữ tài nguyên (unreleased): còn worker đang chạy HOẶC còn worker owned/retained trong 6h gần nhất
                now_sec = int(now)
                unreleased_runs: set[str] = set()
                for d_item in repo_dispatches:
                    rid_d = d_item["runId"]
                    if not rid_d:
                        continue
                    if not d_item["isSettled"]:
                        unreleased_runs.add(rid_d)
                    elif d_item["ownershipState"] == "owned" and d_item["releaseState"] != "released":
                        if d_item["createdEpoch"] <= 0 or (now_sec - d_item["createdEpoch"]) < 6 * 3600:
                            unreleased_runs.add(rid_d)

                # Ánh xạ mỗi slot tới Run đang sở hữu nó (ưu tiên dispatch mới nhất còn owned/retained hoặc đang chạy)
                slot_owner_map: dict[str, str] = {}
                for d_item in repo_dispatches:
                    s_n = d_item["slot"]
                    rid_d = d_item["runId"]
                    if not s_n or not rid_d:
                        continue
                    if not d_item["isSettled"]:
                        busy_slots.add(s_n)
                        hard_busy_slots.add(s_n)
                        slot_owner_map.setdefault(s_n, rid_d)
                    elif (
                        rid_d in unreleased_runs
                        and d_item["ownershipState"] == "owned"
                        and d_item["releaseState"] != "released"
                    ):
                        slot_owner_map.setdefault(s_n, rid_d)

                for s_n, owner_rid in slot_owner_map.items():
                    if not caller_run_id or caller_run_id != owner_rid:
                        # Slot đang thuộc quyền sở hữu (WORKING hoặc RETAINED chưa merge vào main) của một Leader/Run khác!
                        busy_slots.add(s_n)
                        hard_busy_slots.add(s_n)
                        locked_by_run[s_n] = owner_rid
                    else:
                        # Cùng thuộc caller_run_id và đã settled: ưu tiên tái sử dụng lại cho chính Run này (Same-Run Affinity)
                        if s_n not in hard_busy_slots and (s_n == base_wt or s_n.startswith(base_wt + "-")):
                            if s_n not in same_run_owned_slots:
                                same_run_owned_slots.append(s_n)

                def _slot_sort_key(s_val: str) -> int:
                    if s_val == base_wt:
                        return 1
                    try:
                        return int(s_val.rsplit("-", 1)[1])
                    except Exception:
                        return 999

                same_run_owned_slots.sort(key=_slot_sort_key)
                conn.close()
            except Exception:
                pass

        # 4. Áp dụng bảng đặt chỗ tạm thời (chống race condition khi fan-out nhiều lệnh worker-start liên tiếp)
        cleaned_reservations = {}
        for s_key, r_ts in reservations.items():
            age = now - r_ts
            done_ts = latest_done_epoch.get(s_key, 0.0)
            # Nếu agent trong slot vừa hoàn tất SAU thời điểm đặt chỗ và đã qua ít nhất 8s, giải phóng sớm
            if age < reservation_ttl_secs and not (age >= 8.0 and done_ts > r_ts + 1.0 and s_key not in hard_busy_slots):
                cleaned_reservations[s_key] = r_ts
                busy_slots.add(s_key)

        if check_exact_slot:
            requested_slot_hard_busy = check_exact_slot in hard_busy_slots
            # Đối với `--check-slot` (do PreToolUse guard gọi):
            # - Nếu slot đang thực sự chạy worker hoặc đang bị khóa bởi Run khác (`hard_busy_slots`), báo bận ngay.
            # - Nếu chỉ có reservation mềm: chỉ coi là bận nếu reservation mới tạo trong < 3.0s (hai lệnh fan-out sát nhau);
            #   nếu reservation đã > 3.0s mà chưa có worker thực sự chạy trên slot đó (ví dụ gọi `orca-team worktree-arg`
            #   trước rồi mới gọi `worker-start`), cho phép sử dụng để tránh tự chặn chính mình.
            res_age = (now - cleaned_reservations[check_exact_slot]) if check_exact_slot in cleaned_reservations else 999.0
            requested_slot_busy = requested_slot_hard_busy or (res_age < 3.0)

        picked_own = ""
        if task_slot_hint and task_slot_hint in same_run_owned_slots and task_slot_hint not in busy_slots:
            picked_own = task_slot_hint
        elif min_slot == 1:
            for s_own in same_run_owned_slots:
                if s_own not in busy_slots:
                    picked_own = s_own
                    break

        if picked_own:
            chosen_slot = picked_own
        else:
            for k in range(min_slot, min_slot + 32):
                cand_slot = base_wt if k == 1 else f"{base_wt}-{k}"
                if cand_slot not in busy_slots:
                    chosen_slot = cand_slot
                    break

        if check_exact_slot and not requested_slot_busy:
            chosen_slot = check_exact_slot

        if reserve and (not check_exact_slot or not requested_slot_busy):
            cleaned_reservations[chosen_slot] = now
        try:
            res_path.write_text(json.dumps(cleaned_reservations, indent=2), encoding="utf-8")
        except Exception:
            pass
    finally:
        if lock_fd is not None:
            try:
                fcntl.flock(lock_fd.fileno(), fcntl.LOCK_UN)
            except Exception:
                pass
            try:
                lock_fd.close()
            except Exception:
                pass

    has_commit = True
    try:
        hc = subprocess.run(
            ["git", "-C", str(main_root), "rev-parse", "--verify", "HEAD"],
            capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=2,
        )
        has_commit = hc.returncode == 0
    except Exception:
        has_commit = True

    existing_path = existing_wt_paths.get(chosen_slot)
    # Khi tái sử dụng một worktree đã tồn tại và đang rảnh để chạy task mới:
    # 1) Đóng các tab worker cũ (state=done) trên worktree đó để tránh chồng chất nhiều tab cũ.
    # 2) Nếu worktree này là một slot đã RELEASED từ Run cũ (không thuộc same_run_owned_slots của Run hiện tại)
    #    và working tree đang sạch (git status --porcelain rỗng), tự động đồng bộ sạch về nhánh chính (main)
    #    để không bao giờ bị lẫn commit thử nghiệm từ các Run cũ!
    if (
        clean_idle_tabs
        and reserve
        and existing_path
        and Path(existing_path).is_dir()
        and (not check_exact_slot or not requested_slot_busy)
    ):
        try:
            release_settled_worker_terminals(
                main_root,
                target_worktree_name=chosen_slot,
                ignore_reserved_slot=chosen_slot,
                sweep_idle_worktrees=False,
            )
        except Exception:
            pass
        if chosen_slot not in same_run_owned_slots:
            try:
                st_proc = subprocess.run(
                    ["git", "-C", str(existing_path), "status", "--porcelain"],
                    capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=3,
                )
                if st_proc.returncode == 0 and not st_proc.stdout.strip():
                    main_br_proc = subprocess.run(
                        ["git", "-C", str(main_root), "rev-parse", "--abbrev-ref", "HEAD"],
                        capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=2,
                    )
                    main_br_name = (main_br_proc.stdout or "").strip() or "main"
                    if main_br_name != "HEAD":
                        if role_prefix_target in ("qa", "sec", "bench", "critic", "re"):
                            subprocess.run(
                                ["git", "-C", str(existing_path), "reset", "--hard", main_br_name],
                                capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=4,
                            )
                        else:
                            # Với dev/ui/devops: nếu HEAD hiện tại đã nằm trong main (đã merge ở Bước 4) thì reset sạch về main,
                            # hoặc fast-forward/merge main để bắt đầu trên nền code mới nhất
                            anc_proc = subprocess.run(
                                ["git", "-C", str(existing_path), "merge-base", "--is-ancestor", "HEAD", main_br_name],
                                capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=2,
                            )
                            if anc_proc.returncode == 0:
                                subprocess.run(
                                    ["git", "-C", str(existing_path), "reset", "--hard", main_br_name],
                                    capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=4,
                                )
                            else:
                                subprocess.run(
                                    ["git", "-C", str(existing_path), "merge", "--no-edit", main_br_name],
                                    capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=5,
                                )
            except Exception:
                pass

    for wt_p in set(existing_wt_paths.values()):
        if wt_p and Path(wt_p).is_dir():
            _strip_leader_directives_in_child_worktree(Path(wt_p), main_root)

    if not has_commit:
        wt_args = ["--worktree", "current"]
        existing_path = None
    elif existing_path and Path(existing_path).is_dir():
        wt_args = ["--worktree", f"path:{existing_path}"]
    else:
        existing_path = None
        has_pkg = (main_root / "package.json").is_file()
        wt_args = ["--worktree", "new-child", "--name", chosen_slot] + ([] if has_pkg else ["--setup", "skip"])

    return {
        "role": canonical,
        "baseWorktree": base_wt,
        "slot": chosen_slot,
        "requestedSlot": check_exact_slot or None,
        "slotBusy": requested_slot_busy if check_exact_slot else False,
        "hardBusy": requested_slot_hard_busy if check_exact_slot else False,
        "lockedByRun": locked_by_run.get(check_exact_slot) if check_exact_slot else None,
        "callerRunId": caller_run_id or None,
        "sameRunOwnedSlots": same_run_owned_slots,
        "exists": bool(existing_path),
        "path": existing_path,
        "args": wt_args,
        "argString": " ".join(wt_args),
        "busySlots": sorted(busy_slots),
        "hardBusySlots": sorted(hard_busy_slots),
        "mainRoot": str(main_root),
    }


def cmd_worktree_arg(root: Path, args: list):
    """
    CLI: orca-team worktree-arg <role> [--task <TASK_ID>] [--run <RUN_ID>] [--slot-only] [--no-reserve] [--release] [--check-slot <slot>] [--json]
    Trả về chuỗi đối số --worktree cho `orca orchestration worker-start`:
    - Khi slot hiện có đang rảnh (RELEASED hoặc thuộc cùng Run đã settled): tự động đóng tab worker cũ (done) và trả về `--worktree path:/abs/path/to/<role>-worker`
    - Khi slot hiện có đang bận (WORKING hoặc đang RETAINED bởi Run của Leader khác): tự động đẻ/chọn slot kế tiếp (`--worktree new-child --name <role>-worker-2 [--setup skip]` hoặc `path:...`)
    """
    role_arg = "dev"
    slot_only = False
    reserve = True
    release_only = False
    check_exact_slot = ""
    run_id = ""
    task_id = ""
    as_json = False
    target_root = root

    idx = 0
    while idx < len(args):
        tok = args[idx]
        if tok in ("-h", "--help", "help"):
            print("Sử dụng: orca-team worktree-arg <role> [--task <TASK_ID>] [--run <RUN_ID>] [--slot-only] [--no-reserve] [--release] [--check-slot <slot>] [--json]")
            print("Ví dụ:   orca orchestration worker-start --task <ID> $(orca-team worktree-arg dev --task <ID>) --agent antigravity --json")
            return
        elif tok in ("--slot-only", "--slot", "--name-only"):
            slot_only = True
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--no-reserve", "--peek", "--dry-run"):
            reserve = False
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--release", "--unreserve"):
            release_only = True
            idx += 1
        elif tok == "--check-slot" and idx + 1 < len(args):
            check_exact_slot = args[idx + 1].strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--check-slot="):
            check_exact_slot = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--run", "--run-id") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            run_id = args[idx + 1].strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--run=") or tok.startswith("--run-id="):
            run_id = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--task", "--task-id", "-t") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            task_id = args[idx + 1].strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--task=") or tok.startswith("--task-id="):
            task_id = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok == "--json":
            as_json = True
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--path", "-C") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            cand = Path(args[idx + 1]).expanduser()
            if cand.is_dir():
                target_root = cand.resolve()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--path="):
            p_val = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            if p_val and Path(p_val).expanduser().is_dir():
                target_root = Path(p_val).expanduser().resolve()
            idx += 1
        elif not tok.startswith("-"):
            role_arg = tok
            idx += 1
        else:
            idx += 1

    info = resolve_elastic_worktree_slot(
        target_root,
        check_exact_slot or role_arg,
        reserve=reserve,
        release_only=release_only,
        check_exact_slot=check_exact_slot,
        run_id=run_id,
        task_id=task_id,
    )
    if as_json:
        print(json.dumps(info, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
    elif release_only or slot_only:
        print(info["slot"])
    else:
        print(info["argString"])


def cmd_release_workers(root: Path, args: list):
    """
    CLI: orca-team release-workers [--run <RUN_ID>] [--after-dispatch <ID,...>] [--worktree <SLOT>] [--quiet] [--json]
    Giải phóng toàn bộ Worker Dispatches đã hoàn tất của Run và đóng dứt điểm các Terminal Tabs cũ (`state=done`)
    trên các worker worktrees đang rảnh.
    """
    run_id = ""
    after_ids = []
    target_wt = ""
    quiet = False
    as_json = False
    target_root = root

    idx = 0
    while idx < len(args):
        tok = args[idx]
        if tok in ("-h", "--help", "help"):
            print("Sử dụng: orca-team release-workers [--run <RUN_ID>] [--worktree <SLOT>] [--quiet] [--json]")
            print("Giải phóng toàn bộ worker dispatches đã hoàn tất và đóng dứt điểm các tab worker cũ trên các worktree đang rảnh.")
            return
        elif tok == "--run" and idx + 1 < len(args):
            run_id = args[idx + 1].strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--run="):
            run_id = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok == "--after-dispatch" and idx + 1 < len(args):
            after_ids.extend([x.strip() for x in args[idx + 1].split(",") if x.strip()])
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--after-dispatch="):
            after_ids.extend([x.strip() for x in tok.split("=", 1)[1].split(",") if x.strip()])
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--worktree", "--slot") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            target_wt = args[idx + 1].strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--worktree=") or tok.startswith("--slot="):
            target_wt = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--quiet", "-q"):
            quiet = True
            idx += 1
        elif tok == "--json":
            as_json = True
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--path", "-C") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            cand = Path(args[idx + 1]).expanduser()
            if cand.is_dir():
                target_root = cand.resolve()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--path="):
            p_val = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            if p_val and Path(p_val).expanduser().is_dir():
                target_root = Path(p_val).expanduser().resolve()
            idx += 1
        elif tok.startswith("run_") and not run_id:
            run_id = tok.strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok.startswith("ctx_"):
            after_ids.append(tok.strip())
            idx += 1
        else:
            idx += 1

    res = release_settled_worker_terminals(
        target_root,
        run_id=run_id,
        after_dispatch_ids=after_ids or None,
        target_worktree_name=target_wt,
        sweep_idle_worktrees=True,
    )
    if quiet:
        return
    if as_json:
        print(json.dumps(res, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
        return
    rel_cnt = len(res.get("releasedDispatches") or [])
    cls_cnt = len(res.get("closedTerminals") or [])
    rid_lbl = f" (Run {res['runId']})" if res.get("runId") else ""
    print(f"✅ Đã giải phóng {rel_cnt} worker dispatch(es) và đóng dứt điểm {cls_cnt} tab terminal cũ{rid_lbl}.")
    for c_item in res.get("closedTerminals") or []:
        print(f"   • Đã đóng tab: {c_item.get('worktree')} / {c_item.get('title')} ({c_item.get('handle')})")


def _find_orca_orchestration_db() -> Path | None:
    """Tìm đường dẫn tới SQLite orchestration.db của Orca để truy vấn Run/Dispatch tức thì (~3ms)."""
    env_db = os.environ.get("ORCA_ORCHESTRATION_DB", "").strip()
    if env_db:
        p = Path(env_db).expanduser()
        if p.is_file():
            return p
    candidates = [
        Path.home() / "Library" / "Application Support" / "orca" / "orchestration.db",
        Path.home() / ".config" / "orca" / "orchestration.db",
    ]
    appdata = os.environ.get("APPDATA", "").strip()
    if appdata:
        candidates.append(Path(appdata) / "orca" / "orchestration.db")
    for c in candidates:
        if c.is_file():
            return c
    return None


def _infer_task_role_prefix(title: str, spec: str) -> str:
    """Suy luận tiền tố role ('dev', 'ui', 'fix', 'devops', 'qa', 'sec', 'bench', 're', 'critic', 'pr') từ spec hoặc title."""
    s_up = (spec or "").upper()
    if "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL FULL-STACK" in s_up or "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL DEV" in s_up or "[ROLE: DEVELOPER" in s_up:
        return "dev"
    if "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL UI/UX" in s_up or "[ROLE: UI" in s_up:
        return "ui"
    if "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL ISSUE RESOLVER" in s_up:
        return "fix"
    if "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL DEVOPS/SRE" in s_up:
        return "devops"
    if "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL QA/SDET" in s_up:
        return "qa"
    if "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL SECURITY AUDITOR" in s_up:
        return "sec"
    if "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL BENCHMARK & PERF" in s_up:
        return "bench"
    if "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL REVERSE ENGINEER" in s_up:
        return "re"
    if "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL RESEARCH" in s_up or "ADVERSARIAL CRITIC" in s_up:
        return "critic"
    if "[ROLE: PRINCIPAL PR REVIEWER" in s_up:
        return "pr"
    t_low = (title or "").strip().lower()
    m = re.match(r"^(dev|ui|fix|devops|qa|sec|security|bench|re|critic)(?:[-_\s\d:]|$)", t_low)
    if m:
        tok = m.group(1)
        return "sec" if tok == "security" else tok
    return ""


def _extract_user_task_from_spec(spec_str: str) -> str:
    """Trích xuất phần mô tả nhiệm vụ/Checklist Plan gốc của Leader từ chuỗi spec đã tiêm [ROLE: ...]."""
    raw = (spec_str or "").strip()
    if not raw:
        return ""
    m_critic = re.search(
        r"\]\s*Nhiệm vụ:\s*([\s\S]+?)\s*\(Spec tách riêng Triệu chứng[^\n)]*\)\.\s*Chuẩn",
        raw,
    )
    if m_critic:
        return m_critic.group(1).strip()
    m = re.search(
        r"\]\s*Nhiệm vụ:\s*([\s\S]+)\.\s*Chuẩn(?:\s+Quân Sư[^\n:]*)?\s*:",
        raw,
    )
    if m:
        return m.group(1).strip()
    return raw


def _ensure_orca_dir_git_excluded(main_root: Path):
    """Đảm bảo thư mục .orca/ được thêm vào .git/info/exclude để không bao giờ làm bẩn git status."""
    try:
        excl = Path(main_root) / ".git" / "info" / "exclude"
        if excl.parent.is_dir():
            cur = excl.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore") if excl.exists() else ""
            if ".orca/" not in cur.splitlines() and ".orca" not in cur.splitlines():
                with open(excl, "a", encoding="utf-8") as f:
                    if cur and not cur.endswith("\n"):
                        f.write("\n")
                    f.write(".orca/\n")
    except Exception:
        pass


def run_orca_json(orca_args: list, cwd: Path = None, timeout: int = 6) -> tuple[int, dict, str]:
    """Gọi `orca <orca_args>` và parse JSON output (tự động bóc tách lớp vỏ `result` nếu có)."""
    import subprocess

    cmd = ["orca", *[str(a) for a in (orca_args or [])]]
    try:
        proc = subprocess.run(
            cmd,
            cwd=str(cwd) if cwd else None,
            capture_output=True,
            text=True,
            timeout=timeout,
        )
    except (subprocess.TimeoutExpired, OSError) as e:
        return 124, {}, str(e)
    raw_out = (proc.stdout or "").strip()
    raw_err = (proc.stderr or "").strip()
    if not raw_out:
        return proc.returncode, {}, raw_err
    try:
        parsed = json.loads(raw_out)
        if isinstance(parsed, dict):
            inner = parsed.get("result")
            if isinstance(inner, dict):
                return proc.returncode, inner, raw_err
            return proc.returncode, parsed, raw_err
    except Exception:
        pass
    return proc.returncode, {}, raw_err or raw_out


def _has_active_reject_marker(text: str) -> bool:
    """Kiểm tra xem văn bản có chứa cờ từ chối P2P đang hoạt động (QA_REJECT / SEC_BLOCK / INCOMPLETE_PLAN)
    mà KHÔNG phải là câu thông báo đã khắc phục (vd: 'Fixed QA_REJECT', '0 QA_REJECT', 'Resolved SEC_BLOCK')."""
    if not text:
        return False
    if re.search(r"(?:QA_VERDICT|SECURITY_VERDICT)\s*:\s*(?:FAIL|BLOCK)\b", text, re.IGNORECASE):
        return True
    cleaned = re.sub(
        r"\b(?:fixed|resolved|address(?:ed)?|fix(?:ing)?|no|0|zero|without|clear(?:ed)?|pass(?:ed)?\s+after)\s+"
        r"(?:all\s+|the\s+|previous\s+)?(?:qa_reject|sec_block|incomplete_plan)\w*",
        "",
        text,
        flags=re.IGNORECASE,
    )
    return bool(re.search(r"\b(QA_REJECT|SEC_BLOCK|INCOMPLETE_PLAN)\b", cleaned, re.IGNORECASE))


def _classify_p2p_message(m_type: str, m_subj: str, m_body: str) -> str:
    """Phân loại bản tin P2P thành 'ready', 'reject', hoặc 'other'."""
    m_type_l = (m_type or "").strip().lower()
    subj_s = m_subj or ""
    body_s = m_body or ""
    combined = f"{subj_s}\n{body_s}"
    if _has_active_reject_marker(subj_s):
        return "reject"
    if re.search(r"(?:QA_VERDICT|SECURITY_VERDICT)\s*:\s*(?:FAIL|BLOCK)\b", combined, re.IGNORECASE):
        return "reject"
    if m_type_l == "handoff" and re.search(
        r"\b(DEV_READY|DEV HANDOFF|UI_READY|UI READY|INFRA_READY|INFRA READY|QA_FINAL|CONSENSUS_REACHED)\b|"
        r"(?:QA_VERDICT|SECURITY_VERDICT|PERF_VERDICT|CRITIC_VERDICT)\s*:\s*(?:PASS|CONSENSUS_REACHED)\b",
        combined,
        re.IGNORECASE,
    ):
        return "ready"
    if _has_active_reject_marker(body_s):
        return "reject"
    if m_type_l == "handoff":
        return "ready"
    return "other"


def _extract_msg_dispatch_and_task(
    m_obj,
    handle_to_disp: dict[str, str] | None = None,
    handle_to_task: dict[str, str] | None = None,
) -> tuple[str, str]:
    """Trích xuất (dispatch_id, task_id) của người gửi bản tin từ top-level fields, JSON `payload`, hoặc `from_handle`."""
    try:
        m_dict = m_obj if isinstance(m_obj, dict) else dict(m_obj)
    except Exception:
        return "", ""
    s_did = str(
        m_dict.get("fromDispatchId")
        or m_dict.get("from_dispatch_id")
        or m_dict.get("sender_dispatch_id")
        or m_dict.get("senderDispatchId")
        or m_dict.get("dispatch_id")
        or m_dict.get("dispatchId")
        or ""
    ).strip()
    s_tid = str(m_dict.get("task_id") or m_dict.get("taskId") or "").strip()

    raw_payload = m_dict.get("payload")
    payload_obj = None
    if isinstance(raw_payload, dict):
        payload_obj = raw_payload
    elif isinstance(raw_payload, str) and raw_payload.strip().startswith("{"):
        try:
            payload_obj = json.loads(raw_payload)
        except Exception:
            payload_obj = None
    if isinstance(payload_obj, dict):
        if not s_did:
            s_did = str(
                payload_obj.get("dispatchId")
                or payload_obj.get("dispatch_id")
                or payload_obj.get("fromDispatchId")
                or payload_obj.get("from_dispatch_id")
                or ""
            ).strip()
        if not s_tid:
            s_tid = str(payload_obj.get("taskId") or payload_obj.get("task_id") or "").strip()

    from_h = str(m_dict.get("from_handle") or m_dict.get("fromHandle") or m_dict.get("from") or "").strip()
    if from_h:
        norm_h = from_h[len("terminal:"):] if from_h.startswith("terminal:") else from_h
        cand_handles = (from_h, norm_h, f"terminal:{norm_h}")
        if not s_did and handle_to_disp:
            for ch in cand_handles:
                if ch in handle_to_disp and handle_to_disp[ch]:
                    s_did = handle_to_disp[ch]
                    break
        if not s_tid and handle_to_task:
            for ch in cand_handles:
                if ch in handle_to_task and handle_to_task[ch]:
                    s_tid = handle_to_task[ch]
                    break
    return s_did, s_tid


def resolve_run_upstream_branches(
    caller_dir: Path,
    run_id: str = "",
    dispatch_id: str = "",
    task_id: str = "",
    terminal_handle: str = "",
    caller_role: str = "",
    to_main: bool = False,
    allow_live: bool = False,
) -> dict:
    """
    Xác định danh sách các nhánh git worktree thuộc ĐÚNG Run của Leader hiện tại,
    đồng thời kiểm tra xem còn bất kỳ upstream worker nào (dev-worker*, ui-worker*, fix-worker*, devops-worker*)
    trong cùng Run đang chạy dở hoặc chưa được khởi chạy hay không.
    - Ngăn chặn QA/Sec/DevOps/Bench hoặc Leader (Step 4) merge nhầm nhánh của Leader khác khi chạy đa Leader.
    - Ngăn chặn QA/Sec/DevOps/Bench chạy hoặc merge sớm khi dev-worker-2 trong cùng Run vẫn đang làm việc.
    - Hỗ trợ chế độ P2P (khi dev-worker đang LIVE nhưng đã commit sạch và bắn bản tin `--type handoff` DEV_READY,
      hoặc khi truyền `--allow-live` / `--p2p`).
    """
    import sqlite3
    import subprocess

    caller_dir = Path(caller_dir).resolve()
    caller_wt_real = os.path.realpath(str(caller_dir))
    main_root = caller_dir
    git_wt_map: dict[str, str] = {}
    try:
        wt_res = subprocess.run(
            ["git", "-C", str(caller_dir), "worktree", "list", "--porcelain"],
            capture_output=True,
            text=True,
            timeout=4,
        )
        if wt_res.returncode == 0 and wt_res.stdout:
            cur_wt = ""
            cur_br = ""
            first_seen = False
            for ln in wt_res.stdout.splitlines() + [""]:
                if ln.startswith("worktree "):
                    cur_wt = ln[9:].strip()
                    if not first_seen and cur_wt:
                        first_seen = True
                        try:
                            main_root = Path(cur_wt).resolve()
                        except Exception:
                            main_root = Path(cur_wt)
                elif ln.startswith("branch "):
                    cur_br = ln[7:].strip()
                elif not ln.strip() and cur_wt:
                    wt_r = os.path.realpath(cur_wt)
                    br_short = cur_br[len("refs/heads/"):] if cur_br.startswith("refs/heads/") else ""
                    if not br_short and wt_r != os.path.realpath(str(main_root)):
                        br_short = _extract_canonical_slot_name(Path(cur_wt).name) or Path(cur_wt).name
                    git_wt_map[wt_r] = br_short
                    cur_wt = ""
                    cur_br = ""
    except Exception:
        pass

    main_root_real = os.path.realpath(str(main_root))
    main_branch = git_wt_map.get(main_root_real, "main")
    if not main_branch or main_branch == "HEAD":
        main_branch = "main"

    caller_branch = git_wt_map.get(caller_wt_real, "")
    is_in_worker_wt = caller_wt_real != main_root_real and caller_wt_real in git_wt_map

    for wt_r in git_wt_map:
        if wt_r != main_root_real and os.path.isdir(wt_r):
            _strip_leader_directives_in_child_worktree(Path(wt_r), main_root)

    norm_role = (caller_role or "").strip().lower()
    if norm_role in ROLE_ALIASES:
        canon_r = ROLE_ALIASES[norm_role]
        norm_role = BASE_WORKTREE_MAP.get(canon_r, "dev-worker").split("-worker")[0]
    elif norm_role.endswith("-worker"):
        norm_role = norm_role.split("-worker")[0]

    if not norm_role and not to_main and caller_branch:
        m_br = re.match(r"^([a-z]+)-worker(?:-\d+)?$", caller_branch)
        if m_br:
            norm_role = m_br.group(1)

    def _compute_role_prefixes(r_name: str, is_to_main: bool):
        if is_to_main or r_name in ("main", "leader", "coordinator"):
            all_p = ("dev", "ui", "fix", "devops", "qa", "sec", "bench")
            return all_p, all_p, all_p
        if r_name == "devops":
            p = ("dev", "ui", "fix")
            return p, p, p
        if r_name == "sec":
            return ("dev", "ui", "fix", "devops"), ("dev", "ui", "fix"), ("dev", "ui", "fix")
        # Mặc định cho qa, bench (hoặc bất kỳ downstream verifier nào)
        return ("dev", "ui", "fix", "devops"), ("dev", "ui", "fix", "devops"), ("dev", "ui", "fix")

    if to_main or norm_role in ("main", "leader", "coordinator"):
        to_main = True
        norm_role = "main"
    upstream_prefixes, active_blocking_prefixes, unstarted_blocking_prefixes = _compute_role_prefixes(norm_role, to_main)

    resolved_run_id = (run_id or "").strip()
    resolved_dispatch_id = (dispatch_id or "").strip()
    resolved_task_id = (task_id or "").strip()
    resolved_term = (terminal_handle or "").strip()

    run_objective = ""
    tasks_in_run: dict[str, dict] = {}
    dispatches_in_run: list[dict] = []
    p2p_handoff_dispatch_ids: set[str] = set()
    p2p_ready_handoff_ts: dict[str, float] = {}
    db_path = _find_orca_orchestration_db()
    used_sqlite = False

    _SETTLED_STATES = (
        "succeeded",
        "failed",
        "canceled",
        "cancelled",
        "blocked",
        "completed",
        "stopped",
        "timed_out",
        "abandoned",
        "circuit_broken",
    )
    _NON_SUCCESS_STATES = (
        "failed",
        "canceled",
        "cancelled",
        "blocked",
        "stopped",
        "timed_out",
        "abandoned",
        "circuit_broken",
    )

    def _to_epoch_secs(val) -> float:
        if val is None or isinstance(val, bool):
            return 0.0
        if isinstance(val, (int, float)):
            v = float(val)
            return v / 1000.0 if v > 1e11 else v
        s = str(val).strip()
        if not s:
            return 0.0
        try:
            v = float(s)
            return v / 1000.0 if v > 1e11 else v
        except Exception:
            pass
        try:
            if s.endswith("Z"):
                s = s[:-1] + "+00:00"
            dt = datetime.fromisoformat(s)
            if dt.tzinfo is None:
                dt = dt.replace(tzinfo=timezone.utc)
            return dt.timestamp()
        except Exception:
            return 0.0

    def _extract_slot_and_branch(wt_id_str: str) -> tuple[str, str, str]:
        raw = (wt_id_str or "").strip()
        if not raw:
            return "", "", ""
        wt_p = raw.split("::", 1)[-1] if "::" in raw else raw
        if wt_p.startswith("path:"):
            wt_p = wt_p[5:]
        wt_real = os.path.realpath(wt_p) if os.path.isabs(wt_p) else ""
        br = git_wt_map.get(wt_real, "") if wt_real else ""
        base_n = os.path.basename((wt_real or wt_p).rstrip("/"))
        slot = _extract_canonical_slot_name(br) or _extract_canonical_slot_name(base_n) or br or base_n
        if not br and slot and re.match(r"^[a-z]+-worker(?:-\d+)?$", slot):
            br = slot
        return wt_real, slot, br

    if db_path is not None:
        try:
            conn = sqlite3.connect(f"file:{db_path}?mode=ro", uri=True, timeout=1.5)
            conn.row_factory = sqlite3.Row
            used_sqlite = True

            if not resolved_run_id and resolved_dispatch_id:
                row = conn.execute(
                    "SELECT run_id, task_id FROM dispatch_contexts WHERE id = ? LIMIT 1",
                    (resolved_dispatch_id,),
                ).fetchone()
                if row:
                    resolved_run_id = str(row["run_id"] or "")
                    if not resolved_task_id:
                        resolved_task_id = str(row["task_id"] or "")

            if not resolved_run_id and resolved_task_id:
                row = conn.execute(
                    "SELECT run_id FROM tasks WHERE id = ? LIMIT 1",
                    (resolved_task_id,),
                ).fetchone()
                if row:
                    resolved_run_id = str(row["run_id"] or "")

            if not resolved_run_id and resolved_term:
                row = conn.execute(
                    """
                    SELECT dc.run_id, dc.id AS dispatch_id, dc.task_id
                    FROM worker_dispatches wd
                    JOIN dispatch_contexts dc ON dc.id = wd.dispatch_id
                    WHERE wd.agent_terminal_handle = ?
                    ORDER BY dc.created_at DESC LIMIT 1
                    """,
                    (resolved_term,),
                ).fetchone()
                if row:
                    resolved_run_id = str(row["run_id"] or "")
                    if not resolved_dispatch_id:
                        resolved_dispatch_id = str(row["dispatch_id"] or "")
                    if not resolved_task_id:
                        resolved_task_id = str(row["task_id"] or "")

            if not resolved_run_id and is_in_worker_wt:
                rows = conn.execute(
                    """
                    SELECT dc.run_id, dc.id AS dispatch_id, dc.task_id, dc.status, wd.state, wd.worktree_id
                    FROM dispatch_contexts dc
                    JOIN worker_dispatches wd ON wd.dispatch_id = dc.id
                    ORDER BY dc.created_at DESC LIMIT 80
                    """
                ).fetchall()
                fallback_row = None
                for r in rows:
                    wt_real, _, _ = _extract_slot_and_branch(str(r["worktree_id"] or ""))
                    if wt_real == caller_wt_real:
                        st = str(r["state"] or "").lower()
                        dc_st = str(r["status"] or "").lower()
                        if st in ("starting", "ready", "busy", "waiting") or dc_st == "dispatched":
                            resolved_run_id = str(r["run_id"] or "")
                            if not resolved_dispatch_id:
                                resolved_dispatch_id = str(r["dispatch_id"] or "")
                            if not resolved_task_id:
                                resolved_task_id = str(r["task_id"] or "")
                            break
                        if fallback_row is None:
                            fallback_row = r
                if not resolved_run_id and fallback_row is not None:
                    resolved_run_id = str(fallback_row["run_id"] or "")
                    if not resolved_dispatch_id:
                        resolved_dispatch_id = str(fallback_row["dispatch_id"] or "")
                    if not resolved_task_id:
                        resolved_task_id = str(fallback_row["task_id"] or "")

            if not resolved_run_id:
                # Tìm run gần nhất thuộc về main_root này (bao gồm cả Run vừa được tạo chưa có worker_dispatches)
                rows = conn.execute(
                    """
                    SELECT dc.run_id, wd.worktree_id, dc.created_at
                    FROM dispatch_contexts dc
                    JOIN worker_dispatches wd ON wd.dispatch_id = dc.id
                    ORDER BY dc.created_at DESC LIMIT 120
                    """
                ).fetchall()
                candidate_runs: list[str] = []
                cand_latest_ts: dict[str, int] = {}
                for r in rows:
                    rid = str(r["run_id"] or "")
                    wt_real, _, _ = _extract_slot_and_branch(str(r["worktree_id"] or ""))
                    if rid and wt_real and wt_real in git_wt_map:
                        if rid not in candidate_runs:
                            candidate_runs.append(rid)
                            try:
                                cand_latest_ts[rid] = int(r["created_at"] or 0)
                            except Exception:
                                cand_latest_ts[rid] = 0
                best_cand_rid = candidate_runs[0] if candidate_runs else ""
                best_cand_ts = cand_latest_ts.get(best_cand_rid, 0)

                # Kiểm tra xem có Run mới vừa được tạo (chưa có worker_dispatches nào) mới hơn best_cand_rid không
                newest_unstarted_rid = ""
                try:
                    r_rows = conn.execute(
                        """
                        SELECT r.id, r.created_at,
                               (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM dispatch_contexts dc WHERE dc.run_id = r.id) AS dc_cnt
                        FROM runs r
                        ORDER BY r.created_at DESC LIMIT 5
                        """
                    ).fetchall()
                    for rr in r_rows:
                        rr_id = str(rr["id"] or "")
                        rr_ts = int(rr["created_at"] or 0)
                        rr_dc_cnt = int(rr["dc_cnt"] or 0)
                        if rr_id and (Path(main_root_real) / ".orca" / "runs" / rr_id).is_dir():
                            if rr_ts >= best_cand_ts:
                                newest_unstarted_rid = rr_id
                                break
                        if rr_id and rr_dc_cnt == 0 and rr_ts > best_cand_ts:
                            newest_unstarted_rid = rr_id
                            break
                except Exception:
                    pass

                if newest_unstarted_rid:
                    resolved_run_id = newest_unstarted_rid
                elif best_cand_rid:
                    resolved_run_id = best_cand_rid
                else:
                    try:
                        r_row = conn.execute(
                            "SELECT id FROM runs ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 1"
                        ).fetchone()
                        if r_row:
                            resolved_run_id = str(r_row["id"] or "")
                    except Exception:
                        pass

            if resolved_run_id:
                try:
                    r_obj_row = conn.execute(
                        "SELECT objective FROM runs WHERE id = ? LIMIT 1",
                        (resolved_run_id,),
                    ).fetchone()
                    if r_obj_row:
                        run_objective = str(r_obj_row["objective"] or "")
                except Exception:
                    pass

                t_rows = conn.execute(
                    "SELECT id, task_title, spec, status, deps, created_at FROM tasks WHERE run_id = ? ORDER BY created_at ASC",
                    (resolved_run_id,),
                ).fetchall()
                for tr in t_rows:
                    tid = str(tr["id"] or "")
                    t_title = str(tr["task_title"] or "")
                    t_spec = str(tr["spec"] or "")
                    t_role = _infer_task_role_prefix(t_title, t_spec)
                    if tid == resolved_task_id and t_role and not caller_role and not to_main:
                        norm_role = t_role
                        upstream_prefixes, active_blocking_prefixes, unstarted_blocking_prefixes = _compute_role_prefixes(norm_role, to_main)
                    tasks_in_run[tid] = {
                        "id": tid,
                        "title": t_title,
                        "rolePrefix": t_role,
                        "status": str(tr["status"] or "").lower(),
                        "spec": t_spec,
                        "userTask": _extract_user_task_from_spec(t_spec),
                        "createdAt": tr["created_at"],
                    }

                d_rows = conn.execute(
                    """
                    SELECT dc.id AS dispatch_id, dc.task_id, dc.status AS dc_status, dc.created_at, dc.completed_at,
                           wd.state AS wd_state, wd.worktree_id, wd.agent_terminal_handle
                    FROM dispatch_contexts dc
                    LEFT JOIN worker_dispatches wd ON wd.dispatch_id = dc.id
                    WHERE dc.run_id = ?
                    ORDER BY dc.created_at ASC
                    """,
                    (resolved_run_id,),
                ).fetchall()
                for dr in d_rows:
                    did = str(dr["dispatch_id"] or "")
                    tid = str(dr["task_id"] or "")
                    dc_st = str(dr["dc_status"] or "").lower()
                    wd_st = str(dr["wd_state"] or "").lower()
                    wt_real, slot, br = _extract_slot_and_branch(str(dr["worktree_id"] or ""))
                    slot_prefix = ""
                    m_sp = re.match(r"^([a-z]+)-worker(?:-\d+)?$", slot or br)
                    if m_sp:
                        slot_prefix = m_sp.group(1)
                    if not slot_prefix and tid in tasks_in_run:
                        slot_prefix = tasks_in_run[tid].get("rolePrefix") or ""

                    is_settled = wd_st in _SETTLED_STATES or dc_st in _SETTLED_STATES
                    is_succeeded = wd_st == "succeeded" or (dc_st == "completed" and wd_st not in _NON_SUCCESS_STATES)
                    dispatches_in_run.append({
                        "dispatchId": did,
                        "taskId": tid,
                        "dcStatus": dc_st,
                        "state": wd_st or dc_st,
                        "isSettled": is_settled,
                        "isSucceeded": is_succeeded,
                        "worktreePath": wt_real,
                        "slotName": slot,
                        "branch": br,
                        "rolePrefix": slot_prefix,
                        "terminalHandle": str(dr["agent_terminal_handle"] or ""),
                        "createdAt": dr["created_at"],
                    })

                try:
                    m_rows = conn.execute(
                        """
                        SELECT from_handle, type, subject, body, payload, created_at
                        FROM messages
                        WHERE run_id = ? AND type IN ('handoff', 'escalation')
                        ORDER BY created_at ASC, rowid ASC
                        """,
                        (resolved_run_id,),
                    ).fetchall()
                    disp_role_map = {
                        str(d.get("dispatchId") or ""): str(d.get("rolePrefix") or "dev")
                        for d in dispatches_in_run
                        if d.get("dispatchId")
                    }
                    handle_to_disp: dict[str, str] = {}
                    for d in dispatches_in_run:
                        did_v = str(d.get("dispatchId") or "").strip()
                        th_v = str(d.get("terminalHandle") or "").strip()
                        if did_v and th_v:
                            norm_th = th_v[len("terminal:"):] if th_v.startswith("terminal:") else th_v
                            handle_to_disp[th_v] = did_v
                            handle_to_disp[norm_th] = did_v
                            handle_to_disp[f"terminal:{norm_th}"] = did_v
                    latest_reject_ts = 0.0
                    latest_ready_ts_by_disp: dict[str, float] = {}
                    for mr in m_rows:
                        fd_id, _ = _extract_msg_dispatch_and_task(mr, handle_to_disp=handle_to_disp)
                        m_type = str(mr["type"] or "").strip().lower()
                        m_subj = str(mr["subject"] or "")
                        m_body = str(mr["body"] or "")
                        m_ts = _to_epoch_secs(mr["created_at"])
                        msg_cls = _classify_p2p_message(m_type, m_subj, m_body)
                        if msg_cls == "reject":
                            if m_ts > latest_reject_ts:
                                latest_reject_ts = m_ts
                        elif msg_cls == "ready" and fd_id:
                            if m_ts >= latest_ready_ts_by_disp.get(fd_id, 0.0):
                                latest_ready_ts_by_disp[fd_id] = m_ts
                    max_ready_ts_by_grp: dict[str, float] = {}
                    for fd_id, r_ts in latest_ready_ts_by_disp.items():
                        r_pref = disp_role_map.get(fd_id, "dev")
                        r_grp = "builder" if r_pref in ("dev", "ui", "fix") else r_pref
                        if r_ts > max_ready_ts_by_grp.get(r_grp, 0.0):
                            max_ready_ts_by_grp[r_grp] = r_ts
                    for fd_id, r_ts in latest_ready_ts_by_disp.items():
                        r_pref = disp_role_map.get(fd_id, "dev")
                        r_grp = "builder" if r_pref in ("dev", "ui", "fix") else r_pref
                        if r_ts > 0 and max_ready_ts_by_grp.get(r_grp, 0.0) > latest_reject_ts:
                            p2p_handoff_dispatch_ids.add(fd_id)
                            p2p_ready_handoff_ts[fd_id] = r_ts
                except Exception:
                    pass
            conn.close()
        except Exception:
            used_sqlite = False

    if not used_sqlite:
        # Fallback qua Orca CLI nếu không đọc được SQLite
        if not resolved_run_id:
            rc_rl, out_rl, _ = run_orca_json(["orchestration", "run-list", "--json"], cwd=main_root, timeout=6)
            if rc_rl == 0 and isinstance(out_rl, dict):
                runs = out_rl.get("runs") if isinstance(out_rl.get("runs"), list) else []
                if runs and isinstance(runs[0], dict):
                    resolved_run_id = str(runs[0].get("id") or "")
                    run_objective = str(runs[0].get("objective") or "")
        if resolved_run_id:
            rc_tl, out_tl, _ = run_orca_json(
                ["orchestration", "task-list", "--run", resolved_run_id, "--json"],
                cwd=main_root,
                timeout=6,
            )
            if rc_tl == 0 and isinstance(out_tl, dict):
                t_list = out_tl.get("tasks") if isinstance(out_tl.get("tasks"), list) else []
                t_list_sorted = sorted(t_list, key=lambda x: _to_epoch_secs(x.get("createdAt")) if isinstance(x, dict) else 0.0)
                for tr in t_list_sorted:
                    if not isinstance(tr, dict):
                        continue
                    tid = str(tr.get("id") or "")
                    t_title = str(tr.get("title") or tr.get("taskTitle") or "")
                    t_spec = str(tr.get("spec") or "")
                    t_role = _infer_task_role_prefix(t_title, t_spec)
                    if tid == resolved_task_id and t_role and not caller_role and not to_main:
                        norm_role = t_role
                        upstream_prefixes, active_blocking_prefixes, unstarted_blocking_prefixes = _compute_role_prefixes(norm_role, to_main)
                    tasks_in_run[tid] = {
                        "id": tid,
                        "title": t_title,
                        "rolePrefix": t_role,
                        "status": str(tr.get("status") or "").lower(),
                        "spec": t_spec,
                        "userTask": _extract_user_task_from_spec(t_spec),
                        "createdAt": tr.get("createdAt"),
                    }

            rc_wl, out_wl, _ = run_orca_json(
                ["orchestration", "worker-list", "--run", resolved_run_id, "--json"],
                cwd=main_root,
                timeout=6,
            )
            if rc_wl == 0 and isinstance(out_wl, dict):
                w_list = out_wl.get("workers") if isinstance(out_wl.get("workers"), list) else []
                # Orca CLI worker-list trả về thứ tự mới nhất trước (DESC); cần đảo/sort tăng dần theo thời gian để giữ đúng latest_dispatch
                w_list_sorted = sorted(
                    enumerate(w_list),
                    key=lambda pair: (
                        _to_epoch_secs(pair[1].get("createdAt") or pair[1].get("startedAt")) if isinstance(pair[1], dict) else 0.0,
                        -pair[0],
                    ),
                )
                for _, w in w_list_sorted:
                    if not isinstance(w, dict):
                        continue
                    did = str(w.get("dispatchId") or w.get("id") or "")
                    tid = str(w.get("taskId") or "")
                    st = str(w.get("workerState") or w.get("state") or w.get("status") or "").lower()
                    res_obj = w.get("resource") if isinstance(w.get("resource"), dict) else {}
                    wt_id_val = str(res_obj.get("worktreeId") or w.get("worktreeId") or w.get("worktreePath") or "")
                    wt_real, slot, br = _extract_slot_and_branch(wt_id_val)
                    slot_prefix = ""
                    m_sp = re.match(r"^([a-z]+)-worker(?:-\d+)?$", slot or br)
                    if m_sp:
                        slot_prefix = m_sp.group(1)
                    if not slot_prefix and tid in tasks_in_run:
                        slot_prefix = tasks_in_run[tid].get("rolePrefix") or ""
                    is_settled = bool(w.get("isSettled")) or st in _SETTLED_STATES
                    is_succeeded = st in ("succeeded", "completed")
                    dispatches_in_run.append({
                        "dispatchId": did,
                        "taskId": tid,
                        "dcStatus": st,
                        "state": st,
                        "isSettled": is_settled,
                        "isSucceeded": is_succeeded,
                        "worktreePath": wt_real,
                        "slotName": slot,
                        "branch": br,
                        "rolePrefix": slot_prefix,
                        "terminalHandle": str(w.get("agentTerminalHandle") or ""),
                        "createdAt": w.get("createdAt") or w.get("startedAt"),
                    })

            rc_ml, out_ml, _ = run_orca_json(
                ["orchestration", "inbox", "--limit", "500", "--json"],
                cwd=main_root,
                timeout=6,
            )
            if rc_ml == 0 and isinstance(out_ml, dict):
                m_list = out_ml.get("messages") if isinstance(out_ml.get("messages"), list) else []
                m_list = [
                    m for m in m_list
                    if isinstance(m, dict) and (m.get("run_id") == resolved_run_id or m.get("runId") == resolved_run_id)
                ]
                m_list_sorted = sorted(
                    enumerate(m_list),
                    key=lambda pair: (
                        _to_epoch_secs(pair[1].get("createdAt") or pair[1].get("created_at")) if isinstance(pair[1], dict) else 0.0,
                        pair[0],
                    ),
                )
                disp_role_map = {
                    str(d.get("dispatchId") or ""): str(d.get("rolePrefix") or "dev")
                    for d in dispatches_in_run
                    if d.get("dispatchId")
                }
                handle_to_disp = {}
                for d in dispatches_in_run:
                    did_v = str(d.get("dispatchId") or "").strip()
                    th_v = str(d.get("terminalHandle") or "").strip()
                    if did_v and th_v:
                        norm_th = th_v[len("terminal:"):] if th_v.startswith("terminal:") else th_v
                        handle_to_disp[th_v] = did_v
                        handle_to_disp[norm_th] = did_v
                        handle_to_disp[f"terminal:{norm_th}"] = did_v
                latest_reject_ts = 0.0
                latest_ready_ts_by_disp: dict[str, float] = {}
                for _, mr in m_list_sorted:
                    if not isinstance(mr, dict):
                        continue
                    m_type = str(mr.get("type") or "").strip().lower()
                    if m_type not in ("handoff", "escalation"):
                        continue
                    fd_id, _ = _extract_msg_dispatch_and_task(mr, handle_to_disp=handle_to_disp)
                    m_subj = str(mr.get("subject") or "")
                    m_body = str(mr.get("body") or "")
                    m_ts = _to_epoch_secs(mr.get("createdAt") or mr.get("created_at"))
                    msg_cls = _classify_p2p_message(m_type, m_subj, m_body)
                    if msg_cls == "reject":
                        if m_ts > latest_reject_ts:
                            latest_reject_ts = m_ts
                    elif msg_cls == "ready" and fd_id:
                        if m_ts >= latest_ready_ts_by_disp.get(fd_id, 0.0):
                            latest_ready_ts_by_disp[fd_id] = m_ts
                max_ready_ts_by_grp: dict[str, float] = {}
                for fd_id, r_ts in latest_ready_ts_by_disp.items():
                    r_pref = disp_role_map.get(fd_id, "dev")
                    r_grp = "builder" if r_pref in ("dev", "ui", "fix") else r_pref
                    if r_ts > max_ready_ts_by_grp.get(r_grp, 0.0):
                        max_ready_ts_by_grp[r_grp] = r_ts
                for fd_id, r_ts in latest_ready_ts_by_disp.items():
                    r_pref = disp_role_map.get(fd_id, "dev")
                    r_grp = "builder" if r_pref in ("dev", "ui", "fix") else r_pref
                    if r_ts > 0 and max_ready_ts_by_grp.get(r_grp, 0.0) > latest_reject_ts:
                        p2p_handoff_dispatch_ids.add(fd_id)
                        p2p_ready_handoff_ts[fd_id] = r_ts

    def _is_live_dispatch_p2p_ready(d_item: dict) -> bool:
        """Kiểm tra xem một upstream dispatch đang LIVE có đủ điều kiện P2P-Ready để downstream merge hay không:
        1. Đã gửi bản tin `--type handoff` (vd: DEV_READY) sau bất kỳ bản tin QA_REJECT/SEC_BLOCK nào trong Run HOẶC caller truyền `--allow-live`/`--p2p`.
        2. Nhánh git của worker đó đã có ít nhất 1 commit mới hơn `main_branch`, commit HEAD không mới hơn thời điểm gửi DEV_READY (tránh merge WIP commit ở vòng tiếp theo), và worktree sạch.
        """
        did_s = str(d_item.get("dispatchId") or "")
        br_s = str(d_item.get("branch") or "")
        wt_s = str(d_item.get("worktreePath") or "")
        if not br_s or br_s == main_branch:
            return False
        if to_main and not allow_live:
            return False
        if not allow_live and did_s not in p2p_handoff_dispatch_ids:
            return False
        try:
            rev_proc = subprocess.run(
                ["git", "-C", str(main_root), "rev-list", "--count", f"{main_branch}..{br_s}"],
                capture_output=True,
                text=True,
                timeout=3,
            )
            ahead_cnt = int((rev_proc.stdout or "0").strip() or "0") if rev_proc.returncode == 0 else 0
            if ahead_cnt <= 0:
                return False
            if not allow_live and did_s in p2p_ready_handoff_ts and p2p_ready_handoff_ts[did_s] > 0:
                ct_proc = subprocess.run(
                    ["git", "-C", str(main_root), "log", "-1", "--format=%ct", br_s],
                    capture_output=True,
                    text=True,
                    timeout=3,
                )
                if ct_proc.returncode == 0:
                    head_ct = _to_epoch_secs((ct_proc.stdout or "0").strip())
                    if head_ct > p2p_ready_handoff_ts[did_s] + 10.0:
                        return False
            if wt_s and os.path.isdir(wt_s):
                st_proc = subprocess.run(
                    ["git", "-C", wt_s, "status", "--porcelain"],
                    capture_output=True,
                    text=True,
                    timeout=3,
                )
                if st_proc.returncode == 0 and (st_proc.stdout or "").strip():
                    return False
            return True
        except Exception:
            return False

    # Phân tích trạng thái upstream trong Run này
    blocking_active_upstream: list[dict] = []
    blocking_unstarted_upstream: list[dict] = []
    blocking_failed_upstream: list[dict] = []
    upstream_branches: list[str] = []
    upstream_dispatches: list[dict] = []

    dispatched_task_ids: set[str] = set()
    succeeded_task_ids: set[str] = set()
    succeeded_role_prefixes: set[str] = set()
    latest_dispatch_by_task: dict[str, dict] = {}
    latest_dispatch_by_slot: dict[str, dict] = {}

    for d in dispatches_in_run:
        tid = d.get("taskId") or ""
        slot_k = d.get("slotName") or d.get("branch") or d.get("dispatchId") or ""
        if not d.get("isSettled"):
            d["isP2PReady"] = _is_live_dispatch_p2p_ready(d)
        else:
            d["isP2PReady"] = False
        if slot_k:
            latest_dispatch_by_slot[slot_k] = d
        if tid:
            dispatched_task_ids.add(tid)
            latest_dispatch_by_task[tid] = d
        if d.get("isSucceeded") or d.get("isP2PReady"):
            if tid:
                succeeded_task_ids.add(tid)
            if d.get("rolePrefix"):
                succeeded_role_prefixes.add(d["rolePrefix"])

    for d in latest_dispatch_by_slot.values():
        did = d.get("dispatchId") or ""
        tid = d.get("taskId") or ""
        r_pref = d.get("rolePrefix") or ""
        br = d.get("branch") or ""

        # Bỏ qua chính dispatch/task hoặc nhánh hiện tại của caller
        if (resolved_dispatch_id and did == resolved_dispatch_id) or (resolved_task_id and tid == resolved_task_id):
            continue
        if is_in_worker_wt and caller_branch and br == caller_branch:
            continue

        if r_pref in active_blocking_prefixes:
            if not d.get("isSettled") and not d.get("isP2PReady"):
                blocking_active_upstream.append({
                    "dispatchId": did,
                    "taskId": tid,
                    "slot": d.get("slotName") or br,
                    "branch": br,
                    "role": r_pref,
                    "state": d.get("state"),
                })

        if r_pref in upstream_prefixes and (d.get("isSucceeded") or d.get("isP2PReady")) and br and br != main_branch:
            if br not in upstream_branches:
                upstream_branches.append(br)
            upstream_dispatches.append({
                "dispatchId": did,
                "taskId": tid,
                "slot": d.get("slotName") or br,
                "branch": br,
                "role": r_pref,
                "isP2PReady": bool(d.get("isP2PReady")),
            })

    # Kiểm tra các task upstream trong cùng Run chưa từng được dispatch hoặc bị failed mà chưa có task/dispatch thay thế
    for tid, t_info in tasks_in_run.items():
        if resolved_task_id and tid == resolved_task_id:
            continue
        t_role = t_info.get("rolePrefix") or ""
        t_status = t_info.get("status") or ""
        if tid not in dispatched_task_ids and t_role in unstarted_blocking_prefixes and t_status in ("ready", "pending", "in_progress", "dispatched", "blocked", "todo"):
            blocking_unstarted_upstream.append({
                "taskId": tid,
                "title": t_info.get("title"),
                "role": t_role,
                "status": t_status,
            })
        elif tid in latest_dispatch_by_task and t_role in active_blocking_prefixes:
            ld = latest_dispatch_by_task[tid]
            if ld.get("isSettled") and not ld.get("isSucceeded") and tid not in succeeded_task_ids:
                # Nếu task đã bị canceled hoặc đã có một task cùng role chạy succeeded sau đó thì không chặn cứng
                if ld.get("state") not in ("canceled", "cancelled") and t_status not in ("cancelled", "canceled", "completed"):
                    blocking_failed_upstream.append({
                        "taskId": tid,
                        "dispatchId": ld.get("dispatchId"),
                        "slot": ld.get("slotName") or ld.get("branch"),
                        "role": t_role,
                        "state": ld.get("state"),
                    })

    ready_to_merge = (
        bool(resolved_run_id)
        and len(blocking_active_upstream) == 0
        and len(blocking_unstarted_upstream) == 0
        and len(blocking_failed_upstream) == 0
    )

    pinned_plan_path = ""
    pinned_plan_content = ""
    if resolved_run_id:
        cand_plan = Path(main_root_real) / ".orca" / "runs" / resolved_run_id / "master-plan.md"
        if cand_plan.is_file():
            try:
                pinned_plan_path = str(cand_plan)
                pinned_plan_content = cand_plan.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore").strip()
            except Exception:
                pass

    upstream_task_specs: list[dict] = []
    for tid, t_info in tasks_in_run.items():
        r_p = t_info.get("rolePrefix") or ""
        ld_slot = (latest_dispatch_by_task.get(tid) or {}).get("slotName") or (latest_dispatch_by_task.get(tid) or {}).get("branch") or ""
        upstream_task_specs.append({
            "taskId": tid,
            "role": r_p,
            "slot": ld_slot,
            "title": t_info.get("title") or "",
            "status": t_info.get("status") or "",
            "userTask": t_info.get("userTask") or "",
        })

    peer_directory: list[dict] = []
    for slot_k, d_item in latest_dispatch_by_slot.items():
        peer_directory.append({
            "slot": slot_k,
            "role": d_item.get("rolePrefix") or "",
            "dispatchId": d_item.get("dispatchId") or "",
            "taskId": d_item.get("taskId") or "",
            "state": d_item.get("state") or "",
            "isSettled": bool(d_item.get("isSettled")),
            "isP2PReady": bool(d_item.get("isP2PReady")),
            "branch": d_item.get("branch") or "",
            "terminalHandle": d_item.get("terminalHandle") or "",
        })

    return {
        "runId": resolved_run_id,
        "runObjective": run_objective,
        "callerRole": norm_role,
        "toMain": to_main,
        "mainRoot": main_root_real,
        "mainBranch": main_branch,
        "callerWorktree": caller_wt_real,
        "callerBranch": caller_branch,
        "isInWorkerWorktree": is_in_worker_wt,
        "readyToMerge": ready_to_merge,
        "upstreamBranches": upstream_branches,
        "upstreamDispatches": upstream_dispatches,
        "blockingActiveUpstream": blocking_active_upstream,
        "blockingUnstartedUpstream": blocking_unstarted_upstream,
        "blockingFailedUpstream": blocking_failed_upstream,
        "pinnedPlanPath": pinned_plan_path,
        "pinnedPlanContent": pinned_plan_content,
        "upstreamTaskSpecs": upstream_task_specs,
        "peerDirectory": peer_directory,
    }


def _print_run_plan_and_peers_summary(info: dict, show_all_tasks: bool = False):
    """In tóm tắt Pinned Master Plan, Danh sách Hạng mục Task Specs [P1..Pn] và Peer Directory cho Worker."""
    run_id = info.get("runId") or "(unknown)"
    obj = (info.get("runObjective") or "").strip()
    pinned_content = (info.get("pinnedPlanContent") or "").strip()
    pinned_path = info.get("pinnedPlanPath") or ""
    task_specs = info.get("upstreamTaskSpecs") or []
    peers = info.get("peerDirectory") or []

    if obj:
        print(f"🎯 Mục tiêu Run ({run_id}): {obj}")
    if pinned_content:
        print(f"\n📌 BẢN KẾ HOẠCH ĐÃ GHIM (PINNED MASTER PLAN — {pinned_path}):")
        print("─" * 88)
        print(pinned_content)
        print("─" * 88)

    relevant_specs = [
        ts for ts in task_specs
        if show_all_tasks or (ts.get("role") in ("dev", "ui", "fix", "devops", "critic"))
    ]
    if relevant_specs:
        print(f"\n📋 CHECKLIST NHIỆM VỤ CÁC ROLE TRONG RUN {run_id} (CĂN CỨ ĐỂ QA/SEC/DEVOPS ĐỐI CHIẾU 100%):")
        for ts in relevant_specs:
            slot_lbl = f" [{ts.get('slot')}]" if ts.get("slot") else ""
            u_task = (ts.get("userTask") or ts.get("title") or "").strip()
            # Nếu đã hiển thị Pinned Master Plan chi tiết ở trên, thu gọn u_task dài để chống rò rỉ token trùng lặp
            if pinned_content and len(u_task) > 220:
                u_task = u_task[:217].rstrip() + "..."
            print(f"   • [{ts.get('taskId')}] ({ts.get('role') or 'task'}{slot_lbl}, status={ts.get('status')}): {u_task}")

    if peers:
        print(f"\n📡 DANH BẠ PEER-TO-PEER TRONG RUN {run_id} (Dùng `--to dispatch:<ID>` hoặc `--to '@all'` kèm `--type handoff` khi giao tiếp nội bộ team):")
        for p in peers:
            if not p.get("isSettled"):
                p2p_lbl = " [P2P HANDOFF READY]" if p.get("isP2PReady") else ""
                live_tag = f"🟢 LIVE{p2p_lbl} (nhắn P2P bằng --type handoff)"
            else:
                live_tag = f"⚪ SETTLED ({p.get('state')})"
            print(
                f"   • {p.get('slot'):<16} ➔ dispatch:{p.get('dispatchId')} | branch={p.get('branch')} | {live_tag}"
            )


def cmd_plan(args: list, caller_dir: Path = None):
    """
    CLI:
      orca-team plan pin [--run <RUN_ID>] [--title <TITLE>] [--file <PATH> | --content <TEXT> | <TEXT>...] [--json]
      orca-team plan [show] [--run <RUN_ID>] [--task-id <TASK_ID>] [--dispatch-id <DISPATCH_ID>] [--json]
    Ghim (pin) hoặc hiển thị (show) Bản Kế Hoạch Tổng Thể (Pinned Master Plan [P1..Pn]) và Danh bạ Peer-to-Peer của Run
    để mọi Worker (Critic, Dev, DevOps, QA, Sec, Bench) cùng nhìn vào một nguồn sự thật duy nhất.
    """
    target_dir = (caller_dir or Path.cwd()).resolve()
    raw_list = list(args or [])
    sub = ""

    run_id = ""
    task_id = ""
    dispatch_id = ""
    terminal_handle = ""
    plan_title = ""
    file_path = ""
    content_parts: list[str] = []
    as_json = False
    after_double_dash = False

    idx = 0
    while idx < len(raw_list):
        tok = str(raw_list[idx])
        if after_double_dash:
            content_parts.append(tok)
            idx += 1
            continue
        if tok == "--":
            after_double_dash = True
            idx += 1
            continue
        if tok in ("-h", "--help", "help"):
            print(
                "Sử dụng:\n"
                "  orca-team plan pin [--run <RUN_ID>] [--title <TITLE>] [--file <PATH> | --content \"<PLAN_MD>\"] [--json]\n"
                "  orca-team plan show [--run <RUN_ID>] [--task-id <TASK_ID>] [--dispatch-id <DISPATCH_ID>] [--json]"
            )
            return
        if not sub and not tok.startswith("-") and tok.lower() in ("pin", "set", "save", "write", "show", "get", "view", "read", "status"):
            sub = "pin" if tok.lower() in ("pin", "set", "save", "write") else "show"
            idx += 1
            continue
        if tok in ("--run", "--run-id") and idx + 1 < len(raw_list):
            run_id = str(raw_list[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--run=") or tok.startswith("--run-id="):
            run_id = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--task", "--task-id") and idx + 1 < len(raw_list):
            task_id = str(raw_list[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--task=") or tok.startswith("--task-id="):
            task_id = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--dispatch", "--dispatch-id") and idx + 1 < len(raw_list):
            dispatch_id = str(raw_list[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--dispatch=") or tok.startswith("--dispatch-id="):
            dispatch_id = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--terminal", "--from") and idx + 1 < len(raw_list):
            terminal_handle = str(raw_list[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--terminal=") or tok.startswith("--from="):
            terminal_handle = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--title", "-t") and idx + 1 < len(raw_list):
            plan_title = str(raw_list[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--title="):
            plan_title = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--file", "-f") and idx + 1 < len(raw_list):
            file_path = str(raw_list[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--file="):
            file_path = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--content", "-c", "--body") and idx + 1 < len(raw_list):
            content_parts.append(str(raw_list[idx + 1]))
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--content=") or tok.startswith("--body="):
            content_parts.append(tok.split("=", 1)[1])
            idx += 1
        elif tok == "--json":
            as_json = True
            idx += 1
        elif tok.startswith("run_") and not run_id:
            run_id = tok.strip()
            idx += 1
        else:
            content_parts.append(tok)
            idx += 1

    if not sub:
        sub = "pin" if (file_path or content_parts or plan_title) else "show"

    info = resolve_run_upstream_branches(
        target_dir,
        run_id=run_id,
        dispatch_id=dispatch_id,
        task_id=task_id,
        terminal_handle=terminal_handle,
    )
    resolved_run = info.get("runId") or run_id or "default"
    main_root = Path(info.get("mainRoot") or target_dir)

    if sub == "pin":
        raw_plan = ""
        if file_path:
            fp = Path(file_path).expanduser()
            if not fp.is_file():
                print(f"❌ Không tìm thấy file kế hoạch: '{file_path}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            raw_plan = fp.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore").strip()
        elif content_parts:
            raw_plan = " ".join(content_parts).replace("\\n", "\n").strip()
        elif not sys.stdin.isatty():
            raw_plan = sys.stdin.read().strip()

        if not raw_plan:
            # Nếu không truyền nội dung riêng, tự động tổng hợp từ Objective & các Task Specs của Run
            lines_auto = []
            if info.get("runObjective"):
                lines_auto.append(f"## Mục tiêu Run ({resolved_run})\n{info.get('runObjective')}\n")
            if info.get("upstreamTaskSpecs"):
                lines_auto.append("## Checklist Hạng Mục Bàn Giao Theo Task")
                for idx_t, ts in enumerate(info.get("upstreamTaskSpecs") or [], 1):
                    lines_auto.append(f"- **[P{idx_t}] ({ts.get('role') or 'task'} - `{ts.get('taskId')}`)**: {ts.get('userTask') or ts.get('title')}")
            raw_plan = "\n".join(lines_auto).strip()

        if not raw_plan:
            print("❌ Thiếu nội dung Master Plan để ghim (dùng --content \"...\", --file <path>, hoặc truyền qua stdin).", file=sys.stderr)
            sys.exit(1)

        _ensure_orca_dir_git_excluded(main_root)
        run_dir = main_root / ".orca" / "runs" / resolved_run
        run_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
        plan_file = run_dir / "master-plan.md"
        header_title = plan_title or info.get("runObjective") or f"Master Plan — {resolved_run}"
        if not raw_plan.startswith("#"):
            formatted_plan = f"# 📌 Pinned Master Plan: {header_title}\n- **Run ID:** `{resolved_run}`\n\n{raw_plan}\n"
        else:
            formatted_plan = raw_plan + "\n"
        plan_file.write_text(formatted_plan, encoding="utf-8")
        latest_file = main_root / ".orca" / "runs" / "latest-master-plan.md"
        try:
            latest_file.write_text(formatted_plan, encoding="utf-8")
        except Exception:
            pass

        if as_json:
            print(json.dumps({"runId": resolved_run, "pinnedPlanPath": str(plan_file), "content": formatted_plan.strip()}, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
        else:
            print(f"📌 [Run {resolved_run}] Đã ghim Pinned Master Plan cho toàn bộ đội ngũ tại: {plan_file}")
        return

    # sub == "show"
    if as_json:
        print(json.dumps(info, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
        return
    _print_run_plan_and_peers_summary(info, show_all_tasks=True)
    if not info.get("pinnedPlanContent") and not info.get("upstreamTaskSpecs"):
        print(f"ℹ️ Run '{resolved_run}' hiện chưa có Pinned Master Plan hoặc Task nào.")


def cmd_kb(args: list, caller_dir: Path = None):
    """
    CLI: orca-team kb [index|01|02|03|04|05|<từ-khóa>]
    Tra cứu nhanh Cẩm nang System Engineering cho Quân sư `critic-worker`.
    """
    kb_dirs = [
        (caller_dir or Path.cwd()).resolve() / "knowledge" / "system-engineer",
        Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent / "knowledge" / "system-engineer",
        Path.home() / ".orca" / "knowledge" / "system-engineer",
    ]
    kb_dir = next((d for d in kb_dirs if d.is_dir()), None)
    if kb_dir is None:
        print("❌ Không tìm thấy thư mục knowledge/system-engineer.", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)

    query = " ".join(args or []).strip().lower()
    if not query or query in ("index", "list", "ls", "all", "-h", "--help", "help"):
        idx_file = kb_dir / "INDEX.md"
        if idx_file.is_file():
            print(idx_file.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore").strip())
            return

    topic_map = {
        "01": "01-distributed-systems-consensus.md",
        "1": "01-distributed-systems-consensus.md",
        "distributed": "01-distributed-systems-consensus.md",
        "consensus": "01-distributed-systems-consensus.md",
        "idempotency": "01-distributed-systems-consensus.md",
        "outbox": "01-distributed-systems-consensus.md",
        "02": "02-data-storage-indexing-consistency.md",
        "2": "02-data-storage-indexing-consistency.md",
        "data": "02-data-storage-indexing-consistency.md",
        "db": "02-data-storage-indexing-consistency.md",
        "index": "02-data-storage-indexing-consistency.md",
        "indexing": "02-data-storage-indexing-consistency.md",
        "migration": "02-data-storage-indexing-consistency.md",
        "03": "03-reliability-sre-observability.md",
        "3": "03-reliability-sre-observability.md",
        "sre": "03-reliability-sre-observability.md",
        "reliability": "03-reliability-sre-observability.md",
        "timeout": "03-reliability-sre-observability.md",
        "logs": "03-reliability-sre-observability.md",
        "04": "04-security-zero-trust-architecture.md",
        "4": "04-security-zero-trust-architecture.md",
        "sec": "04-security-zero-trust-architecture.md",
        "security": "04-security-zero-trust-architecture.md",
        "zerotrust": "04-security-zero-trust-architecture.md",
        "05": "05-performance-capacity-scalability.md",
        "5": "05-performance-capacity-scalability.md",
        "perf": "05-performance-capacity-scalability.md",
        "performance": "05-performance-capacity-scalability.md",
        "scale": "05-performance-capacity-scalability.md",
    }
    target_name = topic_map.get(query)
    if not target_name:
        for f in sorted(kb_dir.glob("*.md")):
            if query in f.name.lower():
                target_name = f.name
                break
    target_file = (kb_dir / target_name) if target_name else (kb_dir / "INDEX.md")
    if target_file.is_file():
        print(target_file.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore").strip())
    else:
        print(f"❌ Không tìm thấy chủ đề '{query}' trong {kb_dir}.", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)


def cmd_merge_upstream(args: list, caller_dir: Path = None):
    """
    CLI: orca-team merge-upstream [--run <RUN_ID>] [--dispatch <CTX_ID>] [--task <TASK_ID>]
         [--terminal <TERM_ID>] [--role <ROLE>] [--to-main] [--allow-live|--p2p] [--check-only|--list-only] [--json]
    Đồng bộ (git merge --no-edit) nhánh main và CHỈ các nhánh upstream thuộc ĐÚNG Run hiện tại
    sau khi đã xác minh 100% upstream worker trong cùng Run đã hoàn tất (succeeded) hoặc đã gửi P2P handoff (DEV_READY).
    """
    target_dir = (caller_dir or Path.cwd()).resolve()
    run_id = ""
    dispatch_id = ""
    task_id = ""
    terminal_handle = ""
    role_str = ""
    to_main = False
    allow_live = False
    check_only = False
    list_only = False
    as_json = False

    idx = 0
    while idx < len(args):
        tok = str(args[idx])
        if tok in ("-h", "--help", "help"):
            print(
                "Sử dụng: orca-team merge-upstream [--role <devops|sec|qa|bench>] [--run <RUN_ID>]\n"
                "         [--task-id <TASK_ID>] [--dispatch-id <DISPATCH_ID>] [--terminal <HANDLE>]\n"
                "         [--to-main] [--allow-live|--p2p] [--check-only] [--list-only] [--json]"
            )
            return
        if tok in ("--run", "--run-id") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            run_id = str(args[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--run="):
            run_id = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--dispatch", "--dispatch-id") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            dispatch_id = str(args[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--dispatch=") or tok.startswith("--dispatch-id="):
            dispatch_id = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--task", "--task-id") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            task_id = str(args[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--task=") or tok.startswith("--task-id="):
            task_id = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--terminal", "--from") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            terminal_handle = str(args[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--terminal=") or tok.startswith("--from="):
            terminal_handle = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--role", "-r") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            role_str = str(args[idx + 1]).strip()
            idx += 2
        elif tok.startswith("--role="):
            role_str = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            idx += 1
        elif tok == "--to-main":
            to_main = True
            idx += 1
        elif tok in ("--allow-live", "--p2p"):
            allow_live = True
            idx += 1
        elif tok == "--check-only":
            check_only = True
            idx += 1
        elif tok == "--list-only":
            list_only = True
            idx += 1
        elif tok == "--json":
            as_json = True
            idx += 1
        else:
            idx += 1

    info = resolve_run_upstream_branches(
        target_dir,
        run_id=run_id,
        dispatch_id=dispatch_id,
        task_id=task_id,
        terminal_handle=terminal_handle,
        caller_role=role_str,
        to_main=to_main,
        allow_live=allow_live,
    )

    if list_only:
        if as_json:
            print(json.dumps(info, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
        else:
            print(" ".join(info.get("upstreamBranches") or []))
        return

    if check_only:
        if as_json:
            print(json.dumps(info, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
        else:
            if info.get("readyToMerge"):
                brs = ", ".join(info.get("upstreamBranches") or []) or "(không có nhánh phụ)"
                print(f"✅ Run {info.get('runId')}: 100% upstream đã hoàn tất. Các nhánh cần merge: {brs}")
            else:
                print(f"⛔ Run {info.get('runId') or '(không xác định)'}: CHƯA SẴN SÀNG MERGE!")
                for b in info.get("blockingActiveUpstream") or []:
                    print(f"   • Worker đang làm việc: {b.get('slot')} ({b.get('dispatchId')}, state={b.get('state')})")
                for u in info.get("blockingUnstartedUpstream") or []:
                    print(f"   • Task chưa chạy: {u.get('taskId')} ({u.get('role')} - {u.get('title')})")
                for f_item in info.get("blockingFailedUpstream") or []:
                    print(f"   • Task bị lỗi chưa khắc phục: {f_item.get('slot')} ({f_item.get('taskId')}, state={f_item.get('state')})")
        if not info.get("readyToMerge"):
            sys.exit(1)
        return

    if not info.get("readyToMerge"):
        if as_json:
            print(json.dumps(info, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
        else:
            print(
                f"⛔ [ORCA RUN-SCOPED MERGE GUARD] Từ chối merge cho Run {info.get('runId') or '(không xác định)'} "
                f"vì các nhánh upstream trong cùng Run CHƯA HOÀN TẤT 100%:",
                file=sys.stderr,
            )
            for b in info.get("blockingActiveUpstream") or []:
                print(
                    f"   • Worker '{b.get('slot')}' ({b.get('dispatchId')}) vẫn đang làm việc (state={b.get('state')}). "
                    f"Nếu merge lúc này sẽ bị thiếu code của '{b.get('slot')}'!",
                    file=sys.stderr,
                )
            for u in info.get("blockingUnstartedUpstream") or []:
                print(
                    f"   • Task upstream '{u.get('taskId')}' ({u.get('role')}: {u.get('title')}) vẫn đang ở trạng thái '{u.get('status')}' (chưa chạy).",
                    file=sys.stderr,
                )
            for f_item in info.get("blockingFailedUpstream") or []:
                print(
                    f"   • Worker upstream '{f_item.get('slot')}' ({f_item.get('taskId')}) kết thúc với trạng thái '{f_item.get('state')}'.",
                    file=sys.stderr,
                )
            print(
                "👉 Hãy chờ toàn bộ dev-worker*/ui-worker* trong cùng Run báo worker-done (succeeded) hoặc gửi P2P handoff (DEV_READY) rồi mới chạy lại `orca-team merge-upstream`.",
                file=sys.stderr,
            )
        sys.exit(1)

    git_cwd = Path(info["mainRoot"]) if to_main else Path(info["callerWorktree"])
    merged_branches: list[str] = []
    main_br = info.get("mainBranch") or "main"

    # Bước 1: Nếu đang đứng trong worktree của worker (không phải --to-main), merge nhánh main trước
    if not to_main and info.get("callerBranch") != main_br:
        rc_v = subprocess.run(
            ["git", "rev-parse", "--verify", "--quiet", main_br],
            cwd=str(git_cwd),
            stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL,
            stderr=subprocess.DEVNULL,
        ).returncode
        if rc_v == 0:
            proc_m = subprocess.run(
                ["git", "merge", "--no-edit", main_br],
                cwd=str(git_cwd),
                capture_output=True,
                text=True,
            )
            if proc_m.returncode != 0:
                err_msg = (proc_m.stderr or proc_m.stdout or "").strip()
                if as_json:
                    info["mergeError"] = f"Conflict/error merging {main_br}: {err_msg}"
                    print(json.dumps(info, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
                else:
                    print(f"❌ Lỗi khi merge nhánh '{main_br}' vào '{info.get('callerBranch')}':\n{err_msg}", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(proc_m.returncode or 1)
            merged_branches.append(main_br)

    # Bước 2: Merge CHỈ các nhánh upstream đã succeeded thuộc ĐÚNG Run hiện tại
    for br in info.get("upstreamBranches") or []:
        if not br or br == info.get("callerBranch"):
            continue
        rc_v = subprocess.run(
            ["git", "rev-parse", "--verify", "--quiet", br],
            cwd=str(git_cwd),
            stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL,
            stderr=subprocess.DEVNULL,
        ).returncode
        if rc_v != 0:
            continue
        proc_b = subprocess.run(
            ["git", "merge", "--no-edit", br],
            cwd=str(git_cwd),
            capture_output=True,
            text=True,
        )
        if proc_b.returncode != 0:
            err_msg = (proc_b.stderr or proc_b.stdout or "").strip()
            if as_json:
                info["mergedBranches"] = merged_branches
                info["mergeError"] = f"Conflict/error merging {br}: {err_msg}"
                print(json.dumps(info, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
            else:
                print(f"❌ Lỗi/xung đột khi merge nhánh '{br}' (thuộc Run {info.get('runId')}):\n{err_msg}", file=sys.stderr)
            sys.exit(proc_b.returncode or 1)
        merged_branches.append(br)

    if not to_main and info.get("isInWorkerWorktree"):
        _strip_leader_directives_in_child_worktree(git_cwd, Path(info["mainRoot"]))

    info["mergedBranches"] = merged_branches
    if as_json:
        print(json.dumps(info, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
    else:
        br_summary = ", ".join(merged_branches) if merged_branches else "(không có nhánh mới cần merge)"
        target_lbl = main_br if to_main else (info.get("callerBranch") or str(git_cwd))
        print(
            f"✅ [Run {info.get('runId')}] Đã đồng bộ an toàn các nhánh thuộc Run hiện tại vào '{target_lbl}': {br_summary}"
        )
        if not to_main:
            _print_run_plan_and_peers_summary(info, show_all_tasks=False)


def cmd_spec(args: list, explicit_root: Path = None):
    raw_list = list(args or [])
    leading_dd = False
    if raw_list and raw_list[0] == "--":
        raw_list = raw_list[1:]
        leading_dd = True
    if not raw_list or (not leading_dd and raw_list[0] in ("-h", "--help", "help")):
        print("Sử dụng: orca-team spec <role> \"<mô-tả-nhiệm-vụ>\" [--goal|--no-goal]")
        print("Các role hỗ trợ: dev, devops, critic, sec, qa, bench, re, ui, pr, issue")
        return
    if not leading_dd and raw_list[0] == "--list":
        for alias_k, canon_v in sorted(ROLE_ALIASES.items()):
            if canon_v in ROLE_SPEC_TEMPLATES:
                print(f"{alias_k:<18} -> {canon_v}")
        return
    clean_args = []
    explicit_role = None
    explicit_task = None
    goal_override = None
    spec_root = explicit_root
    idx = 0
    after_dd = leading_dd
    while idx < len(raw_list):
        tok = raw_list[idx]
        if not after_dd:
            if tok == "--":
                after_dd = True
                idx += 1
                continue
            if tok in ("-h", "--help"):
                print("Sử dụng: orca-team spec <role> \"<mô-tả-nhiệm-vụ>\" [--goal|--no-goal]")
                print("Các role hỗ trợ: dev, devops, critic, sec, qa, bench, re, ui, pr, issue")
                return
            if tok == "--goal":
                goal_override = True
                idx += 1
                continue
            if tok == "--no-goal":
                goal_override = False
                idx += 1
                continue
            if tok in ("--path", "-C"):
                if idx + 1 >= len(raw_list) or not raw_list[idx + 1].strip() or raw_list[idx + 1].startswith("-"):
                    print(f"❌ Thiếu giá trị đường dẫn sau '{tok}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                    sys.exit(1)
                cand = Path(raw_list[idx + 1]).expanduser()
                if not cand.is_dir():
                    print(f"❌ Đường dẫn không tồn tại: '{raw_list[idx + 1]}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                    sys.exit(1)
                spec_root = cand.resolve()
                idx += 2
                continue
            if tok.startswith("--path="):
                p_val = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
                if not p_val or not Path(p_val).expanduser().is_dir():
                    print(f"❌ Đường dẫn không tồn tại: '{p_val}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                    sys.exit(1)
                spec_root = Path(p_val).expanduser().resolve()
                idx += 1
                continue
            if tok in ("--role", "-r") and explicit_role is None:
                if idx + 1 >= len(raw_list) or not raw_list[idx + 1].strip() or raw_list[idx + 1].startswith("-"):
                    print(f"❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '{tok}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                    sys.exit(1)
                explicit_role = raw_list[idx + 1]
                idx += 2
                continue
            if tok.startswith("--role=") and explicit_role is None:
                r_val = tok.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
                if not r_val:
                    print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--role='.", file=sys.stderr)
                    sys.exit(1)
                explicit_role = r_val
                idx += 1
                continue
            if tok in ("--task", "-t") and explicit_task is None:
                if idx + 1 >= len(raw_list):
                    print(f"❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '{tok}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                    sys.exit(1)
                explicit_task = raw_list[idx + 1]
                idx += 2
                continue
            if tok.startswith("--task=") and explicit_task is None:
                explicit_task = tok.split("=", 1)[1]
                idx += 1
                continue
        clean_args.append(tok)
        idx += 1

    if explicit_role is not None:
        role_arg = explicit_role
        task_parts = [explicit_task] if explicit_task is not None else clean_args
    elif not clean_args:
        role_arg = ""
        task_parts = [explicit_task] if explicit_task is not None else []
    else:
        first_tok = clean_args[0].strip().lower()
        if not leading_dd and _is_role_or_slot_token(first_tok):
            role_arg = clean_args[0]
            task_parts = [explicit_task] if explicit_task is not None else clean_args[1:]
        elif not leading_dd and len(clean_args) == 2 and re.match(r"^[a-z0-9_-]{1,20}$", clean_args[0]):
            role_arg = clean_args[0]
            task_parts = [explicit_task] if explicit_task is not None else clean_args[1:]
        else:
            role_arg = "" if clean_args[0].strip().startswith("[ROLE:") else "dev"
            task_parts = [explicit_task] if explicit_task is not None else clean_args
    if task_parts and (after_dd or explicit_task is not None or task_parts != ["-"]):
        task_text = " ".join(task_parts)
    elif not sys.stdin.isatty():
        task_text = sys.stdin.read()
    else:
        task_text = ""
    cfg_root = spec_root if spec_root is not None else find_project_root()
    cfg = load_config(cfg_root) if cfg_root else None
    sys.stdout.write(build_role_spec(role_arg, task_text, config=cfg, goal_override=goal_override) + "\n")


def _is_orca_discovery_link(p: Path) -> bool:
    """True chỉ khi p là symlink do Orca tạo (trỏ tới .agents/GEMINI.md) — không đụng symlink riêng của user."""
    try:
        if not p.is_symlink():
            return False
        tgt = os.readlink(p)
        return tgt == ".agents/GEMINI.md" or Path(tgt).as_posix().endswith("/.agents/GEMINI.md")
    except OSError:
        return False


def _ensure_critic_defaults(config: dict) -> dict:
    """Bổ sung criticSpecialist và goalMode mặc định (trong bộ nhớ) cho config cũ — dùng chung cho status/get/sync."""
    if not isinstance(config, dict):
        return config
    if "goalMode" not in config:
        config["goalMode"] = False
    if isinstance(config.get("coordinator"), dict) and "goalMode" not in config["coordinator"]:
        config["coordinator"]["goalMode"] = config.get("goalMode", False)
    if not isinstance(config.get("roles"), dict):
        config["roles"] = {}
    roles = config["roles"]
    if "criticSpecialist" not in roles:
        coord = config.get("coordinator") if isinstance(config.get("coordinator"), dict) else {}
        sec_cfg = roles.get("security") if isinstance(roles.get("security"), dict) else {}
        roles["criticSpecialist"] = {
            "enabled": True,
            "agent": sec_cfg.get("agent") or coord.get("agent") or "antigravity",
            "model": sec_cfg.get("model") or coord.get("model") or "gemini-4-argon-high",
            "effort": sec_cfg.get("effort") or "high",
            "goalMode": config.get("goalMode", False),
            "utilities": ["git-worktrees", "diff-viewer", "orca-skills-registry"],
        }
    for r_cfg in roles.values():
        if isinstance(r_cfg, dict) and "goalMode" not in r_cfg:
            r_cfg["goalMode"] = config.get("goalMode", False)
    return config

REA_REPO_URL = "https://github.com/morluto/rea.git"
REA_CLIENT_MAP = {
    "antigravity": "antigravity",
    "gemini": "gemini_cli",
    "claude": "claude_code",
    "codex": "codex",
    "cursor": "cursor",
    "opencode": "opencode",
    "copilot": "copilot_cli",
}

def ensure_rea_skill(agent: str = "antigravity"):
    """
    Đảm bảo skill 'reverse-engineer-anything' (từ https://github.com/morluto/rea.git)
    và công cụ 'rea' được cài đặt/đồng bộ cho các agent CLI (Antigravity, Claude, Codex, Kimi...).
    """
    import subprocess
    import tempfile

    skill_targets = [
        Path.home() / ".gemini" / "config" / "skills" / "reverse-engineer-anything",
        Path.home() / ".agents" / "skills" / "reverse-engineer-anything",
        Path.home() / ".claude" / "skills" / "reverse-engineer-anything",
    ]

    # 1. Kiểm tra xem đã có bản cài đặt chuẩn ở một trong các thư mục chưa
    existing_src = None
    for st in skill_targets:
        if (st / "SKILL.md").exists():
            existing_src = st
            break

    # 2. Nếu chưa có ở bất kỳ đâu, thử chạy rea setup, npx rea-agents, hoặc git clone từ https://github.com/morluto/rea.git
    env = _build_discovery_env()
    rea_bin = _find_cli_binary(["rea"], env)
    npx_bin = _find_cli_binary(["npx"], env)
    rea_client = REA_CLIENT_MAP.get((agent or "antigravity").lower(), "antigravity")

    if not existing_src:
        print(f"   🔧 [REA] Đang cài đặt skill 'reverse-engineer-anything' từ {REA_REPO_URL}...")
        if rea_bin:
            try:
                subprocess.run([rea_bin, "setup", "--client", rea_client, "--yes"], capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=30)
            except Exception:
                pass
        elif npx_bin:
            try:
                subprocess.run([npx_bin, "-y", "rea-agents@latest", "setup", "--client", rea_client, "--yes"], capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=45)
            except Exception:
                pass
        for st in skill_targets:
            if (st / "SKILL.md").exists():
                existing_src = st
                break

    if not existing_src:
        tmp_dir = Path(tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix="orca-rea-"))
        try:
            res = subprocess.run(
                ["git", "clone", "--depth", "1", REA_REPO_URL, str(tmp_dir)],
                capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=45
            )
            if res.returncode == 0:
                candidates = [
                    tmp_dir / "skills" / "reverse-engineer-anything",
                    tmp_dir / "skill" / "reverse-engineer-anything",
                    tmp_dir / "reverse-engineer-anything",
                    tmp_dir,
                ]
                for cand in candidates:
                    if (cand / "SKILL.md").exists():
                        target_primary = skill_targets[0]
                        target_primary.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
                        if target_primary.exists():
                            shutil.rmtree(target_primary, ignore_errors=True)
                        shutil.copytree(cand, target_primary, dirs_exist_ok=True)
                        existing_src = target_primary
                        print(f"   ✅ [REA] Đã tải và cài đặt skill 'reverse-engineer-anything' vào {target_primary}")
                        break
        except Exception as e:
            print(f"   ⚠️  [REA] Không thể clone tự động từ {REA_REPO_URL}: {e}", file=sys.stderr)
        finally:
            shutil.rmtree(tmp_dir, ignore_errors=True)

    # 3. Đồng bộ sang các thư mục skill chung (~/.agents/skills và ~/.claude/skills) để mọi worker đều đọc được
    if existing_src and (existing_src / "SKILL.md").exists():
        for st in skill_targets:
            if st == existing_src or (st / "SKILL.md").exists():
                continue
            try:
                st.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
                shutil.copytree(existing_src, st, dirs_exist_ok=True)
            except Exception:
                pass

    # 4. Nếu có binary 'rea', đảm bảo đăng ký MCP/client cho agent được chọn
    if rea_bin:
        try:
            subprocess.run([rea_bin, "setup", "--client", rea_client, "--yes"], capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=20)
        except Exception:
            pass


def find_project_root():
    curr = Path.cwd().resolve()
    # 1. Tra cứu Git common-dir nếu đang nằm trong child worktree
    try:
        import subprocess
        res = subprocess.run(["git", "rev-parse", "--git-common-dir"], capture_output=True, text=True, cwd=str(curr))
        if res.returncode == 0 and res.stdout.strip():
            raw_git = Path(res.stdout.strip())
            common_git = raw_git if raw_git.is_absolute() else (curr / raw_git).resolve()
            main_root = common_git.parent
            if (main_root / "orca-team.json").exists() or (main_root / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md").exists():
                return main_root
    except Exception:
        pass

    # 2. Quét ngược lên các thư mục cha thông thường
    for parent in [curr] + list(curr.parents):
        if (parent / "orca-team.json").exists() or (parent / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md").exists():
            return parent
    return curr

def load_config(root: Path):
    cfg_file = root / "orca-team.json"
    if not cfg_file.exists():
        return None
    try:
        with open(cfg_file, "r", encoding="utf-8") as f:
            return json.load(f)
    except Exception as e:
        print(f"❌ Lỗi đọc orca-team.json: {e}", file=sys.stderr)
        return None

def save_config(root: Path, config: dict):
    cfg_file = root / "orca-team.json"
    with open(cfg_file, "w", encoding="utf-8") as f:
        json.dump(config, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)
        f.write("\n")

def _supports_effort_py(agent: str, model: str) -> bool:
    ag = (agent or "").strip().lower()
    mod = str(model or "").strip()
    if not mod or mod in ("None", "null", "(default)"):
        return False
    if ag in ("antigravity", "codebuddy", "codex", "muse"):
        return True
    if ag == "claude":
        return "haiku" not in mod.lower()
    if ag == "cursor":
        return mod in ("gpt-5.3-codex", "claude-opus-4-8")
    return False

def _fmt_worker_args_py(agent: str, model, effort: str) -> str:
    ag = (agent or "").strip().lower()
    args = f"--agent {agent}"
    mod = str(model).strip() if (model and str(model).strip() not in ("None", "null", "(default)")) else ""
    eff = str(effort).strip().lower() if (effort and str(effort).strip() not in ("None", "null", "-")) else ""

    # Orca worker-start chỉ hỗ trợ --model trên: antigravity, claude, codex, cursor, muse, codebuddy, omp
    # (kimi, gemini, opencode khi tạo new-child, aider, goose, copilot tự lấy model từ config riêng)
    model_supported_agents = {"antigravity", "claude", "codex", "cursor", "muse", "codebuddy", "omp"}
    if not mod or ag not in model_supported_agents:
        return args

    args += f' --model "{mod}"'

    # --effort bắt buộc phải đi kèm --model và chỉ hỗ trợ trên một số agent/model nhất định trong Orca
    if not eff or ag == "omp":
        return args
    if ag == "antigravity" or ag == "codebuddy":
        if eff in ("xhigh", "max", "ultra"):
            eff = "high"
        elif eff == "minimal":
            eff = "low"
        if eff not in ("low", "medium", "high"):
            return args
    elif ag == "claude":
        if "haiku" in mod.lower():
            return args
        if eff not in ("low", "medium", "high", "xhigh", "max"):
            return args
    elif ag == "cursor":
        if mod not in ("gpt-5.3-codex", "claude-opus-4-8") or eff not in ("low", "medium", "high"):
            return args
    elif ag in ("codex", "muse"):
        if eff not in ("minimal", "low", "medium", "high", "xhigh", "max", "ultra"):
            return args
    else:
        return args

    args += f" --effort {eff}"
    return args

def _is_role_enabled(data: dict, is_optional: bool = True) -> bool:
    if not isinstance(data, dict):
        return False
    ag = data.get("agent")
    ag_norm = str(ag).strip().lower() if ag is not None else ""
    if "enabled" in data:
        return bool(data["enabled"]) and ag_norm != "none"
    has_valid_agent = bool(ag_norm and ag_norm not in ("none", "null"))
    return has_valid_agent if is_optional else (ag_norm != "none")

def _sync_discovery_links(root: Path, config: dict, create_missing: bool = False):
    """Đảm bảo GEMINI.md và CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md ở root luôn trỏ tới .agents/GEMINI.md (không ghi đè file riêng của user)."""
    gemini_md = root / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md"
    if not gemini_md.exists():
        return
    root_gemini_md = root / "GEMINI.md"
    claude_md = root / "CLAUDE.md"
    agents_md = root / "AGENTS.md"
    c_agent = str(((config or {}).get("coordinator") or {}).get("agent") or "antigravity").strip().lower()
    both_linked = _is_orca_discovery_link(claude_md) and _is_orca_discovery_link(agents_md)
    has_any_orca_link = (
        create_missing
        or _is_orca_discovery_link(root_gemini_md)
        or _is_orca_discovery_link(claude_md)
        or _is_orca_discovery_link(agents_md)
    )

    if has_any_orca_link and not os.path.lexists(root_gemini_md):
        try:
            os.symlink(".agents/GEMINI.md", root_gemini_md)
        except OSError:
            pass
    if both_linked:
        return
    if c_agent == "claude":
        if has_any_orca_link and not os.path.lexists(claude_md):
            try:
                os.symlink(".agents/GEMINI.md", claude_md)
            except OSError:
                pass
        if _is_orca_discovery_link(agents_md):
            agents_md.unlink(missing_ok=True)
    else:
        if has_any_orca_link and not os.path.lexists(agents_md):
            try:
                os.symlink(".agents/GEMINI.md", agents_md)
            except OSError:
                pass
        if _is_orca_discovery_link(claude_md):
            claude_md.unlink(missing_ok=True)


def sync_gemini_directive(root: Path, config: dict):
    gemini_file = root / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md"
    content = gemini_file.read_text(encoding="utf-8") if gemini_file.exists() else ""
    upgraded_from_template = not gemini_file.exists()

    # Khởi tạo mới hoặc nâng cấp tự động nếu .agents/GEMINI.md đang ở phiên bản cũ (v1/v2 thiếu cấu trúc 4 BƯỚC)
    if (
        "### BƯỚC 1:" not in content
        or "### BƯỚC 2:" not in content
        or "### BƯỚC 3:" not in content
        or "### BƯỚC 4:" not in content
        or "> - **BẮT BUỘC PHÂN VAI ĐÚNG CHUYÊN MÔN:**" not in content
    ):
        tpl_candidates = [
            Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent / "templates" / "GEMINI.md",
            Path.home() / ".gemini" / "antigravity" / "scratch" / "orca-multi-agent-orchestrator" / "templates" / "GEMINI.md",
        ]
        for tpl_p in tpl_candidates:
            if tpl_p.is_file():
                try:
                    content = tpl_p.read_text(encoding="utf-8")
                    upgraded_from_template = True
                    break
                except Exception:
                    pass
        if not content:
            return
    gemini_file.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)

    # Build updated table rows
    rows = []
    rows.append("| Role | Agent & Model | Concurrency | Capabilities & Orca Utilities |")
    rows.append("| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |")

    def _goal_badge(role_cfg: dict) -> str:
        return " (🎯 /goal)" if _is_goal_mode_enabled(role_cfg, config) else ""

    # Coordinator
    coord = config.get("coordinator") or {}
    c_agent = coord.get("agent") or "claude"
    c_model = coord.get("model")
    c_display = f"`{c_agent}`" + (f" ({c_model})" if c_model else "")
    rows.append(f"| **Lead Coordinator** | {c_display} | 1{_goal_badge(coord)} | Task DAG, Zero-Trust Audit, Decision Gates, Release |")

    def _table_conc_label(role_cfg: dict, is_on_demand: bool = False) -> str:
        badge = _goal_badge(role_cfg)
        if is_on_demand:
            return f"On-demand{badge}"
        return f"Auto-scale{badge}"

    # Developer
    roles = config.get("roles") or {}
    dev = roles.get("developer") or {}
    d_agent = dev.get("agent") or "kimi"
    d_model = dev.get("model")
    d_display = f"`{d_agent}`" + (f" ({d_model})" if d_model else "")
    rows.append(f"| **Full-Stack Devs** | {d_display} | {_table_conc_label(dev)} | Child worktrees (`dev-worker*`), clean architecture, unit tests |")

    # QA
    qa = roles.get("qa") or {}
    q_agent = qa.get("agent") or "kimi"
    q_model = qa.get("model")
    q_display = f"`{q_agent}`" + (f" ({q_model})" if q_model else "")
    rows.append(f"| **QA & Testers** | {q_display} | {_table_conc_label(qa)} | Integration/E2E suites, adversarial edge-case testing |")

    # Security
    sec = roles.get("security") or {}
    s_agent = sec.get("agent") or "codex"
    s_model = sec.get("model")
    s_display = f"`{s_agent}`" + (f" ({s_model})" if s_model else "")
    rows.append(f"| **Security & Bug Hunter** | {s_display} | {_table_conc_label(sec)} | OWASP Top 10, concurrency/race conditions, leak audit |")

    # PR Reviewer
    pr = roles.get("prReviewer") or {}
    p_agent = pr.get("agent") or "claude"
    p_model = pr.get("model")
    p_display = f"`{p_agent}`" + (f" ({p_model})" if p_model else "")
    rows.append(f"| **PR Reviewer** | {p_display} | {_table_conc_label(pr, True)} | PR checkout (`--pr`), line-by-line diff audit |")

    # Issue Resolver
    issue = roles.get("issueResolver") or {}
    i_agent = issue.get("agent") or "kimi"
    i_model = issue.get("model")
    i_display = f"`{i_agent}`" + (f" ({i_model})" if i_model else "")
    rows.append(f"| **Issue Resolver** | {i_display} | {_table_conc_label(issue, True)} | Issue checkout (`--issue`), reproduction test & fix |")

    # DevOps Specialist
    devops = roles.get("devopsSpecialist") or {}
    devops_enabled = _is_role_enabled(devops, is_optional=True)
    if devops_enabled:
        do_agent = devops.get("agent") or "codex"
        do_model = devops.get("model")
        do_display = f"`{do_agent}`" + (f" ({do_model})" if do_model else "")
        rows.append(f"| **DevOps Specialist** | {do_display} | {_table_conc_label(devops)} | Docker/K8s rollout, DB migrations, SSH worktrees |")

    # Bench & Perf Specialist
    bench = roles.get("benchSpecialist") or {}
    bench_enabled = _is_role_enabled(bench, is_optional=True)
    if bench_enabled:
        b_agent = bench.get("agent") or "antigravity"
        b_model = bench.get("model")
        b_display = f"`{b_agent}`" + (f" ({b_model})" if b_model else "")
        rows.append(f"| **Bench & Perf Specialist** | {b_display} | {_table_conc_label(bench)} | Stress/Load test (RPS/EPS), p95/p99 latency, profiling |")

    # Reverse Engineering Specialist (REA)
    re_spec = roles.get("reSpecialist") or {}
    re_enabled = _is_role_enabled(re_spec, is_optional=True)
    if re_enabled:
        r_agent = re_spec.get("agent") or "antigravity"
        r_model = re_spec.get("model")
        r_display = f"`{r_agent}`" + (f" ({r_model})" if r_model else "")
        rows.append(f"| **Reverse Eng (REA)** | {r_display} | {_table_conc_label(re_spec)} | Binary/Package/ASAR/Protocol decompile (`rea` skill) |")

    # UI Specialist
    ui = roles.get("uiSpecialist") or {}
    ui_enabled = _is_role_enabled(ui, is_optional=True)
    if ui_enabled:
        u_agent = ui.get("agent") or "claude"
        u_model = ui.get("model")
        u_display = f"`{u_agent}`" + (f" ({u_model})" if u_model else "")
        rows.append(f"| **UI/UX Specialist** | {u_display} | {_table_conc_label(ui)} | Design Mode (Click-to-code), responsive & a11y |")

    # Research & Adversarial Critic Specialist (Auto-seed from security/coordinator if missing in legacy config)
    if "criticSpecialist" not in roles:
        roles["criticSpecialist"] = {
            "enabled": True,
            "agent": sec.get("agent") or coord.get("agent") or "antigravity",
            "model": sec.get("model") or coord.get("model") or "gemini-4-argon-high",
            "effort": sec.get("effort") or "high",
            "goalMode": config.get("goalMode", False),
            "utilities": ["git-worktrees", "diff-viewer", "orca-skills-registry"],
        }
        try:
            save_config(root, config)
        except Exception:
            pass
    critic_spec = roles.get("criticSpecialist") or {}
    critic_enabled = _is_role_enabled(critic_spec, is_optional=True)
    if critic_enabled:
        cr_agent = critic_spec.get("agent") or "antigravity"
        cr_model = critic_spec.get("model")
        cr_display = f"`{cr_agent}`" + (f" ({cr_model})" if cr_model else "")
        rows.append(f"| **Research & Critic** | {cr_display} | {_table_conc_label(critic_spec)} | Deep research, Devil's Advocate critique, root-cause consensus |")

    table_text = "\n".join(rows)

    # Đồng bộ dòng BẮT BUỘC PHÂN VAI ĐÚNG CHUYÊN MÔN, LUẬT CHỐNG ĐỘC ĐOÁN & TRÁCH NHIỆM KIỂM ĐẾM PLAN ở đầu file
    routing_parts = ['Code ứng dụng ➔ **`dev-worker` (`dev-worker-2`... auto-scale)**']
    if devops_enabled:
        routing_parts.append('Docker, K8s, Helm, DB migration, `.env`, infra ➔ **`devops-worker`**')
    routing_parts.append('Kiểm toán bảo mật & rò rỉ ➔ **`sec-worker`**')
    routing_parts.append('Kiểm thử nghiệm thu ➔ **`qa-worker`**')
    if bench_enabled:
        routing_parts.append('Đo tải RPS/EPS & tối ưu hiệu năng ➔ **`bench-worker`**')
    if re_enabled:
        routing_parts.append('Dịch ngược Binary/ASAR/Protocol (`rea`) ➔ **`re-worker`**')
    if ui_enabled:
        routing_parts.append('Giao diện CSS/DOM ➔ **`ui-worker`**')
    if critic_enabled:
        routing_parts.append('Khảo sát sâu, phản biện giả thuyết/kế hoạch & truy tìm root-cause ➔ **`critic-worker`**')
    routing_line = (
        "> - **BẮT BUỘC PHÂN VAI ĐÚNG CHUYÊN MÔN & AUTO-SCALE WORKTREE:** "
        + " | ".join(routing_parts)
        + " (tái sử dụng slot rảnh, tự đẻ `<role>-worker-2`... khi slot cũ bận)."
    )
    anti_autocracy_line = (
        "> - **QUÂN SƯ KIẾN TRÚC & LUẬT CHỐNG ĐỘC ĐOÁN (`critic-worker` + SYSTEM ENGINEERING KB):** Trước khi chốt phương án thiết kế/kế hoạch hoặc quy kết lỗi liên tầng, "
        "Leader **BẮT BUỘC** trao đổi 2 chiều (`ask`/`reply`) với Quân sư **`critic-worker`** (trang bị Cẩm nang System Engineering `~/.orca/knowledge/system-engineer/INDEX.md`, tra cứu qua `orca-team kb`) "
        "đến khi đạt `CRITIC_VERDICT: CONSENSUS_REACHED`, trình sếp chốt nếu cần, rồi ghim bằng `orca-team plan pin --run \"$RUN_ID\" --content \"...\"` "
        "để toàn team cùng nhìn vào thi công; bất đồng sau 3 vòng ➔ mở Human Gate, Leader **CẤM** tự phán quyết."
    )
    if not critic_enabled:
        anti_autocracy_line = (
            "> - **LUẬT CHỐNG ĐỘC ĐOÁN & QUY KẾT VỘI VÀNG:** Leader **CẤM** quy kết lỗi cho bất kỳ role nào "
            "hoặc khóa thiết kế/root-cause khi chưa có bằng chứng `file:line` + log."
        )
    coord_goal = _is_goal_mode_enabled(coord, config)
    any_worker_goal = any(
        _is_goal_mode_enabled(r_cfg, config)
        for r_cfg, en in [
            (dev, True), (qa, True), (sec, True), (pr, True), (issue, True),
            (devops, devops_enabled), (bench, bench_enabled), (re_spec, re_enabled),
            (ui, ui_enabled), (critic_spec, critic_enabled),
        ]
        if en
    )
    if coord_goal:
        goal_rule_line = (
            "> - **CHẾ ĐỘ LÀM TRIỆT ĐỂ MẶC ĐỊNH (`/goal` MODE ON ALL ROLES):** Toàn bộ các vai trò (Lead Coordinator & mọi Worker) "
            "đều bật sẵn chế độ **`/goal` (`goalMode: true`)**. Mọi Task Spec sinh qua `orca-team spec` đều tự động đính kèm hậu tố kích hoạt `/goal` "
            "(`GoalStopHook` + checklist nghiệm thu) buộc Worker hoàn tất 100% yêu cầu và gửi `send --type worker_done` trước khi xuất `<!-- GOAL_COMPLETE -->`. "
            "Lead Coordinator chỉ xuất `<!-- GOAL_COMPLETE -->` khi tạm dừng xin quyết định tại **Human Gate (`gate-create`)** hoặc sau khi hoàn tất **Bước 4**."
        )
    elif any_worker_goal:
        goal_rule_line = (
            "> - **CHẾ ĐỘ LÀM TRIỆT ĐỂ TRÊN WORKER (`/goal` MODE):** Các Worker bật `goalMode: true` sẽ tự động được `orca-team spec` "
            "đính kèm hậu tố kích hoạt `/goal` (`GoalStopHook` + checklist nghiệm thu) buộc hoàn tất 100% yêu cầu và gửi `send --type worker_done` trước khi xuất `<!-- GOAL_COMPLETE -->`."
        )
    else:
        goal_rule_line = (
            "> - **PHÂN ĐỊNH TRÁCH NHIỆM KIỂM SOÁT CHẤT LƯỢNG & TIẾN ĐỘ PLAN (QA KIỂM ĐẾM 100% PLAN — LEADER VERIFY LẦN CUỐI, TẮT `/goal` ĐỂ TIẾT KIỆM TOKEN):** "
            "Mặc định tắt `/goal` (`goalMode: false`) để chống hao token lặp vòng; thay vào đó: "
            "(1) **Bước 1:** Leader tham vấn `critic-worker`, ghim **Pinned Master Plan (`[P1..Pn]`)** bằng `orca-team plan pin` và truyền Checklist `[P1..Pn]` vào Spec của `dev-worker*` & `qa-worker`; "
            "(2) **Bước 2 & 3:** Worker phối hợp P2P Zero-Trust (`--type handoff` tới `--to '@all'` / `--to dispatch:<PEER_ID>`) để dev/test, trong đó **`qa-worker` chịu trách nhiệm chính kiểm đếm 100% tiến độ Plan** (`git diff main...HEAD` đối chiếu 1-1 `[P1..Pn]`, chạy test + quét Runtime Logs, bắn `QA_REJECT`/`INCOMPLETE_PLAN` nếu thiếu mục hoặc còn `TODO`/mock, và xuất **Bảng Đối Chiếu Tiến Độ Plan `[P1..Pn] 100% DONE`**); "
            "(3) **Bước 3 & 4:** **Lead Coordinator chỉ verify lại lần cuối (Final Verification)** trên bằng chứng của QA/Sec/DevOps trước khi mở Human Gate!"
        )
    header_rules_block = routing_line + "\n" + anti_autocracy_line + ("\n" + goal_rule_line if goal_rule_line else "")
    content = re.sub(
        r"^> - \*\*BẮT BUỘC PHÂN VAI ĐÚNG CHUYÊN MÔN[^\n]*\n(?:> - \*\*(?:LUẬT CHỐNG ĐỘC ĐOÁN|QUÂN SƯ KIẾN TRÚC)[^\n]*\n?)?(?:> - \*\*(?:CHẾ ĐỘ LÀM TRIỆT ĐỂ|TRÁCH NHIỆM KIỂM ĐẾM|PHÂN ĐỊNH TRÁCH NHIỆM KIỂM SOÁT)[^\n]*)?",
        header_rules_block,
        content,
        flags=re.M
    )
    content = re.sub(
        r"^> - Tại root workspace, Leader \*\*CHỈ ĐƯỢC PHÉP\*\*[^\n]*",
        lambda m: "> - Tại root workspace, Leader **CHỈ ĐƯỢC PHÉP** chạy lệnh `orca orchestration ...`, `orca-team ...` và `git merge` (sau khi qua Human Gate).",
        content,
        flags=re.M
    )

    # Regex replace the table under ## 👥 Configured Agent (Team)? Topology
    pattern = re.compile(
        r"(## 👥 Configured Agent(?: Team)? Topology\s*\n\s*)(?:\|[^\n]+\|\n)+",
        re.MULTILINE
    )
    if pattern.search(content):
        content = pattern.sub(lambda m: m.group(1) + table_text + "\n", content)

    # Đồng bộ Execution Host và tiêu đề phần 3
    exec_host = str(config.get("executionHost") or "local").strip()
    host_label = "Local Machine" if exec_host == "local" else f"Remote SSH ({exec_host})"
    content = re.sub(
        r"^- \*\*Execution Host:\*\* `[^`]*` \([^\n|]*?\)+(?=\s*\|\s*\*\*Orca CLI:\*\*)",
        f"- **Execution Host:** `{exec_host}` ({host_label})",
        content,
        flags=re.M,
    )
    content = re.sub(
        r"^## ⚡ QUY TRÌNH 4 BƯỚC[^\n]*$",
        "## ⚡ QUY TRÌNH 4 BƯỚC & HIẾN PHÁP KỸ SƯ TRƯỞNG (CHỐNG VƯỢT RÀO, ĐỘC ĐOÁN & BÁO SẠCH GIẢ)",
        content,
        flags=re.M,
    )

    # Bước 1: Tách Task độc lập theo vai trò, tham vấn Critic & ghim Pinned Master Plan
    step1_lines = [
        "### BƯỚC 1: PHÂN TÍCH, THAM VẤN QUÂN SƯ CRITIC, GHIM MASTER PLAN (`orca-team plan pin`) & TÁCH TASKS THEO VAI TRÒ",
        "- Tạo Run mới và **tách Task riêng cho từng vai trò**. Dùng `$(orca-team spec <role> '...')` để tiêm **Sổ tay Hiến pháp (`[ROLE: PRINCIPAL ...]`)** vào Worker (Leader **CẤM** gọi `view_file` đọc hàng loạt source code ở root trước khi giao việc — chỉ dùng `ls` hoặc `git status -s -uno`; **KHÔNG** thêm `--json` vào `task-create` để tránh in lặp toàn bộ spec; tra cứu task bằng `orca orchestration task-list --brief`).",
        "- 📌 **THAM VẤN QUÂN SƯ `critic-worker` & GHIM MASTER PLAN (`orca-team plan pin`):** Phân rã yêu cầu thành **Checklist `[P1..Pn]`** (rõ file/module, API/schema/index, edge cases, tiêu chí test). Nếu bài toán chạm ≥2 tầng, đổi schema/API/auth hoặc tìm root-cause khó ➔ tham vấn **`critic-worker`** tới khi đạt `CRITIC_VERDICT: CONSENSUS_REACHED` (mở Human Gate nếu cần sếp chốt phương án), rồi **ghim kế hoạch chung bằng `orca-team plan pin --run <RUN_ID> --content \"[P1] ... | [P2] ...\"`** (lưu tại `.orca/runs/<RUN_ID>/master-plan.md` để mọi Worker xem qua `orca-team plan show` / `merge-upstream`) và **truyền Checklist `[P1..Pn]` vào cả Spec của `dev-worker*` lẫn `qa-worker`**.",
        "- 🔴 **CHIA TẢI SONG SONG (`DISJOINT FILE OWNERSHIP`):** Khi có ≥ 2 module/nhóm file độc lập (nhất là `dev`), **BẮT BUỘC tách thành nhiều Task (`DEV_TASK_1`, `DEV_TASK_2`...) với phạm vi file + unit test riêng biệt hoàn toàn** để chạy song song ở Bước 2 (**CẤM** gom việc lớn vào 1 task):",
        "  ```bash",
        '  orca orchestration run-create --objective "[Mô tả tổng thể]"',
        '  # Ghim Master Plan [P1..Pn] cho toàn team cùng nhìn vào:',
        '  orca-team plan pin --run <RUN_ID> --content "[P1] Module A (files: ...): ... | [P2] Module B (files: ...): ... | [P3] Tests & Runtime Logs: ..."',
        "",
        "  # 1. Principal Dev (Có ≥2 module độc lập ➔ tạo nhiều Task tách biệt file để chạy song song trên dev-worker, dev-worker-2...):",
        "  orca orchestration task-create --spec \"$(orca-team spec dev '[Hạng mục [P1] - Phạm vi file & unit test riêng: Liệt kê rõ từng mục trong Plan]')\"",
        "  # orca orchestration task-create --spec \"$(orca-team spec dev '[Hạng mục [P2] - Phạm vi file & unit test riêng: Liệt kê rõ từng mục trong Plan]')\"",
    ]
    step_num = 2
    if devops_enabled:
        step1_lines.append(f"  # {step_num}. Principal DevOps/SRE (Docker, K8s, pod, Helm, CI/CD, DB migration, .env, infra):")
        step1_lines.append("  orca orchestration task-create --spec \"$(orca-team spec devops '[Docker/K8s/DB/Infra cần triển khai]')\"")
        step_num += 1
    if critic_enabled:
        step1_lines.append(f"  # {step_num}. Quân sư Research, Critic & System Engineer (Thẩm định Plan theo 5 trục System Engineering & root-cause):")
        step1_lines.append("  orca orchestration task-create --spec \"$(orca-team spec critic 'Triệu chứng & bằng chứng thô: [...] | Giả thuyết/Kế hoạch [P1..Pn] của Leader: [...]')\"")
        step_num += 1
    step1_lines.append(f"  # {step_num}. Principal AppSec Auditor (API mới, Auth/JWT, input validation, concurrency, OWASP):")
    step1_lines.append("  orca orchestration task-create --spec \"$(orca-team spec sec 'Kiểm toán Red-Team cho [module/diff]')\"")
    step1_lines.append(f"  # {step_num + 1}. Principal SDET / QA (Kiểm đếm 100% Tiến độ Plan [P1..Pn], Adversarial Testing & Runtime Logs):")
    step1_lines.append("  orca orchestration task-create --spec \"$(orca-team spec qa 'Kiểm đếm tiến độ 100% Checklist Plan [P1..Pn]: [Liệt kê các hạng mục], chạy Adversarial Testing & kiểm toán Runtime Logs')\"")
    step_num += 2
    if bench_enabled:
        step1_lines.append(f"  # {step_num}. Principal Benchmark & Perf (Đo tải RPS/EPS, latency p95/p99, DB/queue tuning):")
        step1_lines.append("  orca orchestration task-create --spec \"$(orca-team spec bench '[Đo tải, benchmark & profiling]')\"")
        step_num += 1
    if re_enabled:
        step1_lines.append(f"  # {step_num}. Principal Reverse Engineer - REA (Dịch ngược binary/JAR/ASAR/APK/firmware/protocol):")
        step1_lines.append("  orca orchestration task-create --spec \"$(orca-team spec re '[Giải phẫu artifact/binary/protocol với rea]')\"")
        step_num += 1
    if ui_enabled:
        step1_lines.append(f"  # {step_num}. Principal UI/UX (Frontend, CSS/DOM, Design Mode):")
        step1_lines.append("  orca orchestration task-create --spec \"$(orca-team spec ui '[Giao diện, CSS/DOM, Responsive & a11y]')\"")
    step1_lines.append("  ```\n\n")
    step1_full = "\n".join(step1_lines)
    content = re.sub(
        r"### BƯỚC 1:[^\n]*\n[\s\S]*?(?=### BƯỚC 2:)",
        lambda m: step1_full,
        content,
        flags=re.M
    )

    # Bước 2: Elastic Auto-Scale Worktree Slots qua $(orca-team worktree-arg <role> --task <TASK_ID>)
    active_wt_names = ["`dev-worker`"]
    if devops_enabled:
        active_wt_names.append("`devops-worker`")
    active_wt_names += ["`qa-worker`", "`sec-worker`"]
    if bench_enabled:
        active_wt_names.append("`bench-worker`")
    if re_enabled:
        active_wt_names.append("`re-worker`")
    if ui_enabled:
        active_wt_names.append("`ui-worker`")
    if critic_enabled:
        active_wt_names.append("`critic-worker`")

    dev_w_args = _fmt_worker_args_py(d_agent, d_model, dev.get("effort"))
    step2_lines = [
        "### BƯỚC 2: PARALLEL FAN-OUT, GIAO TIẾP P2P TRONG TEAM & AUTO-SCALE WORKTREE SLOTS",
        f'- 🔴 **ELASTIC WORKTREE SLOTS (`$(orca-team worktree-arg <role> --task <TASK_ID>)`):** Mọi lệnh `worker-start` **BẮT BUỘC** dùng `$(orca-team worktree-arg <role> --task <TASK_ID>)` ({", ".join(active_wt_names)}): (1) Slot đang `working` hoặc `retained` (chưa merge ở Bước 4) bởi `Run A` sẽ tự động khóa đối với `Run B` (buộc `Run B` nhảy sang `<role>-worker-2`...); (2) Truyền `--task <TASK_ID>` giúp cùng `Run A` tái sử dụng đúng slot của mình khi fix/re-test vòng 2; (3) Sau Bước 4 (`merge-upstream --to-main` + `release-workers`), slot về `RELEASED` và tự reset sạch về `main` cho Run mới.',
        '- 🔴 **PHÂN ĐỢT THEO SÓNG (WAVE ORDERING) & PHỐI HỢP P2P (`orca-team merge-upstream`):**\n'
        '  1. **Pha Kiến trúc & Wave 1 (`critic-worker` ➔ `dev-worker*` / `ui-worker*` / `re-worker`):** Khởi chạy `critic-worker` chốt `CONSENSUS_REACHED` và ghim `orca-team plan pin`, sau đó chạy `dev-worker*`/`ui-worker*`. **CẤM** gọi `worker-start` cho `qa-worker`, `sec-worker`, `bench-worker`, `devops-worker` khi bất kỳ `dev-worker*`/`ui-worker*` nào trong cùng Run vẫn đang làm dở (`working`)!\n'
        '  2. **Wave 2 (`devops-worker`, `sec-worker`, `qa-worker`, `bench-worker`):** Khởi chạy sau khi **100% `dev-worker*`/`ui-worker*` cùng Run đã `succeeded` hoặc gửi P2P handoff (`DEV_READY`)**. Lệnh `orca-team merge-upstream --role <role> --task-id <task_id> --dispatch-id <dispatch_id>` tự động merge đúng nhánh thuộc Run hiện tại và in kèm **Pinned Master Plan `[P1..Pn]` + Danh bạ P2P (`dispatch:<PEER_ID>`)** để các worker phối hợp P2P (`--to dispatch:<PEER_ID>` hoặc `--to \'@all\'` với `--type handoff`).',
        '- ⚠️ **CHỜ TẤT CẢ `worker-start` TRẢ VỀ `dispatchId` TRƯỚC KHI SANG BƯỚC 3:** Mỗi `worker-start` mất 15–40s (có thể sang background `task-XX`); **BẮT BUỘC** chờ đủ `dispatchId` của đợt Fan-out rồi mới gọi `check --wait`:',
        "  ```bash",
        "  # Dev Worker (tự dùng dev-worker khi rảnh và tự đẻ dev-worker-2, dev-worker-3... khi chạy song song):",
        f"  orca orchestration worker-start --task <DEV_TASK_1_ID> $(orca-team worktree-arg dev --task <DEV_TASK_1_ID>) {dev_w_args} --json",
        f"  # orca orchestration worker-start --task <DEV_TASK_2_ID> $(orca-team worktree-arg dev --task <DEV_TASK_2_ID>) {dev_w_args} --json",
    ]
    if devops_enabled:
        do_w_args = _fmt_worker_args_py(devops.get("agent") or "antigravity", devops.get("model"), devops.get("effort"))
        step2_lines.append("  # DevOps Worker (Wave 2 — sau khi 100% Dev/UI cùng Run đã succeeded):")
        step2_lines.append(f"  orca orchestration worker-start --task <DEVOPS_TASK_ID> $(orca-team worktree-arg devops --task <DEVOPS_TASK_ID>) {do_w_args} --json")
    if critic_enabled:
        cr_w_args = _fmt_worker_args_py(critic_spec.get("agent") or "antigravity", critic_spec.get("model"), critic_spec.get("effort"))
        step2_lines.append("  # Quân sư Research, Critic & System Engineer:")
        step2_lines.append(f"  orca orchestration worker-start --task <CRITIC_TASK_ID> $(orca-team worktree-arg critic --task <CRITIC_TASK_ID>) {cr_w_args} --json")
    sec_w_args = _fmt_worker_args_py(s_agent, s_model, sec.get("effort"))
    step2_lines.append("  # Security Worker (Wave 2 — sau khi 100% Dev/UI cùng Run đã succeeded):")
    step2_lines.append(f"  orca orchestration worker-start --task <SEC_TASK_ID> $(orca-team worktree-arg sec --task <SEC_TASK_ID>) {sec_w_args} --json")
    qa_w_args = _fmt_worker_args_py(q_agent, q_model, qa.get("effort"))
    step2_lines.append("  # QA Worker (Wave 2 — kiểm đếm 100% Plan [P1..Pn] & chạy test sau khi Dev/UI/DevOps succeeded):")
    step2_lines.append(f"  orca orchestration worker-start --task <QA_TASK_ID> $(orca-team worktree-arg qa --task <QA_TASK_ID>) {qa_w_args} --json")
    if bench_enabled:
        b_w_args = _fmt_worker_args_py(bench.get("agent") or "antigravity", bench.get("model"), bench.get("effort"))
        step2_lines.append("  # Benchmark Worker (Wave 2 — sau khi 100% Dev/UI/DevOps cùng Run đã succeeded):")
        step2_lines.append(f"  orca orchestration worker-start --task <BENCH_TASK_ID> $(orca-team worktree-arg bench --task <BENCH_TASK_ID>) {b_w_args} --json")
    if re_enabled:
        r_w_args = _fmt_worker_args_py(re_spec.get("agent") or "antigravity", re_spec.get("model"), re_spec.get("effort"))
        step2_lines.append("  # Reverse Engineering Worker (REA):")
        step2_lines.append(f"  orca orchestration worker-start --task <RE_TASK_ID> $(orca-team worktree-arg re --task <RE_TASK_ID>) {r_w_args} --json")
    if ui_enabled:
        u_w_args = _fmt_worker_args_py(ui.get("agent") or "antigravity", ui.get("model"), ui.get("effort"))
        step2_lines.append("  # UI Worker (Frontend/UI):")
        step2_lines.append(f"  orca orchestration worker-start --task <UI_TASK_ID> $(orca-team worktree-arg ui --task <UI_TASK_ID>) {u_w_args} --json")
    step2_lines += [
        "  ```",
        "  *(On-demand Git: Review PR dùng `orca-review-pr <PR_NUM>` | Sửa Issue dùng `orca-hotfix <ISSUE_ID>`)*\n\n",
    ]
    step2_full = "\n".join(step2_lines)
    content = re.sub(
        r"### BƯỚC 2:[^\n]*\n[\s\S]*?(?=### BƯỚC 3:)",
        lambda m: step2_full,
        content,
        flags=re.M
    )

    # Bước 3 & Bước 4: Tự động lọc bỏ các vai trò tùy chọn đang tắt (disabled)
    handoff_roles = "/".join([r for r, en in [("Critic", critic_enabled), ("RE", re_enabled), ("Dev", True), ("DevOps", devops_enabled), ("UI", ui_enabled), ("QA", True)] if en])
    handoff_ev = ", ".join([e for e, en in [("`CONSENSUS_REACHED`", critic_enabled), ("Commit Hash", True), ("Clean-Room Spec", re_enabled), ("Pod/Port/Log sạch", devops_enabled), ("Bảng Đối Chiếu 100% Plan `[P1..Pn]` của QA", True)] if en])
    esc_roles = "/".join([r for r, en in [("DevOps", devops_enabled), ("QA", True), ("Sec", True), ("Bench", bench_enabled)] if en])
    reverify_w = " & ".join([w for w, en in [("`devops-worker`", devops_enabled), ("`qa-worker`", True)] if en])
    qa_branch_roles = "/".join([r for r, en in [("QA", True), ("DevOps", devops_enabled), ("Sec", True), ("Bench", bench_enabled)] if en])
    log_blind_roles = "/".join([r for r, en in [("DevOps", devops_enabled), ("QA", True)] if en])
    zt4_ro_roles = "/".join([r for r, en in [("Critic", critic_enabled), ("QA", True), ("Bench", bench_enabled), ("RE", re_enabled)] if en])
    self_heal_fixers = "/".join([w for w, en in [("`dev-worker*`", True), ("`devops-worker`", devops_enabled)] if en])
    self_heal_verifiers = "/".join([w for w, en in [("`qa-worker`", True), ("`sec-worker`", True), ("`bench-worker`", bench_enabled)] if en])
    dev_branches_desc = "tất cả các nhánh Dev thuộc cùng Run (`orca-team merge-upstream`)"

    step3_full = (
        '### BƯỚC 3: REACTIVE WAIT, ĐỐI THOẠI QUÂN SƯ CRITIC, QA KIỂM ĐẾM 100% PLAN & LEADER VERIFY LẦN CUỐI\n'
        '- 🔴 **Lắng nghe đủ 4 tín hiệu (`worker_done,escalation,question,handoff`) và DỪNG GỌI TOOL NGAY sau khi chạy (khi `check --wait` sang background `task-XX`, CẤM gọi thêm `check --wait` thứ 2 song song; các lần wait kế tiếp BẮT BUỘC truyền `--ack <DELIVERY_ID>` từ `deliveryId` của batch trước để chống lặp lại tin nhắn gây rò rỉ token):**\n'
        '  ```bash\n'
        '  orca orchestration check [--ack <DELIVERY_ID>] --wait --types "worker_done,escalation,question,handoff" --timeout-ms 900000 --json\n'
