        + (
            '  - **Vòng lặp Phản biện 2 chiều với Quân sư `critic-worker`:** Trước khi chốt kiến trúc lớn hoặc khi gặp 1 trong 4 trigger '
            '((a) bug tái phát ≥1 lần, (b) escalation đổ lỗi chéo / bug liên tầng App↔DB↔Infra↔Network, '
            '(c) đổi schema/API contract/auth/payment hoặc chạm ≥2 tầng, (d) báo cáo mâu thuẫn), Leader **BẮT BUỘC** tham vấn `critic-worker`. '
            'Nhận `question` `CRITIC_CHALLENGE` ➔ `orca orchestration reply --id <MSG_ID> --body "..." --json` kèm phản chứng `file:line`/log hoặc hiệu chỉnh Plan. '
            'Đạt `CRITIC_VERDICT: CONSENSUS_REACHED` ➔ cập nhật `orca-team plan pin --run "$RUN_ID" --content "..."` rồi giao việc; '
            'nếu `Critic Deadlock` sau 3 vòng ➔ CẤM tự quyết, mở `orca orchestration gate-create --task <CRITIC_TASK_ID> --question "Leader vs Critic bất đồng: <2 phương án + bằng chứng>" --options \'["leader","critic","wait"]\' --json`.\n'
            if critic_enabled else
            '  - **Chống quy kết vội vàng:** Leader **CẤM** quy kết lỗi cho bất kỳ role nào khi chưa có bằng chứng `file:line` + log thực tế.\n'
        )
        + '  - **Nhận `question` (`ask`):** Phản hồi qua `orca orchestration reply --id <MSG_ID> --body "[Quyết định của Chief Architect]" --json`.\n'
        f'  - **Nhận `handoff` ({handoff_roles}):** Kiểm duyệt bằng chứng ({handoff_ev}) rồi bàn giao sang Wave kế tiếp hoặc verify lần cuối.\n'
        f'  - **Nhận `escalation` ({esc_roles} — nhất là `INCOMPLETE_PLAN` / `TEST_FAIL` từ `qa-worker`):** Phân xử theo bằng chứng{" (gặp trigger Anti-Autocracy ➔ tham vấn `critic-worker`)" if critic_enabled else ""}: nếu worker cần sửa **đang `live`** ➔ `orca orchestration send --to dispatch:<LIVE_DISPATCH_ID> --type dispatch --subject "Coordinator Directive" --body "..." --json`; nếu **đã `settled`** ➔ tạo Task fix mới + `worker-start` với `$(orca-team worktree-arg <role> --task <TASK_ID>)`, rồi cho {reverify_w} kiểm đếm & test lại.\n'
        '- **QA Kiểm soát 100% Plan & Leader Verify Lần Cuối:** `qa-worker` kiểm đếm chi tiết từng mục `[P1..Pn]` ở Wave 2; tại root, **Leader verify lần cuối** qua trường `messages` của `check --wait --json` + `git log -n 1 --stat <ten-worktree>` (chỉ gọi `worker-read --dispatch <ID> --json` khi worker treo không gửi tin; **CẤM** gọi `orca orchestration inbox --json` gây phình context). '
        '**BÁC BỎ NGAY** nếu vi phạm 1 trong 4 điều:\n'
        '  1. **Thiếu Hạng mục Plan hoặc Báo sạch giả:** `qa-worker` báo `INCOMPLETE_PLAN` (còn `TODO`/`FIXME`/stub/mock giả), hoặc báo `PASS` nhưng **thiếu Bảng Đối Chiếu Tiến Độ Plan 100% (`[P1..Pn] X/X DONE`)**, thiếu `EXIT_CODE=0`, thiếu `git commit` (Commit Hash), '
        f'`Tests Run = 0`'
        f'{", thiếu bảng số liệu Benchmark (RPS/EPS, p95/p99)" if bench_enabled else ""}'
        f'{", thiếu Evidence từ `rea` (`re-worker`)" if re_enabled else ""}'
        f'{", thiếu bằng chứng `file:line` (`critic-worker`)" if critic_enabled else ""}, '
        f'hoặc {qa_branch_roles} chưa merge đủ commit từ {dev_branches_desc}.\n'
        f'  2. **Che giấu Lỗi Runtime (Log Blindness/Masking):** {log_blind_roles} báo `PASS` nhưng thiếu bằng chứng quét '
        '**Full Container/Pod Logs** (App + DB + Kafka/Broker), dùng `--since` ngắn cắt lỗi, hoặc nới lỏng assert / '
        'phớt lờ `ERROR`, `FATAL`, `Exception`, `SQL error`, `SSLHandshakeException`, `health: ERROR`, `close_status: FAILED`.\n'
        f'  3. **Còn lỗi tồn đọng{" / Chưa Đồng thuận" if critic_enabled else ""}:** Lỗi compile/test/runtime, '
        f'{"`Critic Deadlock` chưa qua Gate, " if critic_enabled else ""}'
        f'`SECURITY_VERDICT: BLOCK`, `QA_VERDICT: FAIL`'
        f'{", `PERF_VERDICT: BOTTLENECK_FOUND`" if bench_enabled else ""}'
        f'{", `RE_VERDICT: BLOCKED_BY_UNKNOWN`" if re_enabled else ""}'
        f'{", hoặc pod `CrashLoopBackOff`/`ErrImagePull`" if devops_enabled else ""}.\n'
        f'  4. **Vượt rào (Boundary Crossing):** {zt4_ro_roles} tự sửa code app, Dev xóa/skip test cũ{", DevOps sửa business logic" if devops_enabled else ""}, hoặc Worker tự ý đổi kiến trúc.\n'
        f'- **Bắt làm bù khi thiếu Plan:** Nếu còn mục `[P1..Pn]` chưa xong, **cấm tự sửa ở root và cấm cho qua!** Giao {self_heal_fixers} làm bù trên cùng worktree của Run (`$(orca-team worktree-arg <role> --task <TASK_ID>)`) và chạy lại {self_heal_verifiers} đến khi đạt 100% Plan.\n'
        '- ⚠️ **GIỮ TERMINAL WORKER SỐNG Ở BƯỚC 3 BẰNG `worker-retain` (CẤM GỌI `worker-release` Ở BƯỚC 3):** Khi worker báo `worker_done`, gọi `orca orchestration worker-retain --dispatch <DISPATCH_ID> --json` để giữ quyền sở hữu slot của Run (chặn Leader khác ghi đè trước khi merge) và giữ nguyên trạng thái `🟢`/`✓`/`🔔` trên Orca Sidebar cho tới Bước 4!\n\n'
    )
    content = re.sub(
        r"### BƯỚC 3:[^\n]*\n[\s\S]*?(?=### BƯỚC 4:)",
        lambda m: step3_full,
        content,
        flags=re.M
    )

    step4_ev_items = ["Dev (`Commit Hash` + `Build OK`)"]
    if devops_enabled:
        step4_ev_items.append("DevOps (`Pod/Infra Ready`)")
    step4_ev_items.append("Security (`PASS`)")
    step4_ev_items.append("QA (`PASS 100%` + `Bảng Đối Chiếu 100% Plan DONE`)")
    if bench_enabled:
        step4_ev_items.append("Benchmark (`PERF_VERDICT: PASS`)")
    if re_enabled:
        step4_ev_items.append("Reverse Eng (`RE_VERDICT: EVIDENCE_COMPLETE` nếu có)")
    step4_ev_str = ", ".join(step4_ev_items[:-1]) + " và " + step4_ev_items[-1]

    gate_q_items = ["Build"]
    if devops_enabled:
        gate_q_items.append("DevOps")
    gate_q_items.append("Security (PASS)")
    gate_q_items.append("QA (PASS 100% & Đủ 100% Plan)")
    tail_opt = "/".join([x for x, en in [("Benchmark", bench_enabled), ("RE", re_enabled)] if en])
    if tail_opt:
        gate_q_items.append(tail_opt)
    gate_q_str = ", ".join(gate_q_items[:-1]) + " và " + gate_q_items[-1]

    merge_slot_list = ["`dev-worker*`"]
    if devops_enabled:
        merge_slot_list.append("`devops-worker*`")
    if ui_enabled:
        merge_slot_list.append("`ui-worker*`")
    merge_branches_hint = ", ".join(merge_slot_list)

    goal_gate_hint = (
        " (khi tạm dừng chờ sếp trả lời Gate trên chat, kèm thẻ `<!-- GOAL_COMPLETE -->` ở cuối tin nhắn để nhường quyền điều khiển cho sếp)"
        if coord_goal else ""
    )
    goal_final_hint = (
        ", đóng các terminal worker và xuất thẻ `<!-- GOAL_COMPLETE -->` ở câu trả lời cuối cùng để đóng Goal."
        if coord_goal else " và đóng các terminal worker."
    )

    step4_full = (
        '### BƯỚC 4: LEADER VERIFY LẦN CUỐI, HUMAN GATE & DỌN DẸP SAU MERGE (CHỐT CHẶN CUỐI)\n'
        f'- Chỉ khi **QA đã nghiệm thu 100% Plan `[P1..Pn]` và Leader đã verify lại lần cuối**, {"đạt `CRITIC_VERDICT: CONSENSUS_REACHED` (khi có trigger Anti-Autocracy) và " if critic_enabled else ""}đủ bằng chứng của {step4_ev_str}, mới tạo Gate xin phép người dùng (cấm tự ý merge){goal_gate_hint}:\n'
        '  ```bash\n'
        f'  orca orchestration gate-create --task <FINAL_TASK_ID> --question "QA đã kiểm đếm đủ 100% Plan & Leader đã verify lần cuối: {"Đồng thuận (Critic), " if critic_enabled else ""}{gate_q_str}. Merge code vào nhánh chính chứ sếp?" --options \'["yes","wait"]\' --json\n'
        '  ```\n'
        '- Chỉ khi người dùng phản hồi `"yes"`:\n'
        '  1. Đóng Gate và khôi phục trạng thái `completed` cho `<FINAL_TASK_ID>`:\n'
        '     ```bash\n'
        '     orca orchestration gate-resolve --id <GATE_ID> --resolution "yes"\n'
        '     orca orchestration task-update --id <FINAL_TASK_ID> --status completed\n'
        '     ```\n'
        f'  2. Đồng bộ an toàn **CHỈ các nhánh thuộc Run hiện tại (`$RUN_ID`)** ({merge_branches_hint}) vào nhánh chính bằng `orca-team merge-upstream --to-main --run "$RUN_ID"`, sau đó chạy `orca-team release-workers --run "$RUN_ID"` để giải phóng toàn bộ retention{goal_final_hint}\n'
    )
    content = re.sub(
        r"### BƯỚC 4:[^\n]*\n[\s\S]*$",
        lambda m: step4_full,
        content,
        flags=re.M
    )

    gemini_file.write_text(content, encoding="utf-8")
    _sync_discovery_links(root, config, create_missing=upgraded_from_template)


def _build_discovery_env():
    env = os.environ.copy()
    env["NO_COLOR"] = "1"
    env["TERM"] = "dumb"
    extra_paths = [
        str(Path.home() / ".local" / "bin"),
        str(Path.home() / ".kimi-code" / "bin"),
        str(Path.home() / ".kimi" / "bin"),
        str(Path.home() / ".antigravity" / "antigravity" / "bin"),
        str(Path.home() / ".opencode" / "bin"),
        str(Path.home() / ".cursor" / "bin"),
        "/usr/local/bin",
        "/opt/homebrew/bin",
    ]
    curr_path = env.get("PATH", "")
    for p in reversed(extra_paths):
        if p not in curr_path:
            curr_path = f"{p}:{curr_path}"
    env["PATH"] = curr_path
    return env

def _find_cli_binary(names, env):
    path_str = env.get("PATH", "")
    for name in names:
        found = shutil.which(name, path=path_str)
        if found:
            return found
    return None

def _strip_ansi_and_spinners(line: str) -> str:
    line = re.sub(r"\x1b\[[0-9;?]*[A-Za-z]", "", line)
    line = re.sub(r"\r", "\n", line)
    line = re.sub(r"^[⠋⠙⠹⠸⠼⠴⠦⠧⠇⠏\s]+", "", line)
    return line.strip()

def _extract_baked_effort(model_id: str) -> str:
    m = re.search(r"-(minimal|low|medium|high|xhigh|max|ultra)$", model_id, re.IGNORECASE)
    return m.group(1).lower() if m else ""

def _load_orca_cached_models(agent: str) -> list:
    models = []
    seen = set()
    orca_profiles = Path.home() / "Library" / "Application Support" / "orca" / "profiles"
    if not orca_profiles.exists():
        return models
    agents_to_check = [agent]
    if agent == "gemini":
        agents_to_check.append("antigravity")
    elif agent == "antigravity":
        agents_to_check.append("gemini")

    for p_dir in orca_profiles.iterdir():
        data_file = p_dir / "orca-data.json"
        if not data_file.exists():
            continue
        try:
            data = json.loads(data_file.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore"))
            settings = data.get("settings") or {}
            by_host = settings.get("discoveredModelsByAgentByHost") or {}
            by_agent = settings.get("discoveredModelsByAgent") or {}
            raw_list = []
            for ag in agents_to_check:
                for host_map in by_host.values():
                    if isinstance(host_map, dict) and isinstance(host_map.get(ag), list):
                        raw_list.extend(host_map[ag])
                if isinstance(by_agent.get(ag), list):
                    raw_list.extend(by_agent[ag])
            for item in raw_list:
                if not isinstance(item, dict):
                    continue
                mid = str(item.get("id") or "").strip()
                if not mid or mid == "default" or mid in seen:
                    continue
                seen.add(mid)
                lbl = str(item.get("label") or mid).strip()
                baked = _extract_baked_effort(mid)
                t_levels = item.get("thinkingLevels") or []
                effs = [str(x.get("id") if isinstance(x, dict) else x) for x in t_levels if x]
                models.append({
                    "id": mid,
                    "label": lbl,
                    "bakedEffort": baked,
                    "efforts": [] if baked else (effs or ["low", "medium", "high"]),
                    "source": "orca-cache"
                })
        except Exception:
            pass
    return models

def discover_models_for_agent(agent: str, refresh: bool = False) -> tuple:
    """
    Trả về (models_list, source_label) bằng cách truy vấn trực tiếp CLI của provider đã chọn.
    Có cache phiên ngắn hạn (120s) tại /tmp/orca-cli-models-cache.json để tránh gọi lại CLI 8 lần liên tiếp trong cùng 1 phiên khởi tạo.
    Mỗi phần tử trong models_list:
      {"id": str, "label": str, "bakedEffort": str, "efforts": list[str], "source": str}
    """
    import subprocess
    import time
    ag = (agent or "").strip().lower()
    cache_file = Path("/tmp/orca-cli-models-cache.json")
    if not refresh and cache_file.exists():
        try:
            c_data = json.loads(cache_file.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore"))
            entry = c_data.get(ag)
            if isinstance(entry, dict) and (time.time() - entry.get("ts", 0) < 120) and entry.get("models"):
                return entry["models"], entry.get("source", "provider-cli")
        except Exception:
            pass

    env = _build_discovery_env()
    models = []
    seen = set()
    source_label = "provider-cli"

    def add_model(mid: str, label: str = "", efforts=None, src="provider-cli"):
        mid = (mid or "").strip()
        if not mid or mid == "default" or mid in seen:
            return
        seen.add(mid)
        baked = _extract_baked_effort(mid)
        if efforts is None:
            if baked:
                eff_list = []
            elif re.search(r"(opus|sonnet|argon|flash|gemini|o1|o3|gpt-5|r1|k1|k3|glm|thinking|reasoning)", mid, re.I):
                eff_list = ["low", "medium", "high"]
            else:
                eff_list = []
        else:
            eff_list = [] if baked else list(efforts)
        models.append({
            "id": mid,
            "label": (label or mid).strip(),
            "bakedEffort": baked,
            "efforts": eff_list,
            "source": src
        })

    # 1. ANTIGRAVITY / GEMINI (`agy models`)
    if ag in ("antigravity", "gemini"):
        bin_path = _find_cli_binary(["agy", "antigravity"] if ag == "antigravity" else ["agy", "gemini", "antigravity"], env)
        if bin_path:
            try:
                res = subprocess.run([bin_path, "models"], capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=8)
                raw_out = (res.stdout or "") + "\n" + (res.stderr or "")
                raw_out = re.sub(r"\r", "\n", raw_out)
                for raw_line in raw_out.splitlines():
                    clean = _strip_ansi_and_spinners(raw_line)
                    if not clean or clean.lower().startswith(("loading", "available", "fetching", "id ", "model ")):
                        continue
                    # Format: <id>\t<label> or <id>   <label>
                    m = re.match(r"^([a-zA-Z0-9._-]+)\s{2,}(.+)$", clean) or re.match(r"^([a-zA-Z0-9._-]+)\t+(.+)$", clean)
                    if m:
                        mid, lbl = m.group(1).strip(), m.group(2).strip()
                        if mid.lower() not in ("id", "model", "name"):
                            add_model(mid, lbl, src=f"{Path(bin_path).name} models")
                if models:
                    source_label = f"{Path(bin_path).name} models"
            except Exception:
                pass

    # 2. CLAUDE (`claude -p --input-format stream-json --output-format stream-json --verbose`)
    elif ag == "claude":
        bin_path = _find_cli_binary(["claude"], env)
        if bin_path:
            try:
                proc = subprocess.Popen(
                    [bin_path, "-p", "--input-format", "stream-json", "--output-format", "stream-json", "--verbose"],
                    stdin=subprocess.PIPE,
                    stdout=subprocess.PIPE,
                    stderr=subprocess.PIPE,
                    text=True,
                    env=env
                )
                req = '{"type":"control_request","request_id":"orca-model-discovery","request":{"subtype":"list_models"}}\n'
                try:
                    out, _ = proc.communicate(input=req, timeout=5)
                except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:
                    proc.kill()
                    out, _ = proc.communicate()
                for line in (out or "").splitlines():
                    line = line.strip()
                    if not line.startswith("{"):
                        continue
                    try:
                        obj = json.loads(line)
                        if obj.get("type") == "control_response":
                            resp = (obj.get("response") or {}).get("response") or {}
                            m_list = resp.get("models") or []
                            for m_obj in m_list:
                                mid = m_obj.get("value") or m_obj.get("id")
                                lbl = m_obj.get("displayName") or m_obj.get("label") or mid
                                desc = m_obj.get("description") or ""
                                full_lbl = f"{lbl} ({desc.splitlines()[0]})" if desc else lbl
                                effs = m_obj.get("supportedEffortLevels") or ["low", "medium", "high"]
                                add_model(mid, full_lbl, efforts=effs, src="claude stream-json list_models")
                    except Exception:
                        pass
                if models:
                    source_label = "claude CLI (list_models)"
            except Exception:
                pass
        # Check ~/.claude/settings.json cho custom/router models
        claude_settings = Path.home() / ".claude" / "settings.json"
        if claude_settings.exists():
            try:
                c_cfg = json.loads(claude_settings.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore"))
                c_env = c_cfg.get("env") or {}
                for k in ("ANTHROPIC_MODEL", "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL", "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL", "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL"):
                    val = c_env.get(k)
                    if val and isinstance(val, str):
                        add_model(val, f"{val} (từ ~/.claude/settings.json {k})", src="~/.claude/settings.json")
                if models and source_label == "provider-cli":
                    source_label = "~/.claude/settings.json"
            except Exception:
                pass

    # 3. KIMI (`~/.kimi-code/config.toml` & `~/.kimi/config.toml`)
    elif ag == "kimi":
        cfg_paths = [
            Path.home() / ".kimi-code" / "config.toml",
            Path.home() / ".kimi" / "config.toml"
        ]
        for cfg_p in cfg_paths:
            if not cfg_p.exists():
                continue
            try:
                raw_toml = cfg_p.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore")
                def_m = re.search(r'^\s*default_model\s*=\s*"([^"]+)"', raw_toml, re.M)
                default_id = def_m.group(1).strip() if def_m else ""
                sec_pattern = re.compile(r'^\[models\.(?:"([^"]+)"|([A-Za-z0-9_.-]+))\]\s*$([\s\S]*?)(?=^\[|\Z)', re.M)
                parsed_entries = []
                for sm in sec_pattern.finditer(raw_toml):
                    m_key = (sm.group(1) or sm.group(2) or "").strip()
                    body = sm.group(3) or ""
                    disp_m = re.search(r'^\s*model\s*=\s*"([^"]+)"', body, re.M)
                    disp = disp_m.group(1).strip() if disp_m else m_key
                    has_think = "thinking" in body.lower() or "k3" in m_key.lower() or "k1" in m_key.lower()
                    effs = ["low", "medium", "high"] if has_think else []
                    lbl = f"{disp}{' [default]' if m_key == default_id else ''}"
                    parsed_entries.append((0 if m_key == default_id else 1, m_key, lbl, effs))
                parsed_entries.sort(key=lambda x: x[0])
                for _, m_key, lbl, effs in parsed_entries:
                    add_model(m_key, lbl, efforts=effs, src=f"kimi ({cfg_p.parent.name}/config.toml)")
                if default_id and default_id not in seen:
                    add_model(default_id, f"{default_id} [default]", efforts=["low", "medium", "high"], src=f"kimi ({cfg_p.parent.name}/config.toml)")
                if models:
                    source_label = f"kimi CLI ({cfg_p.parent.name}/config.toml)"
            except Exception:
                pass

    # 4. CODEX (`codex debug models`)
    elif ag == "codex":
        bin_path = _find_cli_binary(["codex"], env)
        if bin_path:
            try:
                res = subprocess.run([bin_path, "debug", "models"], capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=6)
                obj = json.loads(res.stdout or "{}")
                for item in (obj.get("models") or []):
                    slug = item.get("slug")
                    disp = item.get("display_name") or slug
                    r_levels = item.get("supported_reasoning_levels") or []
                    effs = [x.get("effort") for x in r_levels if isinstance(x, dict) and x.get("effort")]
                    add_model(slug, disp, efforts=effs or ["low", "medium", "high"], src="codex debug models")
                if models:
                    source_label = "codex debug models"
            except Exception:
                pass

    # 5. CURSOR (`cursor-agent --list-models`)
    elif ag == "cursor":
        bin_path = _find_cli_binary(["cursor-agent"], env)
        if bin_path:
            try:
                res = subprocess.run([bin_path, "--list-models"], capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=6)
                for line in (res.stdout or "").splitlines():
                    m = re.match(r"^([^\s]+)\s+-\s+(.+)$", line.strip())
                    if m:
                        add_model(m.group(1), m.group(2), src="cursor-agent --list-models")
                if models:
                    source_label = "cursor-agent --list-models"
            except Exception:
                pass

    # 6. OPENCODE / OPENCODE2 (`opencode models`)
    elif ag in ("opencode", "opencode2"):
        bin_path = _find_cli_binary([ag, "opencode"], env)
        if bin_path:
            try:
                res = subprocess.run([bin_path, "models"], capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=6)
                for line in (res.stdout or "").splitlines():
                    clean = _strip_ansi_and_spinners(line)
                    if clean and " " not in clean and not clean.lower().startswith("available"):
                        add_model(clean, clean, src=f"{Path(bin_path).name} models")
                if models:
                    source_label = f"{Path(bin_path).name} models"
            except Exception:
                pass

    # 7. OTHER DYNAMIC PROVIDERS (pi, omp, jcode, grok, copilot, aider, goose)
    else:
        cmd_map = {
            "pi": (["pi"], ["--list-models"]),
            "omp": (["omp"], ["models"]),
            "jcode": (["jcode"], ["--no-update", "--quiet", "model", "list"]),
            "grok": (["grok"], ["models"]),
            "aider": (["aider"], ["--list-models", ""]),
        }
        if ag in cmd_map:
            bins, args_list = cmd_map[ag]
            bin_path = _find_cli_binary(bins, env)
            if bin_path:
                try:
                    res = subprocess.run([bin_path] + args_list, capture_output=True, text=True, env=env, timeout=6)
                    for line in (res.stdout or "").splitlines():
                        clean = _strip_ansi_and_spinners(line)
                        if clean and not clean.endswith(":"):
                            parts = clean.split()
                            if parts and ("/" in parts[0] or "-" in parts[0]):
                                add_model(parts[0].lstrip("*- "), clean, src=f"{ag} CLI")
                    if models:
                        source_label = f"{ag} CLI"
                except Exception:
                    pass

    # 8. Merge thêm từ Orca Local Cache (nếu có)
    for cached in _load_orca_cached_models(ag):
        if cached["id"] not in seen:
            seen.add(cached["id"])
            models.append(cached)
            if source_label == "provider-cli":
                source_label = "Orca ADE Cache"

    # Lưu cache phiên 120s
    if models:
        try:
            c_data = {}
            if cache_file.exists():
                c_data = json.loads(cache_file.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore"))
            c_data[ag] = {"ts": time.time(), "source": source_label, "models": models}
            cache_file.write_text(json.dumps(c_data, ensure_ascii=False), encoding="utf-8")
        except Exception:
            pass

    return models, source_label


ROLE_TIER_MAP = {
    "coordinator": ("tier1", "high"),
    "developer": ("tier3", "high"),
    "qa": ("tier3", "medium"),
    "security": ("tier2", "high"),
    "prReviewer": ("tier2", "high"),
    "issueResolver": ("tier2", "high"),
    "uiSpecialist": ("tier3", "medium"),
    "devopsSpecialist": ("tier3", "high"),
    "benchSpecialist": ("tier3", "high"),
    "reSpecialist": ("tier2", "high"),
    "criticSpecialist": ("tier2", "high"),
}

def recommend_model_index(models: list, role_tier: str = "tier2", target_effort: str = "high") -> int:
    """
    Chọn vị trí model (1-based) tối ưu nhất trong danh sách động theo kiến trúc Kim Tự Tháp (5% / 15% / 80%):
      - tier1 (Lead Coordinator): ưu tiên Opus + High (hoặc model suy luận kiến trúc đỉnh nhất)
      - tier2 (Security, Research & Critic, Reverse Eng, PR Reviewer, Issue Resolver): ưu tiên Gemini 4 Argon High / Sonnet High / O3
      - tier3 (Full-Stack Dev, QA, UI, DevOps, Bench): ưu tiên Gemini 3.8 Flash (High cho Dev/DevOps, Medium cho QA/UI) / Kimi K3
    """
    if not models:
        return 1
    eff = (target_effort or "high").lower()

    def score_model(m: dict) -> int:
        mid = m["id"].lower()
        lbl = m["label"].lower()
        baked = (m.get("bakedEffort") or "").lower()
        effs = [e.lower() for e in (m.get("efforts") or [])]
        s = 0
        if role_tier == "tier1":
            if "opus" in mid or "opus" in lbl:
                s += 100
            elif "argon" in mid or "o1" in mid or "gpt-5" in mid or "k3" in mid or "r1" in mid:
                s += 70
            elif "sonnet" in mid or "fable" in mid:
                s += 50
        elif role_tier == "tier2":
            if "argon" in mid or "argon" in lbl:
                s += 100
            elif "sonnet" in mid or "fable" in mid or "o3" in mid or "k3" in mid:
                s += 85
            elif "opus" in mid:
                s += 60
            elif "flash" in mid:
                s += 40
        else:  # tier3 (80% workload: Dev, QA, UI, DevOps - tối ưu tốc độ & quota)
            if "flash" in mid or "flash" in lbl:
                s += 100
            elif "k3" in mid or "kimi" in mid or "haiku" in mid or "mini" in mid or "sonnet" in mid:
                s += 85
            elif "argon" in mid:
                s += 50
            elif "opus" in mid:
                s += 10

        if baked == eff:
            s += 30
        elif not baked and eff in effs:
            s += 28
        elif baked == "high":
            s += 15
        elif baked == "medium":
            s += 10

        if "settings.json" not in m.get("source", ""):
            s += 5
        return s

    best_idx = 1
    best_score = -1
    for i, m in enumerate(models, 1):
        sc = score_model(m)
        if sc > best_score:
            best_score = sc
            best_idx = i
    return best_idx


def cmd_models(args: list):
    """
    Liệt kê danh sách model động từ Provider CLI của agent.
    Dùng: orca-team models <agent> [--json|--tsv] [--role <role>] [--tier tier1|tier2|tier3] [--effort low|medium|high] [--refresh]
    """
    agent = "antigravity"
    as_json = False
    as_tsv = False
    refresh = False
    role_tier = "tier2"
    target_effort = "high"
    explicit_tier = False
    explicit_effort = False

    idx = 0
    while idx < len(args):
        a = args[idx]
        if a in ("-h", "--help"):
            print("Usage: orca-team models [agent] [--agent <agent>] [--json|--tsv] [--refresh] [--role <role>] [--tier <tier1|tier2|tier3>] [--effort <low|medium|high>]")
            return
        elif a in ("--agent", "-a"):
            if idx + 1 >= len(args) or args[idx + 1].startswith("-"):
                print(f"❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '{a}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            agent = args[idx + 1].strip().lower()
            idx += 2
        elif a.startswith("--agent="):
            v = a.split("=", 1)[1].strip().lower()
            if not v or v.startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--agent='.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            agent = v
            idx += 1
        elif a == "--json":
            as_json = True
            idx += 1
        elif a == "--tsv":
            as_tsv = True
            idx += 1
        elif a == "--refresh":
            refresh = True
            idx += 1
        elif a == "--tier":
            if idx + 1 >= len(args) or args[idx + 1].startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--tier'.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            role_tier = args[idx + 1].strip()
            explicit_tier = True
            idx += 2
        elif a.startswith("--tier="):
            v = a.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            if not v or v.startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--tier='.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            role_tier = v
            explicit_tier = True
            idx += 1
        elif a == "--effort":
            if idx + 1 >= len(args) or args[idx + 1].startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--effort'.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            target_effort = args[idx + 1].strip()
            explicit_effort = True
            idx += 2
        elif a.startswith("--effort="):
            v = a.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            if not v or v.startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--effort='.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            target_effort = v
            explicit_effort = True
            idx += 1
        elif a == "--role":
            if idx + 1 >= len(args) or args[idx + 1].startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--role'.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            r_key = ROLE_ALIASES.get(args[idx + 1].strip().lower(), args[idx + 1].strip())
            def_t, def_e = ROLE_TIER_MAP.get(r_key, ("tier2", "high"))
            if not explicit_tier:
                role_tier = def_t
            if not explicit_effort:
                target_effort = def_e
            idx += 2
        elif a.startswith("--role="):
            v = a.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            if not v or v.startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--role='.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            r_key = ROLE_ALIASES.get(v.lower(), v)
            def_t, def_e = ROLE_TIER_MAP.get(r_key, ("tier2", "high"))
            if not explicit_tier:
                role_tier = def_t
            if not explicit_effort:
                target_effort = def_e
            idx += 1
        elif not a.startswith("-"):
            agent = a.lower()
            idx += 1
        else:
            print(f"❌ Tùy chọn không hợp lệ: '{a}'.", file=sys.stderr)
            sys.exit(1)

    models, source_label = discover_models_for_agent(agent, refresh=refresh)
    rec_idx = recommend_model_index(models, role_tier, target_effort)

    if as_json:
        print(json.dumps({
            "agent": agent,
            "source": source_label,
            "recommendedIndex": rec_idx,
            "models": models
        }, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
        return

    if as_tsv:
        # Dạng TSV gọn nhẹ cho shell script (orca-project-init):
        # Dòng 1: META\t<source_label>\t<rec_idx>
        # Các dòng sau: MODEL\t<id>\t<label>\t<bakedEffort>\t<efforts_csv>
        clean_src = str(source_label or "provider-cli").replace("\t", " ").replace("\n", " ")
        print(f"META\t{clean_src}\t{rec_idx if models else 0}")
        for m in models:
            mid_val = str(m.get("id") or "").replace("\t", " ").replace("\n", " ").strip()
            lbl_val = str(m.get("label") or mid_val).replace("\t", " ").replace("\n", " ").strip()
            baked_val = str(m.get("bakedEffort") or "-").replace("\t", " ").replace("\n", " ").strip()
            eff_csv = ",".join(str(x).strip() for x in (m.get("efforts") or []) if str(x).strip()) or "-"
            print(f"MODEL\t{mid_val}\t{lbl_val}\t{baked_val}\t{eff_csv}")
        return

    print(f"\n🔍 Danh sách Model truy vấn động cho agent '{agent}' (Nguồn: {source_label}):")
    if not models:
        print(f"   ⚠️ Không tìm thấy CLI hoặc danh sách model động cho '{agent}'.")
        return
    for i, m in enumerate(models, 1):
        rec_tag = " ⭐ (khuyến nghị)" if i == rec_idx else ""
        eff_info = f" [effort tích hợp: {m['bakedEffort']}]" if m.get("bakedEffort") else (
            f" [efforts: {', '.join(m['efforts'])}]" if m.get("efforts") else ""
        )
        lbl_str = f" — {m['label']}" if m["label"] != m["id"] else ""
        print(f"  {i:>2}) {m['id']:<28}{lbl_str}{eff_info}{rec_tag}")
    print("")

def read_terminal_key(fd: int) -> str:
    """Đọc 1 phím hoặc escape sequence từ terminal raw mode (unbuffered os.read trên fd).

    LƯU Ý QUAN TRỌNG: Tuyệt đối KHÔNG dùng `sys.stdin.read(1)` kết hợp `select.select`,
    vì `sys.stdin` (BufferedReader) sẽ hút toàn bộ 3 byte `\\x1b[A` từ kernel buffer vào
    user-space buffer trong lần đọc đầu tiên, khiến `select.select` báo rỗng và trả về
    nhầm phím `\\x1b` (ESC -> hủy cài đặt) khi người dùng bấm mũi tên Lên/Xuống!
    """
    b1 = os.read(fd, 1)
    if not b1:
        return '\x04'
    if b1 == b'\x1b':
        r, _, _ = select.select([fd], [], [], 0.10)
        if not r:
            return '\x1b'
        b2 = os.read(fd, 1)
        if not b2:
            return '\x1b'
        if b2 == b'\x1b':
            # Một số terminal gửi Alt+Arrow dưới dạng ESC ESC [ A hoặc ESC ESC O A
            r_alt, _, _ = select.select([fd], [], [], 0.05)
            if not r_alt:
                return '\x1b'
            b2 = os.read(fd, 1)
            if not b2:
                return '\x1b'
        if b2 == b'[':
            # Chuỗi CSI: ESC [ <params> <final byte trong khoảng 0x40..0x7E (@..~)>
            seq = bytearray()
            for _ in range(16):
                r2, _, _ = select.select([fd], [], [], 0.05)
                if not r2:
                    break
                b_next = os.read(fd, 1)
                if not b_next:
                    break
                seq.extend(b_next)
                if 0x40 <= b_next[0] <= 0x7E:
                    break
            if not seq:
                return '\x1b['
            if seq == bytearray(b'M'):
                # Chuỗi X10 mouse (\x1b[M + 3 byte tọa độ): hút bỏ 3 byte tọa độ để không rò rỉ vào phím kế tiếp
                for _ in range(3):
                    rm, _, _ = select.select([fd], [], [], 0.02)
                    if not rm or not os.read(fd, 1):
                        break
                return '\x1b[M'
            csi_body = seq.decode('latin1', errors='ignore')
            final_ch = csi_body[-1]
            # Chuẩn hóa các phím điều hướng (kể cả khi kèm modifier như \x1b[1;2A)
            if final_ch in ('A', 'B', 'C', 'D', 'H', 'F'):
                return f'\x1b[{final_ch}'
            return f'\x1b[{csi_body}'
        elif b2 == b'O':
            # Chuỗi SS3 (Application Cursor Mode): ESC O A/B/C/D/H/F
            r2, _, _ = select.select([fd], [], [], 0.05)
            if r2:
                b3 = os.read(fd, 1)
                if b3:
                    return '\x1bO' + b3.decode('latin1', errors='ignore')
            return '\x1bO'
        return '\x1b' + b2.decode('latin1', errors='ignore')

    # Nếu là byte đầu của ký tự UTF-8 đa byte (ví dụ bộ gõ tiếng Việt đang bật), đọc nốt các byte tiếp theo
    if b1[0] >= 0x80:
        buf = bytearray(b1)
        for _ in range(3):
            r_utf, _, _ = select.select([fd], [], [], 0.01)
            if not r_utf:
                break
            b_more = os.read(fd, 1)
            if not b_more:
                break
            buf.extend(b_more)
        return buf.decode('utf-8', errors='replace')

    return b1.decode('latin1', errors='ignore')

def interactive_select(
    title: str,
    items: list,
    default_idx: int = 0,
    hint: str = "Dùng phím ↑/↓ hoặc j/k để di chuyển con trỏ, Enter để chọn",
    max_visible: int = 14
) -> tuple:
    """
    Menu điều hướng bằng con trỏ / phím mũi tên (Arrow Keys Interactive TUI).
    Trả về (selected_index, selected_item_str).
    Nếu không phải môi trường TTY tương tác, trả về giá trị mặc định.
    """
    if not items:
        return -1, ""

    current_idx = max(0, min(default_idx, len(items) - 1))

    # Kiểm tra stderr tương tác & lấy fd đọc bàn phím (hỗ trợ cả khi stdin là pipe bằng cách mở /dev/tty)
    if not sys.stderr.isatty():
        return current_idx, items[current_idx]

    import signal
    opened_tty_fd = None
    if sys.stdin.isatty():
        fd = sys.stdin.fileno()
    else:
        try:
            opened_tty_fd = os.open("/dev/tty", os.O_RDONLY)
            fd = opened_tty_fd
        except OSError:
            return current_idx, items[current_idx]

    try:
        old_settings = termios.tcgetattr(fd)
    except Exception:
        if opened_tty_fd is not None:
            os.close(opened_tty_fd)
        return current_idx, items[current_idx]

    try:
        t_rows = shutil.get_terminal_size().lines
        eff_max = max(5, min(max_visible, t_rows - 6))
    except Exception:
        eff_max = max_visible

    def render_menu(start_i: int, cur_i: int) -> int:
        lines_count = 0
        end_i = min(start_i + eff_max, len(items))
        if start_i > 0:
            sys.stderr.write("     \033[90m▲  (...còn phía trên)\033[0m\r\n")
            lines_count += 1
        for i in range(start_i, end_i):
            it = items[i]
            prefix = f"{i+1:>2})"
            if i == cur_i:
                sys.stderr.write(f"\033[1;36m  ❯ {prefix} {it}\033[0m\r\n")
            else:
                sys.stderr.write(f"    {prefix} {it}\r\n")
            lines_count += 1
        if end_i < len(items):
            sys.stderr.write("     \033[90m▼  (...còn phía dưới)\033[0m\r\n")
            lines_count += 1
        sys.stderr.flush()
        return lines_count

    start_idx = 0
    if current_idx >= eff_max:
        start_idx = current_idx - eff_max + 1

    last_rendered_lines = 0
    prev_sigterm = None
    prev_sighup = None

    def _sig_restore(signum, frame):
        raise KeyboardInterrupt

    try:
        prev_sigterm = signal.signal(signal.SIGTERM, _sig_restore)
        prev_sighup = signal.signal(signal.SIGHUP, _sig_restore)
        tty.setraw(fd, when=termios.TCSANOW)
        # Ẩn con trỏ terminal trong lúc tương tác
        sys.stderr.write("\033[?25l")
        sys.stderr.write(f"\r\n\033[1m{title}\033[0m\r\n")
        sys.stderr.write(f"\033[90m({hint})\033[0m\r\n")
        sys.stderr.flush()
        last_rendered_lines = render_menu(start_idx, current_idx)

        while True:
            k = read_terminal_key(fd)
            if k in ('\x1b[A', '\x1bOA', 'k', 'K'):  # Mũi tên Lên / k
                current_idx = (current_idx - 1) % len(items)
            elif k in ('\x1b[B', '\x1bOB', 'j', 'J'):  # Mũi tên Xuống / j
                current_idx = (current_idx + 1) % len(items)
            elif k in ('\x1b[H', '\x1b[1~', '\x1b[7~', '\x1bOH', 'g'):  # Home
                current_idx = 0
            elif k in ('\x1b[F', '\x1b[4~', '\x1b[8~', '\x1bOF', 'G'):  # End
                current_idx = len(items) - 1
            elif k == '\x1b[5~':  # PageUp
                current_idx = max(0, current_idx - eff_max)
            elif k == '\x1b[6~':  # PageDown
                current_idx = min(len(items) - 1, current_idx + eff_max)
            elif k in ('\r', '\n', ' '):  # Enter hoặc Space để xác nhận
                break
            elif k in ('\x03', '\x04', 'q', 'Q', '\x1b'):  # Ctrl+C / Ctrl+D / Esc / q -> Hủy thao tác
                raise KeyboardInterrupt
            elif k.isascii() and k.isdigit() and 1 <= int(k) <= len(items):  # Phím tắt số nhanh
                current_idx = int(k) - 1
                break

            # Điều chỉnh cửa sổ cuộn
            if current_idx < start_idx:
                start_idx = current_idx
            elif current_idx >= start_idx + eff_max:
                start_idx = current_idx - eff_max + 1

            # Xóa các dòng menu cũ và vẽ lại vị trí con trỏ mới
            sys.stderr.write(f"\033[{last_rendered_lines}A\r\033[0J")
            last_rendered_lines = render_menu(start_idx, current_idx)

    finally:
        # Xóa khối menu vừa hiển thị để giữ màn hình gọn đẹp
        if last_rendered_lines > 0:
            sys.stderr.write(f"\033[{last_rendered_lines}A\033[0J")
        # Hiện lại con trỏ terminal
        sys.stderr.write("\033[?25h")
        sys.stderr.flush()
        try:
            termios.tcsetattr(fd, termios.TCSANOW, old_settings)
        except Exception:
            pass
        if opened_tty_fd is not None:
            try:
                os.close(opened_tty_fd)
            except Exception:
                pass
        if prev_sigterm is not None:
            try:
                signal.signal(signal.SIGTERM, prev_sigterm)
            except Exception:
                pass
        if prev_sighup is not None:
            try:
                signal.signal(signal.SIGHUP, prev_sighup)
            except Exception:
                pass

    selected_val = items[current_idx]
    clean_val = re.sub(r"\s*⭐.*$", "", selected_val).strip()
    sys.stderr.write(f"   ➔ Đã chọn: \033[1;32m{clean_val}\033[0m\r\n")
    sys.stderr.flush()
    return current_idx, selected_val

def cmd_select(args: list):
    """
    Menu con trỏ chọn tương tác cho shell script và CLI.
    Dùng: orca-team select --title "..." [--options item1 item2 ...] [--default-idx 0] [--return-idx]
    """
    title = "Chọn một mục:"
    items = []
    default_idx = 0
    return_idx = False

    idx = 0
    while idx < len(args):
        a = args[idx]
        if a == "--title" and idx + 1 < len(args):
            title = args[idx + 1]
            idx += 2
        elif a in ("--default-idx", "--default") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            try:
                default_idx = int(args[idx + 1])
            except ValueError:
                pass
            idx += 2
        elif a in ("--return-idx", "--index"):
            return_idx = True
            idx += 1
        elif a == "--options-json" and idx + 1 < len(args):
            try:
                parsed = json.loads(args[idx + 1])
                if isinstance(parsed, list):
                    items = [str(x) for x in parsed]
            except Exception:
                pass
            idx += 2
        elif a in ("--options", "--items"):
            idx += 1
            while idx < len(args) and not args[idx].startswith("--"):
                items.append(args[idx])
                idx += 1
        elif a in ("--option", "--item") and idx + 1 < len(args):
            items.append(args[idx + 1])
            idx += 2
        else:
            idx += 1

    if not items and not sys.stdin.isatty():
        lines = [l.strip() for l in sys.stdin.readlines() if l.strip()]
        if lines:
            items = lines

    if not items:
        return

    try:
        chosen_i, chosen_val = interactive_select(title, items, default_idx=default_idx)
        if return_idx:
            # 1-based index cho zsh/bash
            print(chosen_i + 1)
        else:
            print(chosen_val)
    except KeyboardInterrupt:
        sys.stderr.write("\r\nĐã hủy.\r\n")
        sys.exit(130)


def cmd_status(root: Path, config: dict):
    if not config:
        print(f"⚠️ Không tìm thấy cấu hình orca-team.json trong '{root}'.")
        print("👉 Hãy khởi tạo trước bằng: orca-project-init")
        sys.exit(1)

    print("\n╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗")
    print("║                     🐋  ORCA MULTI-AGENT TEAM TOPOLOGY & MODEL CONFIGURATION                       ║")
    print("╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝")
    print(f"📍 Dự án: {root}")
    print(f"🌐 Host thực thi: {config.get('executionHost', 'local')}\n")

    print(f"{'VAI TRÒ (ROLE)':<24} | {'AGENT':<12} | {'MODEL':<26} | {'EFFORT':<8} | {'SONG SONG':<10} | {'GOAL MODE'}")
    print("-" * 100)

    _ensure_critic_defaults(config)
    coord = config.get("coordinator") or {}
    c_agent = coord.get("agent") or "claude"
    c_model = coord.get("model") or "(default)"
    c_effort = coord.get("effort") or "-"
    c_goal = "🎯 /goal" if _is_goal_mode_enabled(coord, config) else "OFF"
    print(f"{'1. Lead Coordinator':<24} | {c_agent:<12} | {c_model:<26} | {c_effort:<8} | {'1':<10} | {c_goal}")

    roles = config.get("roles", {})
    role_order = [
        ("developer", "2. Full-Stack Devs"),
        ("qa", "3. QA & Testers"),
        ("security", "4. Security & Bug"),
        ("prReviewer", "5. PR Reviewer"),
        ("issueResolver", "6. Issue Resolver"),
        ("uiSpecialist", "7. UI/UX Specialist"),
        ("devopsSpecialist", "8. DevOps Infra"),
        ("benchSpecialist", "9. Bench & Perf"),
        ("reSpecialist", "10. Reverse Eng (REA)"),
        ("criticSpecialist", "11. Research & Critic"),
    ]

    for key, label in role_order:
        data = roles.get(key, {})
        is_opt = key in ("uiSpecialist", "devopsSpecialist", "benchSpecialist", "reSpecialist", "criticSpecialist")
        enabled = _is_role_enabled(data, is_optional=is_opt)
        if not enabled:
            print(f"{label:<24} | {'[ĐÃ TẮT]':<12} | {'-':<26} | {'-':<8} | {'-':<10} | -")
            continue
        agent = data.get("agent") or "kimi"
        model = data.get("model") or "(default)"
        effort = data.get("effort") or "-"
        conc = "On-demand" if key in ("prReviewer", "issueResolver") else "Auto-scale"
        r_goal = "🎯 /goal" if _is_goal_mode_enabled(data, config) else "OFF"
        print(f"{label:<24} | {agent:<12} | {model:<26} | {effort:<8} | {conc:<10} | {r_goal}")

    print("-" * 100)
    print("💡 Xem model từ CLI của provider: orca-team models <agent>")
    print("💡 Thay đổi cấu hình role:        orca-team set <role> [--agent <id>] [--model <model_id>] [--effort <low|med|high>] [--goal|--no-goal]")
    print("💡 Cấp phát worktree tự động:     orca-team worktree-arg <role>\n")

def cmd_set(root: Path, config: dict, args: list):
    if args and any(a in ("-h", "--help", "help") for a in args):
        print("Sử dụng: orca-team set <role|all> [--agent <id>] [--model <model_id>] [--effort <low|medium|high>] [--goal|--no-goal] [--enable|--disable]")
        print("👉 Các role hợp lệ: coord, dev, qa, sec, pr, issue, ui, devops, bench, re, critic, all")
        return

    if not config:
        print(f"❌ Không tìm thấy orca-team.json trong '{root}'.", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)

    _ensure_critic_defaults(config)

    if not args:
        print("❌ Thiếu vai trò cần cấu hình. Dùng: orca-team set <role> [options]", file=sys.stderr)
        print("👉 Các role hợp lệ: coord, dev, qa, sec, pr, issue, ui, devops, bench, re, critic, all", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)

    role_raw = args[0].lower()
    is_all_roles = role_raw in ("all", "*", "team")
    if is_all_roles:
        role_key = "all"
    elif role_raw in ROLE_ALIASES:
        role_key = ROLE_ALIASES.get(role_raw)
    elif _is_role_or_slot_token(role_raw):
        role_key = _resolve_role_and_slot(role_raw)[0]
    else:
        role_key = None
    if not role_key:
        print(f"❌ Vai trò không hợp lệ: '{role_raw}'.", file=sys.stderr)
        print(f"👉 Hợp lệ: all, {', '.join(sorted(set(ROLE_ALIASES.keys())))}", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)

    # Parse options
    new_agent = None
    new_model = None
    new_effort = None
    new_concurrency = None
    new_goal_mode = None
    toggle_enable = None
    sync_only = False
    force_flag = False

    idx = 1
    while idx < len(args):
        opt = args[idx]
        if opt == "--agent":
            if idx + 1 >= len(args) or args[idx + 1].startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--agent'. Dùng: orca-team set <role> --agent <agent_id>", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            new_agent = args[idx + 1].strip().lower()
            idx += 2
        elif opt.startswith("--agent="):
            v = opt.split("=", 1)[1].strip().lower()
            if not v or v.startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--agent='.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            new_agent = v
            idx += 1
        elif opt == "--model":
            if idx + 1 >= len(args) or (args[idx + 1].startswith("-") and args[idx + 1] != "-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--model'. Dùng: orca-team set <role> --model <model_id>", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            m_val = args[idx + 1].strip()
            new_model = "" if m_val.lower() in ("none", "null", "default", "(default)", "-") else m_val
            idx += 2
        elif opt.startswith("--model="):
            m_val = opt.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            if not m_val or (m_val.startswith("-") and m_val != "-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--model='.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            new_model = "" if m_val.lower() in ("none", "null", "default", "(default)", "-") else m_val
            idx += 1
        elif opt == "--effort":
            if idx + 1 >= len(args) or (args[idx + 1].startswith("-") and args[idx + 1] != "-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--effort'. Dùng: orca-team set <role> --effort <low|medium|high>", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            e_val = args[idx + 1].strip().lower()
            new_effort = "" if e_val in ("none", "null", "off", "-") else e_val
            idx += 2
        elif opt.startswith("--effort="):
            e_val = opt.split("=", 1)[1].strip().lower()
            if not e_val or (e_val.startswith("-") and e_val != "-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--effort='.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            new_effort = "" if e_val in ("none", "null", "off", "-") else e_val
            idx += 1
        elif opt == "--concurrency" or opt.startswith("--concurrency="):
            if opt == "--concurrency":
                if idx + 1 >= len(args) or args[idx + 1].startswith("-"):
                    print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--concurrency'.", file=sys.stderr)
                    sys.exit(1)
                idx += 2
            else:
                idx += 1
            new_concurrency = "auto"
        elif opt == "--goal":
            new_goal_mode = True
            idx += 1
        elif opt == "--no-goal":
            new_goal_mode = False
            idx += 1
        elif opt.startswith("--goal="):
            gv = opt.split("=", 1)[1].strip().lower()
            if gv in ("1", "true", "on", "yes"):
                new_goal_mode = True
            elif gv in ("0", "false", "off", "no"):
                new_goal_mode = False
            else:
                print(f"❌ Giá trị không hợp lệ cho '--goal=': '{gv}' (hợp lệ: true/false, on/off).", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            idx += 1
        elif opt == "--enable":
            toggle_enable = True
            idx += 1
        elif opt == "--disable":
            toggle_enable = False
            idx += 1
        elif opt == "--reset-model":
            new_model = ""
            idx += 1
        elif opt == "--reset-effort":
            new_effort = ""
            idx += 1
        elif opt in ("--sync", "-y", "--yes"):
            # Không return sớm: áp dụng các cờ đã parse rồi mới đồng bộ (trước đây cờ đứng trước --sync bị bỏ qua)
            sync_only = True
            idx += 1
        elif opt in ("--force", "-f"):
            force_flag = True
            idx += 1
        else:
            print(f"❌ Tùy chọn không hợp lệ: '{opt}'. Dùng 'orca-team --help' để xem danh sách cờ hỗ trợ.", file=sys.stderr)
            sys.exit(1)

    if new_agent is not None and new_agent not in KNOWN_AGENTS and not force_flag:
        print(f"❌ Agent không hợp lệ: '{new_agent}'. Hợp lệ: {', '.join(KNOWN_AGENTS)} (dùng --force để bỏ qua kiểm tra).", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)
    if new_effort and new_effort.lower() not in VALID_EFFORTS and not force_flag:
        print(f"❌ Effort không hợp lệ: '{new_effort}'. Hợp lệ: {', '.join(sorted(VALID_EFFORTS))}.", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)
    if new_effort:
        new_effort = new_effort.lower()

    if is_all_roles:
        if new_goal_mode is None and not sync_only:
            print("❌ Với vai trò 'all', hãy truyền '--goal' hoặc '--no-goal' (ví dụ: orca-team set all --goal).", file=sys.stderr)
            sys.exit(1)
        if new_goal_mode is not None:
            config["goalMode"] = new_goal_mode
            config.setdefault("coordinator", {})["goalMode"] = new_goal_mode
            for r_obj in config.setdefault("roles", {}).values():
                if isinstance(r_obj, dict):
                    r_obj["goalMode"] = new_goal_mode
                    r_obj.pop("concurrency", None)
            save_config(root, config)
            sync_gemini_directive(root, config)
            state_lbl = "BẬT (🎯 /goal)" if new_goal_mode else "TẮT (OFF)"
            print(f"\n✅ Đã cập nhật Chế độ /goal = {state_lbl} cho TOÀN BỘ 11 vai trò trong 'orca-team.json' và '.agents/GEMINI.md'.\n")
        else:
            sync_gemini_directive(root, config)
            print("📁 Đã đồng bộ lại '.agents/GEMINI.md' từ 'orca-team.json'.")
        return

    if sync_only and new_agent is None and new_model is None and new_effort is None and new_concurrency is None and new_goal_mode is None and toggle_enable is None:
        sync_gemini_directive(root, config)
        print("📁 Đã đồng bộ lại '.agents/GEMINI.md' từ 'orca-team.json'.")
        return

    # Interactive prompt if no flags provided
    if new_agent is None and new_model is None and new_effort is None and new_concurrency is None and new_goal_mode is None and toggle_enable is None:
        if not (sys.stdin.isatty() and sys.stderr.isatty()):
            print(
                "❌ Môi trường không có TTY tương tác. Hãy truyền cờ tường minh: "
                "orca-team set <role> [--agent <id>] [--model <id>] [--effort <low|medium|high>]",
                file=sys.stderr,
            )
            sys.exit(1)
        role_label = ROLE_LABELS.get(role_key, role_key)
        print(f"\n⚙️  Cấu hình tương tác cho vai trò: {role_label}")
        current = (config.get("coordinator") if role_key == "coordinator" else config.get("roles", {}).get(role_key)) or {}
        raw_curr_agent = current.get("agent")
        curr_agent = raw_curr_agent if (raw_curr_agent and raw_curr_agent != "none") else ((config.get("coordinator") or {}).get("agent") or "antigravity")
        curr_model = current.get("model") or "mặc định"
        curr_effort = current.get("effort") or "-"
        if current.get("enabled") is False:
            toggle_enable = True
            print(f"   Hiện tại: [ĐÃ TẮT] ➔ Sẽ tự động kích hoạt sau khi chọn cấu hình")
        else:
            print(f"   Hiện tại: Agent={curr_agent} | Model={curr_model} | Effort={curr_effort}")

        try:
            agent_list = list(KNOWN_AGENTS) if curr_agent in KNOWN_AGENTS else [curr_agent] + list(KNOWN_AGENTS)
            agent_options = [ag + (" (hiện tại)" if ag == curr_agent else "") for ag in agent_list]
            def_agent_idx = agent_list.index(curr_agent)
            ag_i, _ = interactive_select(
                f"👉 Chọn Agent cho vai trò [{role_label}]:",
                agent_options,
                default_idx=def_agent_idx
            )
            target_agent = agent_list[ag_i]
            if target_agent != raw_curr_agent:
                new_agent = target_agent

            # Truy vấn động danh sách model từ CLI của provider target_agent
            role_tier, def_eff = ROLE_TIER_MAP.get(role_key, ("tier2", "high"))
            print(f"   ⏳ Đang truy vấn danh sách model từ CLI của '{target_agent}'...")
            models, src_label = discover_models_for_agent(target_agent)
            if models:
                rec_idx = recommend_model_index(models, role_tier, def_eff)
                model_menu = []
                for i, m in enumerate(models, 1):
                    rec_str = f" ⭐ (khuyến nghị cho {role_label})" if i == rec_idx else ""
                    lbl_str = f" — {m['label']}" if m["label"] != m["id"] else ""
                    eff_str = f" [{m['bakedEffort']}]" if m.get("bakedEffort") else ""
                    model_menu.append(f"{m['id']}{lbl_str}{eff_str}{rec_str}")
                model_menu.append("Nhập model ID tùy chỉnh...")
                model_menu.append(f"Giữ nguyên ({curr_model})")
                model_menu.append("Bỏ chọn model (mặc định Orca ADE)")

                def_m_idx = rec_idx - 1
                for idx_chk, m in enumerate(models):
                    if m["id"] == curr_model:
                        def_m_idx = idx_chk
                        break

                m_i, _ = interactive_select(
                    f"👉 Chọn Model cho agent '{target_agent}' ({role_label}) — Nguồn: {src_label}:",
                    model_menu,
                    default_idx=def_m_idx
                )
                if m_i < len(models):
                    chosen = models[m_i]
                    new_model = chosen["id"]
                    if chosen.get("bakedEffort"):
                        new_effort = chosen["bakedEffort"]
                elif m_i == len(models):  # Nhập tùy chỉnh
                    c_in = input("   Nhập model ID tùy chỉnh: ").strip()
                    if c_in:
                        new_model = c_in
                elif m_i == len(models) + 1:  # Giữ nguyên
                    pass
                else:  # Bỏ chọn model
                    new_model = ""
            else:
                model_input = input(f"   Nhập model ID mới (Enter = giữ nguyên, 'none' = bỏ chọn model): ").strip()
                if model_input.lower() == "none":
                    new_model = ""
                elif model_input:
                    new_model = model_input

            # Nếu model đã chọn chưa tích hợp sẵn effort trong ID và agent/model hỗ trợ --effort thì mới hỏi tiếp effort
            final_model_id = new_model if new_model is not None else (current.get("model") or "")
            baked_eff = _extract_baked_effort(final_model_id) if final_model_id else ""
            if not _supports_effort_py(target_agent, final_model_id):
                new_effort = ""
                print(f"   ➔ Agent '{target_agent}' / model '{final_model_id or 'default'}' không dùng cờ --effort riêng (tự động đặt effort = -)")
            elif baked_eff:
                new_effort = baked_eff
                print(f"   ➔ Reasoning Effort tự động theo model: {new_effort}")
            else:
                effort_choices = ["high (khuyến nghị suy luận cao)", "medium", "low", "none (tắt reasoning)"]
                eff_def_idx = 0 if def_eff == "high" else (1 if def_eff == "medium" else 2)
                eff_i, _ = interactive_select(
                    f"👉 Chọn Reasoning Effort cho model '{final_model_id or 'mặc định'}':",
                    effort_choices,
                    default_idx=eff_def_idx
                )
                if eff_i == 0:
                    new_effort = "high"
                elif eff_i == 1:
                    new_effort = "medium"
                elif eff_i == 2:
                    new_effort = "low"
                else:
                    new_effort = ""

            if role_key != "coordinator":
                print("   ➔ Cơ chế Song song: Auto-scale (tự động tái sử dụng worktree rảnh hoặc đẻ thêm slot mới khi bận)")
        except (EOFError, KeyboardInterrupt):
            sys.stderr.write("\r\n🚫 Đã hủy thao tác cấu hình.\r\n")
            sys.exit(130)


    # Apply changes
    if role_key == "coordinator":
        target = config.setdefault("coordinator", {})
    else:
        target = config.setdefault("roles", {}).setdefault(role_key, {})

    changes = []
    old_agent_val = (target.get("agent") or "").strip().lower()
    if new_agent and new_agent != old_agent_val and new_model is None and target.get("model"):
        # Khi đổi sang provider khác mà không truyền --model, xóa model cũ của provider trước để tránh xung đột
        if not ({old_agent_val, new_agent} <= {"antigravity", "gemini"}):
            new_model = ""
    if new_agent and new_agent == target.get("agent"):
        new_agent = None
    if new_model is not None and (None if new_model == "" else new_model) == target.get("model"):
        new_model = None
    if new_effort is not None and (None if new_effort == "" else new_effort) == target.get("effort"):
        new_effort = None
    if new_agent:
        old_agent = target.get("agent")
        target["agent"] = new_agent
        changes.append(f"Agent: {old_agent} ➔ {new_agent}")

    if new_model is not None:
        old_model = target.get("model") or "(default)"
        val = None if new_model == "" else new_model
        target["model"] = val
        changes.append(f"Model: {old_model} ➔ {val or '(default)'}")

    OPTIONAL_ROLES = ("uiSpecialist", "devopsSpecialist", "benchSpecialist", "reSpecialist", "criticSpecialist")
    if toggle_enable is not None:
        if toggle_enable is False and role_key not in OPTIONAL_ROLES:
            print(
                f"❌ Vai trò cốt lõi '{ROLE_LABELS.get(role_key, role_key)}' là bắt buộc, không thể tắt (--disable). "
                "Chỉ có thể bật/tắt các vai trò chuyên biệt: ui, devops, bench, re, critic.",
                file=sys.stderr,
            )
            sys.exit(1)
        old_en = target.get("enabled", True)
        target["enabled"] = toggle_enable
        changes.append(f"Enabled: {old_en} ➔ {toggle_enable}")
    elif (new_agent or new_model is not None) and target.get("enabled") is False:
        target["enabled"] = True
        changes.append("Enabled: False ➔ True (tự động kích hoạt khi gán Agent/Model)")

    # Tự động kế thừa Agent/Model/Effort khi bật role có agent='none' (cả qua --enable hoặc qua --model)
    if (toggle_enable is True or ((new_agent or new_model is not None) and target.get("enabled") is True)) and not new_agent and target.get("agent") in (None, "", "none"):
        fallback_role = config.get("roles", {}).get("security" if role_key in ("reSpecialist", "criticSpecialist") else "developer", {})
        fb_agent = fallback_role.get("agent") or (config.get("coordinator") or {}).get("agent") or "antigravity"
        if fb_agent == "none":
            fb_agent = "antigravity"
        target["agent"] = fb_agent
        changes.append(f"Agent: none ➔ {fb_agent} (tự động kế thừa khi bật role)")
        if new_model is None and not target.get("model") and fallback_role.get("model"):
            target["model"] = fallback_role.get("model")
            changes.append(f"Model: (default) ➔ {target['model']}")
        if new_effort is None and not target.get("effort"):
            baked_init = _extract_baked_effort(str(target.get("model") or ""))
            if baked_init:
                target["effort"] = baked_init
            elif _supports_effort_py(fb_agent, str(target.get("model") or "")):
                target["effort"] = "medium" if role_key == "uiSpecialist" else "high"
            if target.get("effort"):
                changes.append(f"Effort: - ➔ {target['effort']}")

    if new_effort is None and (new_agent or new_model is not None):
        eff_ag = target.get("agent") or ""
        eff_mod = target.get("model") or ""
        if not _supports_effort_py(eff_ag, eff_mod):
            if target.get("effort"):
                new_effort = ""
        elif new_model:
            baked_from_mod = _extract_baked_effort(new_model)
            if baked_from_mod and baked_from_mod != target.get("effort"):
                new_effort = baked_from_mod

    if new_effort is not None:
        old_eff = target.get("effort") or "-"
        val = None if new_effort == "" else new_effort
        target["effort"] = val
        changes.append(f"Effort: {old_eff} ➔ {val or '-'}")

    if "concurrency" in target:
        target.pop("concurrency", None)
        if new_concurrency is not None:
            changes.append("Concurrency: Auto-scale (tự động tái sử dụng worktree rảnh hoặc đẻ thêm slot mới khi bận)")
    elif new_concurrency is not None:
        changes.append("Concurrency: Auto-scale (tự động tái sử dụng worktree rảnh hoặc đẻ thêm slot mới khi bận)")

    if new_goal_mode is not None:
        old_g = _is_goal_mode_enabled(target, config)
        target["goalMode"] = new_goal_mode
        if old_g != new_goal_mode or "goalMode" not in target:
            changes.append(f"Goal Mode: {'🎯 /goal' if old_g else 'OFF'} ➔ {'🎯 /goal' if new_goal_mode else 'OFF'}")

    if role_key == "criticSpecialist" and target.get("enabled", True) and not target.get("utilities"):
        target["utilities"] = ["git-worktrees", "diff-viewer", "orca-skills-registry"]

    if not changes:
        sync_gemini_directive(root, config)
        print("ℹ️ Không có thay đổi nào được yêu cầu (đã đồng bộ lại '.agents/GEMINI.md').")
        return

    if role_key == "reSpecialist" and target.get("enabled", True):
        if not target.get("utilities"):
            target["utilities"] = ["git-worktrees", "orca-skills-registry", "reverse-engineer-anything"]
        ensure_rea_skill(target.get("agent") or "antigravity")
        changes.append("Skill: Đã đồng bộ 'reverse-engineer-anything' (morluto/rea)")

    if role_key == "coordinator" and new_agent:
        gemini_md = root / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md"
        root_gemini_md = root / "GEMINI.md"
        claude_md = root / "CLAUDE.md"
        agents_md = root / "AGENTS.md"
        c_low = new_agent.lower()
        has_any_orca_link = (
            _is_orca_discovery_link(root_gemini_md)
            or _is_orca_discovery_link(claude_md)
            or _is_orca_discovery_link(agents_md)
        )
        if has_any_orca_link:
            _sync_discovery_links(root, config, create_missing=False)
            if c_low == "claude":
                changes.append("Leader Discovery Link: Kích hoạt CLAUDE.md" if _is_orca_discovery_link(claude_md)
                               else "⚠️ CLAUDE.md là file/symlink riêng của bạn — giữ nguyên, Leader Claude sẽ đọc file đó thay vì .agents/GEMINI.md")
            elif c_low in ["codex", "cursor", "opencode"]:
                changes.append(f"Leader Discovery Link: Kích hoạt AGENTS.md ({new_agent})" if _is_orca_discovery_link(agents_md)
                               else "⚠️ AGENTS.md là file/symlink riêng của bạn — giữ nguyên")
            else:
                if _is_orca_discovery_link(root_gemini_md) and _is_orca_discovery_link(agents_md):
                    changes.append(f"Leader Discovery Link: Kích hoạt GEMINI.md & AGENTS.md ở root ({new_agent})")
                else:
                    changes.append("⚠️ GEMINI.md hoặc AGENTS.md là file/symlink riêng của bạn — giữ nguyên")

    save_config(root, config)
    sync_gemini_directive(root, config)

    print(f"\n✅ Đã cập nhật thành công vai trò [{ROLE_LABELS.get(role_key, role_key)}]:")
    for ch in changes:
        print(f"   • {ch}")
    print("📁 Đã đồng bộ vào 'orca-team.json' và '.agents/GEMINI.md'.\n")

def cmd_link(root: Path, args: list):
    gemini_md = root / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md"
    root_gemini_md = root / "GEMINI.md"
    claude_md = root / "CLAUDE.md"
    agents_md = root / "AGENTS.md"

    mode = args[0] if args else "status"
    if mode in ["all", "--all"]:
        if not gemini_md.exists():
            print("❌ Không có '.agents/GEMINI.md' để liên kết.", file=sys.stderr)
            sys.exit(1)
        problems = []
        for lp in (root_gemini_md, claude_md, agents_md):
            if _is_orca_discovery_link(lp) and lp.exists():
                continue
            if os.path.lexists(lp):
                if lp.is_symlink() and not lp.exists() and _is_orca_discovery_link(lp):
                    lp.unlink(missing_ok=True)
                else:
                    problems.append(f"{lp.name} đã tồn tại (file/symlink riêng của bạn) — giữ nguyên, không ghi đè")
                    continue
            try:
                os.symlink(".agents/GEMINI.md", lp)
            except OSError as e:
                problems.append(f"{lp.name}: {e}")
        print("🔗 Đã kích hoạt các symlink GEMINI.md, CLAUDE.md và AGENTS.md (sẵn sàng mở bất kỳ AI CLI nào).")
        for pr in problems:
            print(f"   ⚠️  {pr}")
        print("")
    elif mode in ["clean", "--clean"]:
        removed = []
        for lp in (root_gemini_md, claude_md, agents_md):
            if _is_orca_discovery_link(lp):
                lp.unlink(missing_ok=True)
                removed.append(lp.name)
        print(f"🧹 Đã dọn dẹp symlink Orca ở root: {', '.join(removed) or '(không có)'} (chỉ giữ .agents/GEMINI.md; symlink riêng của bạn được giữ nguyên).\n")
    else:
        print("\n🔍 Trạng thái Discovery Links:")
        print(f"   • .agents/GEMINI.md: {'✅ Tồn tại' if gemini_md.exists() else '❌ Không có'}")
        print(f"   • GEMINI.md (root):  {'🔗 Symlink active' if root_gemini_md.is_symlink() else ('✅ File riêng' if root_gemini_md.exists() else '⚪ Không có')}")
        print(f"   • CLAUDE.md:         {'🔗 Symlink active' if claude_md.is_symlink() else ('✅ File riêng' if claude_md.exists() else '⚪ Không có')}")
        print(f"   • AGENTS.md:         {'🔗 Symlink active' if agents_md.is_symlink() else ('✅ File riêng' if agents_md.exists() else '⚪ Không có')}")
        print("\n💡 Tùy chọn:")
        print("   • orca-team link all   : Kích hoạt tất cả symlink để mở tự do Antigravity/Claude/Codex")
        print("   • orca-team link clean : Dọn dẹp symlink ở root\n")

def cmd_uninstall_project(root: Path, args: list):
    """Gỡ bỏ toàn bộ cấu hình Orchestrator khỏi project hiện tại hoặc đường dẫn chỉ định."""
    if args and any(a in ("-h", "--help", "help") for a in args):
        print("Sử dụng: orca-team uninstall [<project_dir>] [-y|--yes|--force]")
        return
    for a in (args or []):
        if not a.startswith("-"):
            cand = Path(a).expanduser().resolve()
            if not cand.is_dir():
                print(f"❌ Đường dẫn không tồn tại hoặc không phải thư mục: '{a}'. Hủy (không gỡ project hiện tại).", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            root = cand
            break

    # Bảo vệ: Không bao giờ tự gỡ bỏ chính kho mã nguồn của framework (kiểm tra TRƯỚC orca-team.json)
    if (root / "templates").is_dir() and (root / "package.json").is_file():
        try:
            pkg = json.loads((root / "package.json").read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
            if pkg.get("name") == "orca-multi-agent-orchestrator":
                print("\n🚫 Đây là thư mục gốc của bộ công cụ 'orca-multi-agent-orchestrator'.", file=sys.stderr)
                print("   Không thể tự gỡ bỏ chính kho mã nguồn framework!", file=sys.stderr)
                print("   Để gỡ bỏ các CLI khỏi máy: hãy chạy './uninstall.sh'.\n", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
        except SystemExit:
            raise
        except Exception:
            pass

    has_any_orca_artifact = (
        (root / "orca-team.json").is_file()
        or (root / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md").is_file()
        or any(_is_orca_discovery_link(root / f) for f in ("GEMINI.md", "CLAUDE.md", "AGENTS.md"))
    )
    if not has_any_orca_artifact:
        print(f"ℹ️  Dự án '{root}' chưa được cấu hình Orca Orchestrator.")
        return

    print(f"\n⚠️  [ORCA UNINSTALL PROJECT] Bạn sắp gỡ bỏ cấu hình Multi-Agent Orchestrator khỏi:")
    print(f"   📁 {root}")
    
    force = any(a in args for a in ["-f", "--force", "-y", "--yes"])
    if not force:
        try:
            ans = input("   ❓ Bạn có chắc chắn muốn xóa cấu hình Orchestrator khỏi project này? [y/N]: ")
            if ans.strip().lower() not in ["y", "yes"]:
                print("   🚫 Đã hủy bỏ thao tác gỡ cài đặt.\n")
                return
        except (KeyboardInterrupt, EOFError):
            print("\n   🚫 Đã hủy thao tác.\n")
            return

    deleted = []
    # 1. Xóa tất cả discovery symlinks ở root
    for f in ["GEMINI.md", "CLAUDE.md", "AGENTS.md"]:
        target = root / f
        if _is_orca_discovery_link(target):
            target.unlink(missing_ok=True)
            deleted.append(f"{f} (symlink)")

    # 2. Xóa orca-team.json
    cfg = root / "orca-team.json"
    if cfg.exists():
        cfg.unlink(missing_ok=True)
        deleted.append("orca-team.json")

    # 3. Xóa .agents/GEMINI.md và chỉ xóa thư mục .agents/ nếu rỗng (bảo vệ .agents/skills hoặc .agents/workflows của user)
    agents_dir = root / ".agents"
    if agents_dir.exists() and agents_dir.is_dir():
        gemini_md = agents_dir / "GEMINI.md"
        if gemini_md.is_file():
            try:
                is_ours = ORCA_DIRECTIVE_MARKER in gemini_md.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore")[:2000]
            except Exception:
                is_ours = False
            if is_ours:
                gemini_md.unlink(missing_ok=True)
                deleted.append(".agents/GEMINI.md")
            else:
                print("   ⚠️  Giữ nguyên '.agents/GEMINI.md' (không phải file do Orca Orchestrator sinh ra).")
        try:
            if not any(agents_dir.iterdir()):
                agents_dir.rmdir()
                deleted.append(".agents/ (thư mục rỗng)")
        except Exception:
            pass

    # 4. KHÔNG xóa .orca/ hay .orca-cache/: đây là dữ liệu runtime của Orca ADE app (không do orchestrator tạo ra)
    for r_item in [".orca", ".orca-cache"]:
        if (root / r_item).exists():
            print(f"   ℹ️  Giữ nguyên '{r_item}/' (dữ liệu runtime của Orca ADE). Xóa thủ công nếu chắc chắn không cần.")

    # 5. Dọn dẹp block trong .gitignore nếu có
    gi = root / ".gitignore"
    if gi.exists():
        try:
            lines = gi.read_text(encoding="utf-8").splitlines()
            cleaned_lines = []
            skip = False
            orca_gi_entries = {
                ".agents/", "GEMINI.md", "AGENTS.md", "CLAUDE.md", "orca-team.json",
                ".orca", ".orca/", ".orca-cache", ".orca-cache/", "*.orca.log", ""
            }
            for line in lines:
                if (
                    "# Orca Multi-Agent Orchestrator" in line
                    or "# Orca ADE runtime" in line
                    or "# Orca Orchestrator Runtime Logs" in line
                ):
                    skip = True
                    continue
                if skip and line.strip() in orca_gi_entries:
                    continue
                else:
                    skip = False
                    cleaned_lines.append(line)
            gi.write_text("\n".join(cleaned_lines) + ("\n" if cleaned_lines else ""), encoding="utf-8")
        except Exception:
            pass

    print("\n🎉 Đã gỡ bỏ thành công toàn bộ cấu hình Orchestrator:")
    for d in deleted:
        print(f"   🗑️  Đã xóa: {d}")
    if not deleted:
        print("   ℹ️ Không có file cấu hình nào cần xóa.")
    print("✨ Dự án đã được khôi phục về trạng thái ban đầu sạch sẽ.\n")

def cmd_get(root: Path, config: dict, args: list):
    if args and any(a in ("-h", "--help", "help") for a in args):
        print("Sử dụng: orca-team get <role> [<field>|--field <agent|model|effort|concurrency|goal|enabled|json>]")
        return
    if not config:
        print("❌ Không tìm thấy orca-team.json", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)
    if not args:
        print("❌ Thiếu role cần lấy thông tin", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)

    role_raw = args[0].lower()
    if role_raw in ROLE_ALIASES:
        role_key = ROLE_ALIASES[role_raw]
    elif _is_role_or_slot_token(role_raw):
        role_key = _resolve_role_and_slot(role_raw)[0]
    else:
        role_key = role_raw
    if role_key not in ROLE_LABELS:
        print(f"❌ Không có cấu hình cho role '{args[0]}'.", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)
    _ensure_critic_defaults(config)
    target = (config.get("coordinator") if role_key == "coordinator" else config.get("roles", {}).get(role_key, {})) or {}

    field = "agent"
    idx_g = 1
    while idx_g < len(args):
        ga = args[idx_g]
        if ga == "--field":
            if idx_g + 1 >= len(args) or args[idx_g + 1].startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--field'.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            field = args[idx_g + 1].strip()
            idx_g += 2
        elif ga.startswith("--field="):
            fv = ga.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            if not fv or fv.startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho '--field='.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            field = fv
            idx_g += 1
        elif not ga.startswith("-"):
            field = ga
            idx_g += 1
        else:
            print(f"❌ Tùy chọn không hợp lệ: '{ga}'.", file=sys.stderr)
            sys.exit(1)

    is_opt = role_key in ("uiSpecialist", "devopsSpecialist", "benchSpecialist", "reSpecialist", "criticSpecialist")
    if not target and not is_opt:
        print(f"❌ Không có cấu hình cho role '{args[0]}'.", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)
    if field == "json":
        print(json.dumps(target))
    elif field == "agent" and not _is_role_enabled(target, is_optional=is_opt):
        print("none")
    elif field == "enabled":
        print("true" if _is_role_enabled(target, is_optional=is_opt) else "false")
    elif field in ("goal", "goalMode", "goal_mode"):
        print("true" if _is_goal_mode_enabled(target, config) else "false")
    else:
        val = target.get(field)
        if val is None and field == "concurrency":
            val = "auto"
        if val is None:
            sys.exit(1)
        print(json.dumps(val, ensure_ascii=False) if isinstance(val, (list, dict)) else val)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Watchdog auto-unblock safety (allowlist + destructive-token denylist, fail-closed)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A 'y' is only auto-sent when the LAST non-empty screen line is a plain [y/n] or (y/n) prompt.
# Note: (yes/no) is intentionally excluded because SSH/apt/db prompts require 'yes' and are high-risk.
_WATCHDOG_SAFE_PROMPT_RES = [
    re.compile(r"[\[(]\s*y\s*/\s*n\s*[\])]\s*[:?]?\s*$", re.I),   # ... [y/n]  (y/n)  [Y/n]  [y/N]
]
# Any of these anywhere in the visible tail blocks auto-approval.
_WATCHDOG_DESTRUCTIVE_RES = [
    re.compile(r"(^|[\s;&|(`])(rm|unlink|rmdir)\s", re.I),                          # rm / unlink / rmdir (any flags)
    re.compile(r"\bremove\s+(regular\s+)?(empty\s+)?(file|directory)\b", re.I),     # rm -i interactive prompt text
    re.compile(r"(^|\s)-delete\b", re.I),                                           # find ... -delete
    re.compile(r"(^|[\s;&|(`])dd\s", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bmkfs(\.\w+)?\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bshred\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\btruncate\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bgit\b[^\n]*\bpush\b[^\n]*(\s-[a-z]*f[a-z]*\b|--force|\s\+\S)", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bgit\b[^\n]*\breset\b[^\n]*--hard", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bgit\b[^\n]*\bclean\b[^\n]*(\s-[a-z]*f|--force)", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bgit\b[^\n]*\b(checkout\s+--|restore\b|branch\s+-D|stash\s+(drop|clear))\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\b(curl|wget)\b[^\n]*\|\s*(sudo\s+)?(ba|z|da|k|fi)?sh\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bch(mod|own|grp)\b[^\n]*\s(-[a-z]*r[a-z]*|--recursive)\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r">\s*/dev/(sd|hd|nvme|disk|xvd|vd)", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bdrop\s+(table|database|schema|index|collection)\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bdelete\s+from\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\b(flushall|flushdb|migrate\s+reset|flyway\s+clean|db:drop|db:reset)\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bcontinue\s+connecting\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bkubectl\b[^\n]*\bdelete\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bdocker\b[^\n]*\b(rm|rmi|system\s+prune|volume\s+(rm|prune)|image\s+prune|container\s+prune|compose\s+down\s+[^\n]*-v)\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bhelm\b[^\n]*\b(uninstall|delete)\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bterraform\b[^\n]*\bdestroy\b", re.I),
    re.compile(r"\bsudo\b", re.I),
]

def _watchdog_prompt_is_safe(screen_text: str) -> tuple:
    """Fail-closed: (True, '') only if the last line is an allowlisted y/n prompt
    and the visible tail contains no destructive token."""
    cleaned_screen = re.sub(r"\x1b\[[0-9;?]*[A-Za-z]", "", str(screen_text or ""))
    lines = [l.rstrip() for l in cleaned_screen.splitlines() if l.strip()]
    if not lines:
        return False, "empty screen"
    if not any(rx.search(lines[-1]) for rx in _WATCHDOG_SAFE_PROMPT_RES):
        return False, "not a recognised y/n prompt"
    tail = "\n".join(lines[-12:])
    for rx in _WATCHDOG_DESTRUCTIVE_RES:
        m = rx.search(tail)
        if m:
            return False, f"destructive token: {m.group(0).strip()[:40]}"
    return True, ""

def cmd_watchdog(root: Path, args: list = None):
    import subprocess
    args = args or []
    if any(a in ("-h", "--help", "help") for a in args):
        print("Sử dụng: orca-team watchdog [<project_dir>] [--unblock|--fix] [--all|-a]")
        return
    for a in args:
        if not a.startswith("-"):
            cand = Path(a).expanduser()
            if not cand.is_dir():
                print(f"❌ Đường dẫn không tồn tại: '{a}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            root = cand.resolve()
            break
    auto_unblock = any(a in args for a in ["--unblock", "--fix"])
    scan_all = any(a in args for a in ["--all", "-a"])
    proj_slug = root.name.lower() if root else ""
    root_str = str(root).lower() if root else ""

    def _extract_wt_id_low(w_item: dict) -> str:
        if not isinstance(w_item, dict):
            return ""
        return str(
            (w_item.get("resource") or {}).get("worktreeId")
            or ((w_item.get("projection") or {}).get("resource") or {}).get("worktreeId")
            or w_item.get("worktreeId")
            or ""
        ).lower()

    def _matches_proj(wt_id_low: str) -> bool:
        if not wt_id_low:
            return False
        return (
            (bool(root_str) and root_str in wt_id_low)
            or (bool(proj_slug) and (f"/{proj_slug}/" in wt_id_low or wt_id_low.endswith(f"/{proj_slug}")))
        )

    print(f"\n🩺 [ORCA AGENT WATCHDOG] Đang quét trạng thái worker ({'toàn hệ thống' if scan_all else root.name})...")
    if auto_unblock:
        print("⚡ Chế độ Auto-Unblock: Đang tự động gửi 'y' mở khóa các worker bị kẹt...")

    orca_bin = os.environ.get("ORCA_BIN") or shutil.which("orca") or "/usr/local/bin/orca"
    if not os.path.exists(orca_bin):
        print(f"❌ Không tìm thấy orca CLI tại {orca_bin}", file=sys.stderr)
        return

    try:
        r_res = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "orchestration", "run-list", "--json"], timeout=6)
        workers = []
        seen_dispatches = set()
        if r_res.returncode == 0:
            r_data = json.loads(r_res.stdout)
            r_obj = r_data.get("result", r_data) if isinstance(r_data, dict) else {}
            all_runs = [r for r in (r_obj.get("runs", []) if isinstance(r_obj, dict) else []) if not r.get("legacy")]
            for r in all_runs[:8]:
                rid = r.get("id")
                if not rid:
                    continue
                w_res = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "orchestration", "worker-list", "--run", rid, "--terminal-state", "active", "--json"], timeout=5)
                if w_res.returncode == 0:
                    w_data = json.loads(w_res.stdout)
                    w_obj = w_data.get("result", w_data) if isinstance(w_data, dict) else {}
                    run_workers = w_obj.get("workers", []) if isinstance(w_obj, dict) else []
                    if not scan_all and proj_slug and run_workers:
                        wt_match = any(_matches_proj(_extract_wt_id_low(w_item)) for w_item in run_workers)
                        if not wt_match:
                            continue
                    for w_item in run_workers:
                        did = w_item.get("dispatchId") or w_item.get("id")
                        if did and did not in seen_dispatches:
                            seen_dispatches.add(did)
                            workers.append(w_item)
        else:
            res = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "orchestration", "worker-list", "--terminal-state", "active", "--json"], timeout=10)
            if res.returncode != 0:
                try:
                    err_data = json.loads(res.stdout)
                    msg = err_data.get("error", {}).get("message", "Lỗi kết nối Orca Runtime")
                    print(f"⚠️ {msg}")
                    print("💡 Hãy đảm bảo Orca đang mở hoặc chạy lệnh trực tiếp trên terminal máy host.\n")
                    return
                except Exception:
                    print(f"⚠️ Không thể kết nối Orca Runtime (mã lỗi: {res.returncode}).\n")
                    return
            data = json.loads(res.stdout)
            res_obj = data.get("result", data) if isinstance(data, dict) else {}
            raw_workers = res_obj.get("workers", []) if isinstance(res_obj, dict) else (data if isinstance(data, list) else [])
            for w_item in raw_workers:
                if not scan_all and proj_slug:
                    wt_id_low = _extract_wt_id_low(w_item)
                    if wt_id_low and not _matches_proj(wt_id_low):
                        continue
                workers.append(w_item)

        if not workers:
            print("✨ Hiện không có worker nào đang chạy ngầm cần xử lý.\n")
            return

        print(f"{'DISPATCH ID':<28} | {'TERMINAL':<14} | {'STATE':<14} | {'GHI CHÚ / TRẠNG THÁI'}")
        print("-" * 82)
        
        cli_index = _index_cli_transcripts()
        hung_count = 0
        for w in workers:
            d_id = str(w.get("dispatchId") or w.get("id") or "-")
            t_id = str(w.get("taskId") or "-")
            term = str(w.get("terminalHandle") or w.get("agentTerminalHandle") or "-")
            state = str(w.get("terminalState") or w.get("state") or "-")
            w_state = str(w.get("workerState") or w.get("state") or "-")
            
            note = ""
            if d_id != "-":
                try:
                    show_res = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "orchestration", "worker-show", "--dispatch", d_id, "--json"], timeout=10)
                    if show_res.returncode == 0:
                        s_data = json.loads(show_res.stdout)
                        s_res = s_data.get("result", s_data) if isinstance(s_data, dict) else {}
                        w_info = s_res.get("worker") or {}
                        d_info = s_res.get("dispatch") or {}
                        if w_info.get("state"):
                            w_state = str(w_info.get("state"))
                        elif d_info.get("status") in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "timed_out"):
                            w_state = str(d_info.get("status"))
                        obs = s_res.get("observation", {})
                        if obs.get("agentWait"):
                            if auto_unblock and term != "-":
                                # An toàn (Fail-Closed): Phân tích màn hình terminal, chỉ duyệt khi an toàn
                                is_safe = False
                                unsafe_reason = "terminal read failed"
                                try:
                                    t_read = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "terminal", "read", "--terminal", term, "--limit", "15", "--screen", "--json"], timeout=5)
                                    if t_read.returncode == 0:
                                        t_data = json.loads(t_read.stdout)
                                        t_res = t_data.get("result", t_data) if isinstance(t_data, dict) else {}
                                        term_obj = t_res.get("terminal", {}) if isinstance(t_res, dict) else {}
                                        if isinstance(term_obj, dict) and term_obj.get("source") == "screen-unavailable":
                                            is_safe, unsafe_reason = False, "screen unavailable"
                                        else:
                                            tail_lines = term_obj.get("tail") if isinstance(term_obj, dict) else None
                                            if isinstance(tail_lines, list):
                                                screen_txt = "\n".join(str(line) for line in tail_lines)
                                            else:
                                                screen_txt = str(t_res.get("content") or t_res.get("screen") or "")
                                            is_safe, unsafe_reason = _watchdog_prompt_is_safe(screen_txt)
                                except Exception:
                                    is_safe = False

                                if is_safe:
                                    send_res = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "terminal", "send", "--terminal", term, "--text", "y", "--enter"], timeout=5)
                                    if send_res.returncode == 0:
                                        note = "🔓 ĐÃ TỰ ĐỘNG GỬI [y] MỞ KHÓA"
                                    else:
                                        note = "⚠️ KẸT CÂU HỎI (Mở khóa lỗi)"
                                        hung_count += 1
                                else:
                                    note = f"⚠️ CẦN DUYỆT THỦ CÔNG ({unsafe_reason})"
                                    hung_count += 1
                            else:
                                note = "⚠️ ĐANG KẸT CÂU HỎI XÁC NHẬN [Y/N]"
                                hung_count += 1
                except Exception:
                    pass

            tf_match = (
                cli_index["by_dispatch"].get(d_id)
                or cli_index["by_task"].get(t_id)
                or cli_index["by_term"].get(term)
            )
            t_metrics = _analyze_antigravity_transcript(tf_match, scope_id=d_id) if tf_match else {}
            if t_metrics and t_metrics.get("bloated_logs"):
                if auto_unblock:
                    tasks_dir = (tf_match.parent.parent / "tasks") if (tf_match and tf_match.parent.name == "logs") else None
                    guard_bin = os.path.expanduser("~/.local/bin/orca-command-guard")
                    if not os.path.exists(guard_bin):
                        guard_bin = str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent / "orca-command-guard.py")
                    try:
                        if tasks_dir and tasks_dir.is_dir() and os.path.exists(guard_bin):
                            import importlib.util
                            from importlib.machinery import SourceFileLoader
                            guard_spec = importlib.util.spec_from_file_location(
                                "orca_guard", guard_bin, loader=SourceFileLoader("orca_guard", guard_bin)
                            )
                            guard_mod = importlib.util.module_from_spec(guard_spec)
                            guard_spec.loader.exec_module(guard_mod)
                            guard_mod.MAX_TASK_LOG_BYTES = 10 * 1024 * 1024
                            guard_mod._enforce_task_log_cap(tasks_dir)
                        else:
                            for bl_path, bl_sz in t_metrics["bloated_logs"]:
                                bl_p = Path(bl_path)
                                with open(bl_p, "rb") as bf:
                                    head_b = bf.read(256 * 1024)
                                    bf.seek(max(0, bl_sz - 128 * 1024))
                                    tail_b = bf.read()
                                bl_p.write_bytes(head_b + f"\n[... ORCA-WATCHDOG: đã lược bỏ {bl_sz - len(head_b) - len(tail_b):,} bytes giữa log ...]\n".encode() + tail_b)
                        bl_msg = "🛡️ ĐÃ NGẮT LỆNH XẢ LOG >10MB & CẮT GỌN FILE LOG"
                        note = f"{note} | {bl_msg}" if note else bl_msg
                    except Exception:
                        pass
                else:
                    bl_msg = "⚠️ LOG PHÌNH TO >10MB (chạy --unblock để cắt gọn)"
                    note = f"{note} | {bl_msg}" if note else bl_msg
                    hung_count += 1

            if not note:
                idle_s = t_metrics.get("idle_since_last_secs", 0.0) if t_metrics else 0.0
                if w_state not in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "timed_out") and idle_s > 180:
                    unblocked_idle = False
                    if auto_unblock and term != "-":
                        try:
                            cap_fixed = 0
                            if tf_match and tf_match.parent.name == "logs":
                                tasks_dir = tf_match.parent.parent / "tasks"
                                guard_bin = os.path.expanduser("~/.local/bin/orca-command-guard")
                                if not os.path.exists(guard_bin):
                                    guard_bin = str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent / "orca-command-guard.py")
                                if tasks_dir.is_dir() and os.path.exists(guard_bin):
                                    import importlib.util
                                    from importlib.machinery import SourceFileLoader
                                    guard_spec = importlib.util.spec_from_file_location(
                                        "orca_guard", guard_bin, loader=SourceFileLoader("orca_guard", guard_bin)
                                    )
                                    guard_mod = importlib.util.module_from_spec(guard_spec)
                                    guard_spec.loader.exec_module(guard_mod)
                                    cap_fixed = guard_mod._enforce_task_log_cap(tasks_dir) or 0
                            if cap_fixed > 0:
                                note = f"🔓 ĐÃ TỰ ĐỘNG NGẮT TIẾN TRÌNH JEST/LOG TREO ({_fmt_dur(idle_s)})"
                                unblocked_idle = True
                            else:
                                t_read_idle = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "terminal", "read", "--terminal", term, "--limit", "15", "--screen", "--json"], timeout=5)
                                if t_read_idle.returncode == 0:
                                    t_data_i = json.loads(t_read_idle.stdout)
                                    t_res_i = t_data_i.get("result", t_data_i) if isinstance(t_data_i, dict) else {}
                                    term_obj_i = t_res_i.get("terminal", {}) if isinstance(t_res_i, dict) else {}
                                    tail_i = term_obj_i.get("tail") if isinstance(term_obj_i, dict) else None
                                    scr_i = "\n".join(str(line) for line in tail_i) if isinstance(tail_i, list) else str(t_res_i.get("content") or t_res_i.get("screen") or "")
                                    clean_i = re.sub(r"\x1b\[[0-9;?]*[A-Za-z]", "", scr_i)
                                    has_destructive = any(rx.search(clean_i) for rx in _WATCHDOG_DESTRUCTIVE_RES)
                                    if not has_destructive and re.search(r"(?m)^\s*[>❯]\s*$", clean_i):
                                        nudge_res = _safe_orca_run(
                                            [
                                                orca_bin, "terminal", "send", "--terminal", term,
                                                "--text", "Tiếp tục hoàn thành nhiệm vụ đang dở (nếu chạy jest phải kèm --forceExit) và gửi báo cáo worker_done về Coordinator ngay khi xong.",
                                                "--enter",
                                            ],
                                            timeout=5,
                                        )
                                        if nudge_res.returncode == 0:
                                            note = f"🔓 ĐÃ GỬI NUDGE ĐÁNH THỨC WORKER TREO ({_fmt_dur(idle_s)})"
                                            unblocked_idle = True
                        except Exception:
                            pass
                    if not unblocked_idle:
                        note = f"⚠️ KHÔNG PHẢN HỒI {_fmt_dur(idle_s)} (last_tool={t_metrics.get('last_tool', '-')})"
                        hung_count += 1
                elif state == "active":
                    note = f"🟢 Đang thực thi ({t_metrics.get('turns', 0)}t, {t_metrics.get('out_tok_s', 0.0):.1f} tok/s)" if t_metrics else "🟢 Đang thực thi"
                elif state == "reclaimable":
                    note = "⚪ Đã xong / Sẵn sàng giải phóng"
                elif state == "retained":
                    note = "🟡 Đang giữ để debug"
                else:
                    note = state

            print(f"{d_id:<28} | {term:<14} | {state:<14} | {note}")

        print("-" * 82)
        if hung_count > 0:
            print(f"⚠️ Phát hiện {hung_count} worker đang bị treo hoặc chờ input!")
            if not auto_unblock:
                print("👉 Tự động mở khóa các worker an toàn: orca-team watchdog --unblock")
            else:
                print("👉 Các worker còn lại đang chờ duyệt lệnh nhạy cảm hoặc bị kẹt tiến trình.")
            print("👉 Để dừng worker bị treo:              orca orchestration worker-stop --dispatch <id>\n")
        else:
            print("✅ Toàn bộ worker đều hoạt động trơn tru.\n")
    except Exception as e:
        print(f"⚠️ Lỗi quét worker: {e}\n")

def estimate_tokens(text: str) -> int:
    if not text:
        return 0
    non_ascii = sum(1 for c in text if ord(c) > 127)
    ascii_chars = len(text) - non_ascii
    return max(1, int(round((ascii_chars / 3.8) + (non_ascii / 2.0))))


def _parse_iso_utc(s):
    if s is None or isinstance(s, bool):
        return None
    from datetime import datetime, timezone
    if isinstance(s, (int, float)):
        v = float(s)
        if v <= 0:
            return None
        return datetime.fromtimestamp(v / 1000.0 if v > 1e11 else v, tz=timezone.utc)
    try:
        clean = str(s).strip()
        if not clean:
            return None
        if re.match(r"^\d+(?:\.\d+)?$", clean):
            v = float(clean)
            if v <= 0:
                return None
            return datetime.fromtimestamp(v / 1000.0 if v > 1e11 else v, tz=timezone.utc)
        if clean.endswith("Z"):
            clean = clean[:-1] + "+00:00"
        elif " " in clean and "+" not in clean and "T" not in clean:
            clean = clean.replace(" ", "T") + "+00:00"
        dt = datetime.fromisoformat(clean)
        if dt.tzinfo is None:
            dt = dt.replace(tzinfo=timezone.utc)
        return dt
    except Exception:
        return None


def _fmt_dur(secs: float) -> str:
    secs_i = max(0, int(round(secs)))
    if secs_i >= 3600:
        return f"{secs_i // 3600}h{(secs_i % 3600) // 60:02d}m"
    if secs_i >= 60:
        return f"{secs_i // 60}m{secs_i % 60:02d}s"
    return f"{secs_i}s"


def _fmt_tok(n: int) -> str:
    if n >= 1_000_000:
        return f"{n / 1_000_000:.2f}M"
    if n >= 10_000:
        return f"{n / 1_000:.1f}k"
    return f"{n:,}"


def _command_from_tool_call(tc: dict) -> str:
    if not isinstance(tc, dict):
        return ""
    if str(tc.get("name") or "") not in ("run_command", "Bash", "bash"):
        return ""
    args = tc.get("arguments") or tc.get("args") or tc.get("input") or {}
    if isinstance(args, str):
        try:
            args = json.loads(args)
        except Exception:
            return args
    if isinstance(args, dict):
        return str(args.get("CommandLine") or args.get("command") or args.get("cmd") or "")
    return ""


def _load_normalized_transcript_steps(tf_path: Path) -> list:
    """Load and normalize steps from either Antigravity (`transcript.jsonl`) or Claude Code (`~/.claude/projects/*/*.jsonl`)."""
    if not tf_path or not tf_path.exists():
        return []
    is_claude = ".claude/projects" in str(tf_path) or tf_path.name not in ("transcript.jsonl", "transcript_full.jsonl")
    if not is_claude:
        full_tf = tf_path.parent / "transcript_full.jsonl"
        read_tf = full_tf if full_tf.exists() else tf_path
        try:
            raw_lines = read_tf.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore").splitlines()
        except Exception:
            return []
        all_steps = []
        for ln in raw_lines:
            if not ln.strip():
                continue
            try:
                obj = json.loads(ln)
            except ValueError:
                continue
            if isinstance(obj, dict):
                all_steps.append(obj)
        return all_steps

    # Claude Code JSONL format (`type: "user" | "assistant"`, streaming blocks sharing `message.id`)
    try:
        with open(tf_path, "r", encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore") as f:
            raw_objs = []
            for ln in f:
                if '"type":"user"' not in ln and '"type":"assistant"' not in ln and '"type": "user"' not in ln and '"type": "assistant"' not in ln:
                    continue
                try:
                    obj = json.loads(ln)
                    if isinstance(obj, dict) and obj.get("type") in ("user", "assistant"):
                        raw_objs.append(obj)
                except Exception:
                    continue
    except Exception:
        return []

    steps = []
    last_ts = ""
    i = 0
    n = len(raw_objs)
    while i < n:
        obj = raw_objs[i]
        t = obj.get("type")
        ts = str(obj.get("timestamp") or "")
        if t == "user":
            msg = obj.get("message") or {}
            cnt = msg.get("content")
            if isinstance(cnt, list) and any(isinstance(b, dict) and b.get("type") == "tool_result" for b in cnt):
                for b in cnt:
                    if isinstance(b, dict) and b.get("type") == "tool_result":
                        rc = b.get("content")
                        rc_str = (
                            "\n".join(str(x.get("text") or x) if isinstance(x, dict) else str(x) for x in rc)
                            if isinstance(rc, list)
                            else str(rc or "")
                        )
                        steps.append({
                            "type": "GENERIC",
                            "created_at": last_ts or ts or "",
                            "status": "ERROR" if b.get("is_error") else "DONE",
                            "content": f"Completed At: {ts}\n{rc_str}" if ts else rc_str,
                        })
            else:
                u_str = (
                    cnt
                    if isinstance(cnt, str)
                    else ("\n".join(str(x.get("text") or "") for x in cnt if isinstance(x, dict)) if isinstance(cnt, list) else "")
                )
                if u_str and not u_str.lstrip().startswith(("<local-command-", "<command-name>", "<task-notification>")):
                    steps.append({"type": "USER_INPUT", "created_at": ts or last_ts or "", "content": u_str})
            if ts:
                last_ts = ts
            i += 1
        elif t == "assistant":
            msg = obj.get("message") or {}
            mid = msg.get("id")
            usage = msg.get("usage") or {}
            it = int(usage.get("input_tokens") or 0) + int(usage.get("cache_creation_input_tokens") or 0)
            ct = int(usage.get("cache_read_input_tokens") or 0)
            ot = int(usage.get("output_tokens") or 0)
            tcs = []
            pending_generics = []
            t_start = last_ts or ts or ""
            t_end = ts or last_ts or ""
            j = i
            while j < n:
                oj = raw_objs[j]
                tj = oj.get("type")
                tsj = str(oj.get("timestamp") or "")
                if tj == "assistant":
                    mj = oj.get("message") or {}
                    if mid and mj.get("id") == mid:
                        uj = mj.get("usage") or {}
                        if uj:
                            it = max(it, int(uj.get("input_tokens") or 0) + int(uj.get("cache_creation_input_tokens") or 0))
                            ct = max(ct, int(uj.get("cache_read_input_tokens") or 0))
                            ot = max(ot, int(uj.get("output_tokens") or 0))
                        if tsj:
                            t_end = tsj
                        for b in (mj.get("content") or []):
                            if isinstance(b, dict) and b.get("type") == "tool_use":
                                b_name = str(b.get("name") or "")
                                b_inp = b.get("input") or {}
                                tcs.append({
                                    "name": b_name,
                                    "args": b_inp if isinstance(b_inp, dict) else {},
                                })
                        j += 1
                        continue
                    elif not mid and j == i:
                        for b in (mj.get("content") or []):
                            if isinstance(b, dict) and b.get("type") == "tool_use":
                                b_name = str(b.get("name") or "")
                                b_inp = b.get("input") or {}
                                tcs.append({
                                    "name": b_name,
                                    "args": b_inp if isinstance(b_inp, dict) else {},
                                })
                        j += 1
                        break
                    else:
                        break
                elif tj == "user":
                    mj = oj.get("message") or {}
                    cj = mj.get("content")
                    has_more_same_mid = False
                    if mid and isinstance(cj, list) and any(isinstance(b, dict) and b.get("type") == "tool_result" for b in cj):
                        for k_look in range(j + 1, min(n, j + 30)):
                            if raw_objs[k_look].get("type") == "assistant" and (raw_objs[k_look].get("message") or {}).get("id") == mid:
                                has_more_same_mid = True
                                break
                    if has_more_same_mid:
                        for b in cj:
                            if isinstance(b, dict) and b.get("type") == "tool_result":
                                rc = b.get("content")
                                rc_str = (
                                    "\n".join(str(x.get("text") or x) if isinstance(x, dict) else str(x) for x in rc)
                                    if isinstance(rc, list)
                                    else str(rc or "")
                                )
                                pending_generics.append({
                                    "type": "GENERIC",
                                    "created_at": t_end,
                                    "status": "ERROR" if b.get("is_error") else "DONE",
                                    "content": f"Completed At: {tsj}\n{rc_str}" if tsj else rc_str,
                                })
                        j += 1
                        continue
                    break
                else:
                    j += 1
            if it > 0 or ct > 0 or ot > 0 or tcs:
                steps.append({
                    "type": "PLANNER_RESPONSE",
                    "created_at": t_start,
                    "completed_at": t_end,
                    "input_tokens": it,
                    "cache_read_tokens": ct,
                    "output_tokens": ot,
                    "tool_calls": tcs,
                })
                for pg in pending_generics:
                    pg["created_at"] = t_end
                    steps.append(pg)
            if t_end:
                last_ts = t_end
            i = j
        else:
            i += 1
    return steps


def _slice_transcript_steps(steps: list, tf_path: Path, scope_id: str = None) -> list:
    """Slice multi-dispatch worker transcripts or multi-run leader transcripts to the exact `scope_id` window."""
    if not scope_id or not steps:
        return steps
    try:
        if scope_id.startswith("ctx_"):
            # Worker transcript may contain multiple dispatches when 1 Role = 1 Worktree terminal reuse is active
            dispatch_starts = []
            for idx_pos, s in enumerate(steps):
                if s.get("type") == "USER_INPUT":
                    c = str(s.get("content") or "")
                    if "You are a dispatched worker" in c or "--dispatch-id" in c or "ctx_" in c:
                        header_c = c.split("=== TASK ===")[0] if "=== TASK ===" in c else c
                        cids = re.findall(r"--dispatch(?:-id)?\s+(ctx_[a-f0-9]{12})\b", header_c)
                        if not cids and "You are a dispatched worker" in header_c:
                            cids = re.findall(r"\bctx_[a-f0-9]{12}\b", header_c)
                        if not cids:
                            cids = re.findall(r"--dispatch(?:-id)?\s+(ctx_[a-f0-9]{12})\b", c)
                        if cids or "You are a dispatched worker" in c:
                            dispatch_starts.append((idx_pos, set(cids)))
            if dispatch_starts:
                for k, (start_pos, cids_set) in enumerate(dispatch_starts):
                    if scope_id in cids_set:
                        end_pos = len(steps)
                        for m in range(k + 1, len(dispatch_starts)):
                            if scope_id not in dispatch_starts[m][1]:
                                end_pos = dispatch_starts[m][0]
                                break
                        return steps[start_pos:end_pos]
                # Nếu transcript chỉ có đúng 1 phiên worker (khớp qua by_task hoặc by_term), trả về từ đầu phiên đó
                if len(dispatch_starts) == 1:
                    return steps[dispatch_starts[0][0]:]
                return []

        elif scope_id.startswith("run_"):
            # Leader transcript may contain multiple sequential orchestration runs (`run-create`) or resumed `--run <rid>` blocks
            def _is_bg_task_sys_msg(st_obj: dict) -> bool:
                if st_obj.get("type") != "SYSTEM_MESSAGE":
                    return False
                txt = str(st_obj.get("content") or "")
                return (
                    "[Message from background task" in txt
                    or bool(re.search(r'Task id "[^"]+/task-\d+" finished with result:', txt))
                )

            run_creates = []
            step_runs = {}
            orch_steps = set()
            release_steps = set()
            for idx_pos, s in enumerate(steps):
                st_type = s.get("type")
                if st_type in ("SYSTEM_MESSAGE", "USER_INPUT"):
                    sm_str = str(s.get("content") or "")
                    for r_m in re.findall(r"\[ORCA RUNTIME NOTIFICATION\s+—\s+RUN:\s*(run_[a-f0-9]{12})\b", sm_str):
                        step_runs.setdefault(idx_pos, set()).add(r_m)
                        if idx_pos + 1 < len(steps) and steps[idx_pos + 1].get("type") == "PLANNER_RESPONSE":
                            step_runs.setdefault(idx_pos + 1, set()).add(r_m)
                            orch_steps.add(idx_pos + 1)
                    if _is_bg_task_sys_msg(s):
                        for r_m in re.findall(r'(?:Created\s+|RUN=|"run(?:Id|_id)"\s*:\s*"|\brun:|"run"\s*:\s*\{\s*"id"\s*:\s*")(run_[a-f0-9]{12})\b', sm_str):
                            step_runs.setdefault(idx_pos, set()).add(r_m)
                    continue
                if st_type != "PLANNER_RESPONSE":
                    continue
                tcs = s.get("tool_calls") or []
                has_rc = False
                has_orch = False
                for tc in tcs:
                    if not isinstance(tc, dict):
                        continue
                    cmd = _command_from_tool_call(tc)
                    if not cmd or "orca-monitor" in cmd:
                        continue
                    if not re.search(r"\bpython3?\b", cmd) and re.search(r"\borca\s+orchestration\s+run-create\b", cmd):
                        has_rc = True
                        has_orch = True
                        orch_steps.add(idx_pos)
                    if re.search(
                        r"\b(?:orca\s+orchestration\s+(?:task-create|worker-start|check|worker-read|gate-create|gate-resolve|task-update|worker-retain|worker-release|worker-stop|send|reply|run-show|task-list|worker-list)|orca-team\s+(?:plan|pin-plan|master-plan|worktree-arg|wt-arg|slot-arg|merge-upstream|merge-run|run-branches|release-workers|cleanup-tabs|gc-workers))\b",
                        cmd,
                    ):
                        has_orch = True
                        orch_steps.add(idx_pos)
                        for r_m in re.findall(r"--(?:run|run-id|id)(?:=|\s+)[\"']?(run_[a-f0-9]{12})\b", cmd):
                            step_runs.setdefault(idx_pos, set()).add(r_m)
                    if re.search(r"\b(?:orca\s+orchestration\s+(?:worker-release|worker-stop)|orca-team\s+(?:release-workers|cleanup-tabs|gc-workers))\b", cmd):
                        release_steps.add(idx_pos)
                if has_rc or has_orch:
                    j = idx_pos + 1
                    created_rids = []
                    fallback_rids = []
                    max_scan = min(len(steps), idx_pos + 12)
                    while j < max_scan:
                        jt = steps[j].get("type")
                        c_str = str(steps[j].get("content") or "")
                        if jt == "USER_INPUT":
                            break
                        if jt == "GENERIC" or _is_bg_task_sys_msg(steps[j]):
                            for r_m in re.findall(r'(?:"run(?:Id|_id)"\s*:\s*"|\brun:|\[Run\s+)(run_[a-f0-9]{12})\b', c_str):
                                step_runs.setdefault(idx_pos, set()).add(r_m)
                            if has_rc:
                                created_rids.extend(
                                    re.findall(r'(?:Created\s+|RUN=|"run"\s*:\s*\{\s*"id"\s*:\s*")(run_[a-f0-9]{12})\b', c_str)
                                )
                                fallback_rids.extend(re.findall(r"\brun_[a-f0-9]{12}\b", c_str))
                        elif jt == "PLANNER_RESPONSE":
                            # Stop scanning GENERIC if we hit another run-create, otherwise allow scanning for async background task completion
                            next_tcs = steps[j].get("tool_calls") or []
                            if any(not re.search(r"\bpython3?\b", _command_from_tool_call(ntc)) and re.search(r"\borca\s+orchestration\s+run-create\b", _command_from_tool_call(ntc)) for ntc in next_tcs if isinstance(ntc, dict)):
                                break
                            if not has_rc or created_rids:
                                break
                        j += 1
                    if has_rc:
                        chosen_rid = created_rids[-1] if created_rids else (fallback_rids[-1] if fallback_rids else None)
                        if chosen_rid:
                            run_creates.append((idx_pos, chosen_rid))
                            step_runs.setdefault(idx_pos, set()).add(chosen_rid)

            def _advance_past_turn(pos: int, limit_pos: int) -> int:
                p = pos
                while p + 1 < limit_pos and steps[p + 1].get("type") == "GENERIC":
                    p += 1
                if p + 1 < limit_pos and steps[p + 1].get("type") == "PLANNER_RESPONSE" and not (steps[p + 1].get("tool_calls") or []):
                    p += 1
                return p

            def _is_short_confirm(content_str: str) -> bool:
                m_req = re.search(r"<USER_REQUEST>(.*?)</USER_REQUEST>", content_str, re.S)
                req = (m_req.group(1) if m_req else content_str).strip()
                return len(req) <= 45

            def _find_run_start(rc_pos: int, prev_rc_pos: int, target_rid: str = None) -> int:
                floor_pos = prev_rc_pos
                for b_pos in range(rc_pos - 1, prev_rc_pos, -1):
                    rset = step_runs.get(b_pos, set())
                    if b_pos in release_steps or (rset and (not target_rid or target_rid not in rset)):
                        floor_pos = _advance_past_turn(b_pos, rc_pos)
                        break
                u_positions = [p for p in range(floor_pos + 1, rc_pos) if steps[p].get("type") == "USER_INPUT"]
                if not u_positions:
                    if floor_pos > prev_rc_pos:
                        return min(rc_pos, floor_pos + 1)
                    for b_pos in range(rc_pos - 1, prev_rc_pos, -1):
                        if steps[b_pos].get("type") == "USER_INPUT":
                            return b_pos
                    return 0 if prev_rc_pos < 0 else rc_pos
                chosen = u_positions[-1]
                idx_u = len(u_positions) - 1
                while idx_u > 0 and _is_short_confirm(str(steps[u_positions[idx_u]].get("content") or "")):
                    idx_u -= 1
                    chosen = u_positions[idx_u]
                return chosen

            for k, (rc_pos, rid) in enumerate(run_creates):
                if rid == scope_id:
                    prev_rc_pos = run_creates[k - 1][0] if k > 0 else -1
                    start_pos = _find_run_start(rc_pos, prev_rc_pos, scope_id)
                    if k + 1 < len(run_creates):
                        next_rc_pos, next_rid = run_creates[k + 1]
                        end_pos = _find_run_start(next_rc_pos, rc_pos, next_rid)
                    else:
                        last_own = rc_pos
                        for p_idx in range(rc_pos, len(steps)):
                            rset = step_runs.get(p_idx, set())
                            if rset and scope_id not in rset:
                                break
                            if p_idx in orch_steps or scope_id in rset:
                                last_own = p_idx
                        last_own_end = _advance_past_turn(last_own, len(steps))
                        end_pos = len(steps)
                        for fwd_pos in range(last_own_end + 1, len(steps)):
                            fwd_type = steps[fwd_pos].get("type")
                            if fwd_type == "USER_INPUT":
                                end_pos = fwd_pos
                                break
                            if fwd_type == "SYSTEM_MESSAGE":
                                sm_txt = str(steps[fwd_pos].get("content") or "")
                                if _is_bg_task_sys_msg(steps[fwd_pos]) or scope_id in sm_txt:
                                    continue
                                end_pos = fwd_pos
                                break
                    return steps[start_pos:end_pos] if end_pos > start_pos else []

            # Fallback for resumed/non-creator sessions that coordinated `scope_id` via `--run <rid>` / `--id <rid>`
            coord_pos = [p for p, rset in sorted(step_runs.items()) if scope_id in rset]
            if coord_pos:
                first_c, last_c = coord_pos[0], coord_pos[-1]
                prev_other = -1
                for p_idx in range(first_c - 1, -1, -1):
                    rset = step_runs.get(p_idx, set())
                    if (rset and scope_id not in rset) or any(rc_p == p_idx for rc_p, _ in run_creates):
                        prev_other = _advance_past_turn(p_idx, first_c)
                        break
                start_pos = _find_run_start(first_c, prev_other, scope_id)
                next_other = len(steps)
                for p_idx in range(last_c + 1, len(steps)):
                    rset = step_runs.get(p_idx, set())
                    if (rset and scope_id not in rset) or any(rc_p == p_idx for rc_p, _ in run_creates):
                        next_other = p_idx
                        break
                last_c_end = _advance_past_turn(last_c, next_other)
                end_pos = next_other
                for fwd_pos in range(last_c_end + 1, next_other):
                    fwd_type = steps[fwd_pos].get("type")
                    if fwd_type == "USER_INPUT":
                        end_pos = fwd_pos
                        break
                    if fwd_type == "SYSTEM_MESSAGE":
                        sm_txt = str(steps[fwd_pos].get("content") or "")
                        if _is_bg_task_sys_msg(steps[fwd_pos]) or scope_id in sm_txt:
                            continue
                        end_pos = fwd_pos
                        break
                return steps[start_pos:end_pos] if end_pos > start_pos else []
            return []
    except Exception:
        pass
    return steps


_GIT_COMMIT_CMD_RE = re.compile(
    r"(?:^|[;&|()\n])\s*(?:env\s+\S+=\S+\s+)*git(?:\s+(?:-C|-c)\s+\S+|\s+--[\w-]+(?:=\S+)?)*\s+commit\b(?!-)"
)
_GIT_COMMIT_AMEND_RE = re.compile(
    r"(?:^|[;&|()\n])\s*(?:env\s+\S+=\S+\s+)*git(?:\s+(?:-C|-c)\s+\S+|\s+--[\w-]+(?:=\S+)?)*\s+commit\b[^\n;&|]*\s--amend\b"
)
_GIT_COMMIT_HEADER_RE = re.compile(
    r"(?m)^\[(?:[a-zA-Z0-9_./-]+|detached HEAD)(?:\s+\(root-commit\))?\s+([0-9a-f]{7,40})\]\s+([^\n\r]+)"
)
_GIT_MERGE_SUBJ_RE = re.compile(r"(?i)^(?:Merge\b|\w+\(merge\):)")
_GIT_REV_INSPECT_CMD_RE = re.compile(
    r"(?:^|[;&|()\n])\s*git(?:\s+(?:-C|-c)\s+\S+)?\s+(?:rev-parse(?:\s+--short)?\s+HEAD\b|log\b[^\n;&|]*-(?:1|n\s*1)\b(?![^\n;&|]*\b[0-9a-f]{7,40}\b)|show\b(?![^\n;&|]*\b[0-9a-f]{7,40}\b))"
)


def _is_feature_git_commit_cmd(cmd_str: str) -> bool:
    """Return True if cmd_str runs a non-merge feature/fix `git commit` (excluding plain `git commit --no-edit` merge continuation)."""
    if not cmd_str or not _GIT_COMMIT_CMD_RE.search(cmd_str):
        return False
    for seg in re.split(r"[;&|\n]+", cmd_str):
        if _GIT_COMMIT_CMD_RE.search(seg):
            if "--no-edit" in seg and not re.search(r"(?:\s-(?:[a-zA-Z]*[amF]|-amend|-message|-all|-file)\b)", seg):
                continue
            return True
    return False


def _step_end_dt(st_obj: dict):
    """Lấy thời điểm kết thúc thực tế của một step (ưu tiên Completed At trong content hoặc completed_at)."""
    if not isinstance(st_obj, dict):
        return None
    c_str = str(st_obj.get("content") or "")
    m_comp = re.search(r"Completed At:\s*([^\n\r]+)", c_str)
    if m_comp:
        dt = _parse_iso_utc(m_comp.group(1).strip())
        if dt:
            return dt
    return _parse_iso_utc(st_obj.get("completed_at")) or _parse_iso_utc(st_obj.get("created_at"))


def _analyze_antigravity_transcript(tf_path: Path, scope_id: str = None) -> dict:
    all_steps = _load_normalized_transcript_steps(tf_path)
    if not all_steps:
        return {}

    steps = _slice_transcript_steps(all_steps, tf_path, scope_id)
    if not steps:
        return {}

    measured_llm_secs = 0.0
    measured_out_tok = 0
    for i, s in enumerate(steps):
        if s.get("type") == "PLANNER_RESPONSE":
            t_s = _parse_iso_utc(s.get("created_at"))
            t_comp = _parse_iso_utc(s.get("completed_at"))
            ot = int(s.get("output_tokens") or 0)
            if t_s and t_comp:
                dt = max(0.5, (t_comp - t_s).total_seconds())
                if dt <= 120.0 and ot >= 20:
                    measured_llm_secs += dt
                    measured_out_tok += ot
            elif i > 0 and t_s:
                prev_end = _step_end_dt(steps[i - 1])
                if prev_end and 0.3 <= (t_s - prev_end).total_seconds() <= 120.0 and ot >= 20:
                    measured_llm_secs += (t_s - prev_end).total_seconds()
                    measured_out_tok += ot
    raw_rate = (measured_out_tok / measured_llm_secs) if measured_llm_secs > 0 else 50.0
    avg_rate = max(30.0, min(120.0, raw_rate))

    llm_secs = 0.0
    tool_secs = 0.0
    idle_wait_secs = 0.0
    in_tok = 0
    cache_tok = 0
    out_tok = 0
    peak_ctx = 0
    last_ctx = 0
    cum_ctx_tok = 0
    tool_output_tok = 0
    max_tool_output_tok = 0
    max_tool_cmd = ""
    replayed_checks = 0
    help_calls = 0
    context_bomb_cmds = []
    referenced_task_logs = set()
    turns = 0
    poll_turns = 0
    view_calls = 0
    tool_calls = 0
    tool_errors = 0
    last_tool_name = "-"
    commit_shas = []
    ran_git_commit = False
    pending_truncated_commit = False

    for i, s in enumerate(steps):
        for m_tl in re.findall(r"\b(task-\d+)\b", str(s.get("content") or "")):
            referenced_task_logs.add(f"{m_tl}.log")
        if s.get("type") == "PLANNER_RESPONSE":
            turns += 1
            it = int(s.get("input_tokens") or 0)
            ct = int(s.get("cache_read_tokens") or 0)
            ot = int(s.get("output_tokens") or 0)
            if ot <= 0:
                # Ước tính output tokens khi Antigravity transcript không ghi trường output_tokens
                est_out_txt = str(s.get("content") or "") + "\n" + str(s.get("thinking") or "")
                for tc_o in (s.get("tool_calls") or []):
                    if isinstance(tc_o, dict):
                        est_out_txt += "\n" + json.dumps(tc_o, ensure_ascii=False)
                ot = estimate_tokens(est_out_txt)
            in_tok += it
            cache_tok += ct
            out_tok += ot
            last_ctx = it + ct
            cum_ctx_tok += last_ctx
            if last_ctx > peak_ctx:
                peak_ctx = last_ctx
            tcs = s.get("tool_calls") or []
            tool_calls += len(tcs)
            tc_names_in_turn = []
            for tc_item in tcs:
                if isinstance(tc_item, dict):
                    nm_item = str(tc_item.get("name") or tc_item.get("tool_name") or "-")
                    tc_names_in_turn.append(nm_item)
                    if nm_item in ("view_file", "Read"):
                        view_calls += 1
            tc_cmds = [_command_from_tool_call(tc) for tc in tcs if isinstance(tc, dict)]
            for cmd_c in tc_cmds:
                if not cmd_c:
                    continue
                if re.search(r"\b(?:orca|orca-team)\b[^\n]*\s(?:-h|--help|help)\b", cmd_c):
                    help_calls += 1
                if re.search(r"\borca\s+orchestration\s+inbox\b", cmd_c):
                    if "orca orchestration inbox" not in context_bomb_cmds:
                        context_bomb_cmds.append("orca orchestration inbox")
                if re.search(r"\borca\s+orchestration\s+task-create\b[^\n]*\s--json\b", cmd_c):
                    if "task-create --json" not in context_bomb_cmds:
                        context_bomb_cmds.append("task-create --json")
            if tc_names_in_turn:
                last_tool_name = tc_names_in_turn[-1]
                is_pure_poll_tools = all(
                    nm_item in ("manage_task", "schedule", "TaskOutput", "BashOutput", "Sleep")
                    for nm_item in tc_names_in_turn
                )
                is_pure_sleep_cmd = bool(tc_cmds) and all(
                    bool(cmd_c and re.match(r"^\s*sleep\s+\d+(?:\.\d+)?\s*$", cmd_c))
                    for cmd_c in tc_cmds
                )
                if is_pure_poll_tools or is_pure_sleep_cmd:
                    poll_turns += 1
            turn_has_git_commit = any(_is_feature_git_commit_cmd(cmd_c) for cmd_c in tc_cmds if cmd_c)
            turn_has_git_amend = any(_GIT_COMMIT_AMEND_RE.search(cmd_c) for cmd_c in tc_cmds if cmd_c)
            turn_has_rev_inspect = any(_GIT_REV_INSPECT_CMD_RE.search(cmd_c) for cmd_c in tc_cmds if cmd_c)
            turn_has_orca_check = any(bool(cmd_c and re.search(r"\borca\s+orchestration\s+check\b", cmd_c)) for cmd_c in tc_cmds)

            t_start = _parse_iso_utc(s.get("created_at"))
            t_comp = _parse_iso_utc(s.get("completed_at"))

            # 1) Tính thời gian suy luận LLM (llm_secs) của lượt này
            if t_start and t_comp:
                llm_secs += max(0.5, (t_comp - t_start).total_seconds())
            elif i > 0 and t_start:
                prev_end = _step_end_dt(steps[i - 1])
                if prev_end and 0.2 <= (t_start - prev_end).total_seconds() <= 120.0:
                    llm_secs += (t_start - prev_end).total_seconds()
                else:
                    est_dt = min(90.0, max(0.8, ot / avg_rate))
                    llm_secs += est_dt
                    if prev_end and (t_start - prev_end).total_seconds() > est_dt:
                        idle_wait_secs += (t_start - prev_end).total_seconds() - est_dt
            else:
                llm_secs += min(90.0, max(0.8, ot / avg_rate))

            # 2) Tính thời gian chạy Tool (tool_secs) và đo lường Token Output của các GENERIC steps thuộc lượt này
            if i + 1 < len(steps) and steps[i + 1].get("type") == "GENERIC":
                j = i + 1
                t_tool_start = t_comp or t_start
                t_tool_end = t_tool_start
                matched_commit_in_turn = False
                saw_merge_header_in_turn = False
                amend_popped = False
                generic_idx = 0
                while j < len(steps) and steps[j].get("type") == "GENERIC":
                    c = str(steps[j].get("content") or "")
                    for m_tl in re.findall(r"\b(task-\d+)\b", c):
                        referenced_task_logs.add(f"{m_tl}.log")
                    # Lược bỏ dòng header Created At / Completed At khi tính token của tool output
                    c_body = re.sub(r"^(?:Created|Completed) At:\s*[^\n\r]+\r?\n?", "", c, flags=re.M)
                    g_tok = estimate_tokens(c_body)
                    tool_output_tok += g_tok
                    idx_tc = min(generic_idx, len(tcs) - 1) if tcs else -1
                    raw_shell_cmd = tc_cmds[idx_tc] if (0 <= idx_tc < len(tc_cmds)) else ""
                    is_shell_cmd = bool(raw_shell_cmd)
                    if is_shell_cmd:
                        cmd_label = raw_shell_cmd
                    elif 0 <= idx_tc < len(tc_names_in_turn):
                        tn = tc_names_in_turn[idx_tc]
                        tc_obj = tcs[idx_tc] if (0 <= idx_tc < len(tcs) and isinstance(tcs[idx_tc], dict)) else {}
                        tc_args = tc_obj.get("arguments") or tc_obj.get("input") or tc_obj.get("args") or {}
                        if isinstance(tc_args, str):
                            try:
                                tc_args = json.loads(tc_args)
                            except Exception:
                                tc_args = {}
                        fp_arg = ""
                        if isinstance(tc_args, dict):
                            fp_arg = str(tc_args.get("AbsolutePath") or tc_args.get("file_path") or tc_args.get("path") or tc_args.get("TargetFile") or "")
                        cmd_label = f"{tn}({os.path.basename(fp_arg)})" if fp_arg else tn
                    else:
                        cmd_label = "tool"
                    cmd_label_short = " ".join(str(cmd_label or "").split())[:72]
                    if g_tok > max_tool_output_tok:
                        max_tool_output_tok = g_tok
                        max_tool_cmd = cmd_label_short
                    if (
                        is_shell_cmd
                        and g_tok >= 3500
                        and cmd_label_short
                        and not re.search(r"\borca\s+orchestration\s+ask\b", raw_shell_cmd)
                        and not any(cmd_label_short in cb for cb in context_bomb_cmds)
                    ):
                        context_bomb_cmds.append(f"{cmd_label_short} (~{g_tok:,} tok)")
                    if turn_has_orca_check and re.search(r'"replayed"\s*:\s*true', c):
                        replayed_checks += 1
                    if "exited with code" in c and "exited with code 0" not in c:
                        tool_errors += 1
                    elif steps[j].get("status") == "ERROR":
                        tool_errors += 1
                    if turn_has_git_commit:
                        for m_c in _GIT_COMMIT_HEADER_RE.finditer(c):
                            c_sha, c_subj = m_c.group(1), m_c.group(2).strip()
                            if _GIT_MERGE_SUBJ_RE.match(c_subj):
                                saw_merge_header_in_turn = True
                            else:
                                if turn_has_git_amend and not amend_popped and commit_shas:
                                    commit_shas.pop()
                                    amend_popped = True
                                if c_sha not in commit_shas:
                                    commit_shas.append(c_sha)
                                matched_commit_in_turn = True
                                pending_truncated_commit = False
                                ran_git_commit = True
                        if (
                            not matched_commit_in_turn
                            and not saw_merge_header_in_turn
                            and ("exited with code 0" in c or steps[j].get("status") != "ERROR")
                            and ("<truncated" in c or "create mode " in c or "files changed" in c or "file changed" in c)
                        ):
                            if turn_has_git_amend and not amend_popped and commit_shas:
                                commit_shas.pop()
                                amend_popped = True
                            pending_truncated_commit = True
                            ran_git_commit = True
                    elif pending_truncated_commit and turn_has_rev_inspect:
                        m_rev = re.search(r"(?m)^(?:commit\s+)?([0-9a-f]{7,40})\b", c)
                        if m_rev:
                            r_sha = m_rev.group(1)
                            if r_sha not in commit_shas:
                                commit_shas.append(r_sha)
                        pending_truncated_commit = False
                    m1 = re.search(r"Created At:\s*([^\n\r]+)", c)
                    if m1:
                        ts1 = _parse_iso_utc(m1.group(1).strip())
                        if ts1 and (not t_tool_start or ts1 < t_tool_start):
                            t_tool_start = ts1
                    m2 = re.search(r"Completed At:\s*([^\n\r]+)", c)
                    ts2 = _parse_iso_utc(m2.group(1).strip()) if m2 else _parse_iso_utc(steps[j].get("created_at"))
                    if ts2 and (not t_tool_end or ts2 > t_tool_end):
                        t_tool_end = ts2
                    generic_idx += 1
                    j += 1
                if not turn_has_git_commit and pending_truncated_commit:
                    pending_truncated_commit = False
                if t_tool_start and t_tool_end and t_tool_end > t_tool_start:
                    tool_secs += (t_tool_end - t_tool_start).total_seconds()
            elif not turn_has_git_commit and pending_truncated_commit:
                pending_truncated_commit = False

    from datetime import datetime, timezone, timedelta
    t0 = _parse_iso_utc(steps[0].get("created_at"))
    t_last_created = _parse_iso_utc(steps[-1].get("created_at"))
    t_last_comp = _parse_iso_utc(steps[-1].get("completed_at"))
    tN_cands = [t_last_comp, t_last_created]
    if steps[-1].get("type") == "PLANNER_RESPONSE" and not t_last_comp and t_last_created:
        last_ot = int(steps[-1].get("output_tokens") or 0)
        last_est_dt = min(90.0, max(0.8, last_ot / avg_rate))
        tN_cands.append(t_last_created + timedelta(seconds=last_est_dt))
    m_last_comp = re.search(r"Completed At:\s*([^\n\r]+)", str(steps[-1].get("content") or ""))
    if m_last_comp:
        tN_cands.append(_parse_iso_utc(m_last_comp.group(1).strip()))
    tN_valid = [tc_dt for tc_dt in tN_cands if tc_dt is not None]
    tN = max(tN_valid) if tN_valid else None
    active_secs = llm_secs + tool_secs
    wall_secs = max(active_secs, (tN - t0).total_seconds()) if (t0 and tN) else active_secs
    idle_wait_secs = max(idle_wait_secs, max(0.0, wall_secs - active_secs))
    now_utc = datetime.now(timezone.utc)
    idle_since_last = max(0.0, (now_utc - tN).total_seconds()) if tN else 0.0

    bloated_logs = []
    tasks_dir = (tf_path.parent.parent / "tasks") if tf_path.parent.name == "logs" else None
    is_sliced_subset = bool(scope_id and len(steps) < len(all_steps))
    if tasks_dir and tasks_dir.is_dir():
        try:
            for tl in tasks_dir.glob("*.log"):
                st_stat = tl.stat()
                sz = st_stat.st_size
                if sz > 16 * 1024 * 1024:
                    if is_sliced_subset and referenced_task_logs and tl.name not in referenced_task_logs:
                        if t0 and tN:
                            mt = datetime.fromtimestamp(st_stat.st_mtime, tz=timezone.utc)
                            if mt < (t0 - timedelta(seconds=60)) or mt > (tN + timedelta(seconds=60)):
                                continue
                    bloated_logs.append((str(tl), sz))
        except Exception:
            pass

    return {
        "transcript_path": str(tf_path),
        "steps": len(steps),
        "turns": turns,
        "poll_turns": poll_turns,
        "effective_turns": max(0, turns - poll_turns),
        "view_calls": view_calls,
        "tool_calls": tool_calls,
        "tool_errors": tool_errors,
        "in_tok": in_tok,
        "cache_tok": cache_tok,
        "out_tok": out_tok,
        "peak_ctx": peak_ctx,
        "last_ctx": last_ctx,
        "cum_ctx_tok": cum_ctx_tok,
        "tool_output_tok": tool_output_tok,
        "max_tool_output_tok": max_tool_output_tok,
        "max_tool_cmd": max_tool_cmd,
        "replayed_checks": replayed_checks,
        "help_calls": help_calls,
        "context_bomb_cmds": context_bomb_cmds[:5],
        "llm_secs": llm_secs,
        "tool_secs": tool_secs,
        "active_secs": active_secs,
        "wall_secs": wall_secs,
        "idle_wait_secs": idle_wait_secs,
        "idle_since_last_secs": idle_since_last,
        "out_tok_s": out_tok / max(1.0, llm_secs),
        "active_tok_s": out_tok / max(1.0, active_secs),
        "prefill_tok_s": (in_tok + cache_tok + out_tok) / max(1.0, llm_secs),
        "cache_hit_pct": (cache_tok / max(1, in_tok + cache_tok)) * 100.0,
        "avg_turn_s": llm_secs / max(1, turns),
        "last_tool": last_tool_name,
        "last_step_at": steps[-1].get("completed_at") or steps[-1].get("created_at") or "",
        "bloated_logs": bloated_logs,
        "commit_shas": commit_shas,
        "ran_git_commit": ran_git_commit,
    }


def _index_cli_transcripts() -> dict:
    """Scan local CLI session directories (Antigravity & Claude Code) and index transcripts by dispatchId, taskId, termHandle, and runId."""
    by_dispatch = {}
    by_task = {}
    by_term = {}
    by_leader_run = {}

    def _index_parsed_steps(tf: Path, parsed_steps: list, is_cli: int):
        if not parsed_steps:
            return
        user_inputs = [
            str(st.get("content") or "")
            for st in parsed_steps
            if st.get("type") == "USER_INPUT" and st.get("content")
        ]
        is_dispatched_worker = any("You are a dispatched worker" in u for u in user_inputs)
        if is_dispatched_worker:
            header_parts = []
            for u in user_inputs:
                if "You are a dispatched worker" in u:
                    header_parts.append(u.split("=== TASK ===")[0])
                elif "--dispatch-id" in u or "--dispatch " in u:
                    header_parts.append(u)
            blob = "\n".join(header_parts) if header_parts else "\n".join(user_inputs[:2])
            cids = re.findall(r"--dispatch(?:-id)?\s+(ctx_[a-f0-9]{12})\b", blob)
            if not cids:
                cids = re.findall(r"\bctx_[a-f0-9]{12}\b", blob)
            for cid_match in cids:
                by_dispatch[cid_match] = tf
            tids = re.findall(r"--task(?:-id)?\s+(task_[a-f0-9]{12})\b", blob)
            if not tids:
                tids = re.findall(r"\btask_[a-f0-9]{12}\b", blob)
            for tid_match in tids:
                by_task[tid_match] = tf
            worker_terms = re.findall(r"--(?:from|terminal)\s+(term_[a-f0-9-]+)", blob)
            if not worker_terms:
                worker_terms = re.findall(r"Worker terminal(?: handle)?:\s*(term_[a-f0-9-]+)", blob, re.I)
            for trm_match in worker_terms:
                by_term[trm_match] = tf
            return

        creator_ts = {}
        coord_ts = {}
        active_coord_rids = set()
        first_ts = ""
        for st in parsed_steps:
            if st.get("created_at"):
                first_ts = str(st.get("created_at"))
                break
        for idx_s, st in enumerate(parsed_steps):
            st_type = st.get("type")
            if st_type in ("SYSTEM_MESSAGE", "USER_INPUT"):
                sm_str = str(st.get("content") or "")
                sm_ts = str(st.get("created_at") or first_ts or "9999")
                for r_m in re.findall(r"\[ORCA RUNTIME NOTIFICATION\s+—\s+RUN:\s*(run_[a-f0-9]{12})\b", sm_str):
                    coord_ts.setdefault(r_m, sm_ts)
                    active_coord_rids.add(r_m)
                continue
            if st_type != "PLANNER_RESPONSE":
                continue
            step_ts = str(st.get("created_at") or first_ts or "9999")
            tcs = st.get("tool_calls") or []
            has_rc = False
            has_active_orch = False
            for tc in tcs:
                cmd_str = _command_from_tool_call(tc)
                if not cmd_str or "orca-monitor" in cmd_str:
                    continue
                if not re.search(r"\bpython3?\b", cmd_str) and re.search(r"\borca\s+orchestration\s+run-create\b", cmd_str):
                    has_rc = True
                    has_active_orch = True
                if re.search(
                    r"\b(?:orca\s+orchestration\s+(?:task-create|worker-start|check|worker-read|gate-create|gate-resolve|task-update|worker-retain|worker-release|worker-stop|send|reply)|orca-team\s+(?:plan|pin-plan|master-plan|worktree-arg|wt-arg|slot-arg|merge-upstream|merge-run|run-branches|release-workers|cleanup-tabs|gc-workers))\b",
                    cmd_str,
                ):
                    has_active_orch = True
                    for r_m in re.findall(r"--(?:run|run-id|id)(?:=|\s+)[\"']?(run_[a-f0-9]{12})\b", cmd_str):
                        coord_ts.setdefault(r_m, step_ts)
                        active_coord_rids.add(r_m)
            if has_rc or has_active_orch:
                j = idx_s + 1
                created_rids = []
                fallback_rids = []
                max_scan = min(len(parsed_steps), idx_s + 12)
                while j < max_scan:
                    jt = parsed_steps[j].get("type")
                    g_content = str(parsed_steps[j].get("content") or "")
                    if jt == "USER_INPUT":
                        break
                    is_bg_sys = jt == "SYSTEM_MESSAGE" and (
                        "[Message from background task" in g_content
                        or bool(re.search(r'Task id "[^"]+/task-\d+" finished with result:', g_content))
                    )
                    if jt == "GENERIC" or is_bg_sys:
                        for r_m in re.findall(r'(?:"run(?:Id|_id)"\s*:\s*"|\brun:|\[Run\s+)(run_[a-f0-9]{12})\b', g_content):
                            coord_ts.setdefault(r_m, step_ts)
                            if has_active_orch:
                                active_coord_rids.add(r_m)
                        if has_rc:
                            created_rids.extend(
                                re.findall(r'(?:Created\s+|RUN=|"run"\s*:\s*\{\s*"id"\s*:\s*")(run_[a-f0-9]{12})\b', g_content)
                            )
                            fallback_rids.extend(re.findall(r"\brun_[a-f0-9]{12}\b", g_content))
                    elif jt == "PLANNER_RESPONSE":
                        next_tcs = parsed_steps[j].get("tool_calls") or []
                        if any(not re.search(r"\bpython3?\b", _command_from_tool_call(ntc)) and re.search(r"\borca\s+orchestration\s+run-create\b", _command_from_tool_call(ntc)) for ntc in next_tcs if isinstance(ntc, dict)):
                            break
                        if not has_rc or created_rids:
                            break
                    j += 1
                if has_rc:
                    chosen_rid = created_rids[-1] if created_rids else (fallback_rids[-1] if fallback_rids else None)
                    if chosen_rid:
                        creator_ts.setdefault(chosen_rid, step_ts)
                        active_coord_rids.add(chosen_rid)
        all_matched_rids = set(creator_ts.keys()) | (set(coord_ts.keys()) & active_coord_rids)
        for rid_match in all_matched_rids:
            score = 2 if rid_match in creator_ts else 1
            ev_ts = creator_ts.get(rid_match) or coord_ts.get(rid_match) or first_ts or "9999"
            cand = (tf, score, is_cli, ev_ts)
            prev = by_leader_run.get(rid_match)
            if not prev or (score, is_cli) > (prev[1], prev[2]) or ((score, is_cli) == (prev[1], prev[2]) and cand[3] < prev[3]):
                by_leader_run[rid_match] = cand

    roots = [
        Path.home() / ".gemini" / "antigravity-cli" / "brain",
        Path.home() / ".gemini" / "antigravity" / "brain",
    ]
    for r_dir in roots:
        if not r_dir.is_dir():
            continue
        for cid_dir in r_dir.iterdir():
            if not cid_dir.is_dir():
                continue
            tf = cid_dir / ".system_generated" / "logs" / "transcript.jsonl"
            full_tf = cid_dir / ".system_generated" / "logs" / "transcript_full.jsonl"
            if not tf.exists():
                continue
            src_tf = full_tf if full_tf.exists() else tf
            try:
                with open(src_tf, "r", encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore") as f:
                    raw_text = f.read()
            except Exception:
                continue
            if "You are a dispatched worker" not in raw_text and "orchestration" not in raw_text:
                continue
            try:
                parsed_steps = [json.loads(sln) for sln in raw_text.splitlines() if sln.strip()]
                parsed_steps = [st for st in parsed_steps if isinstance(st, dict)]
                _index_parsed_steps(tf, parsed_steps, 1 if "antigravity-cli" in str(tf) else 0)
            except Exception:
                continue

    claude_dir = Path.home() / ".claude" / "projects"
    if claude_dir.is_dir():
        for claude_tf in claude_dir.glob("*/*.jsonl"):
            try:
                with open(claude_tf, "r", encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore") as f:
                    raw_text = f.read()
                if "You are a dispatched worker" not in raw_text and "orchestration" not in raw_text:
                    continue
                parsed_steps = _load_normalized_transcript_steps(claude_tf)
                _index_parsed_steps(claude_tf, parsed_steps, 1)
            except Exception:
                continue

    return {
        "by_dispatch": by_dispatch,
        "by_task": by_task,
        "by_term": by_term,
        "by_leader_run": {rid: v[0] for rid, v in by_leader_run.items()},
    }


def _collect_git_diff_stats(
    wt_path: str,
    wt_name: str,
    root: Path = None,
    start_dt=None,
    comp_dt=None,
    is_active: bool = False,
    commit_shas: list = None,
    has_transcript: bool = False,
    ran_git_commit: bool = False,
) -> dict:
    res = {"files": 0, "ins": 0, "del": 0, "commits": 0}
    has_wt_dir = bool(wt_path and os.path.isdir(wt_path))
    git_dir = wt_path if has_wt_dir else (str(root) if root and root.is_dir() else "")
    if not git_dir:
        return res
    import subprocess
    try:
        def _git(*a, t=2, cwd_override=None):
            r = subprocess.run(["git", "-C", cwd_override or git_dir, *a], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=t)
            return r.stdout.strip() if r.returncode == 0 else ""

        seen_files = set()
        if commit_shas:
            valid_shas = []
            for sha in commit_shas:
                if _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "-q", f"{sha}^2") or (
                    root and root.is_dir() and str(root) != git_dir and _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "-q", f"{sha}^2", cwd_override=str(root))
                ):
                    continue
                ns = _git("show", "--numstat", "--format=", sha, t=3)
                if not ns and root and root.is_dir() and str(root) != git_dir:
                    ns = _git("show", "--numstat", "--format=", sha, t=3, cwd_override=str(root))
                if ns or _git("cat-file", "-t", sha) == "commit" or (
                    root and root.is_dir() and str(root) != git_dir and _git("cat-file", "-t", sha, cwd_override=str(root)) == "commit"
                ):
                    valid_shas.append(sha)
                    for ln in ns.splitlines():
                        parts = ln.strip().split("\t")
                        if len(parts) >= 3:
                            seen_files.add(parts[2])
                            if parts[0].isdigit():
                                res["ins"] += int(parts[0])
                            if parts[1].isdigit():
                                res["del"] += int(parts[1])
            if valid_shas:
                res["commits"] = len(valid_shas)
                if is_active and has_wt_dir:
                    dirty_ns = _git("diff", "--numstat", "HEAD", t=3)
                    for ln in dirty_ns.splitlines():
                        parts = ln.strip().split("\t")
                        if len(parts) >= 3:
                            seen_files.add(parts[2])
                            if parts[0].isdigit():
                                res["ins"] += int(parts[0])
                            if parts[1].isdigit():
                                res["del"] += int(parts[1])
                res["files"] = len(seen_files)
                return res

        if has_transcript and not ran_git_commit:
            # Worker có transcript đã phân tích và không thực hiện git commit nào trong phiên này
            if is_active and has_wt_dir:
                dirty_ns = _git("diff", "--numstat", "HEAD", t=3)
                for ln in dirty_ns.splitlines():
                    parts = ln.strip().split("\t")
                    if len(parts) >= 3:
                        seen_files.add(parts[2])
                        if parts[0].isdigit():
                            res["ins"] += int(parts[0])
                        if parts[1].isdigit():
                            res["del"] += int(parts[1])
                res["files"] = len(seen_files)
            return res

        # Nếu không có transcript (hoặc transcript bị cắt cụt SHA commit) nhưng có cửa sổ thời gian thực thi của dispatch (start_dt .. comp_dt)
        if start_dt and comp_dt:
            since_ts = max(0, int(start_dt.timestamp()))
            until_ts = int(comp_dt.timestamp()) + 15
            target_ref = "HEAD" if has_wt_dir else (wt_name if (wt_name and wt_name != "-" and _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "-q", wt_name)) else "HEAD")
            shas = []
            reflog_checked = False
            if has_wt_dir or (target_ref != "HEAD"):
                rf_chk = subprocess.run(
                    ["git", "-C", git_dir, "reflog", "show", "--format=%H|%gs", f"--since=@{since_ts}", f"--until=@{until_ts}", target_ref],
                    capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=3,
                )
                if rf_chk.returncode == 0:
                    reflog_checked = True
                    for rln in rf_chk.stdout.splitlines():
                        if "|" not in rln:
                            continue
                        r_sha, r_gs = rln.split("|", 1)
                        r_sha_clean = r_sha.strip()
                        if r_gs.startswith(("commit:", "commit (amend):", "commit (initial):")) and r_sha_clean not in shas:
                            anc_chk = subprocess.run(
                                ["git", "-C", git_dir, "merge-base", "--is-ancestor", r_sha_clean, target_ref],
                                capture_output=True, timeout=2,
                            )
                            if anc_chk.returncode == 0:
                                shas.append(r_sha_clean)
            if not shas and not reflog_checked:
                rev_args = ["rev-list", "--no-merges", f"--since=@{since_ts}", f"--until=@{until_ts}", target_ref]
                if wt_name and not wt_name.startswith(("dev-worker", "devops-worker", "ui-worker")):
                    for excl_cand in ("main", "master", "develop", "dev-worker", "devops-worker", "ui-worker"):
                        if _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "-q", excl_cand):
                            rev_args.append(f"^{excl_cand}")
                    for extra_k in range(2, 11):
                        for pfx in ("dev-worker", "devops-worker", "ui-worker"):
                            cand_br = f"{pfx}-{extra_k}"
                            if _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "-q", cand_br):
                                rev_args.append(f"^{cand_br}")
                shas = [s.strip() for s in _git(*rev_args, t=3).splitlines() if s.strip()]
            if shas:
                res["commits"] = len(shas)
                for sha in shas:
                    ns = _git("show", "--numstat", "--format=", sha, t=3)
                    for ln in ns.splitlines():
                        parts = ln.strip().split("\t")
                        if len(parts) >= 3:
                            seen_files.add(parts[2])
                            if parts[0].isdigit():
                                res["ins"] += int(parts[0])
                            if parts[1].isdigit():
                                res["del"] += int(parts[1])
            if is_active and has_wt_dir:
                dirty_ns = _git("diff", "--numstat", "HEAD", t=3)
                for ln in dirty_ns.splitlines():
                    parts = ln.strip().split("\t")
                    if len(parts) >= 3:
                        seen_files.add(parts[2])
                        if parts[0].isdigit():
                            res["ins"] += int(parts[0])
                        if parts[1].isdigit():
                            res["del"] += int(parts[1])
            res["files"] = len(seen_files)
            return res

        if not has_wt_dir:
            return res

        head_sha = _git("rev-parse", "HEAD")
        main_sha = (
            _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "-q", "main")
            or _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "-q", "master")
            or _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "-q", "develop")
        )
        head_p2 = _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "-q", "HEAD^2")
        base_ref = None
        if head_sha and main_sha and head_sha != main_sha:
            base_ref = _git("merge-base", "HEAD", main_sha) or main_sha
            if not wt_name.startswith(("dev-worker", "devops-worker", "ui-worker")):
                upstream_brs = ["dev-worker", "devops-worker", "ui-worker"]
                for extra_k in range(2, 11):
                    for pfx in ("dev-worker", "devops-worker", "ui-worker"):
                        upstream_brs.append(f"{pfx}-{extra_k}")
                for src_br in upstream_brs:
                    cand_sha = _git("rev-parse", "--verify", "-q", src_br)
                    if not cand_sha:
                        continue
                    anc = subprocess.run(["git", "-C", git_dir, "merge-base", "--is-ancestor", cand_sha, "HEAD"], capture_output=True, timeout=2)
                    if anc.returncode == 0:
                        fwd = subprocess.run(["git", "-C", git_dir, "merge-base", "--is-ancestor", base_ref, cand_sha], capture_output=True, timeout=2)
                        if fwd.returncode == 0 or head_p2 == cand_sha:
                            base_ref = cand_sha
        if base_ref:
            c_cnt = subprocess.run(["git", "-C", git_dir, "rev-list", "--no-merges", "--count", f"{base_ref}..HEAD"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=2).stdout.strip()
            if c_cnt.isdigit():
                res["commits"] = int(c_cnt)
            numstat = subprocess.run(["git", "-C", git_dir, "diff", "--numstat", f"{base_ref}..HEAD"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=3)
        else:
            numstat = subprocess.run(["git", "-C", git_dir, "diff", "--numstat", "HEAD"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=3)
        if numstat.returncode == 0:
            for ln in numstat.stdout.splitlines():
                parts = ln.strip().split("\t")
                if len(parts) >= 3:
                    res["files"] += 1
                    if parts[0].isdigit():
                        res["ins"] += int(parts[0])
                    if parts[1].isdigit():
                        res["del"] += int(parts[1])
    except Exception:
        pass
    return res


def _safe_orca_run(cmd, **kw):
    """subprocess.run cho Orca CLI: timeout/lỗi spawn trả về returncode != 0 thay vì làm sập cả phần telemetry."""
    import subprocess
    kw.setdefault("capture_output", True)
    kw.setdefault("text", True)
    try:
        return subprocess.run(cmd, **kw)
    except (subprocess.TimeoutExpired, OSError) as e:
        return subprocess.CompletedProcess(cmd, 124, stdout="", stderr=str(e))


def cmd_monitor(root: Path, config: dict, args: list = None):
    import io
    import subprocess
    args = args or []
    if any(a in args for a in ["-h", "--help", "help"]):
        print("Sử dụng: orca-monitor [path] [--run <run_id>] [--fix] [--verbose] [--json]")
        return
    verbose = any(a in args for a in ["-v", "--verbose", "--full"])
    auto_fix = any(a in args for a in ["--fix", "-f"])
    as_json = "--json" in args
    orig_stdout = sys.stdout
    if as_json:
        sys.stdout = io.StringIO()

    print("\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗")
    print("║                   🔬 ORCA ENGINEERING TELEMETRY, SPEED BENCHMARK & TOKEN MONITOR                                     ║")
    print("╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝")
    print(f"📍 Workspace: {root}")
    if auto_fix:
        print("⚡ Auto-Fix Mode: Enabled")
    print("")

    critical_issues = []
    warning_issues = []
    passed_items = []
    actions_taken = []

    # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    # PHẦN 1: CHỈ DẪN HỆ THỐNG & CONTEXT TIÊU TỐN MỖI LƯỢT (PER-TURN SYSTEM PROMPT)
    # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    print("📋 1. SYSTEM PROMPT & STATIC DIRECTIVE OVERHEAD (PER-TURN BASELINE)")
    print(f"{'FILE / NGUỒN':<26} | {'LOẠI':<12} | {'KÍCH THƯỚC':<12} | {'ƯỚC TÍNH TOKENS':<16} | {'TRẠNG THÁI'}")
    print("-" * 88)

    # Kiểm tra đồng bộ cơ chế Tự động co giãn Worktree (orca-team worktree-arg), Chế độ /goal và tối ưu dung lượng (<6.4k tok) trong .agents/GEMINI.md
    gemini_path_chk = root / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md"
    if config and gemini_path_chk.is_file():
        try:
            g_txt = gemini_path_chk.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore")
            roles_cfg_chk = config.get("roles") or {}
            missing_elastic_wt = "orca-team worktree-arg" not in g_txt
            coord_goal_cfg = _is_goal_mode_enabled(config.get("coordinator") or {}, config)
            any_worker_goal_cfg = any(
                _is_goal_mode_enabled(roles_cfg_chk.get(rk) or {}, config)
                for rk in ("developer", "qa", "security", "devopsSpecialist", "benchSpecialist", "reSpecialist", "uiSpecialist", "criticSpecialist", "prReviewer", "issueResolver")
            )
            if coord_goal_cfg:
                missing_goal_directive = "CHẾ ĐỘ LÀM TRIỆT ĐỂ MẶC ĐỊNH" not in g_txt
            elif any_worker_goal_cfg:
                missing_goal_directive = (
                    "CHẾ ĐỘ LÀM TRIỆT ĐỂ TRÊN WORKER" not in g_txt
                    or "CHẾ ĐỘ LÀM TRIỆT ĐỂ MẶC ĐỊNH" in g_txt
                    or "(`goalMode: true` trên `coordinator`)" in g_txt
                )
            else:
                missing_goal_directive = (
                    "CHẾ ĐỘ LÀM TRIỆT ĐỂ" in g_txt
                    or "(`goalMode: true` trên `coordinator`)" in g_txt
                    or "PHÂN ĐỊNH TRÁCH NHIỆM KIỂM SOÁT CHẤT LƯỢNG & TIẾN ĐỘ PLAN" not in g_txt
                    or "orca-team plan pin" not in g_txt
                )
            bloated_orca_directive = ORCA_DIRECTIVE_MARKER in g_txt and estimate_tokens(g_txt) > 6400
            if missing_elastic_wt or missing_goal_directive or bloated_orca_directive:
                if auto_fix:
                    sync_gemini_directive(root, config)
                    fix_parts = []
                    if missing_elastic_wt:
                        fix_parts.append("Tự động co giãn Worktree Slots (orca-team worktree-arg)")
                    if missing_goal_directive:
                        fix_parts.append("Kiến trúc Quân sư Critic + Pinned Master Plan + QA Kiểm toán 100% Plan & trạng thái goalMode")
                    if bloated_orca_directive:
                        fix_parts.append("Tối ưu nén dung lượng chỉ dẫn (< 6,400 tokens/turn)")
                    actions_taken.append(
                        f"Đồng bộ lại '.agents/GEMINI.md' bổ sung đầy đủ: {' & '.join(fix_parts)}."
                    )
                else:
                    if missing_elastic_wt:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            "File '.agents/GEMINI.md' đang ở bản cũ chưa dùng lệnh tự động cấp phát/tái sử dụng Worktree Slot "
                            "('orca-team worktree-arg <role>') (chạy 'orca-team sync' hoặc 'orca-monitor --fix' để cập nhật)."
                        )
                    if missing_goal_directive:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            "File '.agents/GEMINI.md' chưa đồng bộ kiến trúc Quân sư Critic + Pinned Master Plan ('orca-team plan pin') + QA Kiểm toán 100% Plan / trạng thái goalMode (chạy 'orca-team sync' hoặc 'orca-monitor --fix' để cập nhật)."
                        )
        except Exception:
            pass

    base_tokens = 0
    target_files = [
        (".agents/GEMINI.md", root / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md"),
        ("CLAUDE.md", root / "CLAUDE.md"),
        ("AGENTS.md", root / "AGENTS.md"),
        ("orca-team.json", root / "orca-team.json"),
        ("plan.md", root / "plan.md"),
    ]

    for rel_name, path in target_files:
        if not path.exists() and not path.is_symlink():
            continue

        is_link = path.is_symlink()
        try:
            raw_text = path.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore")
            size_b = len(raw_text.encode("utf-8"))
            tokens = estimate_tokens(raw_text)
        except Exception:
            raw_text = ""
            size_b = 0
            tokens = 0

        if is_link:
            status = "Symlink (0 extra)"
            type_str = "Symlink"
            size_str = f"{size_b} B"
            tokens_str = f"~{tokens} (shared)"
        elif rel_name in ("orca-team.json", "plan.md"):
            type_str = "Config/Doc"
            size_str = f"{size_b/1024:.1f} KB" if size_b > 1024 else f"{size_b} B"
            tokens_str = f"~{tokens} (on-demand)"
            status = "On-demand (0 base)"
        elif rel_name in ("CLAUDE.md", "AGENTS.md") and path.exists():
            type_str = "File thật"
            size_str = f"{size_b/1024:.1f} KB" if size_b > 1024 else f"{size_b} B"
            tokens_str = f"~{tokens} tokens"
            gemini_p = root / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md"
            same = False
            if gemini_p.exists():
                try:
                    same = path.read_bytes() == gemini_p.read_bytes()
                except Exception:
                    same = False
            if same:
                if auto_fix:
                    try:
                        path.unlink()
                        os.symlink(".agents/GEMINI.md", path)
                        actions_taken.append(f"Chuyển '{rel_name}' (nội dung trùng 100%) thành symlink trỏ về '.agents/GEMINI.md'.")
                        type_str = "Symlink"
                        tokens_str = f"~{tokens} (shared)"
                        status = "FIXED (Symlink)"
                    except Exception as e:
                        base_tokens += tokens
                        status = "DUPLICATE (x2)"
                        critical_issues.append(
                            f"File '{rel_name}' là bản sao độc lập thay vì symlink tới '.agents/GEMINI.md' (tốn gấp đôi ~{tokens} tokens/turn)."
                        )
                        actions_taken.append(f"Lỗi khi chuyển '{rel_name}' thành symlink: {e}")
                else:
                    base_tokens += tokens
                    status = "DUPLICATE (x2)"
                    critical_issues.append(
                        f"File '{rel_name}' là bản sao độc lập thay vì symlink tới '.agents/GEMINI.md' (tốn gấp đôi ~{tokens} tokens/turn)."
                    )
            else:
                base_tokens += tokens
                status = "CUSTOM FILE"
                warning_issues.append(
                    f"File '{rel_name}' là file riêng của người dùng (~{tokens} tokens/turn, khác '.agents/GEMINI.md')."
                )
        else:
            type_str = "File thật"
            size_str = f"{size_b/1024:.1f} KB" if size_b > 1024 else f"{size_b} B"
            tokens_str = f"~{tokens} tokens"
            base_tokens += tokens
            if tokens > 6400:
                status = "WARN (>6.4k tok)"
                warning_issues.append(f"File '{rel_name}' nặng ~{tokens} tokens (nạp lại vào context trên mỗi turn).")
            else:
                status = "OK"

        print(f"{rel_name:<26} | {type_str:<12} | {size_str:<12} | {tokens_str:<16} | {status}")

    print("-" * 88)
    print(f"👉 Base Directive Overhead: ~{base_tokens:,} tokens/turn")
    if base_tokens < 6400:
        passed_items.append(f"Base Directive Overhead: ~{base_tokens:,} tokens/turn (< 6,400 tokens threshold).")
    elif base_tokens < 7400:
        warning_issues.append(f"Base Directive Overhead ở mức trung bình (~{base_tokens:,} tokens/turn).")
    else:
        critical_issues.append(f"Base Directive Overhead vượt ngưỡng (~{base_tokens:,} tokens/turn).")

    # Kiểm tra rò rỉ file chỉ dẫn Leader (.agents/GEMINI.md, GEMINI.md, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md) sang các Child Worktrees của Worker
    try:
        wt_list_res = subprocess.run(
            ["git", "-C", str(root), "worktree", "list", "--porcelain"],
            capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=4, check=False,
        )
        if wt_list_res.returncode == 0:
            root_real = os.path.realpath(str(root))
            child_wt_paths = []
            for ln in wt_list_res.stdout.splitlines():
                if ln.startswith("worktree "):
                    cand_wt = ln[len("worktree "):].strip()
                    if cand_wt and os.path.realpath(cand_wt) != root_real and os.path.isdir(cand_wt):
                        child_wt_paths.append(cand_wt)
            leaked_child_wts = []
            cleaned_child_wts = []
            for cwt in child_wt_paths:
                matched_files = _strip_leader_directives_in_child_worktree(cwt, root, dry_run=not auto_fix)
                if matched_files:
                    if auto_fix:
                        cleaned_child_wts.append(f"{os.path.basename(cwt)} ({', '.join(matched_files)})")
                    else:
                        leaked_child_wts.append(f"{os.path.basename(cwt)} ({', '.join(matched_files)})")
            if cleaned_child_wts:
                actions_taken.append(
                    f"Gỡ bỏ file chỉ dẫn Leader rò rỉ trong {len(cleaned_child_wts)} child worktree(s) (giữ git status sạch bằng --skip-worktree): {', '.join(cleaned_child_wts)}."
                )
                passed_items.append(f"Child worktrees ({len(child_wt_paths)} worktrees) sạch 100% file chỉ dẫn Leader (0 token leak).")
            elif leaked_child_wts:
                print(f"🚨 Phát hiện rò rỉ file chỉ dẫn Leader trong {len(leaked_child_wts)} child worktree(s): {', '.join(leaked_child_wts)}")
                critical_issues.append(
                    f"Rò rỉ file chỉ dẫn Leader (~{base_tokens:,} tok/turn + lệnh CẤM sửa file) sang child worktree của Worker: {', '.join(leaked_child_wts)} (chạy 'orca-monitor --fix' để dọn sạch)."
                )
            elif child_wt_paths:
                print(f"   • Child Worktree Directive Isolation: {len(child_wt_paths)} worktree(s) clean (0 leaked Leader directive tokens)")
                passed_items.append(f"Child worktrees ({len(child_wt_paths)} worktrees) không bị rò rỉ file chỉ dẫn Leader.")
    except Exception:
        pass
    print("")

    # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    # PHẦN 2: QUÉT BẪY VÒNG LẶP & ĐƯỜNG DẪN CHẾT (DEAD REFERENCE TRAPS)
    # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    print("🕵️ 2. KIỂM TRA ĐƯỜNG DẪN CHẾT TRONG FILE CHỈ DẪN (DEAD REFERENCE CHECK)")
    scanned_directives = []
    seen_real_directives = set()
    for rel_name, p in target_files:
        if rel_name in ("orca-team.json", "plan.md") or not p.exists():
            continue
        try:
            rp = p.resolve()
        except Exception:
            rp = p
        if rp not in seen_real_directives:
            seen_real_directives.add(rp)
            scanned_directives.append(p)
    dead_refs_found = []

    for path in scanned_directives:
        try:
            content = path.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore")
        except Exception:
            continue

        seen_in_file = set()
        raw_matches = re.findall(r'(?:[\s\(\[\`\"\'\:]|^)([a-zA-Z0-9_\-\./]+\.[a-zA-Z0-9]{1,5})(?:[\s\)\]\`\"\'\:]|$)', content)
        for p_str in raw_matches:
            if p_str in seen_in_file:
                continue
            if p_str.startswith(('http://', 'https://', 'git://', 'ssh://')):
                continue
            if re.match(r'^\d+\.\d+$', p_str) or re.search(r'/\d+(?:\.\d+)+$', p_str):
                continue
            if p_str.lower() in (
                'e.g.', 'i.e.', 'etc.', 'example.com',
                'node.js', 'next.js', 'nuxt.js', 'vue.js', 'react.js',
                'express.js', 'nest.js', 'three.js', 'chart.js',
            ):
                continue
            if '/' in p_str or p_str.endswith(('.md', '.json', '.sh', '.py', '.ts', '.js', '.yml', '.yaml', '.txt')):
                if p_str in ("plan.md", "orca-team.json", "package.json", "pnpm-lock.yaml", "yarn.lock", "setup-runner.sh"):
                    continue
                if f"-f {p_str}" in content or f'-f "{p_str}"' in content:
                    continue
                if "github.com" in content[max(0, content.find(p_str)-30):content.find(p_str)+len(p_str)+30]:
                    continue

                seen_in_file.add(p_str)
                target_p = root / p_str
                if not target_p.exists():
                    dead_refs_found.append((p_str, path.name))

    if dead_refs_found:
        print(f"🚨 Phát hiện {len(dead_refs_found)} đường dẫn không tồn tại:")
        for ref, source in dead_refs_found:
            print(f"   ❌ '{ref}' (trong {source})")
            critical_issues.append(
                f"Đường dẫn '{ref}' trong '{source}' không tồn tại trên đĩa (gây lỗi File Not Found khi AI gọi view_file)."
            )
    else:
        print("   • Dead references: 0 (OK)")
        passed_items.append("Dead references trong file chỉ dẫn: 0.")
    print("")

    # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    # PHẦN 3: VỆ SINH WORKSPACE & BẪY GIT STATUS (WORKSPACE HYGIENE)
    # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    print("🧹 3. WORKSPACE HYGIENE & GIT STATUS FOOTPRINT")
    gitignore_path = root / ".gitignore"
    is_orca_proj = (root / "orca-team.json").is_file() or (root / ".agents" / "GEMINI.md").is_file()
    if not gitignore_path.exists():
        if auto_fix and is_orca_proj:
            gitignore_path.write_text(".orca/\n.orca-cache/\n*.orca.log\nnode_modules/\n.venv/\n", encoding="utf-8")
            actions_taken.append("Tạo mới '.gitignore' với quy tắc chặn log Orca.")
            print("   • .gitignore rules (.orca/, .orca-cache/, *.orca.log): FIXED")
            passed_items.append(".gitignore đã chặn thư mục tạm của Orca.")
        else:
            print("⚠️ Chưa có file '.gitignore'.")
            warning_issues.append("Thiếu file '.gitignore'.")
    else:
        gi_content = gitignore_path.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore")
        missing_ignores = [pat for pat in [".orca", ".orca-cache", "*.orca.log"] if pat not in gi_content]
        if missing_ignores:
            if auto_fix and is_orca_proj:
                with open(gitignore_path, "a", encoding="utf-8") as f:
                    f.write("\n# Orca Orchestrator Runtime Logs & Receipts\n")
                    for m in missing_ignores:
                        f.write(f"{m}\n")
                actions_taken.append(f"Bổ sung '{', '.join(missing_ignores)}' vào .gitignore.")
                print("   • .gitignore rules (.orca/, .orca-cache/, *.orca.log): FIXED")
                passed_items.append(".gitignore đã chặn thư mục tạm của Orca.")
            elif is_orca_proj:
                print(f"⚠️ '.gitignore' thiếu: {', '.join(missing_ignores)}")
                critical_issues.append(f"Thiếu '{', '.join(missing_ignores)}' trong .gitignore.")
            else:
                print(f"   • .gitignore rules: Chưa khởi tạo Orca Orchestrator (bỏ qua {', '.join(missing_ignores)})")
        else:
            print("   • .gitignore rules (.orca/, .orca-cache/, *.orca.log): OK")
            passed_items.append(".gitignore đã chặn thư mục tạm của Orca.")

    try:
        git_res = subprocess.run(["git", "status", "--porcelain"], capture_output=True, text=True, cwd=str(root), timeout=5)
        if git_res.returncode == 0:
            lines = [l for l in git_res.stdout.splitlines() if l.strip()]
            untracked = [l for l in lines if l.startswith("??")]
            modified = [l for l in lines if not l.startswith("??")]
            git_tokens = estimate_tokens(git_res.stdout)
            print(f"   • Git status output: {len(modified)} modified, {len(untracked)} untracked (~{git_tokens:,} tokens khi gọi git status)")
            if len(untracked) > 25:
                warning_issues.append(
                    f"Workspace có {len(untracked)} file untracked (~{git_tokens:,} tokens mỗi lần chạy 'git status')."
                )
            else:
                passed_items.append(f"Git status footprint nhỏ ({len(untracked)} untracked files, ~{git_tokens:,} tokens).")
    except Exception:
        pass
    print("")

    # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    # PHẦN 4: RUNTIME TELEMETRY, TỐC ĐỘ MODEL (TOK/S) & PHÂN TÍCH ĐỊNH LƯỢNG
    # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    print("⚡ 4. RUNTIME TELEMETRY, MODEL VELOCITY (TOK/S) & TOKEN BREAKDOWN")
    orca_bin = os.environ.get("ORCA_BIN") or shutil.which("orca") or "/usr/local/bin/orca"

    runtime_ok = False
    active_run_id = None
    active_run_obj = ""
    run_tasks = {}
    workers = []
    hb_count = done_count = esc_count = handoff_count = done_tokens = 0
    p2p_dev_ready_cnt = p2p_reject_cnt = 0
    run_msgs = []
    leader_m = {}
    worker_metrics_list = []
    model_buckets = {}

    explicit_run_id = None
    for idx_a, a in enumerate(args):
        if a == "--run":
            if idx_a + 1 >= len(args) or args[idx_a + 1].startswith("-"):
                if as_json:
                    sys.stdout = orig_stdout
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho cờ --run (ví dụ: --run run_xxxxxxxxxxxx).", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            explicit_run_id = args[idx_a + 1]
        elif a.startswith("--run="):
            val = a.split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            if not val or val.startswith("-"):
                if as_json:
                    sys.stdout = orig_stdout
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị cho cờ --run (ví dụ: --run=run_xxxxxxxxxxxx).", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            explicit_run_id = val
        elif a.startswith("run_"):
            explicit_run_id = a

    try:
        r_res = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "orchestration", "run-list", "--json"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=5)
        all_runs = []
        if r_res.returncode == 0:
            r_data = json.loads(r_res.stdout)
            r_obj = r_data.get("result", r_data) if isinstance(r_data, dict) else {}
            all_runs = r_obj.get("runs", []) if isinstance(r_obj, dict) else []
            runtime_ok = True

        proj_slug = root.name.lower()
        candidate_runs = [r for r in all_runs if not r.get("legacy")]

        selected_run = None
        if explicit_run_id:
            scan_runs = [r for r in candidate_runs if r.get("id") == explicit_run_id] or [{"id": explicit_run_id, "objective": ""}]
        else:
            scan_runs = candidate_runs

        from concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor

        db_p_scan = _find_orca_orchestration_db()
        root_real_lower = os.path.realpath(str(root)).lower()
        root_str_lower = str(root).lower()

        def _fetch_run_workers(r_item: dict):
            rid_str = r_item.get("id")
            if not rid_str:
                return (r_item, None, [])
            w_c = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "orchestration", "worker-list", "--run", rid_str, "--json"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=8)
            if w_c.returncode == 124:
                return (r_item, 124, [])
            w_l = []
            if w_c.returncode == 0:
                try:
                    wo_d = json.loads(w_c.stdout).get("result", {})
                    w_l = wo_d.get("workers", []) if isinstance(wo_d, dict) else []
                except Exception:
                    w_l = []
            if db_p_scan is not None and (not w_l or any(not (wi.get("resource") or {}).get("worktreeId") for wi in w_l if isinstance(wi, dict))):
                try:
                    import sqlite3 as _sq3_w
                    _cw = _sq3_w.connect(f"file:{db_p_scan}?mode=ro", uri=True, timeout=1.5)
                    _cw.row_factory = _sq3_w.Row
                    _wrows = _cw.execute(
                        """
                        SELECT dc.id AS dispatch_id, dc.task_id, dc.status AS dc_status, dc.created_at, dc.completed_at,
                               wd.state AS wd_state, wd.worktree_id, wd.agent_terminal_handle
                        FROM dispatch_contexts dc
                        LEFT JOIN worker_dispatches wd ON wd.dispatch_id = dc.id
                        WHERE dc.run_id = ?
                        ORDER BY dc.created_at DESC
                        """,
                        (rid_str,),
                    ).fetchall()
                    _cw.close()
                    if not w_l and _wrows:
                        for wr in _wrows:
                            w_l.append({
                                "dispatchId": wr["dispatch_id"],
                                "taskId": wr["task_id"],
                                "state": wr["wd_state"] or wr["dc_status"],
                                "workerState": wr["wd_state"] or wr["dc_status"],
                                "createdAt": wr["created_at"],
                                "completedAt": wr["completed_at"],
                                "agentTerminalHandle": wr["agent_terminal_handle"],
                                "resource": {"worktreeId": wr["worktree_id"], "state": "released"},
                            })
                    elif _wrows:
                        wt_by_did = {str(wr["dispatch_id"] or ""): str(wr["worktree_id"] or "") for wr in _wrows if wr["worktree_id"]}
                        for wi in w_l:
                            if isinstance(wi, dict):
                                did_k = str(wi.get("dispatchId") or wi.get("id") or "")
                                if did_k in wt_by_did:
                                    if not isinstance(wi.get("resource"), dict):
                                        wi["resource"] = {}
                                    if not wi["resource"].get("worktreeId"):
                                        wi["resource"]["worktreeId"] = wt_by_did[did_k]
                except Exception:
                    pass
            return (r_item, w_c.returncode, w_l)

        # Kiểm tra theo đúng thứ tự thời gian (mới nhất trước): kiểm tra run đầu tiên ngay lập tức, sau đó quét song song theo lô 6 run
        batch_idx = 0
        while batch_idx < len(scan_runs) and not selected_run:
            batch_size = 1 if batch_idx == 0 else 6
            batch = scan_runs[batch_idx : batch_idx + batch_size]
            batch_idx += batch_size
            if len(batch) == 1:
                batch_results = [_fetch_run_workers(batch[0])]
            else:
                with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=min(6, len(batch))) as pool:
                    batch_results = list(pool.map(_fetch_run_workers, batch))

            for r, w_rc, w_list_tmp in batch_results:
                rid = r.get("id")
                if not rid:
                    continue
                if w_rc == 124:
                    print(f"⚠️  Orca CLI phản hồi chậm (>8s) khi đọc run {rid} — bỏ qua run này.")
                    continue
                wt_paths = [
                    str((w_item.get("resource") or {}).get("worktreeId") or w_item.get("worktreeId") or "").lower()
                    for w_item in w_list_tmp
                    if isinstance(w_item, dict) and ((w_item.get("resource") or {}).get("worktreeId") or w_item.get("worktreeId"))
                ]
                has_local_run_dir = (root / ".orca" / "runs" / rid).is_dir()
                if explicit_run_id or has_local_run_dir:
                    belongs_to_proj = True
                elif wt_paths:
                    belongs_to_proj = any(
                        root_str_lower in ws_str
                        or root_real_lower in ws_str
                        or f"/{proj_slug}/" in ws_str
                        or f"/{proj_slug}-worktrees/" in ws_str
                        or f"/{proj_slug}." in ws_str
                        or ws_str.endswith(f"/{proj_slug}")
                        for ws_str in wt_paths
                    )
                else:
                    belongs_to_proj = bool(
                        re.search(rf"(?<![\w-]){re.escape(proj_slug)}(?![\w-])", str(r.get("objective", "")).lower())
                    )

                if not explicit_run_id and not belongs_to_proj:
                    continue

                t_chk = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "orchestration", "task-list", "--run", rid, "--json"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=8)
                if t_chk.returncode == 124:
                    print(f"⚠️  Orca CLI phản hồi chậm (>8s) khi đọc task-list của run {rid} — bỏ qua run này.")
                    continue
                t_list_tmp = []
                if t_chk.returncode == 0:
                    to = json.loads(t_chk.stdout).get("result", {})
                    t_list_tmp = to.get("tasks", []) if isinstance(to, dict) else []

                in_cand = any(cr.get("id") == rid for cr in candidate_runs)
                if (explicit_run_id and (in_cand or w_list_tmp or t_list_tmp)) or (belongs_to_proj and (w_list_tmp or t_list_tmp or has_local_run_dir)):
                    selected_run = r
                    workers = w_list_tmp
                    for t in t_list_tmp:
                        if t.get("id"):
                            run_tasks[t.get("id")] = t
                    break

        if not selected_run and candidate_runs:
            if explicit_run_id:
                print(f"ℹ️  Không tìm thấy Run '{explicit_run_id}' trong Orca Runtime.")
            else:
                # Không lấy run mới nhất của project KHÁC (trước đây gây hiển thị sai số liệu và --fix đụng vào run của project khác)
                print(f"ℹ️  Không tìm thấy Run nào thuộc project '{root.name}' trong {len(scan_runs)} run gần nhất (truyền --run <run_id> để chỉ định).")

        if selected_run:
            active_run_id = selected_run.get("id")
            active_run_obj = selected_run.get("objective", "")

        if runtime_ok:
            cli_index = _index_cli_transcripts()
            if active_run_id:
                obj_short = (active_run_obj[:78] + "...") if len(active_run_obj) > 81 else active_run_obj
                print(f"🎯 Run ID: {active_run_id} — \"{obj_short}\"")
                pinned_plan_p = root / ".orca" / "runs" / active_run_id / "master-plan.md"
                if pinned_plan_p.is_file():
                    try:
                        p_txt = pinned_plan_p.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore")
                        p_items = list(dict.fromkeys(re.findall(r"\[P\d+\]", p_txt)))
                        p_items_str = f"{len(p_items)} items ({', '.join(p_items[:8])})" if p_items else "active"
                        print(f"📌 Pinned Master Plan: .orca/runs/{active_run_id}/master-plan.md ({p_items_str}, ~{estimate_tokens(p_txt):,} tok)")
                    except Exception:
                        pass
            print(f"👥 Dispatched Workers: {len(workers)} | Tasks in DAG: {len(run_tasks)}")

            # Tải trước messages của Run để vừa thống kê P2P/Mailbox vừa bù report_tok khi task.result trống
            worker_done_body_by_dispatch = {}
            worker_done_body_by_task = {}
            if active_run_id:
                handle_to_disp_mon: dict[str, str] = {}
                handle_to_task_mon: dict[str, str] = {}
                for w_it in workers:
                    if not isinstance(w_it, dict):
                        continue
                    w_did = str(w_it.get("dispatchId") or w_it.get("id") or "").strip()
                    w_tid = str(w_it.get("taskId") or "").strip()
                    w_th = str(w_it.get("agentTerminalHandle") or "").strip()
                    if w_th:
                        norm_th = w_th[len("terminal:"):] if w_th.startswith("terminal:") else w_th
                        for ch in (w_th, norm_th, f"terminal:{norm_th}"):
                            if w_did:
                                handle_to_disp_mon[ch] = w_did
                            if w_tid:
                                handle_to_task_mon[ch] = w_tid

                loaded_msgs_sqlite = False
                db_p_mon = _find_orca_orchestration_db()
                if db_p_mon is not None:
                    try:
                        import sqlite3 as _sq3
                        _c_mon = _sq3.connect(f"file:{db_p_mon}?mode=ro", uri=True, timeout=1.5)
                        _c_mon.row_factory = _sq3.Row
                        _m_rows = _c_mon.execute(
                            """
                            SELECT id, run_id, from_handle, to_handle, subject, body, type, payload, created_at
                            FROM messages
                            WHERE run_id = ?
                            ORDER BY created_at ASC, rowid ASC
                            """,
                            (active_run_id,),
                        ).fetchall()
                        run_msgs = [dict(r) for r in _m_rows]
                        _c_mon.close()
                        loaded_msgs_sqlite = True
                    except Exception:
                        loaded_msgs_sqlite = False

                if not loaded_msgs_sqlite:
                    msg_res = _safe_orca_run(
                        [orca_bin, "orchestration", "inbox", "--limit", "500", "--json"],
                        capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=5,
                    )
                    if msg_res.returncode == 0:
                        try:
                            msg_data = json.loads(msg_res.stdout)
                            msg_obj = msg_data.get("result", msg_data) if isinstance(msg_data, dict) else {}
                            all_msgs = msg_obj.get("messages", []) if isinstance(msg_obj, dict) else []
                            run_msgs = [
                                m for m in all_msgs
                                if isinstance(m, dict) and (m.get("run_id") == active_run_id or m.get("runId") == active_run_id)
                            ]
                        except Exception:
                            run_msgs = []

                try:
                    # Khử trùng lặp các bản ghi fan-out của `--to '@all'` (cùng người gửi, type, subject, body, payload, created_at)
                    dedup_msgs = []
                    seen_msg_keys = set()
                    for m in run_msgs:
                        if not isinstance(m, dict):
                            continue
                        m_type_k = str(m.get("type") or "")
                        if m_type_k == "heartbeat":
                            dedup_msgs.append(m)
                            continue
                        m_key = (
                            str(m.get("from_handle") or m.get("fromHandle") or ""),
                            m_type_k,
                            str(m.get("subject") or ""),
                            str(m.get("body") or ""),
                            str(m.get("payload") or ""),
                        )
                        if m_key in seen_msg_keys:
                            continue
                        seen_msg_keys.add(m_key)
                        dedup_msgs.append(m)
                    run_msgs = dedup_msgs

                    hb_count = sum(1 for m in run_msgs if m.get("type") == "heartbeat")
                    done_count = sum(1 for m in run_msgs if m.get("type") == "worker_done")
                    esc_count = sum(1 for m in run_msgs if m.get("type") in ["escalation", "question"])
                    handoff_count = sum(1 for m in run_msgs if m.get("type") == "handoff")
                    for m in run_msgs:
                        m_type = str(m.get("type") or "")
                        subj_s = str(m.get("subject") or "")
                        body_s = str(m.get("body") or "")
                        if m_type in ("handoff", "escalation"):
                            m_cls = _classify_p2p_message(m_type, subj_s, body_s)
                            if m_cls == "reject":
                                p2p_reject_cnt += 1
                            elif m_cls == "ready" and m_type == "handoff":
                                p2p_dev_ready_cnt += 1
                        if m_type in ("worker_done", "handoff") and body_s:
                            s_did, s_tid = _extract_msg_dispatch_and_task(
                                m,
                                handle_to_disp=handle_to_disp_mon,
                                handle_to_task=handle_to_task_mon,
                            )
                            if s_did and len(body_s) >= len(worker_done_body_by_dispatch.get(s_did, "")):
                                worker_done_body_by_dispatch[s_did] = body_s
                            if s_tid and len(body_s) >= len(worker_done_body_by_task.get(s_tid, "")):
                                worker_done_body_by_task[s_tid] = body_s
                    done_tokens = sum(
                        estimate_tokens(str(m.get("body") or "") + str(m.get("subject") or ""))
                        for m in run_msgs if m.get("type") in ["worker_done", "handoff", "escalation", "question"]
                    )
                except Exception:
                    pass

            if workers:
                print("\n📊 4.1 BẢNG ĐO LƯỜNG TỐC ĐỘ AGENT CLI & TIÊU THỤ TOKEN TRÊN TỪNG WORKER:")
                hdr = (
                    f"   {'DISPATCH / ROLE':<27} | {'MODEL THỰC TẾ':<26} | {'WALL / IDLE':<13} | "
                    f"{'TURNS / TOOLS':<16} | {'LLM / TOOL TIME':<15} | {'OUT e2e | CTX tok/s':<23} | "
                    f"{'TOKENS (OUT / PEAK / CACHE)':<27} | {'STATE'}"
                )
                print(hdr)
                print("   " + "-" * (len(hdr) - 3))

            reclaimable_dispatches = []
            total_spec_tokens = 0
            total_report_tokens = 0
            counted_task_ids = set()
            known_worker_wt_paths = set()

            def _fetch_ws(did_str: str):
                if not did_str or did_str == "-":
                    return None
                try:
                    r = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "orchestration", "worker-show", "--dispatch", did_str, "--json"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=4)
                    if r.returncode == 0:
                        return json.loads(r.stdout).get("result", {})
                except Exception:
                    pass
                return None

            ws_map = {}
            if workers:
                d_ids = [str(w.get("dispatchId") or w.get("id") or "-") for w in workers]
                with ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=min(8, max(1, len(d_ids)))) as pool:
                    for did_k, ws_val in zip(d_ids, pool.map(_fetch_ws, d_ids)):
                        if ws_val:
                            ws_map[did_k] = ws_val

            for w in workers:
                d_id = str(w.get("dispatchId") or w.get("id") or "-")
                t_id = str(w.get("taskId") or "-")
                term = str(w.get("terminalHandle") or w.get("agentTerminalHandle") or "-")
                term_state = str(w.get("terminalState") or "-")
                w_state = str(w.get("workerState") or w.get("state") or "-")
                w_phase = "-"

                wt_name = "-"
                wt_path = ""
                ag_name = "-"
                md_name = "-"
                duration_secs = 0.0
                last_out_idle_secs = None
                start_dt = None
                comp_dt = None

                ws_id = str((w.get("resource") or {}).get("worktreeId") or "")
                if "::" in ws_id:
                    wt_path = ws_id.split("::", 1)[1]
                if "/" in ws_id:
                    wt_name = ws_id.rsplit("/", 1)[-1]

                try:
                    ws_json = ws_map.get(d_id)
                    if ws_json:
                        w_info = ws_json.get("worker", {})
                        d_info = ws_json.get("dispatch", {})
                        t_info = ws_json.get("terminal") or {}
                        p_info = ws_json.get("projection") or {}
                        if w_info.get("state"):
                            w_state = str(w_info.get("state"))
                        elif d_info.get("status") in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "timed_out"):
                            w_state = str(d_info.get("status"))
                        w_phase = str(w_info.get("phase") or w_info.get("stage") or (p_info.get("stage") or {}).get("detail") or "-")
                        res_info = p_info.get("resource") or {}
                        if res_info.get("terminalState"):
                            term_state = str(res_info.get("terminalState"))
                        if t_info.get("worktreePath"):
                            wt_path = str(t_info.get("worktreePath"))
                        start_opts = w_info.get("startOptions", {})
                        if start_opts.get("name"):
                            wt_name = start_opts.get("name")
                        elif start_opts.get("worktree") and wt_name == "-":
                            wt_opt = str(start_opts.get("worktree"))
                            wt_name = wt_opt.rsplit("/", 1)[-1] if "/" in wt_opt else wt_opt.split(":", 1)[-1]
                        eff_launch = (start_opts.get("launch") or {}).get("effective") or {}
                        ag_name = str(eff_launch.get("agent") or start_opts.get("agent") or "-")
                        md_name = str(eff_launch.get("model") or ag_name)

                        c_at = str(d_info.get("dispatchedAt") or w_info.get("createdAt") or "")
                        raw_comp_at = d_info.get("completedAt")
                        from datetime import datetime, timezone
                        now_utc = datetime.now(timezone.utc)
                        if raw_comp_at:
                            comp_dt = _parse_iso_utc(str(raw_comp_at))
                        elif term_state == "active" and w_state not in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "timed_out"):
                            comp_dt = now_utc
                        else:
                            comp_dt = _parse_iso_utc(str(w_info.get("updatedAt") or ""))
                        start_dt = _parse_iso_utc(c_at)
                        if start_dt and comp_dt:
                            duration_secs = max(0.0, (comp_dt - start_dt).total_seconds())

                        last_out_raw = t_info.get("lastOutputAt") or w_info.get("lastHeartbeatAt")
                        if last_out_raw:
                            lo_dt = _parse_iso_utc(str(last_out_raw))
                            if lo_dt:
                                last_out_idle_secs = max(0.0, (now_utc - lo_dt).total_seconds())
                except Exception:
                    pass

                if wt_path:
                    known_worker_wt_paths.add(wt_path)
                    try:
                        known_worker_wt_paths.add(os.path.realpath(wt_path))
                    except Exception:
                        pass

                # Khớp transcript thực tế của Worker CLI
                tf_match = (
                    cli_index["by_dispatch"].get(d_id)
                    or cli_index["by_task"].get(t_id)
                    or cli_index["by_term"].get(term)
                )
                t_metrics = _analyze_antigravity_transcript(tf_match, scope_id=d_id) if tf_match else {}

                t_obj_info = run_tasks.get(t_id, {})
                spec_txt = str(t_obj_info.get("spec") or "")
                res_raw = str(t_obj_info.get("result") or "")
                spec_tok = estimate_tokens(spec_txt)

                rep_body = ""
                reported_files_count = 0
                if res_raw:
                    try:
                        res_parsed = json.loads(res_raw)
                        rep_body = str(res_parsed.get("body") or "")
                        f_mod = res_parsed.get("filesModified") or []
                        reported_files_count = len(f_mod)
                    except Exception:
                        rep_body = res_raw
                if not rep_body:
                    rep_body = worker_done_body_by_dispatch.get(d_id) or worker_done_body_by_task.get(t_id) or ""
                rep_tok = estimate_tokens(rep_body)
                if t_id and t_id != "-" and t_id not in counted_task_ids:
                    counted_task_ids.add(t_id)
                    total_spec_tokens += spec_tok
                    total_report_tokens += rep_tok
                elif not t_id or t_id == "-":
                    total_spec_tokens += spec_tok
                    total_report_tokens += rep_tok

                is_w_active = w_state not in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "timed_out")
                git_stats = _collect_git_diff_stats(
                    wt_path,
                    wt_name,
                    root=root,
                    start_dt=start_dt,
                    comp_dt=comp_dt,
                    is_active=is_w_active,
                    commit_shas=t_metrics.get("commit_shas") if t_metrics else None,
                    has_transcript=bool(t_metrics),
                    ran_git_commit=bool(t_metrics.get("ran_git_commit")) if t_metrics else False,
                )
                files_mod_count = git_stats["files"] if (git_stats["files"] > 0 or t_metrics) else reported_files_count

                # Chuẩn bị các cột hiển thị
                raw_role_col = f"{d_id[:10]}.. ({wt_name})"
                if len(raw_role_col) > 27:
                    prefix_len = max(4, 27 - len(wt_name) - 5)
                    role_col = f"{d_id[:prefix_len]}.. ({wt_name})"[:27]
                else:
                    role_col = raw_role_col
                model_col = md_name[:26]
                wall_s = duration_secs if duration_secs > 0 else t_metrics.get("wall_secs", 0.0)
                idle_s = t_metrics.get("idle_since_last_secs") if t_metrics else last_out_idle_secs
                if w_state in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "timed_out"):
                    wall_idle_col = f"{_fmt_dur(wall_s)} / done"
                elif idle_s is not None:
                    wall_idle_col = f"{_fmt_dur(wall_s)} / {_fmt_dur(idle_s)}"
                else:
                    wall_idle_col = f"{_fmt_dur(wall_s)} / -"

                if t_metrics:
                    turns_tools_col = f"{t_metrics['turns']}t / {t_metrics['tool_calls']}c({t_metrics['tool_errors']}e)"
                    llm_tool_col = f"{_fmt_dur(t_metrics['llm_secs'])} / {_fmt_dur(t_metrics['tool_secs'])}"
                    speed_col = f"{t_metrics['out_tok_s']:>5.1f} | {_fmt_tok(int(t_metrics['prefill_tok_s'])):>6}/s"
                    tok_col = f"{_fmt_tok(t_metrics['out_tok']):>5} / {_fmt_tok(t_metrics['peak_ctx']):>6} / {t_metrics['cache_hit_pct']:>4.1f}%"
                else:
                    turns_tools_col = "N/A (no log)"
                    llm_tool_col = "- / -"
                    speed_col = "N/A"
                    tok_col = "N/A"

                if term_state in ["reclaimable", "retained"]:
                    reclaimable_dispatches.append(d_id)

                state_col = f"{w_state}/{w_phase} ({term_state})"
                print(
                    f"   {role_col:<27} | {model_col:<26} | {wall_idle_col:<13} | "
                    f"{turns_tools_col:<16} | {llm_tool_col:<15} | {speed_col:<23} | "
                    f"{tok_col:<27} | {state_col}"
                )

                # Dòng phụ hiển thị chi tiết công việc kỹ thuật: Git diff, latency trung bình/turn, tool cuối, spec vs report
                t_title = str(t_obj_info.get("title") or t_obj_info.get("taskTitle") or t_obj_info.get("task_title") or t_obj_info.get("display_name") or "")[:54]
                git_str = f"git: {files_mod_count} files (+{git_stats['ins']}/-{git_stats['del']}, {git_stats['commits']} commits)"
                if t_metrics:
                    poll_t = int(t_metrics.get("poll_turns") or 0)
                    eff_t = int(t_metrics["effective_turns"]) if "effective_turns" in t_metrics else max(0, int(t_metrics["turns"]) - poll_t)
                    poll_info = f" | eff_turns: {eff_t}t (poll={poll_t}t)" if poll_t > 0 else ""
                    wait_s = max(float(t_metrics.get("idle_wait_secs") or 0.0), max(0.0, wall_s - float(t_metrics.get("active_secs") or 0.0)))
                    wait_info = f" | wait/retry: {_fmt_dur(wait_s)}" if wait_s >= 30.0 else ""
                    tool_out_tok = int(t_metrics.get("tool_output_tok") or 0)
                    max_tool_tok = int(t_metrics.get("max_tool_output_tok") or 0)
                    replayed_c = int(t_metrics.get("replayed_checks") or 0)
                    help_c = int(t_metrics.get("help_calls") or 0)
                    bomb_c = len(t_metrics.get("context_bomb_cmds") or [])
                    tool_tok_info = f" | tool_out: {_fmt_tok(tool_out_tok)} (max:{_fmt_tok(max_tool_tok)})" if tool_out_tok > 0 else ""
                    leak_info = f" | ⚠️leak(replay={replayed_c},help={help_c},bomb={bomb_c})" if (replayed_c > 0 or help_c > 0 or bomb_c > 0) else ""
                    lat_str = (
                        f"avg_turn: {t_metrics['avg_turn_s']:.1f}s/turn{poll_info} | active_vel: {t_metrics['active_tok_s']:.1f} tok/s{wait_info} | "
                        f"in_fresh: {_fmt_tok(t_metrics['in_tok'])} | cache_read: {_fmt_tok(t_metrics['cache_tok'])}{tool_tok_info}{leak_info} | last_tool: {t_metrics['last_tool']}"
                    )
                else:
                    lat_str = "transcript telemetry unavailable"
                print(f"      ↳ Task: \"{t_title}\" | spec={spec_tok} tok -> report={rep_tok} tok | {git_str}")
                print(f"      ↳ Perf: {lat_str}")

                if t_metrics:
                    replayed_c = int(t_metrics.get("replayed_checks") or 0)
                    help_c = int(t_metrics.get("help_calls") or 0)
                    bomb_cmds = t_metrics.get("context_bomb_cmds") or []
                    max_tool_tok = int(t_metrics.get("max_tool_output_tok") or 0)
                    if replayed_c >= 2:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) gọi 'orca orchestration check' bị lặp lại tin nhắn cũ ({replayed_c} lần replayed=true do thiếu '--ack <DELIVERY_ID>') gây rò rỉ token."
                        )
                    if help_c >= 2:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) chạy lệnh dò '--help' {help_c} lần thay vì dùng thẳng cú pháp đã cung cấp trong Role Spec."
                        )
                    if bomb_cmds:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) chạy {len(bomb_cmds)} lệnh trả về JSON/spec nguyên khối gây phình Context ({', '.join(bomb_cmds[:2])})."
                        )
                    if max_tool_tok >= 8000:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) có 1 lệnh tool bơm tới ~{max_tool_tok:,} tokens vào Context ({t_metrics.get('max_tool_cmd') or 'large stdout'})."
                        )

                if t_metrics and w_state not in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "timed_out") and (idle_s or 0) > 180:
                    warning_issues.append(
                        f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) đang active nhưng không có bước thực thi mới trong {_fmt_dur(idle_s)} (last_tool={t_metrics['last_tool']})."
                    )
                if w_state in ("stopped", "failed", "timed_out") and rep_tok == 0:
                    warning_issues.append(
                        f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) đã dừng ({w_state}/{w_phase}) sau {t_metrics.get('turns', 0)} turns nhưng chưa gửi báo cáo hoàn tất (report=0 tok)."
                    )
                if t_metrics and t_metrics["turns"] > 120:
                    raw_t = int(t_metrics["turns"])
                    poll_t = int(t_metrics.get("poll_turns") or 0)
                    eff_t = int(t_metrics["effective_turns"]) if "effective_turns" in t_metrics else max(0, raw_t - poll_t)
                    view_c = int(t_metrics.get("view_calls") or 0)
                    t_errs = int(t_metrics["tool_errors"])
                    t_calls = int(t_metrics["tool_calls"])
                    if t_errs >= 10 or w_state in ("failed", "stopped", "timed_out"):
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) đã chạy {raw_t} turns (thực thi: {eff_t}t, poll: {poll_t}t) kèm {t_errs}/{t_calls} lỗi tool — dấu hiệu sa đà đào bới lỗi hoặc vòng lặp retry."
                        )
                    elif eff_t <= 120:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) có tổng {raw_t} turns ({w_state}, chỉ {t_errs}/{t_calls} lỗi), nhưng thực thi chính chỉ {eff_t} turns (còn {poll_t} turns là poll manage_task/schedule chờ lệnh background)."
                        )
                    else:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) chạy {raw_t} turns trên tác vụ lớn ({w_state}, {files_mod_count} files, chỉ {t_errs}/{t_calls} lỗi; thực thi chính: {eff_t}t, poll background: {poll_t}t, đọc file: {view_c} lần)."
                        )
                elif t_metrics and t_metrics["tool_errors"] >= 10:
                    warning_issues.append(
                        f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) có {t_metrics['tool_errors']}/{t_metrics['tool_calls']} lệnh tool trả về mã lỗi (command retry overhead)."
                    )
                if t_metrics and t_metrics.get("bloated_logs"):
                    for bl_path, bl_sz in t_metrics["bloated_logs"]:
                        bl_p = Path(bl_path)
                        mb_sz = bl_sz / (1024 * 1024)
                        if auto_fix:
                            try:
                                guard_bin_fix = os.path.expanduser("~/.local/bin/orca-command-guard")
                                if not os.path.exists(guard_bin_fix):
                                    guard_bin_fix = str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent / "orca-command-guard.py")
                                if os.path.exists(guard_bin_fix):
                                    import importlib.util
                                    from importlib.machinery import SourceFileLoader
                                    guard_spec = importlib.util.spec_from_file_location(
                                        "orca_guard", guard_bin_fix, loader=SourceFileLoader("orca_guard", guard_bin_fix)
                                    )
                                    guard_mod = importlib.util.module_from_spec(guard_spec)
                                    guard_spec.loader.exec_module(guard_mod)
                                    guard_mod.MAX_TASK_LOG_BYTES = 10 * 1024 * 1024
                                    guard_mod._enforce_task_log_cap(bl_p.parent)
                                else:
                                    with open(bl_p, "rb") as bf:
                                        head_b = bf.read(256 * 1024)
                                        bf.seek(max(0, bl_sz - 128 * 1024))
                                        tail_b = bf.read()
                                    bl_p.write_bytes(head_b + f"\n[... ORCA-MONITOR: đã lược bỏ {bl_sz - len(head_b) - len(tail_b):,} bytes giữa log ...]\n".encode() + tail_b)
                                actions_taken.append(f"Đã cắt gọn file log phình to bất thường {bl_p.name} ({mb_sz:.1f} MB) của {wt_name} (giữ lại 256KB đầu + 128KB cuối).")
                            except Exception:
                                pass
                        else:
                            critical_issues.append(
                                f"Worker {wt_name} ({d_id}) sinh ra file log phình to bất thường {bl_p.name} ({mb_sz:.1f} MB — runaway stdout flood). Chạy 'orca-monitor --fix' để cắt gọn."
                            )

                worker_metrics_list.append({
                    "dispatch_id": d_id,
                    "role": wt_name,
                    "model": md_name,
                    "state": w_state,
                    "term_state": term_state,
                    "wall_secs": wall_s,
                    "spec_tok": spec_tok,
                    "rep_tok": rep_tok,
                    "files": files_mod_count,
                    "ins": git_stats["ins"],
                    "del": git_stats["del"],
                    "commits": git_stats["commits"],
                    "telemetry": t_metrics,
                })

            # Hiển thị các Task đang chờ tới lượt trong Task DAG (chưa dispatch)
            dispatched_task_ids = {str(w.get("taskId") or "") for w in workers}
            pending_dag_tasks = [
                t for tid, t in run_tasks.items()
                if tid not in dispatched_task_ids and isinstance(t, dict) and t.get("status") in ("ready", "pending", "blocked")
            ]
            if pending_dag_tasks:
                for pt in pending_dag_tasks:
                    pt_title = str(pt.get("title") or pt.get("taskTitle") or pt.get("task_title") or pt.get("display_name") or "")[:68]
                    pt_status = str(pt.get("status") or "ready")
                    print(f"   ⏳ Queued in DAG ({pt.get('id')} - {pt_status}): \"{pt_title}\"")

            # Kiểm tra các Gate treo (pending) bất kể worker đang retained hay đã released,
            # và chỉ tự chữa các Task bị kẹt 'blocked'/'ready' khi toàn bộ worker đã released (và ít nhất 1 succeeded) và không còn pending gate.
            all_workers_settled_released = (
                bool(worker_metrics_list)
                and all(wm.get("term_state") == "released" for wm in worker_metrics_list)
                and any(wm.get("state") == "succeeded" for wm in worker_metrics_list)
            )
            if active_run_id:
                try:
                    g_res = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "orchestration", "gate-list", "--run", active_run_id, "--json"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=4)
                    pending_gates = []
                    if g_res.returncode == 0:
                        g_obj = json.loads(g_res.stdout).get("result", {})
                        pending_gates = [g for g in (g_obj.get("gates") or []) if isinstance(g, dict) and g.get("status") == "pending"]
                    if pending_gates:
                        # Gate là quyết định của con người (Human Gate) — monitor KHÔNG BAO GIỜ tự trả lời "yes"
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Run {active_run_id} còn {len(pending_gates)} Decision Gate 'pending' chờ bạn quyết định: "
                            + ", ".join(str(g.get("id")) for g in pending_gates[:5])
                            + " (trả lời bằng 'orca orchestration gate-resolve --id <GATE_ID> --resolution <...>')."
                        )
                    all_workers_settled = (
                        bool(worker_metrics_list)
                        and all(wm.get("state") in ("succeeded", "failed", "stopped", "abandoned", "circuit_broken") for wm in worker_metrics_list)
                    )
                    any_worker_released = any(wm.get("term_state") == "released" for wm in worker_metrics_list)
                    unreleased_settled = [wm for wm in worker_metrics_list if wm.get("term_state") != "released"]
                    if all_workers_settled and not pending_gates and unreleased_settled and any_worker_released and not auto_fix:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Run {active_run_id} đã kết thúc nhưng còn {len(unreleased_settled)} tab worker ở các đợt trước chưa đóng "
                            f"(chạy 'orca-team release-workers --run {active_run_id}' hoặc 'orca-monitor --fix')."
                        )
                    if auto_fix and not pending_gates:
                        try:
                            rel_info = release_settled_worker_terminals(
                                root,
                                run_id=active_run_id if all_workers_settled else "",
                                sweep_idle_worktrees=True,
                            )
                            rel_d = len(rel_info.get("releasedDispatches") or [])
                            cls_t = len(rel_info.get("closedTerminals") or [])
                            if rel_d or cls_t:
                                actions_taken.append(
                                    f"Giải phóng {rel_d} worker dispatch(es) và đóng dứt điểm {cls_t} tab terminal worker cũ."
                                )
                                if all_workers_settled:
                                    all_workers_settled_released = True
                        except Exception:
                            pass
                    if all_workers_settled_released and not pending_gates:
                        stuck_tasks = [
                            t for t in run_tasks.values()
                            if isinstance(t, dict) and t.get("status") in ("blocked", "ready") and t.get("result")
                        ]
                        if auto_fix and stuck_tasks:
                            fixed_t = 0
                            for t in stuck_tasks:
                                tid = t.get("id")
                                if tid:
                                    tr = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "orchestration", "task-update", "--id", tid, "--status", "completed", "--json"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=4)
                                    if tr.returncode == 0:
                                        fixed_t += 1
                            actions_taken.append(
                                f"Cập nhật {fixed_t}/{len(stuck_tasks)} Task (đã có result, worker đã thu hồi) về 'completed' cho Run {active_run_id}."
                            )
                        elif stuck_tasks:
                            warning_issues.append(
                                f"Run {active_run_id} đã thu hồi hết worker nhưng còn {len(stuck_tasks)} Task '{stuck_tasks[0].get('status')}' đã có result (chạy 'orca-monitor --fix' để đánh dấu completed)."
                            )
                except Exception:
                    pass

            # Kiểm tra xung đột đa-Leader trên cùng 1 worker worktree (live working agents >= 2)
            try:
                ps_chk = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "worktree", "ps", "--json"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=4)
                if ps_chk.returncode == 0 and ps_chk.stdout.strip():
                    ps_w_list = (json.loads(ps_chk.stdout).get("result") or {}).get("worktrees") or []
                    root_resolved_str = str(root.resolve())
                    colliding_wts = []
                    for wt_item in ps_w_list:
                        if not isinstance(wt_item, dict) or wt_item.get("isMainWorktree"):
                            continue
                        p_raw = str(wt_item.get("path") or "").strip()
                        parent_raw = str(wt_item.get("parentWorktreeId") or "").strip()
                        parent_path = parent_raw.split("::", 1)[1] if "::" in parent_raw else parent_raw
                        if parent_path != root_resolved_str and p_raw not in known_worker_wt_paths and os.path.realpath(p_raw) not in known_worker_wt_paths:
                            continue
                        ag_items = wt_item.get("agents") if isinstance(wt_item.get("agents"), list) else []
                        working_cnt = sum(
                            1 for a in ag_items
                            if isinstance(a, dict) and str(a.get("state") or "").strip().lower() in ("working", "running", "busy", "starting")
                        )
                        if working_cnt >= 2:
                            wt_disp = str(wt_item.get("displayName") or Path(p_raw).name)
                            colliding_wts.append(f"{wt_disp} ({working_cnt} working agents)")
                    if colliding_wts:
                        critical_issues.append(
                            f"Phát hiện xung đột đa-Leader trên cùng worktree: {', '.join(colliding_wts)}! "
                            f"Bắt buộc dùng $(orca-team worktree-arg <role>) để tách sang <role>-worker-2."
                        )
            except Exception:
                pass

            # 4.1b Kiểm tra Orca Agent Status Hooks
            hooks_res = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "agent", "hooks", "status", "--json"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=5)
            if hooks_res.returncode == 0:
                hooks_data = json.loads(hooks_res.stdout).get("result", {})
                hook_statuses = {s.get("agent"): s for s in (hooks_data.get("statuses") or []) if isinstance(s, dict)}
                configured_agents = set()
                if config:
                    c_ag = (config.get("coordinator") or {}).get("agent")
                    if c_ag:
                        configured_agents.add(c_ag)
                    for r_cfg in (config.get("roles") or {}).values():
                        if isinstance(r_cfg, dict) and r_cfg.get("enabled", True) and r_cfg.get("agent") and r_cfg.get("agent") != "none":
                            configured_agents.add(r_cfg.get("agent"))
                if not configured_agents:
                    configured_agents = {"antigravity", "claude", "kimi", "gemini"}

                missing_hooks = [
                    ag for ag in sorted(configured_agents)
                    if ag in hook_statuses and not hook_statuses[ag].get("managedHooksPresent")
                ]
                if missing_hooks and not auto_fix:
                    warning_issues.append(f"Agent {', '.join(missing_hooks)} thiếu Orca Status Hooks (chạy 'orca-monitor --fix' để cài).")
                elif missing_hooks:
                    orca_electron = "/Applications/Orca.app/Contents/MacOS/Orca"
                    hook_ctrl = "/Applications/Orca.app/Contents/Resources/app.asar.unpacked/out/main/agent-hooks/managed-agent-hook-controls.js"
                    if os.path.exists(orca_electron) and os.path.exists(hook_ctrl):
                        env_hydrate = os.environ.copy()
                        env_hydrate["ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE"] = "1"
                        h_fix = _safe_orca_run(
                            [
                                orca_electron,
                                "-e",
                                f'require("{hook_ctrl}").installManagedAgentHooks(null, {{agents: {json.dumps(missing_hooks)}, shouldHydrateShellPath: true}}).then(() => process.exit(0)).catch(() => process.exit(1))',
                            ],
                            env=env_hydrate, timeout=8
                        )
                        if h_fix.returncode == 0:
                            actions_taken.append(f"Cài đặt Orca Status Hooks cho: {', '.join(missing_hooks)}")
                            passed_items.append(f"Orca Status Hooks active cho: {', '.join(sorted(configured_agents))}.")
                        else:
                            warning_issues.append(f"Không thể tự cài Orca Status Hooks cho: {', '.join(missing_hooks)}.")
                    else:
                        warning_issues.append(f"Agent {', '.join(missing_hooks)} thiếu Orca Status Hooks.")
                else:
                    passed_items.append(f"Orca Status Hooks active cho: {', '.join(sorted(configured_agents))}.")

        # 4.1c Kiểm tra Orca Command & Stdout Flood Guard Hook (16MB Circuit-Breaker) — chạy cả khi Orca runtime đóng
        guard_bin = os.path.expanduser("~/.local/bin/orca-command-guard")
        agy_hooks_path = os.path.expanduser("~/.gemini/config/hooks.json")
        if os.path.exists(guard_bin):
            try:
                agy_hooks = {}
                if os.path.exists(agy_hooks_path):
                    with open(agy_hooks_path, "r", encoding="utf-8") as hf:
                        agy_hooks = json.load(hf)
                expected_pre = f"if [ -r '{guard_bin}' ]; then ORCA_GUARD_EVENT=PreToolUse python3 '{guard_bin}' --event PreToolUse; else printf '{{\"decision\":\"ask\"}}\\n'; cat >/dev/null 2>&1 || :; fi"
                expected_post = f"if [ -r '{guard_bin}' ]; then ORCA_GUARD_EVENT=PostToolUse python3 '{guard_bin}' --event PostToolUse; else printf '{{}}\\n'; cat >/dev/null 2>&1 || :; fi"
                curr_pre = ""
                try:
                    curr_pre = agy_hooks.get("orca-command-guard", {}).get("PreToolUse", [{}])[0].get("hooks", [{}])[0].get("command", "")
                except Exception:
                    curr_pre = ""
                if (not isinstance(agy_hooks, dict) or curr_pre != expected_pre) and not auto_fix:
                    warning_issues.append("Orca Command Guard hook chưa được đăng ký/đã cũ trong ~/.gemini/config/hooks.json (chạy 'orca-monitor --fix').")
                elif not isinstance(agy_hooks, dict) or curr_pre != expected_pre:
                    if not isinstance(agy_hooks, dict):
                        agy_hooks = {}
                    agy_hooks["orca-command-guard"] = {
                        "PreToolUse": [{"matcher": "run_command", "hooks": [{"type": "command", "command": expected_pre, "timeout": 5}]}],
                        "PostToolUse": [{"matcher": "run_command", "hooks": [{"type": "command", "command": expected_post, "timeout": 5}]}],
                    }
                    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(agy_hooks_path), exist_ok=True)
                    tmp_hooks_path = f"{agy_hooks_path}.{os.getpid()}.orca-tmp"
                    with open(tmp_hooks_path, "w", encoding="utf-8") as hf:
                        json.dump(agy_hooks, hf, indent=2)
                    os.replace(tmp_hooks_path, agy_hooks_path)
                    actions_taken.append("Kích hoạt Orca Command & Stdout Flood Guard (16MB Circuit-Breaker) trong ~/.gemini/config/hooks.json")
                if isinstance(agy_hooks, dict) and (curr_pre == expected_pre or auto_fix):
                    passed_items.append("Orca Command & Stdout Flood Guard (Backtick/Find Blocker + 16MB Log Circuit-Breaker + Stream Filter) active.")
            except Exception as e:
                warning_issues.append(f"Không thể kiểm tra Orca Command Guard hook: {e}")

        # 4.1d Kiểm tra Orca Worktree Setup Hook (setup-runner.sh / ERR_PNPM_NO_PKG_MANIFEST Trap)
        try:
            has_pkg = (root / "package.json").is_file()
            has_pnpm = (root / "pnpm-lock.yaml").is_file() or (root / "pnpm-workspace.yaml").is_file()
            has_yarn = (root / "yarn.lock").is_file()

            def _is_broken_setup_cmd(cmd_txt: str) -> bool:
                if not cmd_txt:
                    return False
                return bool(
                    (re.search(r"\b(?:pnpm|npm|yarn|bun)\s+(?:install|i)\b", cmd_txt) and not has_pkg)
                    or (re.search(r"\bpnpm\s+(?:install|i)\b", cmd_txt) and not has_pnpm)
                    or (re.search(r"\byarn\s+(?:install|i)\b", cmd_txt) and not has_yarn)
                )

            broken_setup_script = ""
            repo_obj = {}
            if runtime_ok:
                repo_res = _safe_orca_run([orca_bin, "repo", "show", "--repo", f"path:{root}", "--json"], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=5)
                if repo_res.returncode == 0:
                    repo_obj = json.loads(repo_res.stdout).get("result", {}).get("repo", {}) or {}
                    setup_cmd = str((repo_obj.get("hookSettings") or {}).get("scripts", {}).get("setup") or "").strip()
                    if _is_broken_setup_cmd(setup_cmd):
                        broken_setup_script = setup_cmd

            stale_runners = []
            dot_git = root / ".git"
            wt_git_dirs = []
            if dot_git.is_dir():
                if (dot_git / "worktrees").is_dir():
                    wt_git_dirs.append(dot_git / "worktrees")
            elif dot_git.is_file():
                try:
                    gd_line = dot_git.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore").strip()
                    if gd_line.startswith("gitdir:"):
                        gd_path = (root / gd_line.split(":", 1)[1].strip()).resolve()
                        if gd_path.parent.name == "worktrees":
                            wt_git_dirs.append(gd_path.parent)
                except Exception:
                    pass
            for wt_git_dir in wt_git_dirs:
                for sr in wt_git_dir.glob("*/orca/setup-runner.sh"):
                    try:
                        sr_txt = sr.read_text(encoding="utf-8", errors="ignore")
                        if _is_broken_setup_cmd(sr_txt):
                            stale_runners.append(sr)
                    except Exception:
                        pass

            if broken_setup_script or stale_runners:
                if not auto_fix:
                    warning_issues.append(
                        f"Orca Worktree Setup Hook ('{broken_setup_script or 'setup-runner.sh'}') bị lỗi do thiếu package.json/lockfile ở root "
                        f"(gây lỗi ERR_PNPM_NO_PKG_MANIFEST khi mở worker worktree — chạy 'orca-monitor --fix' để gỡ)."
                    )
                else:
                    repo_fix_ok = True
                    orca_electron = "/Applications/Orca.app/Contents/MacOS/Orca"
                    rt_client_js = "/Applications/Orca.app/Contents/Resources/app.asar.unpacked/out/cli/runtime-client.js"
                    if broken_setup_script:
                        if os.path.exists(orca_electron) and os.path.exists(rt_client_js):
                            env_node = os.environ.copy()
                            env_node["ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE"] = "1"
                            existing_hooks = repo_obj.get("hookSettings") if isinstance(repo_obj.get("hookSettings"), dict) else {}
                            existing_scripts = existing_hooks.get("scripts") if isinstance(existing_hooks.get("scripts"), dict) else {}
                            merged_hooks = {
                                **existing_hooks,
                                "mode": existing_hooks.get("mode") or "auto",
                                "setupRunPolicy": existing_hooks.get("setupRunPolicy") or "run-by-default",
                                "setupAgentStartupPolicy": existing_hooks.get("setupAgentStartupPolicy") or "start-immediately",
                                "scripts": {**existing_scripts, "setup": ""},
                                "commandSourcePolicy": existing_hooks.get("commandSourcePolicy") or "local-only",
                            }
                            js_code = (
                                f'const {{ RuntimeClient }} = require({json.dumps(rt_client_js)});'
                                f'(async () => {{'
                                f'  const c = new RuntimeClient();'
                                f'  await c.call("repo.update", {{'
                                f'    repo: {json.dumps(f"path:{root}")},'
                                f'    updates: {{ hookSettings: {json.dumps(merged_hooks)} }}'
                                f'  }});'
                                f'}})().then(() => process.exit(0)).catch(() => process.exit(1));'
                            )
                            fix_res = _safe_orca_run([orca_electron, "-e", js_code], env=env_node, timeout=8)
                            if fix_res.returncode == 0:
                                actions_taken.append(f"Xóa Orca Setup Hook lỗi ('{broken_setup_script}') trong cấu hình repo '{root.name}'.")
                            else:
                                repo_fix_ok = False
                                warning_issues.append(f"Không thể xóa Orca Setup Hook lỗi ('{broken_setup_script}') qua RuntimeClient.")
                        else:
                            repo_fix_ok = False
                            warning_issues.append(f"Orca Setup Hook ('{broken_setup_script}') bị lỗi nhưng thiếu Orca RuntimeClient để tự gỡ.")
                    removed_sr = 0
                    for sr in stale_runners:
                        try:
                            sr.unlink(missing_ok=True)
                            removed_sr += 1
                        except Exception:
                            repo_fix_ok = False
                    if removed_sr:
                        actions_taken.append(f"Xóa {removed_sr} file 'orca/setup-runner.sh' lỗi trong .git/worktrees/*.")
                    if repo_fix_ok:
                        passed_items.append("Orca Worktree Setup Hook (setup-runner.sh): Clean (không bị lỗi thiếu package.json).")
            else:
                passed_items.append("Orca Worktree Setup Hook (setup-runner.sh): Clean (không bị lỗi thiếu package.json).")
        except Exception:
            pass

        if runtime_ok:
            # 4.2 Phân tích Mailbox & Giao tiếp P2P
            if active_run_id:
                print(f"\n📬 4.2 MAILBOX & P2P IPC TELEMETRY:")
                print(
                    f"   • Messages in Run: {len(run_msgs)} total | heartbeat={hb_count} (SQLite-handled, 0 LLM tokens) | "
                    f"worker_done={done_count} | handoff={handoff_count} (P2P ready={p2p_dev_ready_cnt}, reject={p2p_reject_cnt}) | escalation/question={esc_count}"
                )
                print(
                    f"   • Coordinator/Peer Wake Payload: {done_count + handoff_count + esc_count} event(s), "
                    f"payload={done_tokens:,} tokens (avg {done_tokens // max(1, done_count + handoff_count + esc_count)} tok/msg)"
                )

            # 4.3 BẢNG TỔNG HỢP SỐ LIỆU ĐO ĐẠC THỰC TẾ (LEADER VS WORKERS TELEMETRY)
            if workers:
                leader_tf = cli_index["by_leader_run"].get(active_run_id) if active_run_id else None
                leader_m = _analyze_antigravity_transcript(leader_tf, scope_id=active_run_id) if leader_tf else {}
                if leader_m:
                    l_replayed = int(leader_m.get("replayed_checks") or 0)
                    l_help = int(leader_m.get("help_calls") or 0)
                    l_bombs = leader_m.get("context_bomb_cmds") or []
                    if l_replayed >= 2:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Leader Coordinator gọi 'orca orchestration check' bị lặp lại tin nhắn cũ ({l_replayed} lần replayed=true do thiếu '--ack <DELIVERY_ID>') gây rò rỉ token."
                        )
                    if l_help >= 2:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Leader Coordinator chạy lệnh dò '--help' {l_help} lần."
                        )
                    if l_bombs:
                        warning_issues.append(
                            f"Leader Coordinator chạy {len(l_bombs)} lệnh trả về JSON/spec nguyên khối gây phình Context ({', '.join(l_bombs[:2])})."
                        )

                w_with_m = [wm["telemetry"] for wm in worker_metrics_list if wm.get("telemetry")]
                w_turns = sum(m["turns"] for m in w_with_m)
                w_poll_turns = sum(int(m.get("poll_turns") or 0) for m in w_with_m)
                w_eff_turns = sum(int(m["effective_turns"]) if "effective_turns" in m else max(0, int(m["turns"]) - int(m.get("poll_turns") or 0)) for m in w_with_m)
                w_tools = sum(m["tool_calls"] for m in w_with_m)
                w_errs = sum(m["tool_errors"] for m in w_with_m)
                w_in_tok = sum(m["in_tok"] for m in w_with_m)
                w_cache_tok = sum(m["cache_tok"] for m in w_with_m)
                w_out_tok = sum(m["out_tok"] for m in w_with_m)
                w_peak_max = max((m["peak_ctx"] for m in w_with_m), default=0)
                w_cum_ctx = sum(int(m.get("cum_ctx_tok") or 0) for m in w_with_m)
                w_tool_out_tok = sum(int(m.get("tool_output_tok") or 0) for m in w_with_m)
                w_max_tool_out = max((int(m.get("max_tool_output_tok") or 0) for m in w_with_m), default=0)
                w_replayed = sum(int(m.get("replayed_checks") or 0) for m in w_with_m)
                w_help = sum(int(m.get("help_calls") or 0) for m in w_with_m)
                w_bombs = sum(len(m.get("context_bomb_cmds") or []) for m in w_with_m)
                w_llm_s = sum(m["llm_secs"] for m in w_with_m)
                w_tool_s = sum(m["tool_secs"] for m in w_with_m)
                w_out_speed = w_out_tok / max(1.0, w_llm_s)
                w_prefill_speed = (w_in_tok + w_cache_tok + w_out_tok) / max(1.0, w_llm_s)
                w_cache_pct = (w_cache_tok / max(1, w_in_tok + w_cache_tok)) * 100.0

                released_cnt = sum(1 for wm in worker_metrics_list if wm.get("term_state") == "released")
                retained_cnt = sum(1 for wm in worker_metrics_list if wm.get("term_state") in ["retained", "reclaimable"])
                active_cnt = sum(1 for wm in worker_metrics_list if wm.get("term_state") == "active")

                print(f"\n📈 4.3 BẢNG ĐỐI CHIẾU SỐ LIỆU ĐO ĐẠC THỰC TẾ (MEASURED TRANSCRIPT METRICS):")
                print("   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────┐")
                print("   │ Chỉ số kỹ thuật (Đo trực tiếp từ Transcript) │ LEADER (Coordinator)            │ WORKERS (Tổng hợp các nhánh)    │")
                print("   ├──────────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────┤")
                if leader_m:
                    l_poll_t = int(leader_m.get("poll_turns") or 0)
                    l_eff_t = int(leader_m["effective_turns"]) if "effective_turns" in leader_m else max(0, int(leader_m["turns"]) - l_poll_t)
                    if l_poll_t > 0:
                        l_turns_str = f"{leader_m['turns']}t (eff:{l_eff_t}) / {leader_m['tool_calls']}c ({leader_m['tool_errors']}e)"
                    else:
                        l_turns_str = f"{leader_m['turns']} turns / {leader_m['tool_calls']} tools ({leader_m['tool_errors']} err)"
                    l_time_str = f"LLM {_fmt_dur(leader_m['llm_secs'])} | Tool {_fmt_dur(leader_m['tool_secs'])}"
                    l_spd_str = f"{leader_m['out_tok_s']:.1f} out/s | {_fmt_tok(int(leader_m['prefill_tok_s']))} tot/s"
                    l_in_str = f"{leader_m['in_tok']:,} tok"
                    l_cache_str = f"{leader_m['cache_tok']:,} tok ({leader_m['cache_hit_pct']:.1f}%)"
                    l_out_str = f"{leader_m['out_tok']:,} tok"
                    l_peak_str = f"{leader_m['peak_ctx']:,} tok (last: {leader_m['last_ctx']:,})"
                    l_cum_str = f"{int(leader_m.get('cum_ctx_tok') or 0):,} tok"
                    l_tool_out_str = f"{int(leader_m.get('tool_output_tok') or 0):,} tok (max:{_fmt_tok(int(leader_m.get('max_tool_output_tok') or 0))})"
                    l_leak_str = f"replay={int(leader_m.get('replayed_checks') or 0)}, help={int(leader_m.get('help_calls') or 0)}, bomb={len(leader_m.get('context_bomb_cmds') or [])}"
                else:
                    l_turns_str = "N/A (IDE/External Session)"
                    l_time_str = "N/A"
                    l_spd_str = "N/A"
                    l_in_str = f"~{base_tokens + total_spec_tokens + total_report_tokens:,} tok (est)"
                    l_cache_str = "N/A"
                    l_out_str = f"~{total_spec_tokens:,} tok (spec)"
                    l_peak_str = f"~{base_tokens + total_report_tokens:,} tok"
                    l_cum_str = "N/A"
                    l_tool_out_str = "N/A"
                    l_leak_str = "N/A"

                if w_with_m:
                    if w_poll_turns > 0:
                        w_turns_str = f"{w_turns}t (eff:{w_eff_turns}) / {w_tools}c ({w_errs}e)"
                    else:
                        w_turns_str = f"{w_turns} turns / {w_tools} tools ({w_errs} err)"
                else:
                    w_turns_str = "N/A"
                w_time_str = f"LLM {_fmt_dur(w_llm_s)} | Tool {_fmt_dur(w_tool_s)}" if w_with_m else "N/A"
                w_spd_str = f"{w_out_speed:.1f} out/s | {_fmt_tok(int(w_prefill_speed))} tot/s" if w_with_m else "N/A"
                w_in_str = f"{w_in_tok:,} tok" if w_with_m else "N/A"
                w_cache_str = f"{w_cache_tok:,} tok ({w_cache_pct:.1f}%)" if w_with_m else "N/A"
                w_out_str = f"{w_out_tok:,} tok" if w_with_m else "N/A"
                w_peak_str = f"max {w_peak_max:,} tok" if w_with_m else "N/A"
                w_cum_str = f"{w_cum_ctx:,} tok" if w_with_m else "N/A"
                w_tool_out_str = f"{w_tool_out_tok:,} tok (max:{_fmt_tok(w_max_tool_out)})" if w_with_m else "N/A"
                w_leak_str = f"replay={w_replayed}, help={w_help}, bomb={w_bombs}" if w_with_m else "N/A"
                l_term_str = f"active={active_cnt}, retain={retained_cnt}"
                w_term_str = f"released={released_cnt}/{len(workers)}"

                print(f"   │ 1. Số lượt suy luận & gọi Tool (Turns/Tools) │ {l_turns_str:<31} │ {w_turns_str:<31} │")
                print(f"   │ 2. Thời gian thực thi (LLM Inference / Tool) │ {l_time_str:<31} │ {w_time_str:<31} │")
                print(f"   │ 3. Tốc độ (OUT e2e tok/s | CTX tok/s)      │ {l_spd_str:<31} │ {w_spd_str:<31} │")
                print(f"   │ 4. Fresh Input Tokens (Nạp mới lũy kế)       │ {l_in_str:<31} │ {w_in_str:<31} │")
                print(f"   │ 5. Cache Read Tokens (Tái sử dụng Cache %)   │ {l_cache_str:<31} │ {w_cache_str:<31} │")
                print(f"   │ 6. Output Tokens (Reasoning + Code sinh ra)  │ {l_out_str:<31} │ {w_out_str:<31} │")
                print(f"   │ 7. Đỉnh Context Window (Peak Context / Turn) │ {l_peak_str:<31} │ {w_peak_str:<31} │")
                print(f"   │ 8. Tổng Context Lũy Kế (Cumul. Billed Input) │ {l_cum_str:<31} │ {w_cum_str:<31} │")
                print(f"   │ 9. Tool Output Footprint (Stdout -> Context) │ {l_tool_out_str:<31} │ {w_tool_out_str:<31} │")
                print(f"   │ 10. Chỉ số Rò rỉ Token (Replay/Help/Bomb)    │ {l_leak_str:<31} │ {w_leak_str:<31} │")
                print(f"   │ 11. Trạng thái Worker Terminals              │ {l_term_str:<31} │ {w_term_str:<31} │")
                print("   └──────────────────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────┘")

                # Phân tích tốc độ theo từng dòng Model thực tế trong Run
                for wm in worker_metrics_list:
                    tm = wm.get("telemetry")
                    if not tm:
                        continue
                    m_key = wm["model"]
                    b = model_buckets.setdefault(m_key, {"runs": 0, "turns": 0, "out_tok": 0, "in_tok": 0, "cache_tok": 0, "llm_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.0})
                    b["runs"] += 1
                    b["turns"] += tm["turns"]
                    b["out_tok"] += tm["out_tok"]
                    b["in_tok"] += tm["in_tok"]
                    b["cache_tok"] += tm["cache_tok"]
                    b["llm_s"] += tm["llm_secs"]
                    b["tool_s"] += tm["tool_secs"]
                if leader_m and config:
                    l_mod = str((config.get("coordinator") or {}).get("model") or "coordinator-model")
                    b = model_buckets.setdefault(f"{l_mod} (leader)", {"runs": 0, "turns": 0, "out_tok": 0, "in_tok": 0, "cache_tok": 0, "llm_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.0})
                    b["runs"] += 1
                    b["turns"] += leader_m["turns"]
                    b["out_tok"] += leader_m["out_tok"]
                    b["in_tok"] += leader_m["in_tok"]
                    b["cache_tok"] += leader_m["cache_tok"]
                    b["llm_s"] += leader_m["llm_secs"]
                    b["tool_s"] += leader_m["tool_secs"]

                if model_buckets:
                    print("\n⏱️ 4.4 BENCHMARK TỐC ĐỘ THỰC TẾ THEO MODEL (MODEL SPEED & LATENCY PROFILE):")
                    for m_key, b in model_buckets.items():
                        out_s = b["out_tok"] / max(1.0, b["llm_s"])
                        tot_s = (b["in_tok"] + b["cache_tok"] + b["out_tok"]) / max(1.0, b["llm_s"])
                        avg_t = b["llm_s"] / max(1, b["turns"])
                        c_pct = (b["cache_tok"] / max(1, b["in_tok"] + b["cache_tok"])) * 100.0
                        llm_share = (b["llm_s"] / max(1.0, b["llm_s"] + b["tool_s"])) * 100.0
                        print(
                            f"   • {m_key:<32}: out_e2e={out_s:>5.1f} tok/s | ctx={_fmt_tok(int(tot_s)):>6} tok/s | "
                            f"latency={avg_t:>4.1f}s/turn | cache={c_pct:>4.1f}% | time_split: LLM {llm_share:.0f}% / Tool {100-llm_share:.0f}%"
                        )

        else:
            print("ℹ️ Không thể kết nối Orca Runtime qua CLI (EPERM hoặc Orca đang đóng).")
            print("  (Chạy 'orca-monitor' trực tiếp trên Terminal để truy xuất runtime telemetry).")
    except Exception as e:
        print(f"ℹ️ Bỏ qua kiểm tra runtime chi tiết do: {e}")
    print("")

    # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    # PHẦN 5: TỔNG KẾT PHÁT HIỆN KỸ THUẬT & LỆNH XỬ LÝ (DIAGNOSTIC SUMMARY)
    # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    print("🎯 5. CHẨN ĐOÁN KỸ THUẬT & KHUYẾN NGHỊ HÀNH ĐỘNG (DIAGNOSTIC AUDIT)")
    print("═" * 105)

    if actions_taken:
        print("🛠️ AUTO-FIX ĐÃ THỰC THI:")
        for act in actions_taken:
            print(f"   • {act}")
        print("")

    if critical_issues:
        print("🔴 CRITICAL ISSUES (CẦN XỬ LÝ NGAY):")
        for idx, iss in enumerate(critical_issues, 1):
            print(f"   {idx}. {iss}")
        print("")

    if warning_issues:
        print("🟡 WARNINGS / BOTTLENECKS (ĐIỂM NGHẼN HOẶC RÒ RỈ CONTEXT):")
        for idx, iss in enumerate(warning_issues, 1):
            print(f"   {idx}. {iss}")
        print("")

    if passed_items:
        print("🟢 PASSED CHECKS:")
        for idx, item in enumerate(passed_items, 1):
            print(f"   {idx}. {item}")
        print("")

    print("⌨️ LỆNH ĐIỀU KHIỂN NHANH:")
    print("   • Tự động sửa lỗi cấu hình / đóng Gate treo:  orca-monitor --fix")
    print("   • Kiểm tra & gỡ kẹt worker chờ prompt:        orca-team watchdog --unblock\n")

    if as_json:
        sys.stdout = orig_stdout
        out_payload = {
            "workspace": str(root),
            "baseDirectiveTokens": base_tokens,
            "runId": active_run_id,
            "objective": active_run_obj,
            "workersCount": len(workers),
            "tasksCount": len(run_tasks),
            "mailbox": {
                "total": len(run_msgs),
                "heartbeat": hb_count,
                "workerDone": done_count,
                "handoff": handoff_count,
                "escalation": esc_count,
                "wakePayloadTokens": done_tokens,
            },
            "leaderTelemetry": leader_m,
            "workerMetrics": worker_metrics_list,
            "modelBenchmarks": model_buckets,
            "summary": {
                "criticalIssues": len(critical_issues),
                "warnings": len(warning_issues),
                "passedChecks": len(passed_items),
                "actionsTaken": len(actions_taken),
            },
            "issues": {
                "critical": critical_issues,
                "warnings": warning_issues,
                "passed": passed_items,
                "actions": actions_taken,
            },
        }
        print(json.dumps(out_payload, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))


def _resolve_monitor_root(default_root: Path, default_config: dict, sub_args: list):
    if any(a in ("-h", "--help", "help") for a in sub_args):
        return default_root, default_config
    skip_next = False
    for a in sub_args:
        if skip_next:
            skip_next = False
            continue
        if a == "--run":
            skip_next = True
            continue
        if a.startswith("-") or a.startswith("run_"):
            continue
        cand = Path(a).expanduser()
        if cand.is_dir():
            r = cand.resolve()
            return r, load_config(r)
        print(f"❌ Đường dẫn không tồn tại hoặc không phải thư mục: '{a}'.", file=sys.stderr)
        sys.exit(1)
    return default_root, default_config


KNOWN_SUBCOMMANDS = {
    "status", "list", "show",
    "set", "get",
    "watchdog", "workers", "health",
    "monitor", "debug", "tokens", "token", "audit-tokens",
    "link", "discovery",
    "sync",
    "uninstall", "remove", "clean-all", "purge",
    "models", "list-models", "discover-models",
    "select", "menu", "choose",
    "agents", "list-agents",
    "spec", "role-spec", "prompt",
    "plan", "pin-plan", "master-plan",
    "kb", "knowledge", "system-engineer",
    "worktree-arg", "wt-arg", "slot-arg",
    "release-workers", "cleanup-tabs", "gc-workers",
    "merge-upstream", "merge-run", "run-branches",
    "-h", "--help", "help",
}


def main():
    raw_args = sys.argv[1:]

    explicit_root = None
    args = []
    i = 0
    after_dd = False
    seen_spec_token = False
    while i < len(raw_args):
        if raw_args[i] == "--":
            after_dd = True
            args.append(raw_args[i])
            i += 1
            continue
        if not after_dd and not args and raw_args[i] in ("spec", "role-spec", "prompt"):
            seen_spec_token = True
            args.append(raw_args[i])
            i += 1
            continue
        if not after_dd and raw_args[i] in ("--task", "-t", "--title", "--content", "-c", "--body", "--file", "-f") and i + 1 < len(raw_args):
            args.append(raw_args[i])
            args.append(raw_args[i + 1])
            i += 2
            continue
        if not after_dd and not seen_spec_token and raw_args[i] in ("--path", "-C"):
            if i + 1 >= len(raw_args) or raw_args[i + 1].startswith("-"):
                print(f"❌ Thiếu giá trị đường dẫn cho cờ '{raw_args[i]}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            cand = Path(raw_args[i + 1]).expanduser()
            if not cand.is_dir():
                print(f"❌ Đường dẫn không tồn tại: '{raw_args[i + 1]}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            explicit_root = cand.resolve()
            i += 2
        elif not after_dd and not seen_spec_token and raw_args[i].startswith("--path="):
            p_val = raw_args[i].split("=", 1)[1].strip()
            if not p_val or p_val.startswith("-"):
                print("❌ Thiếu giá trị đường dẫn cho cờ '--path='.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            cand = Path(p_val).expanduser()
            if not cand.is_dir():
                print(f"❌ Đường dẫn không tồn tại: '{p_val}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                sys.exit(1)
            explicit_root = cand.resolve()
            i += 1
        else:
            args.append(raw_args[i])
            i += 1

    prog_name = Path(sys.argv[0]).name
    if prog_name != "orca-monitor" and args:
        cmd0 = args[0].lower()
        if cmd0 in ("spec", "role-spec", "prompt"):
            cmd_spec(args[1:], explicit_root=explicit_root)
            return
        if cmd0 in ("plan", "pin-plan", "master-plan"):
            caller_dir = explicit_root if explicit_root is not None else Path.cwd().resolve()
            sub_args = (["pin"] + args[1:]) if cmd0 == "pin-plan" else args[1:]
            cmd_plan(sub_args, caller_dir=caller_dir)
            return
        if cmd0 in ("kb", "knowledge", "system-engineer"):
            caller_dir = explicit_root if explicit_root is not None else Path.cwd().resolve()
            cmd_kb(args[1:], caller_dir=caller_dir)
            return
        if cmd0 in ("worktree-arg", "wt-arg", "slot-arg"):
            root = explicit_root if explicit_root is not None else find_project_root()
            cmd_worktree_arg(root, args[1:])
            return
        if cmd0 in ("release-workers", "cleanup-tabs", "gc-workers"):
            root = explicit_root if explicit_root is not None else find_project_root()
            cmd_release_workers(root, args[1:])
            return
        if cmd0 in ("merge-upstream", "merge-run", "run-branches"):
            caller_dir = explicit_root if explicit_root is not None else Path.cwd().resolve()
            sub_args = (["--list-only"] + args[1:]) if cmd0 == "run-branches" else args[1:]
            cmd_merge_upstream(sub_args, caller_dir=caller_dir)
            return
        if cmd0 in ("models", "list-models", "discover-models"):
            cmd_models(args[1:])
            return
        if cmd0 in ("select", "menu", "choose"):
            cmd_select(args[1:])
            return
        if cmd0 in ("agents", "list-agents"):
            print("🐋 Các Agent chính thức được Orca ADE hỗ trợ:")
            for ag in KNOWN_AGENTS:
                print(f"  • {ag}")
            return
        if cmd0 in ("-h", "--help", "help"):
            print(__doc__)
            return

    root = explicit_root if explicit_root is not None else find_project_root()
    config = load_config(root)

    # Nếu được gọi trực tiếp qua alias 'orca-monitor'
    if prog_name == "orca-monitor":
        root, config = _resolve_monitor_root(root, config, args)
        cmd_monitor(root, config, args)
        return

    if not args or args[0] in ["status", "list", "show"] or (
        args[0].lower() not in ROLE_ALIASES
        and args[0].lower() not in KNOWN_SUBCOMMANDS
        and Path(args[0]).expanduser().is_dir()
    ):
        scan_args = args[1:] if (args and args[0] in ("status", "list", "show")) else args
        if any(a in ("-h", "--help", "help") for a in scan_args):
            print("Sử dụng: orca-team [status] [path]")
            return
        for a in scan_args:
            if not a.startswith("-"):
                cand = Path(a).expanduser()
                if not cand.is_dir():
                    print(f"❌ Đường dẫn không tồn tại: '{a}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                    sys.exit(1)
                root = cand.resolve()
                config = load_config(root)
                break
        cmd_status(root, config)
    elif args[0] == "set":
        cmd_set(root, config, args[1:])
    elif args[0] == "get":
        cmd_get(root, config, args[1:])
    elif args[0] in ["watchdog", "workers", "health"]:
        cmd_watchdog(root, args[1:])
    elif args[0] in ["monitor", "debug", "tokens", "token", "audit-tokens"]:
        root, config = _resolve_monitor_root(root, config, args[1:])
        cmd_monitor(root, config, args[1:])
    elif args[0] in ["link", "discovery"]:
        cmd_link(root, args[1:])
    elif args[0] == "sync":
        if any(a in ("-h", "--help", "help") for a in args[1:]):
            print("Sử dụng: orca-team sync [path]")
            return
        for a in args[1:]:
            if not a.startswith("-"):
                if not Path(a).expanduser().is_dir():
                    print(f"❌ Đường dẫn không tồn tại: '{a}'.", file=sys.stderr)
                    sys.exit(1)
                root = Path(a).expanduser().resolve()
                config = load_config(root)
                break
        if not config:
            print(f"❌ Không tìm thấy orca-team.json trong '{root}'.", file=sys.stderr)
            sys.exit(1)
        sync_gemini_directive(root, config)
        print(f"✅ Đã đồng bộ '{root / '.agents' / 'GEMINI.md'}' từ '{root / 'orca-team.json'}'.")
    elif args[0] in ["uninstall", "remove", "clean-all", "purge"]:
        cmd_uninstall_project(root, args[1:])
    else:
        # Default fallback: check if first arg is a role name directly, e.g. "orca-team dev"
        if args[0].lower() in ROLE_ALIASES:
            cmd_set(root, config, args)
        else:
            print(f"❌ Lệnh không hợp lệ: '{args[0]}'. Dùng 'orca-team --help' để xem hướng dẫn.", file=sys.stderr)
            sys.exit(1)

if __name__ == "__main__":
    main()
